msgid "\"99.9% dead?  I'd like to see a million zombies on Wall Street.\""
msgstr "「99.9%が死んだ？ウォール街を埋め尽くす１００万体のゾンビが見られるかな」"

msgid ""
"\"A child's drawing of a house with three stick figures outside.  The sky is a "
"swirling mess of a dozen contrasting colors with purple and red blotches in it.  The "
"three figures are frowning.\""
msgstr ""
"[屋外にいる3人のしかめ面をした棒人間が、拙い手つきで描かれている。空は十色以上の派手な"
"渦巻き模様になっており、あちこちに紫色や赤色のシミが付いている。]"

msgid ""
"\"A drawing of a small stick figure cowering in the corner.  The rest of the page is "
"colored black, with strange faces sneering and laughing at them.\""
msgstr ""
"[小さな棒人間が隅の方でうずくまっている。それ以外の余白は黒く塗り潰され、嘲笑するような"
"奇妙な顔がたくさん描かれている。]"

msgid "\"A man in a black robe came up to me, said he wanted to make a deal…\""
msgstr "「黒いローブの男がやってきて、契約せよとか言いだした...」"

msgid ""
"\"A wood ax works pretty well against them.  So does a machete, but you can't cut down "
"a tree.\""
msgstr "「斧は使いづらい。だからマチェットを使う。しかしマチェットでは木を切れない」"

msgid ""
"\"ALL YOU STONERS WITH YOUR VIDEYA GAMES - I BET YOU WISH YOU TOOK THE TIME TO LEARN A "
"SKILL NOW DONTYA\""
msgstr ""
"「ゲームの中ではみんな殺人鬼になれる。今はただスキルを学ぶ時間が欲しい、そう思ってるん"
"だろ」"

msgid ""
"\"ALWAYS WITH THE EFFICIENCY GUYS; YOU'RE ALWAYS WORKING TO GO HOME TO PAY RENT TO "
"SLEEP TO WAKE UP TO WORK AGAIN.  STOP\""
msgstr ""
"「常に効率を求める者へ。君たちはいつでも家に帰るために働き家賃を払うために家に帰り眠る"
"ために家賃を払い起きるために眠り働くために起き続ける。もう止めよう」"

msgid "\"AMY IS FUNGUS.  DO NOT LISTEN IF SHE ASKS YOU TO TAKE OFF MASK\""
msgstr "「エイミーは真菌だ。マスクを取れと言われても絶対に無視しろ」"

msgid "\"Activating illumination.\""
msgstr "「照明を点灯します。」"

msgid "\"Adderall cures weakness, tramadol cures death\""
msgstr "「アデロールは弱さを克服し、トラマドールは死を克服する」"

msgid "\"Address Allocation for Private Internets\" by Yakov Rekhter et al."
msgstr "ヤコブ・レクター他著「プライベートインターネットのアドレス割り当て」です。"

msgid "\"Affirmative.\""
msgstr "「その通りだな」"

msgid ""
"\"After we were evacuated and I had to leave my toys behind I started collecting empty "
"bullets.  The soldiers here sometimes give me more.  Lieutenant Mora gave me two "
"little ones today, but she looked upset.  I asked her where mom and pa were because I "
"saw them in the back of the camp with her and some soldiers, there was something wrong "
"with dad's face.  Mrs Mora just hugged me and started crying.\""
msgstr ""
"「避難するときにおもちゃを置いていっちゃったから、空の弾を集めるようになった。ここの兵"
"隊さんが、ときどき分けてくれる。今日はモーラ中尉が小さいやつを2つくれた。なにか慌ててる"
"みたいだった。ママが何人かの兵隊さんと一緒にキャンプの後ろにいて、パパの顔がなんか変"
"だった。ママとパパはどこへいくのか聞いたら、モーラ中尉はぎゅってしてくれて、泣いちゃっ"
"た。」"

msgid "\"All I've got is this keg of beer and an appetite.  Come at me, apocalypse!\""
msgstr "「持っているのは樽いっぱいのビールと食欲だけだ。さあ来い災厄！」"

msgid ""
"\"All right, fine.\"  Jenny sets aside the computer and gets up.  \"Grab some tools "
"and do as I tell you.\""
msgstr ""
"「よし、分かった。」ジェニーはパソコンを脇に置き、立ち上がりました。「じゃあ工具を持っ"
"て、言うとおりにやってみて。"

msgid "\"Am I the last one alive?\""
msgstr "「わたし以外はみんなしんだの？」"

msgid ""
"\"An unrecognizable child's drawing made with what appears to be blood and feces.\""
msgstr "[血や汚物で描かれたと思しき、得体の知れない絵]"

msgid "\"And that's supposed to comfort me?\""
msgstr "「で、それは私を満足させてくれるのかな？」"

msgid "\"And what if all the backups fail?\""
msgstr "「予備もダメになったら？」"

msgid ""
"\"Anyone else seen those really… SQUARE-looking towns?  I don't think they're normal.\""
msgstr "「誰か他に...正方形の街を見た者はいないのか？あれは狂っている」"

msgid ""
"\"Anyone hear about that guy who tried to sail his family to Canada?  What a moron, "
"right?\""
msgstr ""
"「船で家族と一緒にカナダへ行こうとした奴を知ってるか？ひどい間抜けがいたもんだな？」"

msgid ""
"\"Anyone reading this, stay off the roads.  Me and the boys were ambushed by some "
"goons there.  If you see a fallen tree blocking your path, just turn around and go "
"back.\""
msgstr ""
"「これを読んでいる人へ。車道沿いに歩いて行くのは止めろ。私と子供たちはそこで強盗に待ち"
"伏せされた。倒木が道を塞いでいたら、すぐ引き返した方がいい」"

msgid ""
"\"Anyone wanna listen to some music at full volume and shoot the Zs that approach?  "
"You pick the tunes if I get some ammo.\""
msgstr ""
"「大音量で音楽をかけながらゾンビを撃つ奴がいるか？弾丸を持ってる奴の前では、選曲に気を"
"付けるんだな」"

msgid "\"Anything else?\""
msgstr "「他に何か？」"

msgid "\"Are they still human inside?\""
msgstr "「あいつらはまだ人間？」"

msgid "\"Are you alone?\""
msgstr "「一人ですか？」"

msgid "\"Are you busy at the moment?\""
msgstr "「今忙しい？」"

msgid "\"Are you busy later?\""
msgstr "「このあと暇？」"

msgid "\"Are you busy tonight?\""
msgstr "「今夜ひま？」"

msgid "\"Are you feeling all right?\""
msgstr "「具合は大丈夫かい？」"

msgid "\"Are you free tonight?\""
msgstr "「今夜空いてる？」"

msgid "\"Are you going to help them?\""
msgstr "「あの人たちを助けようとしてるの？」"

msgid "\"Are you going to the party tonight?\""
msgstr "「今夜パーティーしない？」"

msgid "\"Are you hungry?\""
msgstr "「お腹が空いたのか？」"

msgid "\"Are you my mommy?\""
msgstr "「お母さん？」"

msgid "\"Are you seeing anyone?\""
msgstr "「君...付き合ってる人はいるか？」"

msgid "\"Are you sure?\""
msgstr "「本当ですか？」"

msgid "\"Area nineteen has a few in cold storage.\""
msgstr "「エリア19には、複数の冷蔵倉庫がある」"

msgid "\"At least we know they can die.\""
msgstr "「少なくともあいつらは殺すことができる」"

msgid "\"BURN BURN BURN BURN BURN ALL BURN ALL BURN ALL BURN\""
msgstr "「燃える、燃える、全て燃える、燃える、燃える、全ては燃える」"

msgid "\"Be careful out there.\""
msgstr "「あたりに注意して」"

msgid "\"Be quiet.\""
msgstr "「静かにしろ」"

msgid "\"Best way to train is by throwing pebbles at birds.  You'll be a legend.\""
msgstr "「最善の訓練法は鳥に小石を投げることだ。きっと伝説になれる」"

msgid "\"Big Brother is watching you…\""
msgstr "「ビッグ・ブラザーがあなたを見守っている...」"

msgid "\"Blood… delicious.\""
msgstr "「血...おいしいね」"

msgid "\"Blue\""
msgstr "\"青\""

msgid "\"Blup, blup, blup\", says the mud pot."
msgstr "泥の間欠泉が「ブパッブパッブパッ」と言っています。"

msgid ""
"\"Boyfriend stole my pistol while I was asleep.  I locked him in the bathroom and set "
"the house on fire.  At least he attracted their attention.\""
msgstr ""
"「私が寝ている間に彼は私のピストルを盗んだ。 私は彼を浴室に閉じ込めて、家に火をつけた。"
"彼は時間稼ぎとして私の役に立てた」"

msgid "\"Broadsword!  Yeah!\""
msgstr "「ブロードソードをゲット！よっしゃ！」"

msgid "\"Burning… from the inside…\""
msgstr "「燃えている...体の中から...」"

msgid "\"But what are we measuring???\""
msgstr "しかし、媒介物は一体何？"

msgid "\"CHINA DID THIS\""
msgstr "「これは中国の仕業」"

msgid "\"Call an ambulance.\""
msgstr "「救急車を呼んでくれ」"

msgid "\"Call me.\""
msgstr "「電話してね」"

msgid "\"Call the police.\""
msgstr "「警察を呼んでくれ」"

msgid "\"Can I help you?\""
msgstr "「何か手伝えることは？」"

msgid "\"Can I see your phone?\""
msgstr "「ちょっと携帯電話見せて？」"

msgid "\"Can you help me?\""
msgstr "「手伝ってくれるかな？」"

msgid "\"Can you repeat that?\""
msgstr "「もう一度言ってくれる？」"

msgid "\"Can you swim?\""
msgstr "「君は泳げるかい？」"

msgid "\"Can't… breathe…\""
msgstr "「息が...できな...」"

msgid ""
"\"Cha-cha-cha-chia!  Saw a woman today, with fungus coming out her head like hair "
"tendrils.\""
msgstr ""
"「チャ、チャ、チャ、チア！今日見かけた女、真菌が頭から飛び出てパーマみたいになってやん"
"の」"

msgid ""
"\"Check out my cooking show on The Television!  Making Mannwurst sausages out of some "
"of those assholes who tried to raid my kitchen earlier…\""
msgstr ""
"「テレビをご覧の皆様、クッキングショーをお見逃しなく！以前我が家のキッチンを略奪しよう"
"としたろくでなし共を使って人肉ソーセージを作りましょう...」"

msgid ""
"\"Check your friends for bites, don't let them hide it and turn on you.  Only way out "
"is to shoot em in the head.\""
msgstr ""
"「友人に咬まれた跡がないか調べるんだ。隠したり、振り向いたりされないように。もしそう"
"なったら、頭を撃ち抜くしかない」"

msgid "\"Come get some!\""
msgstr "「こっちだ！」"

msgid "\"Come here!\""
msgstr "「来てくれ！」"

msgid "\"Come on, come on, they can help us!\""
msgstr "「ねえ、ほら、きっと助けてもらえる！」"

msgid "\"Come on, wake up…\""
msgstr "「さあ、起きて」"

msgid "\"Come to the bar if you see this, let's re-enact a zombie movie, friends.\""
msgstr "「これを見たらバーに来てくれ。ゾンビ映画を再現しようぜ、友よ」"

msgid "\"Computer\""
msgid_plural "issues of \"Computer\""
msgstr[0] "本(学習/コンピュータ)"

msgid ""
"\"Cooper killed the neighbors cat today.  dad shoot him.  He was not in the backyart "
"when we came home.\""
msgstr ""
"「クーパーが近所のネコを殺した。パパがクーパーを撃った。家に帰ったら、うらにわからいな"
"くなってた。」"

msgid "\"Cover your head, everyone!\""
msgstr "「みんな伏せて！」"

msgid "\"Crawled in through the vents.  Whole office building is infested.\""
msgstr "「通気口を介して感染しているようだ。オフィスビルは駄目だな」"

msgid ""
"\"DANNY IF YOU READ THIS THIS IS CLARA WE'RE ALL OKAY AND WE'RE HEADING TO THE RIVER.  "
"A BOAT SAID THEY WERE DOCKED NEARBY.\""
msgstr ""
"「ダニー、もしこれを読んでいるなら私たちはみんな無事で川へ向かっている。ボートを見る"
"に、奴らは近くのドックに停まっていたようだ」"

msgid "\"DINT ATE THE MUSHROM\""
msgstr "「きのこはたべるな」"

msgid "\"DOG NOT REAL DOG\""
msgstr "「その犬は偽者だ」"

msgid "\"DON'T EAT THE SLIME DON'T EAT THE SLIME DON'T EAT THE SLIME\""
msgstr "「粘液は食べるな 粘液は食べるな 粘液は食べるな」"

msgid "\"DON't bomB THe PORtals it MAKES iT WORSE\""
msgstr "「ポータルを爆撃するな状況が悪化するだけ」"

msgid ""
"\"DaIsy gOT eaTTEN by a giant roa… (the rest of the note is just unreadable smudges)\""
msgstr "「でいじーがすごくおおキなやつにたべら...(メモの続きは汚れていて読めない)」"

msgid ""
"\"Dad and I have been living in the woods for a week now.  He gives me his pistol when "
"he is out hunting.  It wasn't enough to stop the werewolf that attacked me.  So I had "
"to hide in a small hole for a whole night where it couldn't reach me.  Luckily dad "
"found me and killed it.  He also said he will make me a werewolf jacket for my "
"birthday.  A WEREWOLF JACKET, IHAVETHECOOLESTDADINTHEWORLD.\""
msgstr ""
"「パパとぼくは一週間森に住んでいます。狩りに行くときはピストルを持たせてくれます。で"
"も、ぼくにおそいかかってきたオオカミ人間は倒せなかった。だからぼくは一晩中、オオカミが"
"入れない小さな穴の中で隠れていました。そうしたら、なんと、パパがぼくをみつけて、オオカ"
"ミ人間を退治してくれました。ぼくの誕生日のプレゼントに、オオカミ人間でジャケットを作っ"
"てくれるそうです。世界一かっこいいパパです。」"

msgid ""
"\"Dad said he was going to get groceries two days ago.  he didnt come home yet.  he "
"told me to stay inside the shelter but im getting scared.  i think i remember where "
"the grocery store is.\""
msgstr ""
"「パパが2日前に食べ物を買いに行くと言って、まだ帰らない。シェルターの中にいろって言われ"
"たけど、こわくなってきた。スーパーの場所なら覚えてると思う。」"

msgid "\"Dad-a-chak?\""
msgstr "「ダド・ア・チャック？」"

msgid "\"Dad-a-cham?\""
msgstr "「ダド・ア・チャム？」"

msgid "\"Dad-a-chuk?\""
msgstr "「ダド・ア・チュック？」"

msgid ""
"\"Daddy and Mommy, some really scary storm is happening outside.  I hear some people "
"telling me everything will be okay and everything will be over if I get out, so I'm "
"going with them to help find you, and if not i left a message to you so you know where "
"I'm gone!  I'm just too hungry to keep waiting anymore… I'm sorry.\""
msgstr ""
"「父さんと母さんへ、外はものすごい嵐です。外に出ればきっと大丈夫だと言ってくれる人たち"
"がいるので、一緒に父さんと母さんを探しに行きます！おなかが空いて、これ以上は待てませ"
"ん...ごめんなさい。」"

msgid "\"Daddy hasn't wake up yet…\""
msgstr "「パパがまだ起きてこない...」"

msgid "\"Daddy said we are going on an adventure!\""
msgstr "「父さんが、今からぼくら冒険に行くんだってさ！」"

msgid "\"Daddy, where are you?  I'm scared…\""
msgstr "「おとうさん、どこ？こわいよ...」"

msgid "\"Damn it!\""
msgstr "「しまった！」"

msgid "\"Damn it.\""
msgstr "「しまった」"

msgid ""
"\"Dear Diary, I was at the park today with Percy.  Danny always told me that she was "
"very sad when her dog died, so I broke Percy's neck because I wanted to see how I'd "
"feel.  I think I was sad for a little, but I kept playing with him but I had to stop "
"after too many pieces fell off and Percy became gross.  I buried him in the park so "
"mom and dad wouldn't find out, but Mr. Luca and Mrs Annaliese saw me.  I'm scared "
"they'll tell on me.  Daddy thinks I don't know where he keeps the keys to his gun safe."
"\""
msgstr ""
"「今日の日記、今日はパーシーと公園に行った。犬が死んだら悲しいっていつもダニーが言って"
"たから、どんな気持ちになるかやってみようと思って、パーシーの首を折った。少し悲しかった"
"気がするけど、ずっとパーシーで遊んでたらボロボロがたくさん落ちてなんだかグロくなったか"
"ら止めた。パパとママに見つからないように公園に埋めたけど、ルカさんとアナリーゼさんに見"
"られちゃった。バレたらどうしよう。パパはぼくが銃のたなのカギの隠し場所を知らないと思っ"
"てる。」"

msgid ""
"\"Dear diary- My parents are stupid.  I told Dad to not go outside today, but he "
"wouldn't listen.  Said it was all a hoax.  Now he's beaten up pretty bad, Mom's got "
"the bandages out to help him.  Jimmy lost his toy today, a red stuffed bear.  Looks "
"like I'll have to help him with that.\""
msgstr ""
"「今日の日記 うちの親はバカだ。今日は外に出るなって父さんに言ったけど、ムシされた。ぜん"
"ぶデマだって。それから父さんにかなりつよく叩かれて、母さんは手当てのために包帯を取りに"
"いった。今日はジミーはぬいぐるみをなくした。赤いクマのやつだ。さがすのを手伝ってやらな"
"いと。」"

msgid ""
"\"Dear diary.  Mommy and dad have been making us live in the basement for the last few "
"days.  It's to keep us safe, they say, but it gets really stuffy during the night and "
"I can't sleep, so I sometimes sneak upstairs.  Sometimes I talk to Aunt Maria.  She "
"always stays in the back yard and appears when the sky goes all weird and when scary "
"noises come from outside.  I always ask her to come in, but she tells me she can't and "
"that I should go out instead.  I think it's because dad doesn't want her around, he "
"always told me she died in 2001.  He's a liar, and I think he wants the monsters to "
"eat her.  The door's always locked, but I can reach the garage controls.\""
msgstr ""
"「今日の日記、ママとパパに言われて何日か地下室で暮らしている。私たちの安全を守るため"
"だって。夜中にとても暑くて眠れなくなるので、私はときどきこっそり二階に行く。そしてとき"
"どき、マリアおばさんと話をする。マリアおばさんはいつも裏庭にいて、天気がおかしくなった"
"ときや外で怖い音がしたときに来る。私はいつもおばさんに、中に入ってと言うけど、おばさん"
"は、わたしは入れない、代りにあなたが外に出て、って言う。パパに嫌がられるからだと思う。"
"パパはいつも、おばさんは2001年に死んだと言っていた。パパはうそをついて、おばさんをモン"
"スターのエサにしようとしてるんだと思う。玄関はカギがかかってるけど、ガレージのスイッチ"
"には手が届く。」"

msgid "\"Dear robot, you may have already won our 10 MILLION DOLLAR prize…\""
msgstr "「親愛なるロボットよ、君は今ここに1000万ドルを勝ち取ったのだ...」"

msgid "\"Destroy the specimen if it begins to interact with the lock.\""
msgstr "「施錠部分に接触しようとした場合、速やかに処分すること」"

msgid ""
"\"Diamond coated sword!  Diamond coated hammer!  Diamond coated clothes!  Diamond "
"coated hands help\""
msgstr ""
"「ダイヤモンドコーティングソード！ダイヤモンドコーティングハンマー！ダイヤモンドコー"
"ティング布！ ダイヤモンドコーティングは皆の味方」"

msgid "\"Did you see what they did to him?\""
msgstr "「奴らが彼にした事を見ただろ？」"

msgid "\"Did-a-chak?\""
msgstr "「ディド・ア・チャック？」"

msgid "\"Did-a-chuk?\""
msgstr "「ディド・ア・チュック？」"

msgid "\"Did-a-chum?\""
msgstr "「ディド・ア・チャム？」"

msgid "\"Die for me!\""
msgstr "「死んでよ！」"

msgid "\"Die!\""
msgstr "「死ね！」"

msgid "\"Die, zombie scum!\""
msgstr "「死ね、糞ゾンビ！」"

msgid "\"Disabling illumination.\""
msgstr "「照明を消灯します。」"

msgid "\"Do not fear.\""
msgstr "「怖がらないで。」"

msgid "\"Do not reach for your pockets!\""
msgstr "「ポケットに手を近づけるな！」"

msgid "\"Do they even have sex?\""
msgstr "「そもそも性別があるの？」"

msgid "\"Do you really need that much honey?\""
msgstr "「ハチミツ入れすぎじゃない？」"

msgid "\"Do you smoke?\""
msgstr "「タバコは吸うかい？」"

msgid "\"Do you understand what I'm saying?\""
msgstr "「私の言っていることが分かりますか？」"

msgid "\"Does it scare you?\""
msgstr "「怖がってる？」"

msgid "\"Don't do that.\""
msgstr "「やめてよ」"

msgid "\"Don't keep your goddamn casings!  They'll just weigh you down.\""
msgstr "「空薬莢はさっさと捨てよう！あんなの重荷にしかならない」"

msgid "\"Don't let the ember go out please don't go out I need you precious fire.\""
msgstr "「火口は切らすな、いいか絶対外に切らすなよ、火は貴重なんだ」"

msgid "\"Don't look at the sky!\""
msgstr "「空を見るな！」"

msgid ""
"\"Don't mix powders, them books said.  Do Not Mix powders.  Didn't listen did I.  Blew "
"my goddamn pinky off, near lost my right eye.\""
msgstr ""
"「粉末同士を混ぜるな、と本に書いてあった。粉末同士を混ぜるな。私は従わなかった。そして"
"私のちっぽけな小指は吹っ飛び、右目は無くなった。」"

msgid "\"Don't point that thing at me!\""
msgstr "「指差すのを止めろ！」"

msgid ""
"\"Don't shoot the people who get bit!  It's OK!  Death is the only thing that makes "
"you turn!\""
msgstr "「死にかけの奴に銃を使うな！殺しさえすればこっちのもんだ！」"

msgid "\"Don't trust them.  The mushrooms aren't your friends.  They're delusional\""
msgstr "「奴らを信じるな。キノコは仲間じゃない。とんだ妄想だ」"

msgid "\"Don't worry about it.\""
msgstr "「それについては心配要りませんよ」"

msgid "\"Don't worry, it can't hurt us.\""
msgstr "「大丈夫、私たちに危害は与えないよ」"

msgid ""
"\"Don't worry, it isn't like anything could teleport out of the containment cells.\""
msgstr ""
"「心配する必要はありません。こいつは、格納容器からテレポートで脱出するような代物ではあ"
"りませんよ」"

msgid "\"Don't worry.\""
msgstr "「大丈夫です」"

msgid "\"Down here, they ALL float!\""
msgstr "「おりてきなよ、みんなこっちに浮かんでるよ！」"

msgid "\"Drop your %s!  Now!\""
msgstr "「%sを捨てろ！今すぐに！」"

msgid "\"EMERGENCY, EMERGENCY!\""
msgstr "「緊急事態発生、緊急事態発生！」"

msgid "\"ENGLAND DID THIS\""
msgstr "「これは英国の仕業」"

msgid "\"Every man has got a breaking point.\""
msgstr "「だれにだって限界がある」"

msgid ""
"\"Everyone used their gas to get to another town… but it's the same story everywhere.\""
msgstr "「誰もが別の街に逃げようと車で走り去った、だがどこの街でも同じ事が起きたと聞く」"

msgid "\"Excellent.\""
msgstr "「素晴らしいな」"

msgid "\"Excuse me.\""
msgstr "「ちょっとすみません」"

msgid "\"Experiments to determine extent of cognitive abilities still underway.\""
msgstr "「認知能力の程度を調べる実験が進行中です」"

msgid "\"FIRE BAD.  NOW NAKED.  PLEASE HELP.\""
msgstr "「火はまずい。素っ裸なんだ。誰か助けて」"

msgid "\"FLAMING SWORD HUMANE.  CAUTERIZES WOUNDS.  SURGICAL.\""
msgstr "「燃える剣は慈悲深い。傷を焼灼できる。外科手術だ」"

msgid "\"FUCK FAUX-MUTANTS, BEING 'EXTREMELY THIRSTY' DOES NOT COUNT\""
msgstr "「変異原っぽい物質のくそったれ、『瞬間乾燥』なんていらねぇ」"

msgid "\"FUCK YOU!\""
msgstr "「ファッキュー！」"

msgid "\"Fantastic.\""
msgstr "「最高だ」"

msgid ""
"\"Felt queasy and threw up yesterday, puke looked weird.  I took pills for stomach "
"ache but I don't feel any better.\""
msgstr ""
"「昨日は気分が悪くなって吐いた。吐いたものが変な感じだった。お腹の薬を飲んだけど、まだ"
"よくならない。」"

msgid "\"Food!\""
msgstr "「クイモノ！」"

msgid ""
"\"For anyone that's reading this, I just want to confirm (FROM AN UNBIASED SOURCE) "
"that it was NOT the scientists' fault.\""
msgstr ""
"「誰かこれを読んでいる人へ、一つ(信頼できるソースで)確認したいんだけど、原因は科学者で"
"はないよね」"

msgid "\"For sale: zombaby shoes, very filthy\""
msgstr "「売ります：赤ちゃんゾンビの靴、非常に不潔」"

msgid "\"Forget it.\""
msgstr "「気にしないでくれ」"

msgid ""
"\"Found some food in a box outside my house.  We ate it and now the fungaloids aren't "
"harming us.  I think we are a mushroom now\""
msgstr ""
"「家の外に食料の入った箱を見つけた。皆でそれを食べてみたら、真菌人が襲ってこなくなっ"
"た。きっと、私たちもキノコになってしまったんだ」"

msgid ""
"\"Found some pink berries.  Eating them makes bushes into more pink berries.  Infinite "
"berry.\""
msgstr ""
"「ピンク色のベリーが実っていた。食べていたら、周りの茂みにもっとたくさん実りだした。無"
"限ベリーだ」"

msgid ""
"\"From the bus?  A few of us made it in the end; the Singh family were on that bus "
"with us.  We were some of the last refugees to arrive.\"  He gestures to three people "
"gathered together a short distance away.  \"They put us into a room for processing, "
"where a bunch of the wounded were being handled as best as they could manage.  They "
"were short staffed though, and they missed one.  We all thought he was just having a "
"nap, but he wasn't,\" Pablo wipes his face with his hand and pauses for a moment.  "
"\"When he got back up as a zombie, there was a huge panic.  Gunshots in a small, "
"crowded room, and trampling… it was really ugly.  We were close to the door and "
"managed to get out right away, but then a couple panicking people closed the place off "
"and left innocent people in there for what seemed like ages, calling it an "
"'outbreak'.  By the time leveler heads prevailed, there weren't many people left in "
"there to recover.\""
msgstr ""
"「バスの事故の生き残りか？何人かは最後まで一緒だったよ。あそこのシン一家も一緒のバス"
"だった。」彼は、少し離れたところに集まっている3人組を示しました。「私たちの一団がここに"
"到着したのは最後の方だったな。処置室に通されて、負傷した人はできる限りの手当てをしても"
"らった。でも人手が足りなくて、見落としがあったんだ。誰もが、仮眠を取ってる人がいるな、"
"としか思ってなかった。」パブロは顔を手で覆い、しばらく沈黙していました。「そいつがゾン"
"ビになって蘇り、大パニックになった。狭くて人も多い部屋で銃を撃ったり押しあったり...本当"
"にひどかった。私たちはドアの近くだったからすぐ脱出できたけど、混乱した何人かが『暴動』"
"が起きたと思って部屋を封鎖し、罪もない人々をしばらく閉じ込めていたんだ。皆が冷静になっ"
"た頃には、部屋の中のほとんどの人が手遅れの状態になっていた。"

msgid "\"From time to time.\""
msgstr "「時々な」"

msgid "\"Fuck!\""
msgstr "「くそったれが！」"

msgid "\"Fuck.\""
msgstr "「くそっ」"

msgid "\"Fuckin' piece of garbage.\""
msgstr "「くそったれ、このゴミ屑が」"

msgid "\"Fungus are helping us.  Help them and they will unite us\""
msgstr "「真菌が私たちを救う。真菌を助ければ、真菌と一つになれる」"

msgid ""
"\"G, I have not found any of your notes, which means you're either taking a different "
"path or have already made your way back home.  In the case you're still out here "
"somewhere, if you see the sky suddenly grow dark, hide indoors immediately, I have a "
"feeling this storm is far from over.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。あなたの書いたメモは見つからなかった。ってことは、別の方向へ向かっているか、もう"
"家に帰ったのかな。もしまだどこかにいるなら、空が急に暗くなった時はすぐに屋内に隠れるん"
"だ。この嵐はまだ終わっていない気がする」"

msgid ""
"\"G, I hope you're finding my notes and the supply drops.  Use my binocs, if they're "
"still there, and check out the roof.  Avoid the huge tower.  I don't know what's "
"inside, but the noises that come out of it can't signal anything good.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ、私のメモと支援物資はちゃんと見つけられただろうか。双眼鏡がまだ残っていたら、屋上"
"から見渡してみるといい。巨大な塔は避けろ。どんな状況なのか知らないが、中から嫌な音がす"
"る」"

msgid ""
"\"G, I ran into an actual human today!  He was looking for his daughter.  We exchanged "
"some food and traded information on the surrounding area.  He spoke of a family living "
"on a farm out in the fields, surviving and thriving!  Maybe it's time we carved "
"ourselves a peaceful place in this hell.  We'll discuss this once we meet back home.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。今日は、生きてる人間に会ったんだ！その人は娘を捜していた。食べ物を取り引きして、"
"周辺の情報を交換した。彼の家族は田舎の農場に住んでるらしい。しかも、元気に生き延びてる"
"そうだ！この地獄にも、平穏な場所が作れるってことだ。家で落ち合えたら、詳しく話そう」"

msgid ""
"\"G, I've stopped the bleeding, I'll be fine.  Can't stay here any longer, there's too "
"much commotion outside.  Meet me back at our usual spot, we will retrieve our stuff "
"together, don't go alone.  Be careful when exiting out the back, I saw one of them "
"running around with a spear.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ、出血は止めたから大丈夫。もうこれ以上ここにはいられない。外が騒がしい。いつもの場"
"所で落ち合って、荷物を回収しよう。一人で行くなよ。裏から出るときは気をつけろ。槍を持っ"
"て走り回ってる奴を見た」"

msgid ""
"\"G, be careful around those bulging and pulsating corpses.  I saw one today.  I think "
"there's something eating away at those things.  I didn't stick around to find out.  I "
"burnt the entire building down, just to be sure, so you should have relatively safe "
"passage.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。膨れ上がって脈打ってる死体が近くにあったら要注意だ。今日も見かけた。何かに浸食さ"
"れてるみたいだったから、近寄らないように気を付けた。念のため建物ごと焼いておいたから、"
"安全に通れるとは思う」"

msgid ""
"\"G, don't head straight through, go around.  There's a glowing one just hanging out "
"in the alley.  I tried stabbing it but it zapped me with some sort of static "
"electricity and I ran back here.  I'll try to whack it with a club next time.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。真っすぐ向かわず、回り道しろ。道に光ってる奴がいる。刺してみたらビリっと来たか"
"ら、ここへ引き返した。次は木の棒で叩いてみることにする」"

msgid ""
"\"G, if you find this, I'm at the farm just out of town.  I'll need to stay there a "
"few days, I've been wounded by one of those overgrown bastards, shot a spike right "
"into my thigh.  I'll wait for you there as long as I can, stay safe.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。もしこのメモを見つけたら、私は街はずれの農場に居る。数日は留まることになると思"
"う。ツタが生い茂ってる奴にやられた。脚に棘を撃ち込まれた。できる限り長く待ってるつもり"
"だ。気を付けて来てくれ。」"

msgid ""
"\"G, move only after dark.  I saw lights in the distance, I think there might be "
"someone living around here.  Wish I had my radio right now.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ、移動は暗くなってからにしよう。遠くに明かりが見えたから、この辺に誰か住んでるのか"
"もしれない。手元に無線機があればいいんだけど」"

msgid ""
"\"G, the city is full of them.  I don't know how, it's as if we never came through "
"here.  They're the same ones we'd put down, I am sure of it.  They got back up and now "
"look more dangerous than ever.  I saw one of them just snatch a bird right off the "
"roof with its long hands.  You have to use the sewers.  I know we agreed not to travel "
"underground, but as horrible as it is down there, I fear our world up here is no "
"longer ours either.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。奴らが街中に溢れている。どうしてなんだ、まるで初めて通った道みたいじゃないか。以"
"前倒したのと同じ奴らだ、間違いない。また起き上がって、更に危険になってるみたいだ。長い"
"腕で鳥を捕まえていた。下水道を使おう。下水道は怖いから止めとこうと以前言ったけど、地上"
"の世界ももはや私たちのものじゃない」"

msgid ""
"\"G, there's something not right with the forests here.  The ground there feels soft "
"and is overgrown with some sort of mushrooms.  Be careful not to breathe in the dust "
"they kick up, I accidentally took a whiff and have been coughing and vomiting since.  "
"The map shows there's a cabin just outside town, I'll lay low there until I feel "
"better.  I'm almost home.  I know you will be waiting for me there.\""
msgstr ""
"「Gへ。ここの森は何かおかしい。地面は柔らかく、キノコのようなものが生い茂っている。塵を"
"吸わないよう気をつけて。私はうっかり吸い込んで、それ以来咳と吐き気が治まらない。地図に"
"よれば街外れに小屋があるから、そこで休むつもりだ。もうすぐ家に帰れる。きっと君が待って"
"るんだろうな。」"

msgid "\"GET ON THE GROUND, NOW!\""
msgstr "「今すぐ地面に伏せろ！」"

msgid "\"GET WELL SOON!\""
msgstr "「早くよくなってね！」"

msgid "\"GOD CAN'T SAVE US\""
msgstr "「神は我らを見捨てたもう」"

msgid "\"Gas mask is nice and all, but I can hardly run with it on.\""
msgstr "「ガスマスクは優秀。しかし付けたまま走るのは難しい」"

msgid "\"Get away from here!\""
msgstr "「ここから出ていけ！」"

msgid "\"Get it OFF ME!\""
msgstr "「追い払え！」"

msgid "\"Get me the White House.\""
msgstr "「ホワイトハウスに連れて行ってくれ」"

msgid "\"Get on the ground!  Now!\""
msgstr "「地面に伏せなさい！今すぐに！」"

msgid "\"Get on your knees!\""
msgstr "「跪け！」"

msgid "\"Get the fuck away from me!\""
msgstr "「消え失せろ！」"

msgid "\"Give me a call later.\""
msgstr "「後で電話してくれよ」"

msgid "\"Go ahead.\""
msgstr "「先に行ってて」"

msgid "\"Go back to Libraria!\", says Pat Schroeder."
msgstr "パット・シュローダーが「リベリアに帰れ！」と言っています。"

msgid "\"Go kill yourself!\""
msgstr "「死んじゃえ！」"

msgid ""
"\"Go to every fungus patch you find but WEAR A SUIT.  Food there is very very "
"filling.  Look for pink berries, blue flowers\""
msgstr ""
"「どこでも良いから真菌地帯に行ってみろ。ただし防護スーツは絶対着ろ。食べ物が大量にあ"
"る。ピンク色のベリーと青い花を探せ」"

msgid "\"God damn it!\""
msgstr "「くそっ、しまった！」"

msgid "\"God damn it.\""
msgstr "「ちっ、しまった」"

msgid "\"God\"-Slayer"
msgstr "「神」殺し"

msgid ""
"\"Gonna settle down one day.  Nice big orchard, couple of friends/future family to "
"spend time with, and a nice system of fortifications to keep us safe.\""
msgstr ""
"「いつかは落ち着いて暮らしたい。素敵な広い果樹園、友達や将来家族になる人と過ごす日々、"
"そして安全を保障する立派な要塞。」"

msgid "\"Good afternoon.\""
msgstr "「こんにちは」"

msgid "\"Good evening.\""
msgstr "「こんばんは」"

msgid "\"Good luck.\""
msgstr "「幸運を祈るよ」"

msgid "\"Good morning.\""
msgstr "「おはよう」"

msgid ""
"\"Good news: My teachers aren't trying to tear my limbs off about my homework.  Bad "
"news: My teachers are trying to tear my limbs off regardless.\""
msgstr ""
"「良いニュース: 宿題を忘れても先生が手足を引き裂こうとしてこない。悪いニュース: 良い子"
"にしてても先生が手足を引き裂こうとしてくる」"

msgid "\"Good night.\""
msgstr "「おやすみ」"

msgid "\"Good.\""
msgstr "「いいね」"

msgid "\"Got my mortar and pestle.  Now if I could just find some avocados…\""
msgstr "「乳鉢と乳棒を見つけた。あとはアボカドさえあれば...」"

msgid ""
"\"Gotta slow down, man.  I don't think we spend more than 20% of our time fightin',  "
"Put some Marley on and take off that racketus tripcore nonsense, man.\""
msgstr ""
"「いったん立ち止まろうよ。20パーセント以上の時間を戦いに費やしたくはない。ハッパをやっ"
"て騒いだりトリップしたり無意味なことをして休もうよ」"

msgid "\"Great.\""
msgstr "「素晴らしい」"

msgid "\"Green\""
msgstr "\"緑\""

msgid "\"Guns too loud.  Crossbow too long.  Running is best.\""
msgstr "「銃はうるさい。クロスボウは時間が掛かる。逃げるが勝ちだ」"

msgid "\"G… geddoff me you… you bastard…\""
msgstr "「お...降ろせ...畜生が...」"

msgid "\"HADENSBROOK REBUILT AROUND FUNGUS.  THEY EAT GRAY APPLES AND SPREAD IT\""
msgstr ""
"「ヘイデンスブルックは真菌によって再建した。あそこの住人は灰色のリンゴを食べ、リンゴの"
"木を拡散している」"

msgid "\"HANDS WHERE I CAN SEE THEM!!\""
msgstr "「手を隠すな！！」"

msgid "\"HELP!  HEEEEELP!\""
msgstr "「たすけて！たーすーけーてー！」"

msgid ""
"\"Hahahahaa stupid fuck in his mansion, with his plate armor and big axe.  Guy never "
"swung the thing in his life.  Can't block bullets, dipshit\""
msgstr ""
"「ハハハハ、あの屋敷にはプレートアーマーと斧をつけたアホが住んでるぞ。人生で一度も武器"
"を使ったことなんてないんだろうな。弾丸は防げないんだよ、マヌケ」"

msgid "\"Hands in the air!\""
msgstr "「両手を上げろ！」"

msgid "\"Happy Birthday!\""
msgstr "「ハッピーバースデー！」"

msgid "\"Hate… you…\""
msgstr "「ニクイ...オマエ...」"

msgid "\"Hate…\""
msgstr "「ニクイ...」"

msgid "\"Have a good time.\""
msgstr "「楽しんできてね」"

msgid "\"Have a good trip.\""
msgstr "「良い旅を」"

msgid ""
"\"Have seen a zombie making its kin raise even despite damage that normally would take "
"them down, the surrounding air shimmered like around that hole in the air we've seen "
"creatures coming through back home\""
msgstr ""
"「普通なら動かなくなるほどのダメージを負ったゾンビを復活させるゾンビを見た。復活しつつ"
"あるゾンビも似たような感じだったが、そいつの周囲の空気は揺らめいていた」"

msgid "\"Have you been waiting long?\""
msgstr "「大分待ったかい？」"

msgid "\"Have you done this before?\""
msgstr "「前にこれをやった事があるかい？」"

msgid "\"Have you eaten yet?\""
msgstr "「まだ食べてないの？」"

msgid "\"Have you ever been to California?\""
msgstr "「カリフォルニアに行ったことある？」"

msgid "\"Have you seen my children?\""
msgstr "「私の子供達を見なかったか？」"

msgid ""
"\"Have you seen my friend?  He went into surgery yesterday… or maybe the day before…\""
msgstr "「私の友人に会わなかった？彼は昨日手術したばかりで...いや、おとといだったか...」"

msgid ""
"\"Heard of a place up in Maine where people have their shit together.  Hundreds of "
"people, defense, food and shelter… let's go raid it, guys!\""
msgstr ""
"「メーン州の方で生き残った者が集まってなんとかやっていると聞いた。たくさんの人、防衛施"
"設、食料と避難所...よし、皆で襲いに行こう！」"

msgid ""
"\"Heard recently of some radio op who lives in a skyscraper, announcing where those "
"hordes are going.  Couldn't find the frequency, though.\""
msgstr ""
"「超高層ビルに住んでる奴が暗号化していない通信を最近拾ったらしい。しかし、周波数は分か"
"らない」"

msgid "\"Heehee!\""
msgstr "「へへへっ！」"

msgid "\"Hello.\""
msgstr "「こんにちは」"

msgid "\"Hello?  Hello?!\""
msgstr "「もしもし？もしもーし！？」"

msgid "\"Hello?\""
msgstr "「やぁ？」"

msgid "\"Help!\""
msgstr "「助けて！」"

msgid "\"Here it is.\""
msgstr "「ここにあるよ」"

msgid "\"Here!  Someone's here!\""
msgstr "「ここだ！誰かいるぞ！」"

msgid "\"Hey kids.  Want some candy?\""
msgstr "「やあキミ。お菓子好きかい？」"

msgid "\"Hey look, that one's carrying something.  Let's crack it open and steal it.\""
msgstr "「おい見ろ、何かを運んでるようだ。こじ開けて盗もう」"

msgid ""
"\"Hey, Ted.  Alexander and Cass and I are heading to Z-Mobile for the last of the "
"meth.  Keep the lizard fetus fed for us, OK?\""
msgstr ""
"「やあテッド。アレクサンダーとキャスと私は最後のヤクを探して車を走らせてるよ。私らに配"
"るトカゲの胎児はちゃんと持ってるね？」"

msgid "\"Hey, we got other specimens that could withstand a grenade.\""
msgstr "「やあ、手榴弾にも耐える別の検体を捕獲しましたよ」"

msgid "\"Hey, what happened to my dad's airboat?!\""
msgstr "「ちょっと、パパのエアボートに何が起きたの？！」"

msgid "\"Hi, I'm Anson Williams, TV's 'Potsy'.\""
msgstr "「やあ、アンソン･ウィリアムズだよ。『ポッツィー』の。」"

msgid "\"Hold on, I want to pulp that zombie corpse.\""
msgstr "「ちょっと待ってくれ、ゾンビの死体を破壊したいんだ」"

msgid "\"Honey, where are you?\""
msgstr "「ハニー、どこにいるの？」"

msgid "\"Honey, you need to hurry!\""
msgstr "「ハニー、急いで！」"

msgid "\"Hostile detected.\""
msgstr "「敵を検知」"

msgid "\"How do I use this?\""
msgstr "「これはどうやって使うんですか？」"

msgid "\"How do we get out of here?\""
msgstr "「どうやったら脱出できるんだ？」"

msgid "\"How do you know?\""
msgstr "「何で分かるんだい？」"

msgid "\"How do you like it here?\""
msgstr "「ここは気に入ったかい？」"

msgid "\"How does LIXA work?\""
msgstr "どのように戦闘するんだ？"

msgid ""
"\"How in heck can I wash my neck if it ain't gonna rain no more?\" asks Farmer Al."
msgstr ""
"「雨が降らねえことには、こちとら首の後ろも洗われねえやな？」と農家のアルは答えました。"

msgid "\"How long have you been here?\""
msgstr "「どれだけここにいたんだい？」"

msgid "\"How long were you two together?\""
msgstr "「付き合い始めてどれぐらい経ったかな？」"

msgid "\"How many languages do you speak?\""
msgstr "「君は何ヶ国語話せるの？」"

msgid "\"How many people?\""
msgstr "「何人いるんだい？」"

msgid "\"How much do I owe you?\""
msgstr "「おいくらですか？」"

msgid "\"How much were these earrings?\""
msgstr "「このイヤリングはいくらしたんだい？」"

msgid "\"How much will it cost?\""
msgstr "「料金はいくらですか？」"

msgid "\"How much would you like?\""
msgstr "「値段はいくらが希望なんだい？」"

msgid "\"How old are you?\""
msgstr "「何歳ですか？」"

msgid "\"How tall is it?\""
msgstr "「どれくらいするんだ？」"

msgid "\"How was the movie?\""
msgstr "「映画はどうだった？」"

msgid "\"How was your trip?\""
msgstr "「旅はどうだった？」"

msgid "\"How's it going?\""
msgstr "「調子はどうだい？」"

msgid "\"How's your dad doing?\""
msgstr "「パパは何してる？」"

msgid "\"How's your mom doing?\""
msgstr "「ママは何してる？」"

msgid "\"Hrgm… blood… hungry…\""
msgstr "「グググ...血...腹減った...」"

msgid "\"Huh?  What was that?\""
msgstr "「はあ？なんだあれは？」"

msgid "\"Hunger… must eat…\""
msgstr "「腹減った...なにか食べる...」"

msgid "\"Hunger…\""
msgstr "「ハラヘッタ...」"

msgid "\"Hurry!\""
msgstr "「急げ！」"

msgid ""
"\"Husband 30 yrs died in bombs.  Mushrooms brought him back.  GIVE YOURSELF TO THEm "
"AND THEY WILL HELP YOU\""
msgstr ""
"「夫は30歳の時、爆弾で死にました。キノコが夫を生き返らせてくれました。ソのみをサさげヨ"
"さすレばスくいがあたえラれん」"

msgid "\"I DON'T WANT TO DIE!\""
msgstr "「しにたくない！」"

msgid "\"I TOLD YOU TO GET OUT OF HERE!\""
msgstr "「ここから出て行けって行ったよな！」"

msgid "\"I am not leaving without you!\""
msgstr "「あなたを置いては行けない！」"

msgid "\"I am one with the plants.\""
msgstr "「私は植物と一体化している」"

msgid "\"I can barely move.  Run!  Save yourself!\""
msgstr "「かろうじて動ける。逃げろ！身の安全を確保しろ！」"

msgid "\"I can hear mom's voice crying my name and crying for help in the forest.\""
msgstr "「森の中からママの声が聞こえる。泣きながら私の名前を呼んでる。」"

msgid ""
"\"I can imagine people sending their 'love and prayers' on social media.  Love doesn't "
"kill zeds, prayer doesn't put food in my belly.\""
msgstr ""
"「SNSで『愛と祈り』を送るやつらの姿が目に浮かぶね。愛はゾンビを殺さないし、祈りで腹は膨"
"れない」"

msgid ""
"\"I can see a large tower in the distance, And strange stalk-like creatures are around "
"it.  I feel sick just looking at it, and fire hasn't solved it.  Those things seem to "
"stay around it though.\""
msgstr ""
"「遠くに大きな塔があり、その周りに奇妙な細長い化け物がいる。見ているだけで気持ち悪い"
"し、火でも退治できない。まだ辺りに残っているようだ。」"

msgid "\"I cannot… yet I must.  How do you calculate that?\""
msgstr "「できない...でも、やらなければ。どうやって計算すればいいんだ？」"

msgid "\"I didn't mean to do it!\""
msgstr "「そんなつもりじゃなかった！」"

msgid ""
"\"I discovered 10 new stars tonight!  To bad that mom and dad aren't home.  They even "
"forgot to close the front door.\""
msgstr ""
"「今夜は知らない星を10も見つけた！パパとママが留守で残念だ。玄関のドアを閉めるのも忘れ"
"て出掛けちゃうなんて。」"

msgid "\"I don't have enough time to double tap.  You don't either.\""
msgstr "「もうとどめを刺す余裕がない。お前もそうだろ？」"

msgid "\"I don't want to leave the house, but I'm hungry…\""
msgstr "「いえから出たくない。おなかへった...」"

msgid "\"I feel cold…\""
msgstr "「さむい...」"

msgid ""
"\"I found a chocolate bar on my pillow when I got home last night.  I left and don't "
"wanna go back.\""
msgstr ""
"「昨晩家に帰ってきたら、枕元にチョコレートバーが置いてあった。すぐに家を出た。二度と戻"
"りたくない」"

msgid ""
"\"I found a corpse with strange berries shoved down their gullet, seems to have choked "
"to death on the stuff.  greedy bastard\""
msgstr ""
"「奇妙な果実を喉に詰まらせた死体を見つけた。どうやら窒息死らしい。大した食い意地だ」"

msgid ""
"\"I found some kind of stone pyramid with spikes.  I feel… I feel like I'm being "
"watched.\""
msgstr ""
"「トゲが生えたピラミッド型の石を見つけた。なんだか...誰かに見られてるような気がする」"

msgid "\"I get air conditioners, but… this whole place is frozen to ice!\""
msgstr "「エアコンを手に入れた、けど...ここは何もかも氷漬けだ！」"

msgid "\"I got a round trip ticket.\""
msgstr "「往復チケットを買ったよ」"

msgid ""
"\"I got my tinfoil hat on.  Good thing too, cause this monster was starrin at me kinda "
"funny, trying to freeze my mind in place.\""
msgstr ""
"「アルミ箔帽をかぶってみた。幸運にも、この怪物はおかしな様子でこちらをじっと見つめてい"
"るだけだ。私を驚かそうとしているらしい」"

msgid "\"I got this weird rash a few days ago.\""
msgstr "「数日前から異様な発疹が出てきたんだ」"

msgid ""
"\"I got woke up by mom and dad trembling on their sleep and drooling a lot.  I think "
"it is that weird big crow we ate the other day.  I don't feel too good as well…\""
msgstr ""
"「おきたら、パパとママがガタガタふるえて、よだれをダラダラたらしていた。きっとこの前食"
"べた変な大きなカラスのせいだ。私も気分がよくない...」"

msgid "\"I had a phobia of bees BEFORE they grew to enormous sizes.\""
msgstr "「ハチ恐怖症だったけど、ハチが巨大化したら克服できた」"

msgid "\"I had to do it!\""
msgstr "「仕方なかったんだ！」"

msgid ""
"\"I hate it here.  I want to go home.  Abba and Ima told me things would be okay and "
"we will be here a for a few days and then a bus will come take us and we will be safe "
"but I heard them arguing last night.  Ima cried.  I'm scared.  I wanna go home.\""
msgstr ""
"「ここはイヤだ。いえにかえりたい。アッバもイッマも、だいじょうぶで、もう少しいればバス"
"が来てあんしんだといっていた。でも、きのうの夜は、ケンカをしていた。イッマは泣いてい"
"た。わたしはこわい。いえにかえりたい。」"

msgid "\"I hate you.\""
msgstr "「だいっきらい」"

msgid "\"I have done what you asked.  Please let me go!\""
msgstr "「言われたことはもうやった。放っておいてくれ！」"

msgid "\"I just realized how damn demented those fliers are.\""
msgstr "「ようやく気付いた。チラシにはとんでもなくイカレた事が書いてある」"

msgid "\"I just wanted to help\""
msgstr "お役に立てて嬉しいよ。"

msgid "\"I kept shooting with my handgun, but I never got any better!\""
msgstr "「ハンドガンを撃ち続けているが、状況が一向に良くならない！」"

msgid "\"I love the smell of napalm in the morning.\""
msgstr "「朝のナパーム弾の臭いは格別だ」"

msgid "\"I love you and I'll never forget you.\""
msgstr "「愛してる、一生忘れないよ」"

msgid "\"I love you too.\""
msgstr "「私も愛してるよ」"

msgid "\"I love you!\""
msgstr "「だいすき！」"

msgid "\"I love you.\""
msgstr "「愛しているよ」"

msgid ""
"\"I made mushroom babies.  My arms hurt.  I hurt.  I had mushroom babies.  They are "
"growing now.\""
msgstr ""
"「私にきのこの赤ちゃんができました。腕が痛い。痛い。きのこの赤ちゃん。すくすくそだつ」"

msgid "\"I miss mom and dad.  Where is everyone?\""
msgstr "「ママとパパに会いたい。みんなどこいったの？」"

msgid "\"I need a new lab coat.\""
msgstr "「新しい白衣が必要なんだ」"

msgid "\"I pity the fool who mistakes me for kitten!\", sez Mr. T."
msgstr "「子猫につられて私を取り逃がしたおばかさん、かわいそ！」 Mr.T"

msgid "\"I propose a new currency: 9mm.\""
msgstr "「私は新しい通貨の制定を提案する。9mm弾だ」"

msgid ""
"\"I put my toilet water into a gastank.  Then I poured it into a glass cup.  Then I "
"drank it without vomiting my insides back into the toilet.\""
msgstr ""
"「ガソリンタンクに貯めておいたトイレの水をグラスに注いだ。水にガソリンが混じってトイレ"
"にゲロする、なんてことはなく普通に飲み干せた」"

msgid ""
"\"I saved a puppy that was being harassed by giant bugs the other day.  He is "
"scratching a lot but seems fine, i hope i can keep him.\""
msgstr ""
"「でっかい虫に追いかけられてた子犬を助けてあげた。元気だから飼いたいけど、なんだかかゆ"
"そうにしてる。」"

msgid "\"I saw a huge mushroom yesterday.  I feel itchy.\""
msgstr "「昨日は大きなキノコを見つけた。なんだかかゆい。」"

msgid ""
"\"I saw a zombie covered in shrooms emitting some strange dust.  When another zombie "
"got close, the two tore each other apart.  I'd rather not stay here anymore.  Im "
"packing up my stuff soon.\""
msgstr ""
"「キノコに覆われたゾンビが妙な粉を振りまいているのを見た。別のゾンビが近付き、互いを攻"
"撃し始めた。もうここにはいたくない。すぐに荷物をまとめるつもりだ。」"

msgid ""
"\"I saw millie playing in the playground, but all she does is walk around in circles.\""
msgstr "「ミリーがうんどうじょうであそんでたけど、ずっとぐるぐるあるいてる」"

msgid ""
"\"I saw two huge dragonflies hugging.  It was kinda cute but my brother just said they "
"were having sex.  He's gross.\""
msgstr ""
"「2匹の大きなトンボがハグしてるのをみた。ちょっとかわいいと思ったけど、弟は、セックスし"
"てるんだとか言ってた。ほんとキモい。」"

msgid "\"I shot the sheriff; but I couldn't find the deputy\""
msgstr "「俺は保安官を撃った。だけど助手は見つからない」"

msgid "\"I should never have trusted you!\""
msgstr "「絶対に信じない！」"

msgid ""
"\"I swear to God I've seen these plant things before!  In a book, or something!  I "
"swear…\""
msgstr "「おお神よ、私はあの植物を知っています！本か何かで！間違いない...」"

msgid "\"I think I need to see a doctor.\""
msgstr "「医者に診て貰う必要がありそうだ」"

msgid "\"I think I'll live.\""
msgstr "「何とか生きてはいる...と思うよ」"

msgid "\"I think it's starting to kick in.\""
msgstr "「始まったようだ」"

msgid "\"I think there's something in the air that's keeping us alive.\""
msgstr "「きっと、私らを生かし続ける物質が空気に混じってるんだ」"

msgid "\"I thought my damn terminal cancer was bad enough… now the dead are rising?!\""
msgstr ""
"「末期癌が見つかるなんて最悪の事態だと思っていたけど...今度は死者が生き返っただっ"
"て！？」"

msgid "\"I told you to let me die.\""
msgstr "「死なせてくれと言っただろ」"

msgid ""
"\"I took all the supplies.  Don't follow me.  I'm sorry, man.  I have to look out for "
"myself now.\""
msgstr "「食べ物は全て貰って行く。追って来るな。悪いね、君。私は自分が一番大切なんだ」"

msgid ""
"\"I tried playing memorial music for my dead brother, on a radio.  They must have been "
"attracted to it.  I can't see his grave through the crowd anymore.\""
msgstr ""
"「私はラジオで死んだ兄弟を悼む曲を流したのです。するとおそらく音楽に惹きつけられたので"
"しょう。彼の墓は集まった群衆達によって取り囲まれ、もう見えなくなってしまいました」"

msgid "\"I tried to be a bard, but the rats didn't like my piping.\""
msgstr "「吟遊詩人を目指してみたが、どうやらネズミは私の笛が気に入らないらしい」"

msgid ""
"\"I used to be human.  But… my arms… they are like tentacles.  I slither along akin to "
"a snail and I shed my feathers every day.\""
msgstr ""
"「私は人間だった。でも...私の腕は...触手になった。カタツムリのように這って動くし、羽毛"
"が毎日生え変わる」"

msgid ""
"\"I used to take everything at face value.  If you couldn't measure it, couldn't "
"explain it, couldn't put a number to it, it wasn't real.  Then this shit happened.  "
"Real funny.\""
msgstr ""
"「以前の私は、こんな思想を鵜呑みにしていた。測定できなければ、説明できなければ、数字で"
"表現できなければ、それは現実ではない。それが今じゃこのザマだ。笑うしかないよ」"

msgid "\"I want a hug\""
msgstr "「ハグしてほしい」"

msgid "\"I want mom's pancakes\""
msgstr "「ママのパンケーキがたべたい」"

msgid "\"I want to play with jimmy, why did daddy said to get away from him?\""
msgstr "「ジミーとあそびたい。どうしてパパはジミーからはなれろって言ったんだよ？」"

msgid "\"I want to see daddy\""
msgstr "「パパに会いたい」"

msgid "\"I want to see mommy\""
msgstr "「ママに会いたい」"

msgid ""
"\"I was in high school, you know.\"  Gunny jabs his thumb at his shirt, which reads "
"'Alexander Bullock High'.  \"Most of the way through my junior year.  'My story'?  I "
"got on a bus with my parents, the bus crashed, and everyone died except a few people, "
"most of whom are crammed into this little shelter now.  Who knows when we're getting "
"out.\""
msgstr ""
"「見ての通り、僕は高校生。」ガニーは「アレクサンダー・ブロック高校」とプリントされた"
"シャツを親指で示しました。「もうすぐ2年生が終わるって頃だね。それで、話が聞きたいって？"
"両親と乗り込んだバスが事故って、ほとんど全員が死んだ。生き残りの大半はこの小さな避難所"
"に詰め込まれてる。いつになったら出られるんだろうな。"

msgid "\"I was once a man.  A MAN!\""
msgstr "「私もかつては人間だった。ニンゲンだったのだ！」"

msgid "\"I watched a snail crawl along the edge of a straight razor.\""
msgstr "「カタツムリを見ていた。カミソリの刃の上を這っている」"

msgid "\"I went and keeped only necesary items like dad told me\""
msgstr "「父さんの言ったとおり、必要なものだけもってきた」"

msgid ""
"\"I woke up with a dozen bears in a tribe outside the vault.  One was covered in red "
"markings, glowing-- speaking.\""
msgstr ""
"「気づいたら地下シェルターの外で、十数匹のクマの群れに囲まれていた。一匹は毛皮が血まみ"
"れで、しかも...喋るんだ」"

msgid "\"I wonder if it understands us.\""
msgstr "「アレは私たちの事を理解しているんだろうか」"

msgid ""
"\"I wonder what's in this sarcophagus?  Maybe it's a real sarcophagus.  Maybe there's "
"a big guy named God under here.\""
msgstr ""
"「この石棺の中には何があるんだろう？たぶんこれは本当の棺なんだ。神と呼ばれた偉大な者が"
"眠っているんだ」"

msgid "\"I'll never forget you.\""
msgstr "「決して君を忘れないよ」"

msgid "\"I'm NOT fucking sorry.\""
msgstr "「腹が減った...」"

msgid ""
"\"I'm alone in this shelter now… i can see some people outside but they are just "
"standing there really quiet and not doing anything.  The monsters seems to ignore them "
"too, maybe they will help me?\""
msgstr ""
"「とうとうシェルターに一人ぼっちだ...外に何人か人がいるけど、だまって立ってるだけで、何"
"もしてない。化け物もあの人たちを無視してるみたいだし、もしかしたら、助けてくれるか"
"も？」"

msgid "\"I'm certain it's trying to understand us.\""
msgstr "「私たちの事を理解しようとしている。きっとそうだ」"

msgid "\"I'm coming back for this note in twelve hours.  If I don't, take all my shit!\""
msgstr "「12時間後にこのメモの所へ戻ってくる。戻れなかったらここの物は全部やるよ！」"

msgid "\"I'm fine.\""
msgstr "「平気だ」"

msgid ""
"\"I'm gonna be honest here, I'm really gonna die soon so I dont want to gt forgnottedn "
"ples dont forntget me y nrmmy name is h@@hbhbh\""
msgstr ""
"「正直に言うと、私はもうすぐ死ぬからわたしのなまえわすれないでなまえはふぶふふぶふふ」"

msgid "\"I'm heading to the pool after work.\""
msgstr "「仕事が終わってプールに行くところだよ」"

msgid "\"I'm hungry\""
msgstr "「おなかすいた」"

msgid "\"I'm hungry.\""
msgstr "「腹が減った...」"

msgid "\"I'm not afraid of you!\""
msgstr "「お前なんて怖くないぞ！」"

msgid "\"I'm not convinced it can actually comprehend us.\""
msgstr "「アレが私たちを理解できるとは、到底思えません」"

msgid "\"I'm okay, don't worry about me.\""
msgstr "「大丈夫だ、問題ない」"

msgid ""
"\"I'm puttering around, I always have stuff on the go.\"  Jenny rubs the bridge of her "
"nose briefly, blinking fatigue from her eyes.  \"Gotta keep busy, keep my mind off "
"stuff, you know?\""
msgstr ""
"「意味もなく弄ってるだけ。PCはいつでも持ち歩いてる。」ジェニーは鼻の下を軽くこすり、疲"
"れた目を何度か瞬かせました。「とにかく忙しくしてないと気が休まらない気持ち、分かるで"
"しょ？"

msgid ""
"\"I'm starting to feel bad about disabling all these turrets and stealing their "
"ammunition.\""
msgstr "「全てのタレットの電源を切って弾薬を盗んだのはマズかったかな」"

msgid "\"I'ma cut those fuckin' tentacles off, bitch!\""
msgstr "「その触手を叩き切ってやる、クソが！」"

msgid "\"I've been looking all over for you.\""
msgstr "「ずいぶん捜したんだよ」"

msgid "\"I've got a headache.\""
msgstr "「頭痛がする」"

msgid "\"I've got family coming tomorrow.\""
msgstr "「家族が帰ってくる日を待っているんだ」"

msgid ""
"\"I've heard it's safer across the Mississippi.  Going to start driving today.  If "
"you're reading this, pray for me\""
msgstr ""
"「ミシシッピ州は比較的安全だと聞いた。今から車で向かう。これを読んだ人がいたら、私の無"
"事を祈ってほしい。」"

msgid "\"I've never been very confident, is that why my shots keep missing?\""
msgstr ""
"「こんなに不安になったことは無い、どうしてショットガンをいつまでたっても見つけられない"
"んだろう？」"

msgid "\"I've seen horrors, horrors that you've seen.\""
msgstr "「私は地獄を見た。君が見た地獄を」"

msgid "\"IM OFF TO THUNDERDOME, BYE SUCKERS.\""
msgstr "「サンダードームを去る、さらばクソども」"

msgid "\"IT'S BURIED!  THE TEMPLE IS BURIED!\""
msgstr "「埋まってる！神殿が埋まってる！」"

msgid ""
"\"ITS OKEY GUYS!  I BARRYED A TIME CAPSUL IN MY BACKYARD!  I PUT IN SOME HOEHOES.\""
msgstr "「やぁお前ら！裏庭にタイムカプセルを埋めたぞ！かなり深くに埋めてある」"

msgid ""
"\"If I had a dollar for every cash card I've found, I'd have more money than is on "
"these stupid things!\""
msgstr ""
"「今までに拾った全部のキャッシュカードがドル紙幣だったら、こんなゴミ束よりずっと価値が"
"あったのにな！」"

msgid ""
"\"If you get a parasite, take some sand and some vodka.  Rub the sand into the "
"afflicted area, real good too; like you're washing your hair.  Then rinse with vodka.\""
msgstr ""
"「寄生虫にやられたら、砂とウォッカを飲みなさい。ちょうどシャンプーのように砂が患部を洗"
"うのでとてもよく効く。ウォッカはリンスだ」"

msgid ""
"\"If you see a trail of dirt getting displaced in your direction… run.  Run for your "
"life.\""
msgstr ""
"「もしも汚いものが這った痕を見つけたら...全力で逃げ。命が惜しければすぐに逃げて」"

msgid "\"Illumination disabled, low power.\""
msgstr "「照明が無効です。電力が不足しています。」"

msgid "\"Imagine if this spread to, like, Australia.  Zombie kangaroos.  Haha…\""
msgstr ""
"「想像が膨らむよな。例えば、オーストラリアには、ゾンビカンガルーとか、ハハハ...」"

msgid ""
"\"In case of emergency fill out this form so that you may present it to emergency "
"personnel for identification purposes.  Keep this form with your emergency supplies.  "
"If You need to request new copies of this form, speak with the school safety office.  "
"Remember to keep calm, and stay in one location if possible, this will help emergency "
"personnel to find you.  If this form is found please contact Oak Grove Elementary "
"School.  Name: Aiden.  Parent or Guardian: Mommy Daddy.  Phone number where you can be "
"reached: I don't remember I think it has a 5 in it.  Teacher: Miss daisy.  Current "
"location: I dont no I'm scared, Im hear all alone.  Medical Conditions ie diabetes: I "
"dont no what that is.  Additional Information: Why is everyone acting so weird?!\""
msgstr ""
"「用紙に必要事項を記入し、救急隊員に提示することで、緊急時の本人確認が可能です。この用"
"紙は、非常用持ち出し品と共に保管してください。用紙の再発行が必要な場合は、当校の安全管"
"理課にご相談ください。非常時は落ち着いて、可能な限り移動しないように努めてください。こ"
"の用紙を発見された方は、オーク・グローブ小学校にご連絡ください。氏名: エイデン 両親また"
"は保護者: ママとパパ 連絡が可能な電話番号: おぼえてないけど5なんとかだっけ 担任教諭: デ"
"イジーせんせい 現在地: わかんないこわい一人でいます 持病(糖尿病など): なんてよむかわか"
"らない 追加情報: なんかへんだけどどうなってるの！？」"

msgid "\"Individual instances of U-O Seven-Seven-Three-Four.\""
msgstr "「U-O 7-7-3-4の個別試験」"

msgid "\"Is everything all right?\""
msgstr "「何か問題はないかい？」"

msgid "\"Is it done?  Am I perfect now?\""
msgstr "「完了したのか？超人になれたのか？」"

msgid "\"Is it supposed to rain tomorrow?\""
msgstr "「明日は雨かな？」"

msgid "\"Is robbing a bank easier or harder now that all the guards are undead?\""
msgstr ""
"「警備員共がゾンビになってやがる今、銀行強盗は簡単になったのか難しくなったのか...どっち"
"なんだ？」"

msgid "\"Is that glass electrified?\""
msgstr "「あのガラスには電流でも流れているのか？」"

msgid ""
"\"Is that one pharmaceutical company gonna come out with a, like, cure for this "
"anytime soon?\""
msgstr "「製薬会社は治療薬をすぐに開発してくれるんでしょうか？」"

msgid "\"It all boils down to the Apex Predator.\""
msgstr "「最後に残るのは頂点捕食者」"

msgid "\"It can't follow all of us.\""
msgstr "「これなら追いつかれない」"

msgid "\"It could even be a way of trying to scare us off.\""
msgstr "「もしくは、私たちを追い払おうとしているのかも」"

msgid "\"It does seem to have some form of higher level brain functioning.\""
msgstr "「より高度な脳機能を持っているようだな」"

msgid "\"It doesn't matter how you die.  You're gonna turn into one of them.\""
msgstr "「どいつがどのように死ぬかなんてどうでもいい。どうせ死体の一つになるだけだ」"

msgid "\"It may be a mechanism for attracting prey.\""
msgstr "「獲物を引き寄せるための機能、という可能性もあります」"

msgid ""
"\"It was a pleasure to burn.  It was a special pleasure to see things eaten, to see "
"things blackened and changed.\""
msgstr ""
"「火の色は愉しかった。ものが燃えつき、黒い色に変わっていくのを見るのは、格別の愉しみ"
"だった。」"

msgid "\"It wasn't my fault!\""
msgstr "「私のせいじゃない！」"

msgid "\"It won't hurt a bit.\""
msgstr "「全然痛くないよ」"

msgid "\"It'll be over quick.  I promise.\""
msgstr "「すぐに終わるよ、約束する」"

msgid "\"It's EtERNITy in there\""
msgstr "「そこに誰かいますか？」"

msgid ""
"\"It's always a different dream, but always kind of the same.  I stand in a hallway "
"and knock on a door for a joke, but I can't turn and run when the doorknob starts "
"turning.  I stand up mockingly in class while the teacher's back is turned, but can't "
"seem to sit back down as they turn back to look at me.   I dive into the beautiful, "
"clear ocean, but freeze in place just below the surface as something rises from below "
"to meet me.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Do you feel any guilt about the work you do here, Jason?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"You know I'm not allowed to talk about any specifics.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Of course, but I haven't asked what you're doing, I asked how you feel about it.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I don't feel like we're doing anything wrong here.  On the contrary, I think leaving "
"the work undone would be a thing to feel guilty about.  The untapped potential, the "
"understanding we're building… it will change how we think of the world.  That has to "
"be a good thing, right?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"And yet, in your dreams you feel like a kid caught with their hands in the cookie "
"jar.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I'd rather we drop this line of discussion, Doctor.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Naturally, Jason.  Or would \"Chief Investigator\" make you feel more in control?\""
msgstr ""
"「いつも違うんだけど、どことなく似た感じの夢を見る。通路に立ってて、いたずらで扉をノッ"
"クするんだけど、ドアノブが回り始めても体が動かず、逃げ出せない。授業中に、先生が板書し"
"てる間にふざけて立ち上がるんだけど、先生がこっちを振り返っても、座って誤魔化せない。綺"
"麗に澄んだ海に飛び込んでも、水中から登ってきた何かが邪魔になって、水面スレスレで体が固"
"まってしまう」\n"
"\n"
"「ジェイソンさん、この仕事に罪悪感がありますか？」\n"
"\n"
"「具体的な話はできないって、知ってるだろ」\n"
"\n"
"「もちろんそうですが、私はあなたの業務内容ではなく、業務についてどう感じているかを聞き"
"たいんです」\n"
"\n"
"「悪いことをしているとはまったく思っていない。逆に、徹底的にやらなかったことに罪悪感を"
"覚えることすらある。手つかずの可能性、私たちが構築している情報...それらは、世界に対する"
"考え方を変えるものだ。いい方向にね？」\n"
"\n"
"「それなのに、夢の中ではつまみ食いがバレた子供のような気分になってしまう、と」\n"
"\n"
"「先生、この話はもう止めにしないか」\n"
"\n"
"「ジェイソンさん、それでも構いませんが、カウンセリングより『調査主任』の業務中の方が自"
"分を制御できていると考えていますか？」"

msgid "\"It's faster than us.\""
msgstr "「僕らより素早いね」"

msgid "\"It's heading right for us!\""
msgstr "「こっちに向かってくる！」"

msgid "\"It's just a scratch.\""
msgstr "「こんなのかすり傷さ」"

msgid "\"It's just repeating us.\""
msgstr "「言葉を真似してるぞ」"

msgid "\"It's looking for us.\""
msgstr "「私たちを探してるよ」"

msgid "\"It's looking right at us.\""
msgstr "「こっちを見てるよ」"

msgid "\"It's parroting us, but we're uncertain as to how or why.\""
msgstr "「確かに言葉を真似ていますが、何故、どんな方法で、ということが分かりません」"

msgid "\"It's probably more scared of us than we are of it.\""
msgstr "「きっと我々がアレを恐れる以上に、アレも我々の事を恐れていますよ」"

msgid "\"It's so cold.\""
msgstr "「寒くてたまらない」"

msgid ""
"\"It's tense here, but I don't know.  Stan, Boris and I have been pretty insular.  I "
"guess we'd better get to know some of the others here eventually.\"  He looks around "
"the room, his eyes dull.  \"It feels it should be a temporary stop, but it's starting "
"to look like we'll be here for the long term.  If we live that long.\""
msgstr ""
"「緊張感はあるが、よく分からない。スタンとボリスと私の3人で固まっているからね。他の人達"
"とも交流した方が良いとは思っているんだ。」彼はぼんやりと室内を見渡しました。「センター"
"での滞在は一時的なものだと思っていたけど、もっと長い時間を過ごすことになりそうだ。"
"まぁ、長生きできればの話だけど。"

msgid "\"I… I feel weak…\""
msgstr "「な...なんだかフラフラする...」"

msgid ""
"\"Joe's Diner; 1/2 pound of meat, 3 toppings, 'your choice', all with a side of "
"freedom fries and a BIG Gulp size pop.\""
msgstr ""
"「ジョーズ・ダイナー；肉1/2ポンド、3種のトッピング(お好みで)、全てのメニューにフリーダ"
"ム・フライとLLサイズの炭酸飲料がセット」"

msgid "\"Just a little.\""
msgstr "「ほんの少しだけね」"

msgid "\"Just because it doesn't look like you doesn't mean that it isn't.\""
msgstr "「しかし、外見が僕らとかけ離れているからといって、知性が無いとは限らない」"

msgid "\"Just being an alien creature doesn't mean it's intelligent.\""
msgstr "「地球外生命体だからといって、知性があるとは限りませんよ」"

msgid "\"KASHWAK: NO-FO\""
msgstr "「カシュワク＝圏外」"

msgid "\"Katty is feeling bad, mommy hasn't returned\""
msgstr "「キャティーは気分がわるそう、ママは帰ってこない」"

msgid "\"Keep your hands up!\""
msgstr "「そのまま手を上げ続けろ！」"

msgid "\"Kick the bucket, filthy dead!\""
msgstr "「汚らわしい死人め、くたばれ！」"

msgid "\"Kill them all and let God sort them out!\""
msgstr "「皆殺しにしろ。仕分けは神に任せろ」"

msgid ""
"\"Killed a giant worm thing, but now I'm only three feet tall.  Should've just left "
"the damn worm alone, now none of my clothes fit!\""
msgstr ""
"「気味の悪いニョロニョロしたものと戦っていたら、身長が90cmまで縮んでしまった。あんな"
"忌々しい化け物は放っておけばよかった。どの服もサイズがブカブカだ！」"

msgid "\"LEAVE!  NOW!\""
msgstr "「出て行け！今すぐに！」"

msgid "\"LIGO and spatial compression.\""
msgstr "工業用コンプレッサー"

msgid "\"Last one standing.  It's good feeling.  I win.  I win I win I win I win I win\""
msgstr ""
"「最後に残るのは一人だけ。いい感じだ。私が勝つぞ。勝つぞ勝つぞ勝つぞ勝つぞ勝つぞ」"

msgid "\"Lemme outta here!\""
msgstr "「ここから出せっての！」"

msgid "\"Lend us a fiver 'til Thursday\", pleas Andy Capp."
msgstr "「木曜日まで5ドル貸してくれないか？」とアンディ・キャップが嘆願しています。"

msgid "\"Let me have a look at it.\""
msgstr "「ちょっと見せてみてよ」"

msgid "\"Let me see your hands!\""
msgstr "「手を広げてこちらに見せろ！」"

msgid "\"Let us help you.\""
msgstr "「あなたを助けてあげたい。」"

msgid "\"Let's have a tea party!\""
msgstr "「お茶会を開きましょう！」"

msgid "\"Let's have fun!\""
msgstr "「楽しみましょう！」"

msgid "\"Let's play together!\""
msgstr "「一緒に遊びましょう！」"

msgid "\"Let's play… Russian roulette.\""
msgstr "「一緒に...ロシアンルーレットで遊びましょう」"

msgid "\"Libraries are useless after the apocalypse.\""
msgstr "「図書館なんて大変動が起きてからは無用の長物だな」"

msgid "\"Like we said, we have no idea what it's thinking.\""
msgstr "「言った通り、何を考えているのかさっぱりだろう」"

msgid ""
"\"Lisa always was a fan of sports.  Thank God these Global Athletics Games in Harran "
"started some time before the outbreak, so she was able to leave New England before it "
"was quarantined.  I can only hope there are no zombies, as we do have here, in the "
"city she flew to.\""
msgstr ""
"「リサはスポーツが好きだった。事件前からハラン市で国際陸上競技の大会が開催されていたの"
"で、彼女はニューイングランドを離れていた。あっちにはゾンビがおらず、彼女が無事でいるこ"
"とを願う」"

msgid ""
"\"Local auto shop is full of the things.  And to think I worked with them on repairing "
"cars… now they're just… fucking corpses.\""
msgstr ""
"「地元の自動車整備工場なら物資がたくさんある。ついでに車の修理も手伝ってもらおうと思っ"
"ていたが...着いてみたら...死体しかなかった」"

msgid "\"Look at this fuckin' shit we're in, man.\""
msgstr "「まるで地獄じゃないか」"

msgid "\"Look out!\""
msgstr "「気をつけろ！」"

msgid "\"Look, it's responding!\""
msgstr "「見ろ、返事をした！」"

msgid ""
"\"Lots of new easy ways to burn calories now.  Fighting animata, managing the fields, "
"running with my wings buzzing, and more.\""
msgstr ""
"「カロリーを簡単に消費する方法を思いついた。激しく戦ったり、現場監督をやったり、羽をバ"
"タつかせながら走ったり、他にもいろいろ」"

msgid "\"MEAT!\""
msgstr "「肉！」"

msgid "\"MY GLITTERING SNAKE COMPELS YOU!  OBEY!\""
msgstr "「俺のきらめくヘビが怖いだろう！従え！」"

msgid "\"Mail Routing and the Domain System\" by Craig Partridge."
msgstr "クレイグ・パートリッジ著「メールルーティングとドメインシステム」です。"

msgid "\"Makayla Sanchez burned down my fucking house\""
msgstr "「マケイラ・サンチェスが自宅を燃やしやがった」"

msgid ""
"\"Make sure you strip the house for all available resources-- tubes, pipes, ceramics, "
"sheets, strings, and more\""
msgstr ""
"「利用できるすべての資源を確保しろ--ゴムホース、パイプ、セラミック、シーツ、糸、他」"

msgid "\"Make sure your car is REALLY stopped before you get out.\""
msgstr "「降りる前に車が間違いなく止まっているかどうかを確認しろ」"

msgid "\"May I have a cookie?\""
msgstr "「クッキーを食べてもいい？」"

msgid "\"Me go, you stay.\""
msgstr "「ワタシ、イク。キミ、クルナ」"

msgid ""
"\"Me?  I trained at MIT in mechanical engineering, I worked for a long time as senior "
"engineer at Marduk Thermal in Rhode Island.  It was a good job, but I landed my dream "
"gig at Boston Dynamics and moved up north to start there.\"  She tips back her head "
"and lets out a long, wistful sigh.  \"I had just finished my orientation and was going "
"to start work when the riots started.  Just my damn luck.\""
msgstr ""
"「私？MITで機械工学の勉強をして、ロードアイランド州のマーダック・ターミナル社で上級エン"
"ジニアとしてしばらく働いてた。いい職場だったけど、夢を実現するためボストン・ダイナミク"
"スに転職して、心機一転、北上してきたの。」彼女は天を仰ぎ、長い溜息をつきました。「ちょ"
"うどオリエンテーションが終わって、さあ仕事を始めるぞって時に暴動が始まってね。運が悪す"
"ぎでしょ。"

msgid "\"Members of the species have some kind of neurocognitive link.\""
msgstr "「この生物は、認知神経をリンクできるようだ」"

msgid ""
"\"Mike, we have your dog and that ginger fuck you run around with.  You know where to "
"find us.  Come alone, it's time to pay up.\""
msgstr ""
"「マイクへ。イヌは預かった。元気に走り回っているぞ。どこにいるかは分かってるんだ。一人"
"で来い。清算の時が来た」"

msgid ""
"\"Mom fell asleep in the bathtub.  I keep trying to wake her up but she's getting cold."
"\""
msgstr "「ママがおふろでねちゃった。おこそうとしてるけどおきないしつめたい。」"

msgid ""
"\"Mom is acting weird.  She thinks I'm 2 and that Mike still lives here and that she's "
"still married to dad.  It's like my little sister doesn't exist to her so I have to "
"take care of her now.  She's just a baby and it's so hard.\""
msgstr ""
"「ママが変になった。私が2才で、マイクがここに今も住んでて、パパとも離婚してないと思って"
"る。妹はムシされてるから、私が世話をしないといけない。まだ赤ちゃんだからとても大変。」"

msgid ""
"\"Mom went to pick up Cristy early from school today, but she isn't back yet.  I don't "
"know why the monster outside is wearing her face.\""
msgstr ""
"「ママは今日、学校へ早めにクリスティを迎えに行ったけど、まだ帰ってこない。外にいる怪物"
"がママの顔をしてるのはなんでだろう。」"

msgid "\"Mom, I miss you.\""
msgstr "「母さん、会えなくて寂しいよ」"

msgid "\"Mom.\""
msgstr "「母さん」"

msgid "\"Mommy cried the other day… I don't want to be here anymore.\""
msgstr "「この前もママは泣いてた...もうここにいたくない。」"

msgid ""
"\"Mommy is behind me forcing me to draw and write notes.  I don't know why, but she "
"has been acting weirder everyday, and I think she hurt daddy… I'm scared im scared, "
"someone help, im scared im… (The rest of the note seems to be endless begging for help "
"until it ends in a bloody smear)\""
msgstr ""
"「ママがわたしの後ろから、ずっと絵をかけとか作文をかけとか怒ってきます。どうしてか分か"
"らないけど、ママは毎日おかしくて、パパをぶったみたいで...怖い、怖い、誰か助けて、助け"
"て、怖い、怖い、怖い、(延々と助けを求めており、記述の最後は血にまみれて読み取れな"
"い。)」"

msgid "\"Mommy, help!\""
msgstr "「お母さーん、助けてぇ！」"

msgid "\"Mommy, where are you?  I miss you…\""
msgstr "「おかあさん、どこ？会いたいよ...」"

msgid "\"Mommy?\""
msgstr "「ママ？」"

msgid ""
"\"Most things can be taken out with a shotgun.  More things can be taken out with a "
"grenade.  Imagine what a mini-nuke does.\""
msgstr ""
"「ほとんどの人は散弾銃を手にした。さらに手榴弾を手にした人もいた。では、小型核爆弾はど"
"うだろう」"

msgid "\"Move along!  Nothing to see here!\""
msgstr "「もう行けよ！ここには何も無い！」"

msgid ""
"\"My cousin says that murder nowadays is just a war crime.  War for what, I don't "
"know, since the undead seem to be rebels without a cause.\""
msgstr ""
"「こんな状況じゃ殺人も戦争犯罪だな、従兄がそう言っていた。不死者どもは理由もなく襲い掛"
"かってくる。これは何のための戦争なんだ。」"

msgid "\"My next-door neighbor had a katana in his basement!\""
msgstr "「なんて幸運だ！隣人が地下室に刀を隠していたなんて！」"

msgid "\"My previous owner squealed like a pig when I gutted her!\""
msgstr "「前のごしゅじんさまは、ブタみたいに鳴きながらハラワタぶちまけてたよ！」"

msgid "\"My skin is crawling and I teleport every few minutes… what is going o\""
msgstr "「肌がむずむずして数分おきにテレポートしている...何が起こ」"

msgid ""
"\"My window lit up at midnight.  I tried seeing what it was but it broke.  My ears "
"hurt.\""
msgstr "「夜中に窓が光った。見ようとしたけど、壊れたみたい。耳が痛い。」"

msgid "\"Negative.\""
msgstr "「違うな」"

msgid "\"No officer on scene.  Requesting backup!\""
msgstr "「警官が見つかりません。予備人員を要請中！」"

msgid ""
"\"No wonder all the camps got overrun, they kept a goddamn zombie test subject!  Each "
"and every one of 'em!\""
msgstr ""
"「キャンプがゾンビで溢れてるのはそこで実験をしていたからだったなんて！そりゃゾンビの巣"
"窟にもなるわ！」"

msgid "\"No!  Stop!\""
msgstr "「だめだ！止まれ！」"

msgid "\"No!\""
msgstr "「駄目だ！」"

msgid "\"No!\" says the bit."
msgstr "ビットが「No！」と言っています。"

msgid "\"Nobody is helping us.\""
msgstr "「誰も助けてくれない」"

msgid ""
"\"Not sure if my companion WANTED to turn into a bird, but I was the one giving her "
"the serum, and I saved her life!  That's fair, right?\""
msgstr ""
"「私の友達が鳥に変身したがっていたかどうかは知らない。でも、私は彼女に薬液を注射して命"
"を救ってあげた！間違ってないよね？」"

msgid "\"Not that way!  Go left!\""
msgstr "「そっちじゃない！左に進め！」"

msgid "\"No… stop the burning!\""
msgstr "「やめろ...もう燃やすな！」"

msgid "\"Of course it is.\""
msgstr "「ええ、良いですよ」"

msgid "\"Of course… it's all fractals!\""
msgstr "「もちろん...全てがフラクタルになる！」"

msgid ""
"\"Offroad\" is a rough estimate of how efficient your vehicle moves when not on "
"pavement.  Your vehicle's safe speed, top speed, and acceleration are multiplied by "
"roughly the offroad percentage value when your vehicle is not on the pavement.  The "
"offroad percentage decreases as vehicle mass increases, and increases with the size "
"and number of wheels.  Tank treads will give your vehicle an excellent offroad "
"percentage but your vehicle will be slower due to the treads' very high rolling drag."
msgstr ""
"「未舗装道」は、舗装されていない道路を走行する際の移動効率の概算数値です。未舗装道を走"
"行する際は、車両の安全速度、最高速度、加速度に未舗装道の数値のパーセンテージが乗算され"
"ます。未舗装道の数値は、車両の質量が増えると減少し、ホイールのサイズと数が増えると増加"
"します。キャタピラは未舗装道での性能が極めて高い部品ですが、転がり抵抗も高いため、非常"
"に低速でしか走行できません。"

msgid "\"Oh God, I'm the only one left.\""
msgstr "「何てこった、置いてけぼりにされた」"

msgid "\"Oh God, my leg, Oh God!\""
msgstr "「なんてことだ、脚が...おおぉ！」"

msgid "\"Oh God, what's happening?\""
msgstr "「おお、何が起こってる？」"

msgid "\"Oh you motherfucking shellfish, you're going down.\""
msgstr "「ふざけたカニの化け物め、死にかけじゃないか」"

msgid "\"Oh, how fun!\""
msgstr "「あぁ楽しい！」"

msgid "\"Oi, dingus, you can't keep me in 'ere.\""
msgstr "「おい、よく分からん奴、捕まえられるもんか」"

msgid "\"Okay.\""
msgstr "「了解だ」"

msgid "\"Om nom nom!  Delicious!\""
msgstr "「ムシャムシャ、美味しいね！」"

msgid "\"On this spot in 1962, Henry Winkler was sick.\""
msgstr "「1962年、ヘンリー･ウィンクラー、この地で病に倒れる」"

msgid "\"Only a few more days 'til the weekend.\""
msgstr "「もうちょっとで週末だよ」"

msgid "\"Other dangers\" is a little vague.  Do you have anything more substantial?"
msgstr "「その他の危険」とは曖昧だな。もっと役立つ情報はないのか？"

msgid "\"Over here!\""
msgstr "「こっちだ！」"

msgid "\"PINK TALL ONES RUN RUN RUN RUN RUN\""
msgstr "「ピンクのおおきななにか。にげろにげろにげろ」"

msgid "\"Papaya!\""
msgstr "「パパイヤ！」"

msgid "\"Please don't.\""
msgstr "「お願い、やめて。」"

msgid "\"Please help me.\""
msgstr "「おねがい、助けて」"

msgid "\"Please open the door and enter the cell.\""
msgstr "「ドアを開けて、部屋に入ってください」"

msgid ""
"\"Please state your name and ID for the record.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Dr. Maria Catarina Gonzales, S-7531.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Thank you, Doctor.  You know why we're here, don't you?  Please tell us about your "
"previous project supervisor.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Ruslan was…\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Ruslan?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I'm sorry, Dr. Lavochkin was extremely enthusiastic about our research when I "
"arrived in the facility.  That enthusiasm had a way of dragging people with him, you "
"know?  We wanted to see our subjects as he did, full of wonder and untapped potential."
"\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Did he ever tell you what it was that you were working on?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Not really, no.  We were to \"characterize the effects of need-to-knowium on a wide "
"range of living subjects\" was his little joke, back when he made jokes.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"When did that change?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"He became a lot more distant when we began testing PE050 and PE150, the intravenous "
"formulation.  He sent us back to the pods way before he left the lab, and he started "
"muttering about \"preparing the world\" for something under his breath.  That "
"coincided with him requisitioning more… exotic test subjects.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"How did he rationalize those?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"He could be very convincing, and we were happy to see that spark again.  You want to "
"hear about the centipedes, right?  L.coeculus are parthenogenetic and completely lack "
"social behavior, making them a reasonable long-term subjects for PE050's \"societal "
"predisposition\" effects, as we liked to call it.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Do you still consider that decision \"reasonable\"?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Not in the light of what happened, I suppose.  But your people kicking in the "
"observation room's door and starting shooting wasn't the most reasonable course of "
"action either, if we're being honest.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We're not here to review the actions of Security on that day.  Did he ever mention "
"anywhere he could be hiding?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We weren't close, so no he didn't share the location of his secret treehouse.  With "
"those things in tow he shouldn't be too hard to find though -- just follow the song of "
"the centipedes.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Thank you for the advice, Doctor.  I am to inform you that you are restricted to "
"your residential pod until the review of your involvement in the incident is "
"concluded.  You are expected to finish any remaining reports in the meantime, but your "
"workstation will be isolated from the facility network otherwise.\""
msgstr ""
"「記録のために、お名前とIDをお願いします」\n"
"\n"
"「マリア・カタリナ・ゴンザレス博士、S-7531」\n"
"\n"
"「ありがとうございます、ドクター。なぜここにいるのか、お分かりですね？以前参加されてい"
"たプロジェクトの管理者について、お聞かせください」\n"
"\n"
"「ルスランは...」\n"
"\n"
"「ルスラン？」\n"
"\n"
"「失礼、ラヴォシュキン博士は、私がこの施設に来た当初から熱心に研究に取り組まれていまし"
"た。人を惹きつける、熱意を持った方でした。ラヴォシュキン博士のように、驚きと可能性に満"
"ちた被験者を調べたいと、皆が思っていました」\n"
"\n"
"「詳しい研究内容を本人から聞いたことは？」\n"
"\n"
"「いいえ、ありません。ジョークが好きな方で、研究内容についても『様々な生物に対する重要"
"キミツニウムの影響を調べている』と冗談を仰ってました」\n"
"\n"
"「様子が変わったのはいつ頃？」\n"
"\n"
"「PE050とPE150の静脈注射用製剤の試験を始めた頃から、孤立しがちになりました。私たちを早"
"めに研究室から帰したり、息を荒げて『世界を作り出す』といったことを呟いたり。彼がより..."
"特異な被験体を多く寄越すよう要求し始めた時期と重なります」\n"
"\n"
"「彼はその要求をどのように正当化したのでしょう？」\n"
"\n"
"「説得がとても上手な方でしたから。また何か思い付いたんだろうと、私も嬉しく思っていまし"
"た。ムカデには詳しいですか？トゲイシムカデ属コエクルス種は単為生殖が可能かつ真社会性で"
"はないため、PE050がもつ『社会的素因』効果の長期試験に適した被験体とされているんです"
"よ」\n"
"\n"
"「事件時の判断は『合理的』だったと、今でもお思いですか？」\n"
"\n"
"「起きてしまった事を考えれば、違いますね。ですが、あなた方が観察室のドアを蹴破って発砲"
"を始めたことも、正直言って、まったく合理的とは言えません」\n"
"\n"
"「これは、セキュリティの行動を検証するための聞き取りではありませんよ。彼は、何か潜伏場"
"所などを言っていませんでしたか？」\n"
"\n"
"「そこまで親しくなかったので、秘密基地の場所は教えてもらっていません。でも...ムカデの鳴"
"き声を辿っていけば、簡単に見つかるかも」\n"
"\n"
"「ご助言ありがとうございます、ドクター。あなたの活動範囲は現在居住区内のみに制限されて"
"います。事件への関与について調査が完了するまでは、残った報告書の作成に取り組んでくださ"
"い。情報端末についても、ネットワークからの隔離措置を取らせていただきます」"

msgid ""
"\"Please state your name for the record.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Fuck off.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"You are in possession of a fake driver's license issued to one Jonathan Smith, which "
"is the alias you applied for employment with in our facility.  We will find out your "
"real name in time, but I'll refer to you as Mr. Smith for this interview.  Is that "
"acceptable, Mr. Smith?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Fuck off.  I want to talk to my lawyer.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"You don't have a lawyer.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I know my rights, shithead.  You won't get a word out of me before I talk to my "
"lawyer.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"You seem to be confused about your situation, Mr. Smith.  As far as the world is "
"concerned you stopped existing the moment you entered this facility, and as far as we "
"are concerned you stopped having rights as soon as you tried to access areas above "
"your provisional clearance.  Let me present your options going forward:  You continue "
"withholding information from us and you will suffer a meticulously-documented accident "
"leaving no doubt to your demise even though no body will ever be found.  Or you "
"cooperate fully and without hesitation, in which case you will get to see the sky "
"again and act like nothing has happened.  Am I understood?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"…yes.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Please state your name for the record.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"M-my name is Thomas Wright.  I'm a, uh, a freelance journalist.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"What were you trying to accomplish in this facility, Mr. Wright?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"There was th-this guy offering good money for some pictures from the inside of this "
"place.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"I don't suppose this man told you his name?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"No, no… He just handed me the application forms and the license, paid quarter up "
"front, and said to bring the pictures to the same spot in a week's time.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"What did he say to expect here?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"This place is… look, you can't expect people not to talk about it, right?  You can't "
"just put up a warehouse of a shipping company nobody's heard of practically overnight "
"and act like it was always here.  He said you guys were a, uh, top secret prison for "
"political prisoners.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"That explains your attempts to clumsily pick the first closed door you came across.  "
"How did your employer contact you?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"A friend of a friend gave him my number, at least according to him.  If you haven't "
"noticed in here times are tough, so I couldn't really afford to be picky about work "
"even before he started throwing cash around.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Very well.  While we verify that account my colleagues here will take you through a "
"tour of our facility:  You will take photographs with your \"hidden\" camera when and "
"where they instruct you to.  You will submit these pictures for review and remain in "
"our custody until we can be certain of your compliance.  You will be released and at "
"the appointed time you will hand over the pictures to your employer.  You will not "
"mention this conversation to them, or to anybody outside of this room.  You will enjoy "
"your well-earned payment, far away from this facility.  Am I understood?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Yes, sir, I can do that.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Excellent, Mr. Wright.  I look forward to never seeing you again.\""
msgstr ""
"「記録しますので、お名前とIDをどうぞ」\n"
"\n"
"「クソッタレ」\n"
"\n"
"「あなたはジョナサン・スミスという名の運転免許証を所持されていますが、これはあなたが当"
"施設で雇用申請をした際の偽名ですね。本名はいずれ判明するでしょうが、今回の面談ではスミ"
"スさんとお呼びします。よろしいですか、スミスさん？」\n"
"\n"
"「クソが。弁護士と話をさせろ」\n"
"\n"
"「弁護士はおりません」\n"
"\n"
"「弁護士を呼ぶ権利があるだろ、知ってんだぞ、クソ。弁護士と相談するまで何も言わない」\n"
"\n"
"「ご自分の状況を理解しておられないようですね、スミスさん。我々としては、あなたが当施設"
"に入った瞬間に世界から存在が消え、暫定クリアランス以上の区画に侵入しようとした時点であ"
"らゆる権利を失ったと考えています。今後あなたが取りうる選択肢を提示しましょう。情報提供"
"を拒み続け、事故に遭い、死体は発見されないものの間違いなく死亡したと詳細に記録される。"
"もしくは、全面的に協力し、再び現世に帰り、何事もなかったように生活する。ご理解いただけ"
"ましたか？」\n"
"\n"
"「...分かった」\n"
"\n"
"「では、記録しますので、お名前をどうぞ」\n"
"\n"
"「な、名前は、トーマス・ライト。ふ、ふ、フリーのジャーナリスト」\n"
"\n"
"「ライトさん、この施設で何をしようとしていたのですか？」\n"
"\n"
"「な、内部の写真を撮ったら、大金をくれるって依頼で」\n"
"\n"
"「依頼者の名前は？」\n"
"\n"
"「さ、さあね...申請書と免許証を渡されて、前金で25セント貰って、1週間後に同じ場所に写真"
"を持ってこいって言われた」\n"
"\n"
"「施設内に何があると聞かされた？」\n"
"\n"
"「そ、それは...噂になってるに決まってんだろ？聞いたこともない運送会社の倉庫が一晩で生え"
"てきて、昔から建ってました、なんて顔したってさ。そいつの話では、せ、せ、政治犯の、秘密"
"刑務所だって」\n"
"\n"
"「なるほど、目についた扉を不用意に開けようとしたのはそういう訳か。依頼者とはどのように"
"連絡を取った？」\n"
"\n"
"「友達の友達から、俺の電話番号を聞いたらしい。最近景気が悪いから、前金がショボくても、"
"こだわってられなかったんだ」\n"
"\n"
"「よし。依頼者について調査する間、他のスタッフに施設内を案内させよう。指定された地点"
"で、隠し撮り風に写真を撮れ。撮影した写真は審査のため一度提出し、規約が遵守されているこ"
"とが確認できるまで我々の管理下に置く。それが終わったらここを出て、指定された時間に写真"
"を依頼者に渡せ。この話は、依頼者はもちろん、施設外の誰にも漏らすな。なるべく遠方へ向か"
"い、そいつから貰った報酬で楽しめ。理解できたか？」\n"
"\n"
"「はい、言う通りにします」\n"
"\n"
"「物分かりが良くて助かるよ、ライトさん。二度と顔を合わさないことを願っている」"

msgid "\"Please take me with you!\""
msgstr "「一緒に連れて行って！」"

msgid "\"Please, God.\""
msgstr "「神様、どうか私を許して下さい」"

msgid "\"Please, I don't want to die.\""
msgstr "「やめて、死にたくない」"

msgid "\"Please, don't!\""
msgstr "「お願いだ、やめてくれ！」"

msgid ""
"\"Please, kill me!\", followed by an electronic voice saying \"SELF PRESERVATION "
"PROTOCOLS ACTIVATED\""
msgstr ""
"「頼む、私を殺してくれ！」という叫び声の後に「ジコホゾンプロトコルヲサドウシマシタ」と"
"いう電子音声が聞こえました。"

msgid "\"Please, take me with you.\""
msgstr "「お願いだ、一緒に連れて行ってくれ」"

msgid "\"Police inbound.  Stay where you are!\""
msgstr "「警察が到着する。そのまま動くな！」"

msgid "\"Positive.\""
msgstr "「まったくだな」"

msgid "\"Problem solving, memory retention, that sort of thing.\""
msgstr "「問題の解決や、記憶の保持、そういったことだ」"

msgid "\"Proud to be an American.\""
msgstr "「アメリカ人万歳！」"

msgid "\"Put it down!  We can talk about this…\""
msgstr "「もう止めて！お互い話し合おう...」"

msgid "\"RUSSIA DID THIS\""
msgstr "「これはロシアの仕業」"

msgid "\"Raagh!\""
msgstr "「グアァ！」"

msgid "\"Reading is good!  Never stop reading.  Read EVERYTHING.\""
msgstr "「読書はいいぞ！読書を続けよう。全てを読み尽くそう」"

msgid "\"Red\""
msgstr "\"赤\""

msgid "\"Remain where you are!\""
msgstr "「その場で動くな！」"

msgid ""
"\"Renting out my rat tunnels for 50 9mm rounds a night.  I dug them with my own claws, "
"so you know they're the best.\""
msgstr ""
"「夜のうちに私のネズミ穴に隠しておいた50発の9mm弾を貸してあげよう。穴は自分の爪で掘った"
"んだけど、すごくいい出来だよ」"

msgid "\"Requesting assistance!\""
msgstr "「応援を要請中！」"

msgid "\"Requesting supervisor!\""
msgstr "「管理者を要請中！」"

msgid ""
"\"River water around these parts is extremely safe.  Probably more safe than the damn "
"tap water at this point.\""
msgstr "「川の水はおそらく安全です。あの忌々しい水道水よりは」"

msgid "\"Robot may not injure kitten, or, through inaction, …\""
msgstr ""
"「ロボットは子猫に危害を加えてはならない。また、子猫の危険を看過してはならない...」"

msgid "\"Run!\""
msgstr "「逃げろ！」"

msgid "\"Run… chase… eat…\""
msgstr "「走って...追いかけて...食べる...」"

msgid "\"SHOOT YOURSELF, LET IT END QUICKLY\""
msgstr "「自分自身を撃て。それで全てが終わる」"

msgid "\"STAY AWAY FROM CONCORD\""
msgstr "「コンコードから離れろ」"

msgid "\"STAY AWAY FROM THE BIG ONES IN THE FOREST\""
msgstr "「森にはデカイのがいるから近付くんじゃねぇぞ」"

msgid "\"STOP FOLLOWING ME I CAN HEAR YOU IN THE DARK\""
msgstr "「ついてくるのは止めろ暗闇でも音は聞こえてるぞ」"

msgid "\"STOP IN THE NAME OF THE LAW!!!\""
msgstr "「法の名において静止を命じる！！！」"

msgid "\"STOP RESISTING!!!\""
msgstr "「抵抗を止めろ！！！」"

msgid "\"STOP!\""
msgstr "「止まれ！」"

msgid "\"SWAMPS RUN SWAMPS NO SWAMPS RUN\""
msgstr "「沼　逃げろ 沼は嫌 沼　逃げろ」"

msgid ""
"\"Saw a boy couldnt be older than 16.  Walked straight through the mushroom tower.  "
"THROUGH IT\""
msgstr ""
"「中学生にもなっていないぐらいの男の子を見かけた。キノコの塔のすぐ傍を通り過ぎて行っ"
"た。そう、まったく無事に通り過ぎたんだよ」"

msgid ""
"\"Saw some chick in the forest.  Her body is all green and shit, and she was covered "
"in leaves and vines.\""
msgstr "「森の中で若い女を見かけた。全身の皮膚が緑色で、葉や蔓に覆われていた」"

msgid ""
"\"School bus with solar panels = TRUST.  Gave us berries and seeds, we were out of "
"food\""
msgstr ""
"「ソーラーパネルを付けたスクールバスは信用できる。食べ物がなくなって困っていたが、果実"
"と種を分けてくれた」"

msgid ""
"\"See if you want to be, extra annoying you can, nod off to the, dump and go, help, "
"Erin to dig up the, last, peice\""
msgstr ""
"「たとえば貴方に すこしだけでも けっして諦めぬ おもいが有れば より強くだいた んに食いつ"
"ない でいけるだろう」"

msgid "\"See you later.\""
msgstr "「また後で」"

msgid "\"See you tonight.\""
msgstr "「また今夜ね」"

msgid "\"See you… IN HELL!\""
msgstr "「さようなら...地獄で会おうね！」"

msgid "\"Seven o'clock.\""
msgstr "「7時だ」"

msgid "\"Shit!\""
msgstr "「ちくしょう！」"

msgid "\"Shit.\""
msgstr "「ちくしょう」"

msgid "\"Shows a noted preference for human brain tissue.\""
msgstr "「人間の脳組織に対する顕著な反応」"

msgid "\"Sing with me!\""
msgstr "「一緒に歌おうよ！」"

msgid "\"Slingshot right through the windshield k?\""
msgstr "「フロントガラス越しにスリングショットを使え、いいな？」"

msgid "\"So, what is this thing supposed to be, exactly?\""
msgstr "「ええと、一体これは何だ？」"

msgid ""
"\"Some bridges, they're right next to each other, right?  If you see something up "
"ahead one of those, just careen through to the other side.  My van was long enough to "
"bridge right across!\""
msgstr ""
"「たまに、途中で途切れている橋があるだろ？橋の先が見えるぐらいの近さだったら、思い切っ"
"てかっ飛ばして通ってみるんだ。私のバンは途切れた橋を渡れるぐらい長かったよ！」"

msgid ""
"\"Some guy is walking through the horde without a scratch.  Please tell me they're "
"docile now.  Please fucking tell me.\""
msgstr ""
"「群れの傍を無傷で通り抜けた男を見た。奴らをおとなしくする方法を教えてくれ。頼むから教"
"えてくれ」"

msgid ""
"\"Some of 'em are big.  Real big.  Don't stick around, I saw my mate get fucking torn "
"in half!\""
msgstr ""
"「奴はクソデカい。マジでクソデカい。仲間がクソ真っ二つに引き裂かれたのを見ちまった。ク"
"ソが」"

msgid ""
"\"Some plant vines started chasin after me, so I took a gas mask and some teargas and "
"I ran through them.\""
msgstr ""
"「後ろから追いかけてくる蔓がいたから、ガスマスクと催涙ガスを持ってきて、それを使って逃"
"げてきた」"

msgid "\"Somehow, I doubt that.\""
msgstr "「なんだか、信じられないな」"

msgid ""
"\"Sometimes what you need when you're infected, bleeding, sick and hungover is a J and "
"some chips.\""
msgstr ""
"「感染症や病気や二日酔いになったときに、たまに欲しくなるのがマリファナとポテトチップ"
"ス」"

msgid "\"Sorry.\""
msgstr "「すまない」"

msgid ""
"\"So… what happens if the military rescues us?  We're all freaks by now, right?  How "
"the fuck are we gonna go back to real life?\""
msgstr ""
"「それで...軍に救助されたとして、それからどうなる？みんな頭がおかしくなってる、そうだ"
"ろ？どうやって普通の生活に戻れっていうんだ？」"

msgid ""
"\"Squeeze some ammonia into zombie flesh and hold it tight.  You smell like one of "
"them!  I think.\""
msgstr ""
"「汚染肉にアンモニアを加えて揉み込むとゾンビの匂いの出来上がり。コレを使えば...」"

msgid ""
"\"Started my own brewery recently.  I just need some glass bottles, now!  Several "
"thousand!  I'm planning way ahead.\""
msgstr ""
"「最近自分の醸造所を建てました。ガラス瓶が今すぐ必要です！数千本！ずっと先の計画まで立"
"てています」"

msgid "\"Starting today, the hallucinations are my only friends.\""
msgstr "「今日からは、幻覚だけが私の友達」"

msgid "\"Stay away from me!\""
msgstr "「あっちへ行け！」"

msgid "\"Stay with me… forever!\""
msgstr "「一緒だよ...永遠にね！」"

msgid "\"Stop it please.\""
msgstr "「止めて下さい。」"

msgid "\"Stop laughing at me!\""
msgstr "「笑うのを止めろ！」"

msgid "\"Stop resisting!\""
msgstr "「抵抗を止めなさい！」"

msgid "\"Stop where you are!\""
msgstr "「その場で止まりなさい！」"

msgid ""
"\"Stratosphere: The Rise of Hoops\" chronicles four decades of professional basketball "
"against a backdrop of sustained social change."
msgstr ""
"『成層圏へ:バスケットボールの進化』は、長期的な社会の変化を背景にプロバスケットボール40"
"年の歴史を描いた本です。"

msgid ""
"\"Stuck here.  Zombies outside.  Friends were outside too, now they're part of "
"zombies.  Need to be quiet\""
msgstr ""
"「立ち往生だ。ゾンビ共が外にいる。友達も外にいたが今や奴らの仲間だ。静かにしていない"
"と」"

msgid "\"Subject has so far displayed a total lack of empathy toward human suffering.\""
msgstr "「これまでの実験によれば、検体は人間の苦しみに対する共感が完全に欠如しています」"

msgid "\"Sure hope we get some rain soon,\" says Farmer Joe."
msgstr "「そうさな、近々雨のひとつも降ってくれりゃあな」と農家のジョーは言いました。"

msgid "\"Suspect in sight!\""
msgstr "「容疑者を発見しました！」"

msgid "\"Suspect on the move!\""
msgstr "「容疑者が移動しています！」"

msgid "\"Suspected felony!\""
msgstr "「重犯罪容疑！」"

msgid "\"Suspected misdemeanor!\""
msgstr "「軽犯罪容疑！」"

msgid "\"TEKELI-LI!  TEKELI-LI!  TEKELI-LI!\""
msgstr "「テケリ・リ！テケリ・リ！テケリ・リ！」"

msgid "\"TEKELI-LI!\""
msgstr "「テケリ・リ！」"

msgid "\"THE GOO IS IN THE WATER DON'T DRINK WATER\""
msgstr "「妙なものが水に混じっている。水は飲むな」"

msgid "\"THE MARLEY WAS RIGHT\""
msgstr "「ボブ・マーリー最高」"

msgid "\"THEY DON'T feel ANYTHING\""
msgstr "「あいつらはなにも感じない」"

msgid "\"THIS UNIT IS BROKEN.  PLEASE CALL AN ATTENDANT.\""
msgstr "「ユニットが故障しています。係員にご連絡ください」"

msgid "\"Take his gun, we're going to need it.\""
msgstr "「彼の銃を貰っていこう、きっと役に立つ」"

msgid "\"Take my hand.\""
msgstr "「手を握ってくれ」"

msgid "\"Teep.\""
msgstr "「ピー。」"

msgid "\"Tekeli-li.\""
msgstr "「テケリ・リ」"

msgid ""
"\"Thank You RivTech.  Thank You For Good Coffee.  Will Always Stay Awake For You "
"Rivtech.\""
msgstr ""
"「ありがとうRivTech社。美味しいコーヒーをありがとう。Rivtech社のために生き続けます」"

msgid "\"That creepy abandoned post-apocalyptic lab complex looks safe…\""
msgstr "「滅亡後の放棄された研究施設みたいで不気味だが、中は安全そうだ...」"

msgid "\"That fuckin' thing is horrible, man, it gives me the creeps.\""
msgstr "「あぁ畜生、恐ろしいよ、本当に、ゾッとする」"

msgid ""
"\"That little fakkin rat din say anythin till we whacked him with a steel chain!  Then "
"'e just wanted to know if he could buy the chain!\""
msgstr ""
"「あのくそったれチビネズミの騒音には参ったな、鉄鎖でぶっ叩くまで治まりやしない！鎖を買"
"いたいなら言ってくれたらよかったのに！」"

msgid "\"That was a long time ago.\""
msgstr "「ずいぶん経ったな」"

msgid "\"That's not true!\""
msgstr "「嘘をつくな！」"

msgid "\"That's the first time it moved all morning.\""
msgstr "「午前中ずっと動いていたのは初めてですね」"

msgid "\"The Theory and Practice of Oligarchical Collectivism\" by Emmanuel Goldstein."
msgstr "エマニュエル・ゴールドスタイン著『少数独裁制集産主義の理論と実際』です。"

msgid ""
"\"The bricks of this bathroom look like a face.  Haha… it's all I can focus on.  At "
"least let me shit before you break down the door.  Please…\""
msgstr ""
"「バスルームの煉瓦が顔に見える。ハハ... それ以外何も見えない。ドアが壊される前に糞を出"
"しきれるといいな。頼むよ...」"

msgid "\"The cell structure is unlike any we've ever seen.\""
msgstr "「こんな細胞の構造は見たことが無い」"

msgid ""
"\"The crows I used to feed have gotten HUGE!  One brought me a super pretty watch and "
"another an earring but there was weird black gunk on it.\""
msgstr ""
"「前にエサをやったカラスたちが超デカくなってた！一匹はすごくきれいな腕時計をもってき"
"て、もう一匹はイヤリングをもってきたけど、なんか変な黒いごみがついてた。」"

msgid ""
"\"The damn Autodoc overrides wouldn't work and I didn't have my hospital ID.  I "
"couldn't save them alone.\""
msgstr ""
"「忌々しいオートドクはプログラムの上書きもできないし、病院のIDカードも手元にない。一人"
"では安全も確保できない」"

msgid ""
"\"The evac shelters are a death trap.  They took everyone else away but something in "
"the driver's eyes told me not to go.  Now it's just me.\""
msgstr ""
"「避難シェルターは死の罠だ。皆は車で連れていかれたが、運転手の目は乗るなと訴えていた。"
"今ここには私しかいない」"

msgid "\"The fewer people in New England, the stronger we'll become.\""
msgstr "「ニューイングランドにいる人間が少なければ少ないほど、私たちはもっと強くなる」"

msgid "\"The glass alone won't keep us safe for very long.\""
msgstr "「ガラス1枚だけでずっと安全が保障されるとは思えないな」"

msgid ""
"\"The whispering fog is taking me in like a blanket.  I'm warm now.  I'm finally\""
msgstr "「ささやく霧が毛布のように私を包む。暖かい。これで終わりだ」"

msgid "\"There appear to be some anomalous aspects to the mimicry.\""
msgstr "「変則的な擬態機能があるようですね」"

msgid ""
"\"There are five basic rules to survival.  One, stay prepared and watchful.  Two, keep "
"your iron sights lined up or succumb.  Three, stay FAR WAY from all\""
msgstr ""
"「サバイバルには基本的なルールが5つある。一つ、見晴らしの良い場所を確保しろ。二つ、アイ"
"アンサイトを持て。無理なら死ね。三つ、全てから距離を取れ。無理なら」"

msgid "\"There are seven backup generators.\""
msgstr "「予備発電機を7台用意しています」"

msgid "\"There is no kitten!\" cackles the old crone.  You are shocked by her blasphemy."
msgstr ""
"「子猫なんていないよ！」 老婆のしわがれ声が聴こえました。冒涜的な言葉にショックを受けま"
"した。"

msgid ""
"\"There is some really pretty floating swirly outside.  I was told to not go near it, "
"but I can hear voices from it.  I want to see what's inside.\""
msgstr ""
"「外に、とてもきれいなうずまきが浮いている。近付くなって言われたけど、声が聞こえてく"
"る。中に何があるのか見たい。」"

msgid "\"There you are.\""
msgstr "「さあどうぞ」"

msgid "\"There's gotta be a better use of all this rebar…\""
msgstr "「鉄筋を有効に活用する方法があるはずだ...」"

msgid ""
"\"There's nothing wrong with eating people if you HAVE to.  I mean, I only did it "
"because I didn't want to waste my potato chips!\""
msgstr ""
"「そうしなければならない理由があるなら人間を食べるのは何も間違っていない。ポテトチップ"
"スを食べるのがもったいないと言うのは正当な理由だと思うよ！」"

msgid "\"There's still an evacuation point at Concord, spread the word.\""
msgstr "「コンコードにはまだ避難場所がある、拡散希望」"

msgid ""
"\"These berries are delicious!  Maybe taking these were worth it.  And the more I eat, "
"the more of it appears!  it's like an infinite food cycle!\""
msgstr ""
"「美味しいベリーを見つけた！いいものを手に入れた。食べれば食べるほど出てくる！無限の食"
"料だ！」"

msgid "\"These turrets keep dodging my FUCKING BULLETS!\""
msgstr "「タレット共が弾丸を避け続けやがる！」"

msgid "\"They are NOT slow!  They are NEVER slow!\""
msgstr "「奴らはノロくない！奴らはノロくならない！」"

msgid "\"They made me do it!\""
msgstr "「命令されたんだ！」"

msgid ""
"\"They said a walking cane was a useless weapon… but then I hit one of them with it.\""
msgstr ""
"「人々はステッキなど武器にならないと言った。しかし今、私はそれで敵を打ち倒している」"

msgid ""
"\"They set up the roadblock guns to run automatically.  TV said those fuckin things "
"needed a human to keep em safe, they ain't safe now.\""
msgstr ""
"「封鎖された道路のタレットは自動で射撃するよう設定されている。テレビでは人間の安全を守"
"るために必要な措置と言っていたが、全然安全じゃない」"

msgid ""
"\"They're all hiding on an oil rig, I heard it myself over the AM airwaves.  They "
"think they're the nobles of the 21st century, the prigs.\""
msgstr ""
"「石油プラットフォームに隠れている集団がいる。中波放送で確かにそう聞いた。きっと21世紀"
"の貴族、うぬぼれ屋どもだ」"

msgid "\"This cannot continue.\""
msgstr "「コノママジャダメ」"

msgid ""
"\"This has to be China's fault.  Seriously, why is nobody suspecting the people we're "
"having a cold war with!  This is an invasion!  These aren't zombies, it's just "
"camouflage!  WAKE UP, SHEEPLE!\""
msgstr ""
"「間違いなく中国の仕業だ。真剣な話、どうして冷戦を仕掛けてくるような国を疑おうとしない"
"んだ！これは侵略だ！ゾンビはただの隠れ蓑だ！シープルよ、目覚めよ！」"

msgid "\"This is a dream.  This has to be a dream.\""
msgstr "「これは夢だ。きっとそうに違いない」"

msgid ""
"\"This is all just a dream, right??!  I'M GOING TO WAKE UP, SHE'S GOING TO BE OK\""
msgstr "「これはただの夢、そうだろ？？！僕が目覚めたら、彼女も無事、そうだよな」"

msgid "\"This is my life now… this is my life now… this is my life now…\""
msgstr "「これが私の人生...これが私の人生...これが私の人生...」"

msgid "\"This is the way the fuckin' world ends.\""
msgstr "「これが、この世の終わりだ」"

msgid "\"This isn't real this is a test to turn you into a Manchurian Candidate!\""
msgstr "「これは現実ではなくあなたをスパイに仕立て上げるテストだ」"

msgid "\"This one's repeating phrases that the previous specimen was exposed to.\""
msgstr "「繰り返している単語は、前回の被験者の言葉ですね」"

msgid "\"This place is like a maze.\""
msgstr "「まるで迷路だな」"

msgid "\"This smell… Don't know…\""
msgstr "「この臭い...知らない...」"

msgid ""
"\"This thing isn't a car any more.  It's just a fucking mountain of metal on wheels, "
"which I live in.\""
msgstr "「これはもう車じゃない。車輪の上にくず鉄製の家が乗ってるだけだ。」"

msgid "\"This'll get back t'my bosses, right and so!\""
msgstr "「これで親分が帰ってくる、そうだよな！」"

msgid "\"Those Fiktok clan people picked this place clean… no food…\""
msgstr "「強盗団がここの食べ物を持ち去っていった...何もない...」"

msgid "\"Time to play!\""
msgstr "「遊びましょう！」"

msgid "\"To be kept in a standard biohazardous containment chamber.\""
msgstr "「標準的な生物災害用格納施設に保管」"

msgid ""
"\"To whoever may find this, I've had enough of cowering and hiding.  I have realized I "
"can't outlast whatever this is.  I saw something different at the grocery store down "
"the block.  Skulking around on all four, faster than all the others.  It jumped at me "
"from behind a car.  It's as if they were all changing.  I'm sure I'll see many more of "
"these as time goes on.  I'm leaving.  Whatever you want, take it.\""
msgstr ""
"「このメモを見た人へ。私はもう身を隠すのは止めた。何が起きてるのか分からないが、きっと"
"私は長く生きられない。この先の食料品店前に、ヤバいのが居た。四つん這いになって凄いス"
"ピードでカサカサ動き回ってた。車の陰から飛び出してきた。奴らはみんな変化してる。時間が"
"経てばあんなのをもっと大勢見ることになる。もう嫌だ。欲しいものがあれば勝手に持ってい"
"け」"

msgid "\"Today I saw a butterfly the size of my head\""
msgstr "「今日は頭くらい大きなちょうちょを見た」"

msgid ""
"\"Took a picture of a dead dog leaping right onto a soldier.  Sweet fucking shot!\""
msgstr "「兵士に飛びかかる瞬間のゾンビ犬の写真が撮れたぜ。超ベストショット！」"

msgid "\"Topsoil's all gone, ma,\" weeps Lil' Greg."
msgstr "「畑の土が全部流されちまった」と、幼いグレッグは泣きました。"

msgid ""
"\"Tried wearing dead zombie clothes, but they still knew I was alive!  It's like "
"they're a hivemind, man!\""
msgstr ""
"「ゾンビの服を着て死人に扮してみたが、奴らは私が生きているのが分かるようだ！まるで、第"
"六感でもあるみたいだ！」"

msgid "\"U-O Seven-Seven-Three-Four.\""
msgstr "「U-O 7-7-3-4」"

msgid "\"USER PASSWORD UNRECOGNIZED.\""
msgstr "「ユーザーパスワードが認証されません」"

msgid "\"Uncategorized object seven-seven-three-four.\""
msgstr "「未分類オブジェクト、7-7-3-4」"

msgid "\"Uncle Tim said we are going on a trip, but I just want to see daddy.\""
msgstr "「ティムおじさんが旅に出ようって言ってたけど、パパに会いたい。」"

msgid ""
"\"Uncle buried ms Carmichael after she got sick but she's not in the backyard "
"anymore.  Uncle isn't home either.\""
msgstr ""
"「おじさんが埋めた病気のカーマイケルさんはいなくなった。おじさんも家からいなくなっ"
"た。」"

msgid ""
"\"Universal curfew is in effect.  Please return to your home.  This unit is authorized "
"to open fire.\""
msgstr ""
"「夜間外出禁止令が発出されています。自宅へ戻ってください。当ユニットは発砲を許可されて"
"います」"

msgid "\"Until such time as more permanent arrangements are made.\""
msgstr "「期間は、より恒久的な事態が発生するまで」"

msgid ""
"\"Volleyball: Get Ready to Get Ready\" is YOUR illustrated guide to level up your "
"game.  With full-color photos and diagrams, you will learn the drills and techniques "
"you need to dominate the competition."
msgstr ""
"『バレーボール:一に準備二に準備』は、試合のレベルアップを目指す人のための図解付きガイド"
"です。フルカラーの写真と図で、ゲームを制するために必要な練習と技能を学べます。"

msgid "\"W-where am I?  Why does it hur-REBOOTING IN 59 SECONDS.\""
msgstr "「こ、ここはどこだ？この痛みはなん...再起動中...59秒経過」"

msgid ""
"\"WBLF 970 went off-air three days ago.  There's nobody left on the radio.  Might as "
"well throw this thing away…\""
msgstr ""
"「WBLF970が3日前に停波してしまった。ラジオからは誰の声も聞こえない。もう捨てていいだろ"
"う...」"

msgid "\"WE WERE RIGHT THE GOVERNMENT DID IT\""
msgstr "「我々が正しかった。政府はやり遂げた」"

msgid "\"WE'RE GOING TO SAIL TO CANADA, BITCHES!\""
msgstr "「船でカナダまで行ってくるぜ、あばよ！」"

msgid "\"WHAT THE FUCK DO YOU WANT FROM ME?!\""
msgstr "「一体ぜんたい何が望みなんだよ！？」"

msgid "\"WHY DO ALL THE DEAD CHILDREN GO TO SCHOOL\""
msgstr "「なぜ学校の子供達が全滅していたんだ」"

msgid "\"WHY THE FUCK are you doing this to me?\""
msgstr "「一体私に何をしようというんだ？」"

msgid "\"WHY!  WHY, WHYYY!\""
msgstr "「何故だ！何故だ、何故だぁぁ！」"

msgid "\"Wait for law enforcement officer!\""
msgstr "「警官到着まで動くな！」"

msgid "\"Wanna go home…\""
msgstr "「家に帰りたい...」"

msgid "\"Wanna play with me?\""
msgstr "「わたしと一緒に遊ばない？」"

msgid "\"Watch you bleed out!\""
msgstr "「黙って死にな！」"

msgid ""
"\"We all ate together as a big happy family.  Even Mike was there even though mom "
"normally puts him to bed at 8pm.  Atleast he won't cry in the middle of the night "
"anymore.\""
msgstr ""
"「たのしいだいかぞくは、みんないっしょにたべました。いつも8じにねるマイクも、いっしょに"
"たべました。もうよるもなかずにいられるね」"

msgid "\"We are friendly.\""
msgstr "「私たちは友達。」"

msgid ""
"\"We are seen.  It's not long until we will be touched.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Touched by what, exactly?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Touched.  Chewed.  Tasted.  Digested.  Processed.  Excreted.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Ramin, focus, please.  What is doing all that?  Or rather, what do you feel will be "
"doing those things?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"It's big.  Bigger than the Sun.  Smaller than an atom.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"And what does this large small thing want, beyond touching us?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"It just is.  It needs no reason.  It needs only to exist.  It needs only to expand."
"\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Do you want to talk about Immersion 132R?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"There's nothing to talk about.  I wasn't there.  It didn't touch me.  I didn't "
"look.  It didn't look back.  It didn't smile with a million rotten worlds in its mouth."
"\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Have you been taking your medication?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Like they would help.  I tried, Doc, I really did.  But the truth is, I like having "
"these thoughts.  They give me a certainty, and I am thankful for knowing how it will "
"all end.  That we all belong to something, and nothing can take us from it now.\""
msgstr ""
"「私たちは見られている。もうすぐ、触られてしまう」\n"
"\n"
"「何に、触られてしまうのですか？」\n"
"\n"
"「触られる。噛まれる。賞味される。咀嚼される。消化される。排泄される」\n"
"\n"
"「ラミンさん、気を確かにもってください。何が、触れようとしているのですか？いえ、あなた"
"は、何がそれらの行為をすると感じていますか？」\n"
"\n"
"「大きい。太陽より大きい。原子より小さい」\n"
"\n"
"「それでは、その大きくて小さいものは、何が目的で、私たちに触れたりするのでしょう？」\n"
"\n"
"「ただ、そうするだけ。理由なんかない。存在して、拡大するだけ」\n"
"\n"
"「132Rへの浸入のお話をしてくださいますか？」\n"
"\n"
"「話すことは何もない。私はそこに居なかった。それは私に触らなかった。私は見なかった。振"
"り返らなかった。何百万もの腐った世界を食べても、それは笑わなかった」\n"
"\n"
"「お薬はちゃんと服用していますか？」\n"
"\n"
"「薬は効いてますよ、先生、ちゃんと飲むようにしてます。でも、考えたくて考えてるんです。"
"それが私に確信を与えてくれた。私は終わり方を知れた事に感謝してるんです。私たちは皆、一"
"員なんです、もう奪われることは無いんです」"

msgid "\"We can help you.\""
msgstr "「あなたを助けたい。」"

msgid "\"We found it in a wreckage, barely alive.  Not the first one, either.\""
msgstr "「瓦礫の中で発見したが、かろうじて生きている。最初に発見したものとも違うな」"

msgid ""
"\"We going to hide in the subways, but I keep hearing really weird screams down there."
"\""
msgstr "「地下鉄にかくれるつもりだったけど、変な叫び声が聞こえる。」"

msgid "\"We got a treaty w'yer people, don'we?\""
msgstr "「そいつらと約束したんだよ、な？」"

msgid "\"We have Landed our Comet.  The Sky is Ablaze.\""
msgstr "「コメットを着陸させた。空は輝いていた。」"

msgid "\"We have a serious situation here.\""
msgstr "「ここは深刻な状況だよ」"

msgid "\"We just don't know.\""
msgstr "「分からないな」"

msgid "\"We should hit up the shooting range later.\""
msgstr "「もっと射程距離を伸ばさないと」"

msgid "\"We should split into groups of two each.\""
msgstr "「二手に分かれよう」"

msgid ""
"\"We were… I… we can scarcely remember those times.\"  Dave looks pained.  \"No, we "
"had no doctor.  We didn't need one.  We had a job and… and… we don't like to talk "
"about this.\""
msgstr ""
"「ええと...その...前のことは、ほとんど覚えていない。」デイブは表情を歪めました。「い"
"や、医者はいなかった。必要もなかった。仕事もあったし...それに...この話はしたくない。"

msgid "\"We wish you no harm.\""
msgstr "「あなたを傷つけたくない。」"

msgid "\"We'd have to terminate the specimen.\""
msgstr "「試験を中止する必要があるでしょうね」"

msgid "\"We're all alone.\""
msgstr "「人は皆1人ぼっちさ」"

msgid "\"We're both scavs, in't we?\""
msgstr "「スカベンジャー同士だろ、な？」"

msgid "\"We're not even sure what it is.\""
msgstr "「これは何だ、さっぱりわからん」"

msgid "\"We're on our own.\""
msgstr "「自力で頑張ろう」"

msgid "\"We're still trying to figure out what makes it tick.\""
msgstr "「こいつがまだ動けるかどうか調べているところだ」"

msgid ""
"\"We're the eagle-eyes in the sky!  Just two mutant avians in our helicopter!  Filming "
"the Cataclysm!  Check us out on any working electronics!\""
msgstr ""
"「鷹の目を手に入れた！私たちのヘリには2人の鳥類変異者が乗っている！大変動を記録に残すん"
"だ！動いている機械が無いか調査しよう！」"

msgid "\"We've got it okay, I guess"
msgstr "「大丈夫だと思う"

msgid ""
"\"Went to the emergency shelter, some guy walked in, walked out, grabbed a rock, "
"smashed a bench to bits, carved a plank out of it, walked out again.  Haven't seen "
"them in 3 days… wonder what their story is.\""
msgstr ""
"「避難シェルターにいたら、知らない人たちが入ってきて、出て行って、石を掴んで、また入っ"
"てきて、ベンチを叩き壊して、板を削って、また出て行った。あの人たちの姿はもう3日も見てい"
"ない...一体何だったんだろう」"

msgid "\"What IS that?\""
msgstr "「一体何なんだ？」"

msgid "\"What are you afraid will happen?\""
msgstr "「何を怖がっているの？」"

msgid "\"What are you doing?  No!  NO!\""
msgstr "「何をしている？止めろ！止めろ！」"

msgid "\"What are you!?\""
msgstr "「何者だ！？」"

msgid "\"What did that thing just hit me with?\""
msgstr "「こんなものが私を攻撃したのか？」"

msgid "\"What did you do with my Mommy?\""
msgstr "「わたしのママに何したの？」"

msgid "\"What do you think you're doing?\""
msgstr "「何をしているか分かっているのか？」"

msgid "\"What do you want from me?\""
msgstr "「どうしろって言うんだ？」"

msgid "\"What have I become?  Why can't I die?\""
msgstr "「私はどうなる？何故死ねないんだ？」"

msgid "\"What have I become?\""
msgstr "「私はどうなる？」"

msgid "\"What is LIXA?\""
msgstr "何だい？"

msgid "\"What the hell are they mining for in these shafts?\""
msgstr "「一体全体、この坑道はなんのために掘られたんだ？」"

msgid "\"What time do you get off?\""
msgstr "「いつ出発するんだ？」"

msgid "\"What was the government doing, anyway?\""
msgstr "「政府は一体何をやらかしたんだ？」"

msgid "\"What'll happen if the power goes out?\""
msgstr "「もし停電になったらどうなるんだ？」"

msgid ""
"\"What's the deal with boiling water?  Rain water is distilled naturally!  It's "
"perfectly safe, you could save so much time if you didn't boil it.  I drunk some river "
"water, and I'm fine!\""
msgstr ""
"「まだ水を沸騰させているの？雨水は自然に蒸留されてる。そのままでも安全だし、煮沸なんて"
"時間の無駄だ。川の水を飲んだけど、ピンピンしてるよ！」"

msgid ""
"\"What's up?\"  He stares at you for a moment.  \"What a weird question.  The world "
"ended.  That's what's up.  What am I supposed to answer to that one?\""
msgstr ""
"「調子はどう、だって？」彼は一瞬、こちらを凝視しました。「分からないな。世界が終わっ"
"たってのに、調子も何もないよ。一体どう答えろっていうんだ？"

msgid ""
"\"When I think of all the dead people I get mad, because I was supposed to be the next "
"big leader.  WHERES MY CHANCE!??\""
msgstr ""
"「あの死人どもの事を考えると頭に来る。次代の有力な指揮官は俺のはずだったのに、次のチャ"
"ンスはどこだ！？？」"

msgid ""
"\"When I was a kid I used to slingshot at bugs and birds.  Its really playing off "
"nowadays, Ill tell you what\""
msgstr ""
"「子供の頃はスリングショットで虫や鳥を撃っていた。この災難が、今こそ試合の本番がやって"
"きたって教えてくれたよ」"

msgid "\"When did you find out?\""
msgstr "「何か見つけたかい？」"

msgid "\"Where did you come from?\""
msgstr "「君はどこから来たんだい？」"

msgid "\"Who's there?\""
msgstr "「そこにいるのは誰？」"

msgid "\"Why are all the lawnmowers broken?!\""
msgstr "「どうしてあちこちの芝刈り機が壊されているんだ！？」"

msgid "\"Why don't you touch it and find out?\""
msgstr "「触ってみてはどうだ？」"

msgid "\"Why won't you die?\""
msgstr "「さっさと死んでよ？」"

msgid ""
"\"Why would you ever hide in a damn gun store?  The owner… he was a moron alright.\""
msgstr ""
"「どうしてこんな銃砲店に隠れちまったんだ？ひとつ言えるのは...店主はクソ忌々しいことに無"
"事だろうってことだ」"

msgid ""
"\"Why would you hide in a farm?  Sure, it's isolated, but if they know where you are, "
"you don't exactly have cover on all sides.\""
msgstr ""
"「どうして農場に隠れない？確かに孤立した場所だ。だがそれはお前らが集まらないからだ。お"
"前らが集まれば全方位をカバーできるんだ」"

msgid "\"Will you die already?!\""
msgstr "「さっさと死ね！」"

msgid "\"Woah, bud!  Not all cannibals eat meat!\""
msgstr "「うわぁ、やめてよ！全ての食人嗜好者が肉好きとは限らないんだ！」"

msgid "\"Would it react differently with a child?\""
msgstr "「子供に反応するかな？」"

msgid "\"YOU ARE UNDER ARREST!\""
msgstr "「お前を逮捕する！」"

msgid ""
"\"Yeah, we did.\"  He gestures to a turbaned older man, speaking quietly with a small "
"woman a little way away.  \"Seems like it should be a great thing, right?  It is.  "
"We're super lucky.  But I can't help feel like people blame us for it.  I keep "
"wondering, y'know, 'why us'.  What makes me so special?  And how can I even enjoy "
"this, when everyone around me is hurting so bad?\""
msgstr ""
"「ああ、そうだよ。」彼は少し離れたところにいるターバンを巻いた年配の男性を指し示しまし"
"た。小柄な女性と静かに話をしているようです。「本当に良かったって思うだろ？その通り。僕"
"らは超ラッキーなんだ。でも、幸運を恨まれてるような気がしてならない。『どうして僕ら"
"が』って、ずっと考えてる。どうして僕らが特別に助かったんだ？周りが皆傷ついているのに、"
"どうして喜べるんだ？ってね。"

msgid "\"Yeah.  I can't believe he stayed alive that long.\""
msgstr "「ああ。あんなに長く息があったなんて信じられない」"

msgid "\"Yes!\" says the bit."
msgstr "ビットが「Yes！」と言っています。"

