msgid "\"we're a team, we've got this!\""
msgstr "「みんななかまだ、がんばるぞ！」"

msgid "\"wek ik spak\""
msgstr "「ウェック・イック・スパック」"

msgid "\"when it started, we could still hope The Man was gonna save us…\""
msgstr "「事が起きたばかりの頃は、政府が助けてくれると思っていた...」"

msgid "\"wow!  you look just like me!  we should look out for each other!\""
msgstr "「わー！わたしたちそっくり！気をつけていこうね！」"

msgid ""
"\"…damn those hybrid cars are efficient.  wish I was smart enough to finagle that "
"engine controller out of it… heard scrapper Joe put one in his deathmobile and now "
"doesn't need gas at all… then again, Joe is full of shit…\""
msgstr ""
"「...ハイブリッドカーの燃費はサイコーだ。スマートエンジン制御装置を使いこなせるくらいに"
"賢くなりたいもんだ...自慢の改造車に積んで以来ガソリンがほとんど要らなくなったって、解体"
"屋のジョーが言ってたが...ジョーめ、またでたらめ言って...」"

msgid ""
"\"⋯bioluminescent, 5' diameter⋯  appears to be an immense disembodied eyeball, capable "
