msgid ""
".  I have spent so much time, just regretting what I have lost.  Thank you for "
"bringing back what little you could."
msgstr ""
"。私は長い間、失ったものを悔やんでばかりだった。今はいつもの調子が多少戻って来た気がす"
"るよ。ありがとう。"

msgid ".  I have these things, but I do not have peace.  No one here does"
msgstr "。なのに、平穏だけが手に入らない。ここにいる誰もが失ったものです"

msgid ""
".  People don't talk to us because we wear turbans and we still have each other.  They "
"think because we're still together, we didn't lose anything.  My dad believes it, too, "
"and I think my mom's on the fence."
msgstr ""
"。ターバンを巻いて家族だけで固まってる僕らには、誰も話しかけようとしない。家族が一緒な"
"ら別に問題ないだろって思われてる。父さんも同じ考え。母さんも、多分同じだろうな。"

msgid ""
".  The situation is pretty tight, though.\"  She glances around at the huddled crowds "
"of people in the room.  \"If we're stuck here for too long people are going to start "
"getting a bit stir crazy.\""
msgstr ""
"。かなり厳しいのは間違いない。」彼女は、混み合っている部屋を見渡しました。「あんまり長"
"くここにいると、おかしくなってしまいそう。」"

msgid ".  To me, though, that is all just a drop in the bucket"
msgstr "。私にとっては、そんなもの毛ほども辛くない"

msgid ""
".  We are crowded, we are plagued by the sounds and the memories of the dead.  The "
"situation is grim."
msgstr "。窮屈な場所で、死者の音と記憶に悩まされています。本当に辛い。"

msgid ".  Why don't you fuckin' figure it out?\""
msgstr "。クソみたいな状況を理解できたかしら？」"

msgid ".  Will need sleep in "
msgstr "。睡眠欠乏"

msgid ""
".\"  He slides his hand through his hair and smiles, his eyes half-lidded.  \"They "
"call me Alonso.\""
msgstr "。」彼は髪を撫でつけ、流し目で微笑みました。「皆は私をアロンソと呼ぶ。」"

