"最も古い弾薬の一つであり、大型動物を近距離から狙う目的で愛用されています。"

msgid ""
".45-70 Government ammunition loaded with a 405 grain lead flat nose bullet to original "
"specifications for safe use in antique firearms.  Quite a bit less powerful than "
"modern ammo, but still packs a punch."
