msgid ""
".454 Casull ammunition with a 300gr jacketed soft point bullet.  The .454 Casull round "
"is derived from .45 Long Colt with a stronger, lengthened case.  It is an "
"exceptionally powerful cartridge with higher stopping power than many rifle rounds, "
"although its extreme recoil makes it unsuitable for most purposes."
msgstr ""
