msgid ""
"4.6x30mm ammunition with a 31gr copper plated lead bullets.  The 4.6x30mm round was "
"developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge.  It has low recoil, "
"but lacks its usual armor penetration due to using a simple lead bullet rather than a "
"proper factory-made penetrator projectile."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約2gの4.6x30mm銅メッキ鉛弾です。4.6x30mm弾はFNハースタル社の5.7x28mm弾の競合品"
"として、H&K社によって開発されました。低反動ですが、工場生産の徹甲弾ではなく作りが単純な"
"鉛弾を使っているため、正規品ほどの装甲貫通力はありません。大変動の生存者、あるいは単な"
"る趣味人が手詰めしたものであり、性能は工場生産された弾薬に比べてやや劣ります。"

msgid ""
"4.6x30mm ammunition with a 31gr copper plated steel bullet.  The 4.6x30mm round was "
"developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge.  It has low recoil "
"and excellent armor penetration."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約2gの4.6x30mm銅メッキ鉛弾です。4.6x30mm弾はFNハースタル社の5.7x28mm弾の競合品"
