msgid ""
"5.7x28mm ammunition with a 31gr AP FMJ bullet.  The 5.7x28mm cartridge was designed by "
"FN Herstal to replace the 9x19mm round in NATO use.  Although the project to replace "
"9x19mm Parabellum was effectively canceled, the 5.7x28mm round has seen action in many "
"conflicts and has proven to be reliable.  It has very low recoil and its armor "
"penetration is a defining feature."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約2gの5.7x28mmフルメタルジャケット徹甲弾です。9x19mmNATO弾の次世代としてFNハー"
"スタル社が設計しました。実際には完全に代替わりすることはありませんでしたが、その信頼性"
"から各地の紛争で活躍しました。この銃弾は反動が非常に小く貫通力が高い点が特徴です。"

msgid ""
"5.7x28mm ammunition with a 31gr AP FMJ bullet.  The 5.7x28mm cartridge was designed by "
"FN Herstal to replace the 9x19mm round in NATO use.  Although the project to replace "
"9x19mm Parabellum was effectively canceled, the 5.7x28mm round has seen action in many "
"conflicts and has proven to be reliable.  It has very low recoil but lacks its usual "
"armor penetration due to using a simple lead bullet rather than a proper factory-made "
"penetrator projectile."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約2gの5.7x28mmフルメタルジャケット徹甲弾です。9x19mmNATO弾の次世代としてFNハー"
"スタル社が設計しました。実際には完全に代替わりすることはありませんでしたが、その信頼性"
"から各地の紛争で活躍しました。この銃弾は反動が非常に小く貫通力が高い点が特徴です。低反"
"動ですが、工場生産の徹甲弾ではなく作りが単純な鉛弾のため、正規品ほどの装甲貫通力はあり"
"ません。"

