msgid ""
"7.62x39mm ammunition with a 123gr jacketed, hollowpoint bullet.  Made for hunting "
"medium game, cartridges such as these were once popular for those using cheap military "
"surplus rifles, as 7.62x39's ballistics are somewhat similar to that of 30-30 "
"Winchester.  The combination of sanctions against exporting nations and drying up of "
"formerly plentiful surplus has made these loadings of 7.62x39 less popular."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約8gの7.62x39mmジャケッテッド・ホローポイント弾です。中型動物の狩猟用に作られて"
"いますが、30-30ウィンチェスター弾と弾道が多少似ている7.62x39mm弾は、かつては安価な軍の"
"払い下げライフルを利用する者に好まれていました。輸出国に対する制裁と豊富な余剰が枯渇し"
"たことが原因で、今は人気に陰りが見えています。"

