msgid ""
"AKA \"drunken boxing,\" Zui Quan is a style of kung fu that mimics the unpredictable "
"movements of a drunk.  You gain a passive Dodging skill bonus based on Intelligence "
"and dodge attempts.  Dodging increases your damage and accuracy based on Intelligence "
"for a short time.  Moving gives you an additional dodging bonus."
msgstr ""
"「ドランクンボクシング」とも呼ばれる酔拳は、酔っぱらいの動きを真似て敵を惑わす武術で"
"す。知性と回避の試行回数に応じて、回避が成功しやすくなります。回避に成功すると、与ダ"
"メージと命中精度が短時間上昇します。移動すると敵の攻撃を回避しやすくなります。"

