msgid ""
"Anita Diamant's survey-level discussion of the daily practices and rituals of Jewish "
"life.  Originally mostly superseded by the free availability of information on the "
"internet, it's much more useful now for everyone who feels bad that they didn't attend "
"their synagogue often enough before it was overrun."
msgstr ""
"アニタ・ディアマントが著した、ユダヤ教徒の日常ていな習慣や儀式を調査した研究書です。発"
"売当初はインターネットで無料で入手できる情報とさして変わらないものでしたが、荒らされる"
"以前のシナゴーグに通えず残念がっている生存者にとっては、遥かに役立つことでしょう。"

msgid "Ankh necklace"
msgid_plural "Ankh necklaces"
