msgstr "全て"

msgid ""
"Any bionic can be removed from your body, but this process may be even harder - and "
"thus riskier - than the initial installation.  Both installation and removal are non-"
"trivial surgical procedures, and therefore require anesthesia."
msgstr ""
"あらゆるCBMは身体から除去できますが、除去は移植より更に難しく、それ故に危険を伴います。"
"CBMの移植と除去は大がかりな外科的処置を伴うため、麻酔が必要です。"

msgid "Any chance you could point the way to that cabin for me?"
msgstr "その山小屋までの経路を教えてもらえないか？"

msgid ""
"Any containers in this zone you don't otherwise sort will have their contents dumped "
"out and placed on the same tile.  This includes corpses, magazines, and magazine wells."
msgstr ""
"この区域内の容器からアイテムを抜き取り、該当分類区域に移動します。分類が設定されていな"
"い場合は容器と同じタイルに置きます。容器には死体、弾倉、銃器も含まれます。"

msgid "Any fuel to stoke these embers?"
msgstr "体内炉で燃やせそうなものはない？"

msgid "Any good rumors?"
msgstr "何かいい話はある？"

msgid "Any hints about the world we now live in?"
msgstr "この世界で生き抜くために役立つ話はある？"

msgid "Any idea how we ended up here, in this mess?"
msgstr "どうしてこんなことになったのか、何か心当たりはある？"

msgid "Any idea where we could find other survivors?"
msgstr "他の生存者はどこにいるんだろう？"

msgid "Any jobs you need done?"
msgstr "何か私に手伝える仕事はあるか？"

msgid "Any leads on where a camp might be?"
msgstr "キャンプまで案内を他の誰に頼めばいいんだ？"

msgid "Any luck finding the LMOE shelter?"
msgstr "LMOEシェルターは見つかったか？"

msgid "Any luck finding the cabin?"
msgstr "山小屋は見つかったか？"

msgid "Any luck finding the farm?"
msgstr "農場は見つかったか？"

msgid "Any luck looking for that gunsmithing text?"
msgstr "運よく銃器製造の本が見つかった？"

msgid "Any luck with that horror?"
msgstr "化け物を倒してくれたか？"

msgid "Any luck with the pregnancy?"
msgstr "家族計画は上手くいってる？"

msgid "Any luck, survivor?"
msgstr "収穫はあったか？"

msgid "Any luck?"
msgstr "どうだった？"

msgid "Any luck?  Bigger ones?"
msgstr "あるだろう？さっきより大きい奴だぞ？"

msgid "Any luck?  Please find me a holy symbol.  Any of them will do."
msgstr "どうだった？どうか聖なる象徴を探してきてほしい。どんなものでもいい。"

msgid "Any luck?  Please find me a small relic.  Any relic will do."
msgstr "どうだった？小さな遺物を見つけてくれ。どんなものでもいい。"

msgid ""
"Any luck?  Please find me a small relic.  Any relic will do.  It looks like a rock."
msgstr "どうだった？小さな遺物を見つけてくれ。どんなものでもいい。単なる石でもいい。"

msgid "Any lucky find?"
msgstr "何か品物は入荷した？"

msgid ""
"Any nearby forest should have all you need.  Otherwise, you might try breaking down "
"some furniture in town."
msgstr ""
"近くの森へ行けば、必要なものは全部揃う筈だ。それか、街で家具を分解してみるのもいいかも"
"しれない。"

msgid "Any new abilities recently?"
msgstr "最近追加された能力はあるのか？"

msgid "Any news on that Remington?"
msgstr "レミントンはどうなった？"

msgid "Any old port in a storm, I guess."
msgstr "まるで、嵐の海に浮かぶ古びた港だ。"

msgid "Any ordinary robot could see from a mile away that this wasn't kitten."
msgstr ""
"普通のロボットなら間違いなく、1マイル離れた地点からこれが子猫ではないことを判別できま"
"す。"

msgid "Any problems boss?"
msgstr "ボス、何だい？"

msgid "Any progress on getting some anesthetic or parts?"
msgstr "麻酔薬は見つけたか？麻酔器の製作に進展はあったか？"

msgid "Any progress on getting to the camp?"
msgstr "キャンプへは辿り着けそうか？"

msgid "Any progress?"
msgstr "何か進展はあった？"

msgid "Any sign of a motor I can use?"
msgstr "使えそうなモーターは見つかった？"

msgid "Any sign of a tank I can use?"
msgstr "使えそうなタンクは見つかった？"

msgid "Any sign of an air rifle book I can use?"
msgstr "空圧ライフルに関係してそうな資料は見つかった？"

msgid "Any suggestions on how we could find others?"
msgstr "もっと人を探し出すための、いい方法はないだろうか？"

msgid "Any time!  But I'd better go."
msgstr "それは良かった！もうそろそろ行かないと。"

msgid "Any tips for surviving?"
msgstr "サバイバルの知恵を教えてくれる？"

msgid "Any tips?"
msgstr "役立つ情報はある？"

msgid "Any variant is fine, I am not that choosy…"
msgstr "どんなものでもいい、選り好みなんてしていられない..."

msgid "Any vehicles in this area are marked for deconstruction."
msgstr "この区域内にある車両は解体の対象になります。"

msgid "Any vehicles in this area are marked for repair work."
msgstr "この区域内にある車両は修理の対象になります。"

msgid ""
"Anyone can make a cookie, but you can make it look amazing.  Cakes and other fluffies "
"are also no longer a barrier."
msgstr ""
"クッキーなんて誰でも作れますが、美味しいクッキーとなれば話は別です。ケーキなどのふんわ"
"りした菓子も、もはや難関ではありません。"

msgid ""
"Anyone can toss stuff into deep fryer oil.  You know more about selecting oil, keeping "
"the food from burning, and the like."
msgstr ""
"揚げ油に食材を放り込むだけなら誰でもできますが、油の選び方や食材が焦げ付くのを防ぐ方法"
"など、より詳しい知識を身に着けています。"

msgid "Anyone else hear that?"
msgstr "聞こえたか？"

msgid "Anyone else want to die?"
msgstr "まだ死にたいやつはいるか？"

msgid "Anyone hearing that <swear> noise?"
msgstr "<swear>、物音が聞こえたか？"

msgid "Anything Can Be Beautiful"
msgid_plural "copies of Anything Can Be Beautiful"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/誰でも美しくなれる)"

msgid "Anything I can do for you?"
msgstr "何か手伝えることはないか？"

msgid "Anything I can do to help you out?"
msgstr "何か手伝えることはあるか？"

msgid "Anything I could do for you?"
msgstr "何か手伝えることはある？"

msgid "Anything else  I can do in the faction manager?"
msgstr "派閥メニューで他にできることはある？"

msgid ""
"Anything else I should know, like making you pulp zombies or assigning you a seat in "
"my vehicle?"
msgstr "ゾンビを叩いて潰すとか、車両の座席とか、他に知っておくべきことはある？"

msgid "Anything else you need?"
msgstr "他に必要なものは？"

msgid "Anything else?"
msgstr "もう終わり？"

msgid "Anything more to it?"
msgstr "まだ何かあるのか？"

msgid "Anything on your mind?"
msgstr "何か気になることが？"

msgid "Anything to do before I go to sleep?"
msgstr "寝入る前にやっておくことでもあるのか？"

msgid ""
"Anything valuable really.  If you really want to know, go ask one of the actual "
"traders.  I'm just protection."
msgstr ""
"大変貴重なものさ。私はただの警備だから、そういう話が聞きたいなら商人のところに行け。"

msgid "Anything you buying or selling, by chance?"
msgstr "何か商売をしているのか？"

msgid ""
"Anyway, long story short, I were headin' back up to Mount Greenwood to check on th'old "
"campin' place again when I heard all that trouble start.  Decided to camp out there to "
"see it all through, but it didn't ever end, now, did it?  So here I am."
msgstr ""
"まぁ、要するに、色々と物騒になってきたちょうどその頃に、またキャンプ場跡を見に行こうと"
"グリーンウッド山へ向かったんだ。そこで野宿しようと思っていたんだが、結局、上手くいかな"
"かった。その後どうしたかって？ここにやってきたのさ。"

msgid "Anyway…"
msgstr "ところで..."

msgid "Anywhere would be a good place to sleep…"
msgstr "どんな場所でもぐっすり眠ってしまいそうです..."

msgid "AoE"
msgstr "効果範囲"

msgid "Apartment Building (rooftop)"
msgstr "アパート(屋上)"

msgid "Apartment Building Alternate (rooftop)"
msgstr "アパート(屋上)2"

msgid "Apartment Complex (rooftop)"
msgstr "集合住宅(屋上)"

msgid "Apex Predator"
msgstr "頂点捕食者"

msgid "Apocalypse Now"
msgid_plural "copies of Apocalypse Now"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/アポカリプス・ナウ)"

msgid "Apollo"
msgstr "ｱﾎﾟﾛ"

msgid ""
"Apparently one of the other survivors picked up on an unusually dense horde of undead "
"moving into the area.  At the center of this throng there was a 'leader' of some "
"sort.  The short of it is, kill the son of a bitch.  We don't know what it is capable "
"of or why it is surrounded by other zombies but this thing reeks of trouble.  Do "
"whatever it takes but we can't risk it getting away."
msgstr ""
"聞くところによれば、この地域に接近するゾンビの異常な大集団を他の生存者たちが目撃したん"
"だ。この群れの中心には「リーダー」のようなものがいるらしい。これを殺すんだ。こいつがど"
"んな能力を持っているのか、なぜ他のゾンビを無数に従えているのか、それは謎だが、とにかく"
"危険の根源であることは間違いない。なんとしても大群を追い払おう。"

msgid "Apparently the microskirt wasn't short enough."
msgstr "どうやらマイクロスカートでは長すぎたようです。"

msgid ""
"Apparently this zombie was doing time when the Cataclysm struck.  It wears black and "
"white striped prisoner clothes, and tattoos can be seen on its decaying skin."
msgstr ""
"大変動が起きた時に刑務所の中で過ごしていたことは間違いありません。白と黒の縞模様の囚人"
"服を着ており、腐った皮膚には刺青が残っています。"

msgid "Apparently, it's Edmund Burke."
msgstr "どうやらエドマンド・バークのようです。"

msgid "Apparently, it's more interested in your flesh than the dog food in your hand!"
msgstr "どうやらドッグフードよりも生きのいい肉に興味があるようです！"

msgid "Appendices"
msgstr "追加部位"

msgid "Appliance has no connection to a battery."
msgstr "設備は蓄電装置と接続されていません。"

msgid "Appliance power consumption: "
msgstr "設備の消費電力: "

msgid "Appliances"
msgstr "設備"

msgid "Applied Science"
msgstr "応用科学"

msgid "Applies various effects when you see the creature."
msgstr "視線が合った者に様々な効果を付与します。"

msgid "Apply brake to mill"
msgstr "ブレーキ装置を起動する"

msgid "Apply contact lenses"
msgstr "装着する"

msgid "Apply diamond coating"
msgstr "ダイヤモンドをコーティングする"

msgid "Apply preset"
msgstr "プリセットを適用"

msgid "Apply to wound"
msgstr "傷を処置する"

msgid "Applying first aid!"
msgstr "応急処置をしているところだ！"

msgid "Applying the brake will stop milling process."
msgstr "ブレーキ装置を起動すると製粉が停止します。"

msgid ""
"Applying the science of distillation to alcoholic beverages to get something tasty."
msgstr "蒸留の技術を酒造りに応用して、美味しい飲み物を作れます。"

msgid "Approaching.  One car.  J.  Followed by.  Two car.  M, M.  In five.  Minutes."
msgstr "何か来ます。一台の車。J。それに続いて。二台の車。M、M。この間。5秒。"

