msgid ""
"Bring her home.  Your help is needed.\n"
"\n"
"MISSING PERSON\n"
"$50,000 REWARD\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a middle-aged woman with shoulder-length black hair in a cropped group "
"photo.]\n"
"\n"
"A $50,000 reward is being offered for anyone willing to come forward with new "
"information that leads to finding Shayla Kaplan.\n"
"\n"
"On March 12 Shayla Kaplan was last seen leaving her residence on 445 Huntz Lane, "
"Franklin, MA.  She has not been heard from since.\n"
"\n"
"She was 43 years old at the time of her disappearance.  She was described as a Native "
"American female with shoulder-length black hair and brown eyes.  She was 5'5\" tall "
"and weighed 153 lbs.\n"
"\n"
"If you have any information about what may have happened to her, please contact the "
"number below.\n"
"  > Call: (508)555-5918\n"
"  > Or text information to: (508)555-1711"
msgstr ""
"家に帰りたい。あなたの助けが必要です。\n"
"\n"
"行方不明者\n"
"懸賞金 $50,000\n"
" \n"
"[肩まで黒髪を伸ばした中年女性が写っている、集合写真の切り抜き]\n"
"\n"
"シェイラ・カプラン氏の発見に繋がる新たな有力情報の提供者には、懸賞金$50,000を差し上げま"
"す。\n"
"\n"
"シェイラ・カプラン氏は3月12日にマサチューセッツ州フランクリンのハンツ通り445番地にある"
"自宅から出た姿を目撃されて以降、消息不明になっています。\n"
"\n"
"カプラン氏は失踪当時43歳で、黒髪を肩まで伸ばしており、瞳の色は茶色、人種はネイティブア"
"メリカン、身長は165cm、体重は69kgでした。\n"
"\n"
"カプラン氏の行方について何らかの情報をお持ちの方は、以下の番号までご連絡ください。\n"
" > 電話: (508)555-5918\n"
" > SMS: (508)555-1711"

