msgid ""
"Build a concrete ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the corresponding ramp "
"down leading from the z-level above to this level.  It must be built next to a low end "
"of a ramp to allow moving between z-levels in both directions."
msgstr ""
"一つ上の層へ通じるコンクリート製の傾斜路を現在の層に設置し、この層へ通じる傾斜路を一つ"
"上の層に設置します。異なる層への移動を可能にするためには、隣接する地点に上り傾斜路下端"
"を設置してください。"

msgid ""
"Build a concrete ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the corresponding ramp "
"down leading from the z-level above to this level.  The high end of a ramp must be "
"built adjacent to allow moving between z-levels in both directions."
msgstr ""
"一つ上の層へ通じるコンクリート製の傾斜路を現在の層に設置し、この層へ通じる傾斜路を一つ"
"上の層に設置します。異なる層への移動を可能にするためには、隣接する地点に上り傾斜路上端"
"を設置してください。"

msgid "Build a drop hammer"
msgstr "ドロップハンマーを設置する"

msgid ""
"Build a palisade gate to allow us to reach the fields and replow them with a tractor "
"next year."
msgstr ""
"来年にはトラクターで畑を耕したいので、畑に進入できるように矢来門を設置しましょう。"

msgid "Build a radio tower"
msgstr "電波塔を設置する"

msgid "Build a radio tower console"
msgstr "電波制御装置を設置する"

msgid "Build a wooden bench"
msgstr "ベンチ(木)を設置する"

msgid ""
"Build an earth ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the corresponding ramp down "
"leading from the z-level above to this level.  It must be built next to a low end of a "
"ramp to allow moving between z-levels in both directions."
msgstr ""
"一つ上の層へ通じる傾斜路を現在の層に設置し、この層へ通じる傾斜路を一つ上の層に設置しま"
"す。異なる層への移動を可能にするためには、隣接する地点に上り傾斜路下端を設置してくださ"
"い。"

msgid ""
"Build an earth ramp leading to the next z-level above, and the corresponding ramp down "
"leading from the z-level above to this level.  The high end of a ramp must be built "
"adjacent to allow moving between z-levels in both directions."
msgstr ""
"一つ上の層へ通じる傾斜路を現在の層に設置し、この層へ通じる傾斜路を一つ上の層に設置しま"
"す。異なる層への移動を可能にするためには、隣接する地点に上り傾斜路上端を設置してくださ"
"い。"

msgid "Build sofa"
msgstr "ソファを設置する"

msgid "Building a butchery rack will allow us to hunt bigger animals."
msgstr "食肉処理ラックを置けば、より大きな動物を狩りに行けます。"

msgid ""
"Building a processing shack should allow us to reclaim additional seeds from our "
"byproducts."
msgstr "加工場を建てれば、農業の副産物から種子を採取できます。"

msgid "Building a tool rack should be the first priority."
msgstr "何よりもまず、工具を置く棚を作る必要があります。"

msgid "Building for Beginners"
msgid_plural "copies of Building for Beginners"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/初級建築術)"

msgid "Built in a tree."
msgstr "樹木がある位置に建設する必要があります。"

msgid ""
"Built in the image of the venerable Winchester Model 1886, Big Horn Armory's Model 89 "
"rifle packs all the power of the .500 S&W Magnum cartridge into a package less likely "
"to break one's wrist."
msgstr ""
"Big Horn Armory社のModel 89ライフルは、由緒あるウィンチェスターM1886をイメージして製造"
"されました。自分の手首の骨を折ることなく、装填した.500口径S&Wマグナム弾の威力を発揮でき"
"ます。"

msgid ""
"Built in the same style as the venerable AK series of rifles, this Russian exported "
"firearm feeds from detachable magazines rather than making use of a standard tubular "
"design like most commercial shotguns.  With 10 and 30-round magazines available, "
"reloading is rendered a much quicker procedure than can ever be accomplished with "
"conventional bottom-feeding firearms."
msgstr ""
"市販のショットガンのようなチューブ型弾倉ではなく、ロシアの古典ライフルAKシリーズのよう"
"な着脱式の弾倉で給弾する、ロシア製の銃器です。10発と30発の二種類の弾倉があり、従来のボ"
"トムフィード方式の銃では不可能だった短時間でのリロードを実現しています。"

msgid "Bulgarian flag"
msgid_plural "Bulgarian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾌﾞﾙｶﾞﾘｱ)"

msgid "Bulged ink glands"
msgstr "充満した墨袋"

msgid "Bulging Eyes"
msgstr "出目"

msgid "Bulging Reservoir"
msgstr "水分蓄積"

msgid "Bull Roids"
msgstr "ウシの巨体"

msgid "Bull's Eye"
msgstr "大当たり"

msgid ""
"Bullet marks pock the walls, interspersed with finger-deep scratches and dried blood."
msgstr "壁に指先ほどの深さの弾痕が残っており、あちこちに乾いた血が飛び散っています。"

msgid ""
"Bullshit, that's what.  The assholes busted me on possession, wasn't even my fuckin' "
"stash.  I don't do weed, man, that shit's nasty, I was just carryin' it for my buddy "
"Johnny.  Y'know, this might be a <swear> hellhole now, but if I've seen the last power-"
"trippin' asshole pistol man, it might all be worth it."
msgstr ""
"まったくのでたらめさ。麻薬の不法所持だかでブチこまれたが、あれは私が隠したブツじゃな"
"い。あんな粗悪なハッパ、自分で使うかよ、相棒のジョニーのために持ってきてやっただけだ。"
"知っての通り、今やこの世は地獄のような状況だが、<swear>、あの鼻持ちならないピストル使い"
"が消えてくれるんだったら、多少は意味があるのかもな。"

msgid "Buluotuo"
msgid_plural "copies of the Buluotuo"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/ブロト)"

msgid "Burdock, a bitter thistle-like vegetable.  Can be eaten raw or cooked."
msgstr "アザミのような姿の、苦みの強い野菜です。生でも調理しても食べられます。"

msgid "Burkina Faso flag"
msgid_plural "Burkina Faso flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾌﾞﾙｷﾅﾌｧｿ)"

msgid "Burn Care"
msgstr "火傷治療"

msgid "Burned Ground"
msgstr "焦土"

msgid "Burned Ground (Point)"
msgstr "狭い焦土"

msgid "Burned ground is here."
msgstr "植物が焼失した土地です。"

msgid ""
"Burns diesel or JP8 fuel from a tank in the vehicle.  Can also burn biodiesel or "
"kerosene, though somewhat less efficiently."
msgstr ""
"車両のタンクに入った軽油やJP8燃料を燃焼させて稼働する燃焼機関です。多少効率は悪くなりま"
"すが、バイオディーゼル燃料や灯油も燃料として利用できます"

msgid "Burrowing"
msgstr "穴掘り"

msgid "Burst Fire"
msgstr "バースト射撃"

msgid "Burst-fire wielded item"
msgstr "装備アイテムバースト射撃"

msgid "Burundian flag"
msgid_plural "Burundian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾌﾞﾙﾝｼﾞ)"

msgid "Bury the beartrap?"
msgstr "トラバサミを埋めますか？"

msgid "Bury the land mine?"
msgstr "地雷を埋めますか？"

msgid "Bus"
msgstr "バス"

msgid "Bushes"
msgstr "藪"

msgid "Business in the front, party in the back!"
msgstr "前はビジネス、後ろはパーティー！"

msgid "Busy While Working"
msgstr "仕事中の暇潰し"

msgid "Busy crafting!\n"
msgstr "忙しそうに製作しています！\n"

msgid "But bees aren't usually aggressive…"
msgstr "ハチは普通そんなに攻撃的じゃないような..."

msgid "But bees aren't usually aggressive… do you mean wasps?"
msgstr "ハチは普通そんなに攻撃的じゃない...もしかしてスズメバチ？"

msgid ""
"But being this is a .44 Magnum, the most powerful handgun in the world and would blow "
"your head clean off, you've gotta ask yourself one question:  Do I feel lucky?  Well, "
"do ya, punk?"
msgstr ""
"こいつはマグナム44って言って世界一強力な拳銃なんだ。お前のドタマなんて一発で消し飛ぶ"
"ぜ？楽にあの世まで逝けるんだ。運が良けりゃな。さあどうする？"

msgid "But can you dodge a bullet?"
msgstr "弾丸も躱せるでしょうか？"

msgid ""
"But like, I was a park ranger.  I wasn't exactly making six figures, and you know how "
"bad rent was.  I couldn't buy a ton of canned food, but what I *could* do is can "
"things myself.  Not in tin cans, but in jars; the old way.  So every paycheck, I'd use "
"a little bit to buy one or two big glass jars, and on the weekends I'd spend a few "
"hours filling them up with food and sealing them.  I started brushing up at the range "
"too.  Proud gun owner, baby."
msgstr ""
"でも、私は自然保護官だ。年収は6ケタに届かないし、家賃の高さは知っての通り。缶詰を大量に"
"買うことはできないから、自分で保存食を作った。昔ながらの瓶詰めだね。給料が出る度に大き"
"なガラス瓶を1つか2つ買って、休みの日に数時間かけて食材を浸けて封をしたんだ。射撃場で練"
"習も始めた。誇り高き銃所持者って奴だね。"

msgid "But nothing seems to happen."
msgstr "しかし、何も起こりませんでした。"

msgid "But the quality of %s image is worse than the previous one."
msgstr "%sは前に撮った写真の方が上手く撮れています。"

msgid ""
"But we're good to go, right?  I mean… the door is the only trick you had?  No clever "
"traps hidden in the walls or anything?"
msgstr ""
"でも、仕掛けさえ分かれば簡単に入れたな？つまり...ドア以外に仕掛けは用意していないのか？"
"壁に卑劣な罠を隠しておくとか、そういうのは？"

msgid "But what?"
msgstr "思っていたのに...？"

msgid "But why bother then?"
msgstr "どうしてわざわざそんな活動を？"

msgid ""
"But you DID leave your computer unprotected.  AND full of evidence.  It's exactly what "
"a government agent would need to track you down…  Someone like me…"
msgstr ""
"しかし、実際はコンピューターをそのままにして出て行った。証拠が詰まったパソコン。追跡し"
"ている政府機関にはたまらないだろうな...そう、私のような..."

msgid "But you can't touch this."
msgstr "「ユー・キャント・タッチ・ディス」"

msgid "But you did get out."
msgstr "でも今は抜け出せているじゃないか。"

msgid "But you're already smokin' hot."
msgstr "既にあなたは煙が出るほどホットです。"

msgid "Butch"
msgstr "ﾌﾞｯﾁ"

msgid "Butcher"
msgstr "死体解体"

msgid "Butcher corpses"
msgstr "食肉解体"

msgid "Butcher everything"
msgstr "全て解体"

msgid "Butcher knives are not that rare to find.  They are commonly found in kitchens."
msgstr "ブッチャーナイフは珍しい刃物じゃない。普通は台所で見つかるだろう。"

msgid "Butchering corpses"
msgstr "死体の解体"

msgid "Buttery Duck Bites"
msgstr "アヒル肉のバター炒め"

msgid "Buttonholes for cufflinks"
msgstr "カフスボタン(銀/ﾌﾞﾙｰﾄﾊﾟｰｽﾞ)"

msgid "Buy %s."
msgstr "%sの購入"

msgid "Buy the ticket, take the ride.  The datura has you now."
msgstr "チケットを買って飛び乗る。ただそれだけです。もはやダチュラの虜。"

msgid ""
"By briefly pushing off a nearby wall and leaping, you can make yourself more dangerous "
"and evasive.\n"
"\n"
"+2.0 Dodging skill, +10% critical hit chance.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"近くの壁を使って素早く跳躍し、攻撃と回避に生かします。\n"
"\n"
"回避スキル+2.0、会心発生+10%\n"
"2ターン継続"

msgid ""
"By careful dissection of the corpse, you will examine it for possible bionic implants, "
"or discrete organs and harvest them if possible.  Requires scalpel-grade cutting "
"tools, ruins corpse, and consumes a lot of time.  Your medical knowledge is most "
"useful here."
msgstr ""
"死体を注意深く解剖し、利用できそうな生体部品や個別の臓器を採取します。作業にはメスと同"
"程度の性能をもつ道具が必要で、非常に時間がかかり、作業後の死体は破壊されます。医学的知"
"識が非常に役立つ作業です。"

msgid ""
"By concentrating for a moment, you can bolster the strength of your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"Bash, cut, and stab armor increased by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"瞬間的に集中することで、皮膚を鉄のように硬くします。\n"
"\n"
"筋力x50%の打撃/斬撃/刺突耐性上昇\n"
"2ターン継続"

msgid ""
"By default, the filter applies to proficiencies containing the given string.  Using "
"just a glob <color_c_yellow>*</color> matches anything.\n"
"ex: <color_c_yellow>l:*</color> returns all learned proficiencies."
msgstr ""
"通常は、入力した文字列を含む熟練が対象になります。接頭辞に続いて<color_c_yellow>*</"
"color>とだけ入力すると、全ての熟練が対象になります。\n"
"例: <color_c_yellow>l:*</color> と入力すると、習得済みの全ての熟練が表示されます。　　"

msgid ""
"By disregarding offense in favor of defense, you are better at protecting yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 100% of Dexterity, +2 blocking effectiveness, +1.0 Dodging "
"skill."
msgstr ""
"攻撃より防御を優先することで身を守ります。\n"
"\n"
"器用x100%のブロック時ダメージ軽減、ブロック効果+2、回避スキル+1.0"

msgid ""
"By empowering the warp obelisk, you can expand the quality and variety of available "
"expeditions."
msgstr "転移のオベリスクを強化することで、遠征の質を上げ、バリエーションを拡大できます。"

msgid "By how much?  (in kJ, negative to discharge)"
msgstr "バッテリー残量を設定(単位:kJ、マイナスで減少)"

msgid ""
"By learning the fundamentals of chassis building and suspension design you will gain "
"the critical knowledge needed to hot rod properly."
msgstr ""
"車両のシャシー構築とサスペンション設計の基礎を学ぶことで、ホットロッドに必要な知識を正"
"しく身につけられます。"

msgid ""
"By making the most of your small stature, you can avoid the notice of all but the most "
"perceptive creatures, and your speed is greatly increased."
msgstr ""
"小さな背丈を最大限に生かし、大抵の生物に気づかれず動けます。速度が大幅に向上します。"

msgid ""
"By morning, the area around the lake was covered in a pinkish mold, and there were "
"walking mushrooms around shooting clouds of the dust in the air.  We didn't know what "
"was going on, but neither of us wanted to stay and find out.  We packed up our shit, "
"scraped off the boat, and took off upriver."
msgstr ""
"朝になったら、湖の周囲がピンク色のカビで覆われていて、キノコが埃みたいなものをまき散ら"
"しながら歩いていた。何が起こったのかさっぱり分からなかったけど、そこに留まって調べよう"
"なんて思わなかったよ。だから荷物をボートに詰め込んで、上流に向かったんだ。"

msgid ""
"By most mechanical and dirty hand.  I shall have such revenges on you… both.  The "
"things I will do, what they are, yet I know not.  But they will be the terrors of the "
"earth."
msgstr ""
"機械の汚れた手で、お前に復讐しよう...お前にも。それが何であれ、私にもまだ分からぬ。だが"
"世界は恐怖におののく。"

msgid ""
"By perfectly positioning yourself and your opponent, you have become more accurate and "
"can bypass your opponent's defenses.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 20% of Perception, armor penetration increased by 50% of "
"Perception.\n"
"Lasts 2 seconds."
msgstr ""
"敵の動きを正確に捉える位置取りによって精密な攻撃を繰り出し、防御を掻い潜ります。\n"
"\n"
"感覚x20%の命中上昇、感覚x50%の装甲貫通上昇\n"
"2ターン継続"

msgid "By process of elimination, you found the wire that starts the engine."
msgstr "エンジンを始動するワイヤーだと消去法で判断したものを見つけました。"

msgid ""
"By pushing your whole 'foot' against the ground you are able to move across rough "
"terrain without losing your 'footing'.  You're also able to cling to the ground "
"underwater, allowing you to move along the bottom more easily."
msgstr ""
"「足」全体を地面に押し付けて移動することで、平坦ではない地形もしっかりとした「足取り」"
"で通れます。また、水底にもしがみつくことができるため、水中の移動がより楽になります。"

msgid ""
"By quartering a previously field dressed corpse you will acquire four parts with "
"reduced weight and volume.  It may help in transporting large game.  This action "
"destroys skin, hide, pelt, etc., so don't use it if you want to harvest them later."
msgstr ""
"内臓を摘出した死体を部位ごとに分割することで、重量と体積を減らすことができます。大型動"
"物を運びたい時に役立つかもしれません。この解体方法は皮や毛皮などを破壊してしまうため、"
"それらを収穫したい場合は使用しないでください。"

msgid ""
"By taking a moment to prepare yourself, you are able to use your entire body fully for "
"attacking and defending.\n"
"\n"
"+2 blocking effectiveness, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Perception.\n"
"Enables \"Palm Strike\" and \"Double Palm Strike\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 3 seconds."
msgstr ""
"時間をかけて準備を整えることで、全身をフルに使った攻防が可能になります。\n"
"\n"
"ブロック効果+2、感覚x50%のブロック時ダメージ軽減\n"
"「掌打」「双掌打」有効化\n"
"3ターン継続"

msgid ""
"By the time you reach the rear of the matriarch, most of its offspring have "
"disappeared into the grass.  Some stuck around feeding on their unhatched siblings, "
"unwilling to give up the easy meal until the last moment"
msgstr ""
"女王の尾へ至るころには、その子孫のほとんどはどこかに姿を消してしまいました。こんな状況"
"でも食欲を抑えきれず、まだ孵化していない兄弟を食べようと留まっているものもいます"

