msgid ""
"Bōjutsu, \"The Way of the Staff\", is the Japanese martial art of fighting with a "
"staff.  Bōjutsu focuses on maintaining a good stance to effectively block and "
"counterattack."
msgstr ""
"棒術は、棒を使って戦う日本の武術です。相手の攻撃を巧みに防ぎ反撃を繰り出すために、姿勢"
"を崩さず構え続けることに重きを置いています。"

msgid "C"
