"Craft the Proof of Determination from experimental materials and miscellaneous parts.  "
"The Heart of the Island has already placed the recipe inside your mind.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: Reach Rank 2.  Some upgrades and unlocks will not be available until you have "
