msgid ""
"DEXTER IS LOST!\n"
"AGAIN!!!  He was scared off by the neighbor's dogs on 6th May & doesn't know how to "
"get home…\n"
"…he's not very clever at finding his way back!\n"
"He's a 3 y/o male Devon Rex cat with soft gray fur and big blue eyes.\n"
"He's chipped and should be wearing a yellow collar with a tag that has his name & my "
"phone number on it.\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a short-haired gray cat sitting next to four similar-looking felines.  "
"Dexter is circled in and has a bright red arrow pointing at him.]\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU SEE MY DEXTER, PLEASE DIAL 978-555-8152!\n"
"\n"
"!!!REWARD OFFERED!!!"
msgstr ""
"デクスターが失踪！\n"
"またしてもです！5月6日に近所の犬に吠えられて逃げ、帰り道が分からなくなったようです...\n"
"...とんだ方向音痴猫ですね！\n"
"3歳のオスのデボンレックスで、灰色の柔らかい毛と大きな青い目が特徴です。\n"
"チップを埋め込んでおり、黄色い首輪に名前と電話番号を書いたタグが付いています。\n"
