msgstr ""
"マカロニチーズや量り売り食品に使われるような、脱水した粉末状のチーズソースです。非常に"
"長期間保存できます。"

msgid ""
"Dehydrated fish flakes.  With proper storage, this dried food will remain edible for "
"an incredibly long time."
msgstr "乾燥させた魚です。適切に保管すれば、非常に長期にわたる保存が可能です。"

msgid ""
"Dehydrated fruit flakes.  With proper storage, this dried food will remain edible for "
"an incredibly long time.  They are useful for several cooking recipes."
msgstr ""
"乾燥させた果物です。適切に保管すれば、非常に長期にわたる保存が可能です。いくつかの料理"
"の材料にもなります。"

msgid ""
"Dehydrated garlic.  You definitely don't want to eat these like this, but they can be "
"milled or grounded into garlic powder."
msgstr ""
"脱水したニンニクです。このまま食べようとは思いませんが、ガーリックパウダーに加工できま"
"す。"

msgid ""
"Dehydrated lobster meat.  With proper storage, this dried food will remain edible for "
"an incredibly long time."
msgstr ""
"乾燥させたロブスターの身です。適切に保管すれば、非常に長期にわたる保存が可能です。"

msgid ""
"Dehydrated long-grain rice.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, virtually inedible when "
