msgid ""
"Description, huh?  Where to begin?  Let's start with the giant mob of zombies that was "
"infesting the building.  Oh, and there were also horrors full of toxic gas that "
"exploded when I got near them or killed one, so I was constantly choking on fumes the "
"whole time."
msgstr ""
"説明、ねぇ？何から話す？まず、建物内にうじゃうじゃいるゾンビの群れだ。それから、有毒ガ"
"スを貯め込んだ化け物。こいつは近寄ったり殺したりすると爆発する。毒ガスで息苦しいったら"
"なかったね。"

