msgid ""
"EMERGENCY BROADCAST - TRANSMISSION FAILED.  Original message follows: Specimens have "
"breached containment.  Facility lockdown initiated.  Experimental subjects have "
"escaped and killed lab personnel.  Revivification has triggered widespread violence.  "
"Control protocols have not been successful.  Local garrison compromised.  Please send "
"backup.  CONTACT YOUR SYSADMIN TO ATTEMPT TO RESEND."
msgstr ""
"緊急放送 [送信に失敗しました。以下のメッセージは送信できませんでした] 施設の封鎖が始"
