msgid "Firearm Cleaning"
msgstr "銃器整備"

msgid "Firearm-quality gunpowder intended for use in large rifle ammunition."
msgstr "大型ライフルの弾薬に使われる銃器用の火薬です。"

msgid "Firearm-quality gunpowder intended for use in magnum pistol ammunition."
msgstr "マグナムハンドガンの弾薬に使われる銃器用の火薬です。"

msgid "Firearm-quality gunpowder intended for use in pistol ammunition."
msgstr "ハンドガンの弾薬に使われる銃器用火薬です。"

msgid "Firearm-quality gunpowder intended for use in rifle ammunition."
msgstr "ライフルの弾薬に使われる銃器用の火薬です。"

msgid "Firearm-quality gunpowder intended for use in shotgun shells."
msgstr "ショットガンの弾薬に使われる銃器用火薬です。"

msgid ""
"Firearm-quality gunpowder, mixed without concern for composition, burn rate, or shape, "
"making it thoroughly useless for reloading ammunition.  It has been slightly ground to "
"make its properties more uniform."
msgstr ""
"銃器用の様々な火薬を組成や燃焼速度、見た目を気にせず混合した粉末です。特性が均質になる"
"ように多少砕いて細かくしていますが、こんなもので弾薬は作れません。"

msgid "Fireball Death"
msgstr "炎上(死亡効果)"

msgid "Fireflies.  Got it."
msgstr "ホタル狩りね。なるほど。"

msgid "Firefly 10-round magazine"
