msgstr "食料: %s %d kcal"

msgid "Food Truck"
msgstr "キッチンカー"

msgid "Food Vendor Cart"
msgstr "フードカート"

msgid "Food from before the Cataclysm won't last forever.  Keep that in mind."
msgstr "大変動以前からあった食料はいつか必ず不足します。心に留めておきましょう。"

msgid "Food is just the thing a starving man needs.  Thanks for the help, <name_g>."
msgstr "飢えた人間に必要なのは食べ物だけさ。本当に助かった、<name_g>。"

msgid "Food photos… your stomach rumbles!"
msgstr "美味しそうな食べ物の写真です...お腹が空いてきますね！"

msgid ""
"Food takes some time to digest, and water travels faster through your digestive system "
"than does solid food.  Sudden overeating and overdrinking may make you feel "
"excessively full, so split your meals.  If you had been starved before, it will take "
"some time to recover your body mass by building up stored calories through regular "
"eating.  Overeating for a prolonged period of time leads to obesity.  Both sides of "
"the spectrum are penalized.  When hunger and thirst progress to severe levels, you "
"will also suffer penalties.  Thirst will kill you faster than hunger."
msgstr ""
"食べ物は消化に時間がかかり、水はすぐに消化されます。一気に大量に飲み食いするのは過度な"
"満腹感の原因になるので、食事は細かく分けて摂りましょう。飢餓状態にあった人が適正体重に"
"戻るには、時間をかけて定期的な食事で摂取するカロリー量を増やしていく必要があります。長"
"期間にわたる過食は肥満の原因です。どちらにせよ、極端な食事には気を付けるべきでしょう。"
"深刻なレベルの飢えと渇きによってもペナルティは発生します。飢餓よりも喉の渇きの方が命に"
"関わります。"

msgid "Food:"
msgstr "食事:"

msgid ""
"Food:     %15d (kcal)\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"食料:     %15d (kcal)\n"
"\n"

msgid "Foodless"
msgstr "食事抜き"

msgid "Footing"
msgstr "足取り"

msgid "Footing move cost modifier <color_dark_gray>(Footing)</color>"
msgstr "移動コスト補正<color_dark_gray>(足取り)</color>"

msgid "Footwork"
msgstr "足捌き"

msgid "For Odin"
msgid_plural "sets of For Odin"
msgstr[0] "ゲームセット(オーディンの宴)"

msgid ""
"For a custom GLYPH or COLOR follow the examples below.  Default GLYPH and COLOR looks "
"like this: <color_yellow>N</color>"
msgstr ""
"全体マップにメモを追加します。表示文字や表示色は以下のように記述します。初期設定の表示"
"文字と表示色は<color_yellow>N</color>です。"

msgid ""
"For a good melee weapon, you can't beat a machete.  I've seen a guy take down a zombie "
"brute with one!  Of course, if you can find a katana, that might be even better…"
msgstr ""
"優れた近接武器と言えばやっぱりマチェットだね。マチェット1つで凶暴ゾンビを倒してる人を見"
"たことがあるよ！もちろん、刀を見つけられたら、それに越したことはないだろうけど..."

msgid "For a heartbeat, your blood cools down."
msgstr "心臓が一拍打つごとに、血が冷たくなっていきます。"

msgid ""
"For a moment the shifting mass passes into you as if it were an illusion and a slight "
"wave of fatigue washes over you."
msgstr "ポータルレイスに肉体を触れられ、軽い倦怠感に襲われました。"

msgid "For a moment you felt a great hostility all around you."
msgstr "一瞬、周囲の世界から強い敵意を感じました。"

msgid "For a moment, you feel something in your hands, but it disappears!"
msgstr "一瞬、手に何かの感触がありましたが、消えてしまいました！"

msgid ""
"For all I know, you COULD have something to do with this.  Who really knows what "
"happened?"
msgstr ""
"先程から、随分と事細かに話すじゃないか。この事態の発生原因について、何か知っているの"
"か？"

msgid ""
"For all you know, I did.  I'm being nice for now.  You'd better hope that it lasts."
msgstr ""
"ことによると、悪人かもな。今の所は優しくしてやっているんだから、大人しく従っておけ。"

msgid "For an instant you feel the absence's hunger upon you."
msgstr "一瞬、虚無からの渇望の視線を感じました。"

msgid "For containing pseudo magazines, obviously."
msgstr "疑似弾倉を収納するためのものです。"

msgid ""
"For example, on her torso, a character might wear a leather corset (close to skin), a "
"combat shirt (normal), a trenchcoat (outer), and a survivor runner pack (strapped).  "
"Her encumbrance penalty is 0.  If she put on a tank top it would conflict with the "
"leather corset and add the minimum encumbrance penalty of 2."
msgstr ""
"例えば、レザーコルセット(肌着)、軍用シャツ(通常)、トレンチコート(上着)、サバイバーラン"
"ニングバッグ(帯)を着用している場合、胴体の動作制限にペナルティはありません。しかし、更"
"にタンクトップ(肌着)を着用すると、レザーコルセット(肌着)と層が重複してしまうため、ペナ"
"ルティとして動作制限が2増加します。"

msgid ""
"For free in the construction menu: a crafting spot, a firewood source, and a practice "
"target."
msgstr "製作場所、焚物置き場、練習標的は、道具や材料なしで建設メニューから設置できます。"

msgid "For fuck's sake, shut UP!"
msgstr "頼むから、もう黙っててくれ！"

msgid "For hiking, skiing, and enjoying nature."
msgstr "ハイキングやスキーをして自然を楽しみましょう"

msgid ""
"For how long?  You've seen what's out there.  If we survive today, we'll die the day "
"after.  Or the day after that.  And if we live beyond that, we'll just see everyone we "
"care about die.  All of them.  Might as well get it over with."
msgstr ""
"生き残るって、どれだけだ？何が起きてるか知ってるだろ。今日生き残っても、明日には死ぬ。"
"明日生き残っても明後日に死ぬ。それでもずっと生き残るってことは、知ってる人間が全員死ぬ"
"まで見届けるってことだ。それを、全部、乗り越えて生きろっていうのか。"

msgid "For its apparent hunger for meat, its intestines seem almost atrophied"
msgstr "餌がほとんどなかったのか、腸はほぼ完全に萎縮しています"

msgid ""
"For lone survivors, the standard choice for installing or uninstalling bionics is an "
"Autodoc.  Usually, you can find one in a hospital or clinic.  All Autodoc procedures "
"require an anesthetic kit.  Don't even try without proper anesthesia - normal drugs "
"won't help.  However, you can bypass this restriction if you find a way to completely "
"negate pain."
msgstr ""
"生存者が単独でCBMを移植・除去する場合の標準的な選択肢がオートドクです。オートドクは通"
"常、病院や診療所に設置してあります。使用するには麻酔キットが必要です。一般的な薬品は麻"
"酔の代用にはなりませんが、苦痛を完全に除去する手段を見つけた場合は、麻酔は必要ありませ"
"ん。"

msgid ""
"For me, this started a couple days before <the_cataclysm>.  I'm a chemist.  I did my "
"research work with a brilliant colleague, Pat Dionne.  I hadn't talked to Pat in ages… "
"word has it, Pat got signed up for some kind of secret project.  So, I was a bit "
"surprised to get a letter from Pat… even more surprised when it was a series of "
"nostalgic references to a game we played years earlier."
msgstr ""
"私にとって、<the_cataclysm>は数日前に始まっていたんだ。私は化学者だ。優秀な同僚のパッ"
"ト・ディオンヌと一緒に研究をしていた。もう何年もパットとは話していないが...噂では、何か"
"極秘プロジェクトに参加することになったらしく、私とは疎遠になってしまったんだ。だから、"
"パットから手紙が届いた時は驚いたね...しかも内容が、2人で何年も前に遊んだゲームを懐かし"
"むものだったから、さらに驚いたよ。"

msgid ""
"For now, the perimeter of the Refugee Center is free of threats.  That means we can "
"afford to divert our attention to others in need of help.  However, our communication "
"with the wasteland is lacking at best and nonexistent at worst.  We need to broaden "
"our reach to intercept and send radio broadcasts.  Unfortunately Radio Towers are out "
"of the question to widen our broadcasts, as the emergency grid for them is out of "
"action.  However, Radio Stations in towns or urban areas should still have some juice "
"left.  I want you to install something called a \"radio repeater mod\" in these "
"stations that can broaden their reach and allow them to pick weaker signals.  Sadly, I "
"have neither these devices nor a manual for them at my disposal.  You'll need to find "
"instructions and assemble them yourself.  Are you up for this task?"
msgstr ""
"今のところは、避難センターの周囲に脅威はない。つまり、助けを必要としている他の生存者に"
"注意を向ける余裕があるということだ。しかし、この荒野での通信手段は控えめに言っても不足"
"気味、実際存在しないと言ってもいい状況だ。無線が受信、送信できる範囲を広げる必要があ"
"る。残念ながら緊急送電網が機能していないため、電波塔による通信範囲拡大は不可能だ。しか"
"し、市街や都市部のラジオ局ならば、今も生きた電源があるかもしれない。そのような放送局"
"に、無線通信の範囲を広げ弱い信号を拾えるようにするための「無線中継モジュール」と呼ばれ"
"る部品を繋いでもらいたい。申し訳ないが、このモジュール自体も図面も手元にはない。図面を"
"見つけ、自力で組み立てることになるだろう。この仕事に取り組んでもらえるだろうか？"

msgid ""
"For once, something *good* came back from the dead.  This ancient design lacks the "
"fire-rate of modern weapons, but packs as much punch as the best of 'em and rewards "
"the skilled shooter with easily-crafted ammunition."
msgstr ""
"悪しきものばかりではなく、*善き*銃も死の淵から蘇りました。設計が古いため現代銃器には劣"
"りますが、それでもかなり高水準の威力を発揮します。熟練したガンナーであれば、弾薬も簡単"
"に自作できます。"

msgid ""
"For some reason you dream of your shoes.  They don't fit, and nothing seems to help…"
msgstr ""
"どういう訳か履いている靴に関する夢を見ました。靴は足にフィットせず、誰も助けてはくれま"
"せん..."

msgid ""
"For some reason, things always seem to hurt you more.  Pain dealt to you is increased "
"by 25%."
msgstr ""
"何らかの理由で、常人よりも痛みを感じやすくなっています。苦痛が通常より25%増加します。"

msgid "For such a tiny creature, you're in a very big pickle."
msgstr "小動物にとってこの状況は一大事です。"

msgid ""
"For the first time in your life, you are free of the ugly sound of your pulse in your "
"ears.  How did you ever function, beaten down by that hideous rhythm?"
msgstr ""
"生れて初めて、耳の奥で聞こえる不快な拍動から解放されました。あのおぞましいリズムに支配"
"された状態で、どうやって生きてきたのでしょう？"

msgid "For the last goddamn time, leave or I will defend myself!  I will kill you!"
msgstr "最後の警告だ。ここから去らなければ、自衛手段をとるぞ！殺してやる！"

msgid "For the love of all that is holy, PLEASE shut the hell up!"
msgstr "後生だから、頼むから、もう黙ってくれ！"

msgid ""
"For your banking convenience, this Automated Teller Machine is fully capable of "
"operating autonomously in the event of complete network failure.  You can deposit "
"funds from cash cards and migrate all of your inflation-adjusted earnings to a single "
"card.  This thing has seen better days; there's been a run on the bank, and this "
"machine has the dents and cracks to prove it."
msgstr ""
"銀行の利便性を確保するために、このATMは致命的なネットワーク障害が発生した際にも完全自立"
"稼働できるようになっています。キャッシュカードからの入金や、インフレ調整済みの全資産を1"
"枚のカードにまとめる機能も備わっていますが、それが役立ったのももはや過去の話です。取り"
"付け騒ぎがあったようで、機械のあちこちに凹みやヒビが残っています。"

msgid ""
"For your first cut you connect the dozen openings on the creature's sides, only to "
"reveal a finger-sized wriggling grub in each"
msgstr ""
"死体の側面にある12個の開口部を切り開いて広げてみると、中から指ほどのサイズの蠢く幼虫が"
"現れました"

msgid "For zombies that are spawning something and die in the process."
msgstr "召喚された後死亡するゾンビのための呪文です。"

msgid "Forage through %s?"
msgstr "%sを漁りますか？"

msgid "Forager Cooking"
msgstr "野外料理"

msgid "Foraging for edible plants.\n"
msgstr "食用植物を採集しています\n"

msgid "Force capital/modified letters in prompts"
msgstr "大小文字・キー割当変更文字の入力指定"

msgid "Force redraw"
msgstr "強制再描写"

msgid "Force smart engine controller off"
msgstr "スマートエンジン制御装置の自動停止"

msgid "Force temperature"
msgstr "編集 - 気温"

msgid "Force unarmed"
msgstr "素手格闘固定"

msgid ""
"Forces the game to redraw at least once per turn.  May cause problems with weather "
"effects if enabled."
msgstr "trueにすると、最低でも1ターンに1回はゲームを再描写します。"

msgid "Foreign Mind"
msgstr "精神異常"

msgid "Foreign thoughts seem to invade your mind."
msgstr "妙な考えが頭の中に浮かび、落ち着きません。"

msgid "Foreman"
msgstr "現場監督"

msgid "Forest"
msgstr "森林"

msgid "Forested Wetland"
msgstr "森林湿地"

msgid "Forget I asked."
msgstr "その話はもういい。"

msgid "Forget I said anything, I have to go."
msgstr "さっきの話は忘れてほしい。もう行かないと。"

msgid "Forget I said anything."
msgstr "今の話は無かったことにしてほしい。"

msgid "Forget I said anything.  Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr "さっきの話は忘れてほしい。何か他の話をしようか？"

msgid "Forget all recipes"
msgstr "解禁 - 全レシピ"

msgid "Forget it, let's get going."
msgstr "その話は忘れて、もう行こう。"

msgid "Forget it, since you're not interested in taking this seriously."
msgstr "上手くできる気がしない。今の話は忘れてほしい。"

msgid "Forget it.  Enjoy your freedom."
msgstr "この話は忘れて、自由を満喫するといい。"

msgid "Forget it.  Let's go."
msgstr "その話はもういいや。さあ行こう。"

msgid "Forget vehicle position"
msgstr "車両位置の追跡を止める"

msgid "Forked Tongue"
msgstr "ヘビの舌"

msgid ""
"Formal victory is attained, and your mind is cleared to focus on your next moves.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempt.\n"
"Lasts 5 seconds."
msgstr ""
"一時の勝利に酔うことなく、次の行動に集中できるように心を整えます。\n"
"\n"
"ブロック発動+1\n"
"5ターン継続"

msgid ""
"Formaldehyde, here dissolved in water, was widely used before the Cataclysm as a "
"precursor to production of many chemicals and materials and as an embalming agent.  "
"Easily identifiable by its pungent odor.  Terribly toxic, carcinogenic, and volatile."
msgstr ""
"様々な化学物質や素材を精製する前段階、あるいは防腐剤として、大変動前は広く普及していた"
"ホルムアルデヒドの水溶液です。刺激臭があるため簡単に識別できます。強い毒性、発がん性、"
"および揮発性があります。"

msgid ""
"Formally known as Bologna sausage, this is a finely-ground preserved meat that comes "
"in circular slices.  Its first name isn't Oscar.  You can eat it cold."
msgstr ""
"輪切りされた状態で包装されている、細かい挽肉を使った保存食です。オスカー・マイヤー社の"
"製品ではなさそうです。加熱せずそのまま食べられます。"

msgid ""
"Formed from a network of interlocking bones, a long tail has mutated from the base of "
"your spine, with ossified tendons assisting in keeping the limb stiff and rigid.  A "
"plume of lengthy feathers sprouts from the reptilian flesh along your new tail, "
"drawing the eye.  While it is useless in combat and prevents you from wearing non-"
"fabric pants, you find it's pretty handy for maintaining your balance."
msgstr ""
"背骨の根元からそのまま骨格が伸びて尾になり、硬い腱によってしっかりと支えられています。"
"爬虫類の尾の表面からは長い羽毛が生えており、目を引きます。戦闘の役には立たず、布製以外"
"のアイテムを脚に着用できませんが、身体のバランスを保つ用途には役立ちます。"

msgid "Former Cop"
msgstr "元警官"

msgid "Former prisoners who got their freedom during the apocalypse."
msgstr "大変動によって自由を得た元囚人です。"

msgid ""
"Formerly belonging to an RMES mech-suit, this powerful long-range laser rifle was "
"never designed for human hands.  You might be able to make it work if you deployed it "
"or mounted it to a vehicle, though, and its long range and potency could be pretty "
"handy if you can keep it powered."
msgstr ""
"元々はRMES外骨格メックスーツに搭載されていた、強力な長距離レーザーライフルです。人間が"
"扱えるようには設計されていませんが、設置するか車両に搭載すれば、使えなくもありません。"

msgid "Forming coarse fibers into shapes."
msgstr "繊維を粗く編む技術です。"

msgid "Formula One is for Sunday drivers."
msgstr "F1なんて休日のドライブみたいなものです。"

msgid "Fortified wine from Madeira.  A true Royal Navy drink."
msgstr "マデイラ島産の酒精強化ワインです。英国海軍のための真の酒です。"

msgid "Fortitude of the Island"
msgid_plural "Fortitude of the Islands"
msgstr[0] "空島の精神"

msgid "Fortune and glory, kid.  Fortune and glory."
msgstr "冨と栄光のためさ、少年よ。富と名声だ。"

msgid "Fouling"
msgstr "汚損"

msgid ""
"Fouling is caused by firing gunpowder loads repeatedly, which reduces reliability and "
"can eventually cause damage to the gun.  Fouling accumulates slowly (unless "
"blackpowder is used) due to the design of modern smokeless powder found in the vast "
"majority of retail cartridges and it is not a significant problem until high levels of "
"fouling are reached due to firing thousands of rounds without cleaning your firearm."
msgstr ""
"銃弾を繰り返し発射することで蓄積する銃の汚損は、信頼性の低下を引き起こし、最終的には銃"
"自体の損傷に繋がります。現在市販されている大抵の無煙火薬の特性から、汚損は非常にゆっく"
"り蓄積します(黒色火薬を使った弾薬は例外です)。銃器を掃除しないまま数千発の弾薬を発射し"
"続けることでもしない限り、重大な影響はありません。"

msgid "Found a gunslinger?"
msgstr "銃の名手は見つかったかい？"

msgid "Found kitten <3"
msgstr "子猫を発見した <3"

msgid "Four Tentacles"
msgstr "触手口"

msgid ""
"Four horizontal stripes of yellow, white, red, and blue serve as a backdrop for a "
"sideways green triangle on the far left, with a white crescent moon and four stars in "
"the center."
msgstr ""
"旗が黄色、白色、赤色、青色で横に四分された旗の左端が緑色で横に長い三角形に区切られ、そ"
"の中央に白い三日月と四つの星が描かれています。"

msgid "Four in a Row set"
msgid_plural "Four in a Row sets"
msgstr[0] "ゲームセット(コネクトフォー)"

msgid "Fractal patterns dance across your vision."
msgstr "フラクタルパターンが視界を覆い尽くし、揺れ動いています。"

msgid "Frag out!"
msgstr "手榴弾投擲！"

msgid "Fragile"
msgstr "超虚弱"

msgid "Fragment mass: "
msgstr "破片の質量: "

msgid ""
"Fragments of visible uniform hint that this monstrosity was once a soldier.  Anything "
"human is invisible, hidden inside a sheath of living shadow.  It moves with "
"preternatural fluidity and grace."
msgstr ""
"見え隠れする制服の一部から、この怪物がかつては兵士だったことが分かります。それ以外の全"
"身が生きた影の幕に覆われ、全く視認できません。異常なほど滑らかに動きます。"

msgid "Frail"
msgstr "虚弱"

msgid ""
"Framed by the towering spires, roller coaster arches, and medley of stores, "
"restaurants, and vendor kiosks of some form of theme park's main boulevard, a smiling "
"family stands arrayed in the foreground of this picture.  Standing with their arms "
"about one another's shoulders, an older man and woman, two young children, and an "
"adolescent grin up at you from out of this photo—or, at least, most of them do.  One "
"of the children has their face set in a sullen glare and is, clearly unbeknownst to "
"their parents, flipping the bird towards the camera, the offending hand peeking out "
"from behind their mother's waist."
msgstr ""
"そびえ立つ尖塔、ジェットコースターのアーチ、テーマパークの大通りに並ぶ様々な店舗、レス"
"トラン、売店を背景に、笑顔の家族が写っています。成人の男性と女性は腕を組んで立ち、二人"
"の幼い子供と少し大きな少年が、カメラに向かって微笑んでいるように見えます。しかしよく見"
"ると、少年だけは不機嫌そうな顔をしており、近くにいる鳥を両親にばれないように睨みつけ驚"
"かそうとしています。"

msgid "Franchi SPAS-12 shotgun"
msgid_plural "Franchi SPAS-12 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "ショットガン(12ga/ﾌﾗﾝｷ･ｽﾊﾟｽ-12)"

msgid "Frankenstein's Monster mask"
msgid_plural "Frankenstein's Monster masks"
msgstr[0] "仮装マスク(ﾌﾗﾝｹﾝｼｭﾀｲﾝ)"

msgid "Frankie"
msgstr "ﾌﾗﾝｷｰ"

msgid "Freakish"
msgstr "大柄(レベル3)"

msgid "Freakishly Huge"
msgstr "大柄(レベル3)"

msgid "Fred"
msgstr "ﾌﾚｯﾄﾞ"

msgid "Free Barry from the mysterious structure"
msgstr "奇妙な構造物からバリーを逃がす"

msgid "Free Dmitry Sklyarov!"
msgstr "ドミトリー・スクリャーロフを解放せよ！"

msgid "Free Holster Volume (%s): %s Used Holsters:"
msgstr "ﾎﾙｽﾀｰ最大空容積(%s): %s ﾎﾙｽﾀｰ数:"

msgid "Free Jon Johansen!"
msgstr "ヨン・ヨハンセンを解放せよ！"

msgid "Free Merchant"
msgstr "自由商人"

msgid "Free Merchant Missions"
msgstr "自由商人任務"

msgid "Free Volume (%s): %s Volume (%s):"
msgstr "最大空容積(%s): %s 総容積(%s):"

msgid "Free yourself from your bionic failures"
msgstr "故障したCBMから解放される"

msgid "Freedom fighter"
msgstr "自由戦士"

msgid "Freeform"
msgstr "ファイヤーダンス"

msgid "Freeman's favorite"
msgstr "フリーマンのお気に入り"

msgid "Freeway speed limit"
msgstr "高速道路の速度規制"

msgid "Freeze point: "
msgstr "凍結点: "

msgid "Freeze you <swear> <zombies>!"
msgstr "<swear>、止まれ、<zombies>め！"

msgid "Freeze!  Show me your hands!"
msgstr "動くな！両手を見える位置に置け！"

msgid "Freezing"
msgstr "寒い **"

msgid "Freezing!"
msgstr "猛烈に寒い！"

msgid "Freight hauler access card reader"
msgstr "搬入区画カードリーダー"

msgid "French flag"
msgid_plural "French flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾌﾗﾝｽ)"

msgid "French fries"
msgid_plural "French fries"
msgstr[0] "フライドポテト"

msgid "French maid hat"
msgid_plural "French maid hats"
msgstr[0] "ホワイトブリム"

msgid "French maid outfit"
msgid_plural "French maid outfits"
msgstr[0] "ホワイトブリム"

msgid "French toast"
msgid_plural "French toast"
msgstr[0] "フレンチトースト"

msgid "Frenzied"
msgstr "狂乱"

msgid "Freq: "
msgstr "高確率: "

msgid "Frequent Flyer"
msgstr "フリークエントフライヤー"

msgid "Fresh Breeze"
msgstr "疾風(8.0～10.8m)"

msgid "Fresh Clay"
msgstr "粘土"

msgid "Fresh fruit cooked with sugar to make it last longer."
msgstr "新鮮な果物を、日持ちが良くなるように砂糖で煮込んだものです。"

msgid "Fresh gelatin.  Not vegan-friendly!"
msgstr "みずみずしいゼラチンです。ヴィーガン食品ではありません！"

msgid ""
"Fresh lobster meat, perfectly seasoned with lemon juice and a vegetable "
"accompaniment.  A gourmet dish that is both healthy and delicious."
msgstr ""
"新鮮なロブスターの身にレモン汁で絶妙な味付けを施し、野菜を添えた料理です。健康的でしか"
"も美味しい、美食家のための一品です。"

msgid "Fresh wet noodles.  Fairly bland, but fills you up."
msgstr "できたての水茹で麺です。まったく面白みのない味ですが、お腹は満たされます。"

msgid "Fresh, clean water.  Truly the best thing to quench your thirst."
msgstr "新鮮で清潔な水は喉の渇きを癒すのにぴったりです。"

msgid ""
"Freshly extracted gelatin in a dilute acid solution.  It needs to be strained to "
"separate the gelatin from the acid."
msgstr ""
"抽出されたゼラチン入りの希酸溶液です。ろ過してゼラチンを酸から分離する必要があります。"

msgid "Freshly shaven"
msgstr "顔を綺麗に剃った"

msgid "Freshly-squeezed from real fruit!  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "ちゃんと果物を絞って作ってあります！美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

msgid "Freshly-squeezed from real pineapples!  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "本物のパイナップルから絞ったジュースです！美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

msgid "Freshly-squeezed from the fruit of the Mycus."
msgstr "ミカズの果実を絞って作ったジュースです。"

msgid "Freshwater Osmosis"
msgstr "淡水浸透性"

msgid "Freshwater Research Station"
msgstr "淡水研究所"

msgid "Freshwater Research Station Base"
msgstr "拠点(淡水研究所)"

msgid ""
"Freud referred to women's sexuality as a \"dark continent\" for psychoanalysis, "
"drawing on colonial use of the same phrase to refer to Africa.  This book details how "
"the problematic universalism of psychoanalysis led theorists to reject its relevance "
"for postcolonial critique."
msgstr ""
"フロイトは女性を精神分析の「暗黒大陸」と評しましたが、これはこの言葉がアフリカという意"
"味で植民地時代に使われていたことを引き合いに出したものです。本書では、精神分析における"
"不確かな普遍主義とポストコロニアル理論批判との関連性を、理論家がどのように否定したのか"
"について詳細に解説しています。"

msgid "Freya"
msgstr "ﾌﾚｲﾔ"

msgid "Friday"
msgstr "金曜日"

msgid "Fried Desserts"
msgstr "菓子フライ調理"

msgid "Fried mozzarella cheese sticks, yum.  They lack sauce though."
msgstr ""
"モッツァレラチーズをスティック状に切って揚げた料理です。美味しいですが、ソースは付いて"
"いません。"

msgid "Fried potatoes with delicious cheese smothered on top."
msgstr "美味しいチーズがかかったフライドポテトです。"

msgid "Fried rice, a simple dish made by stir-frying rice with other ingredients."
msgstr "ご飯と他の食材を混ぜて炒めたシンプルな料理です。"

msgid "Friendly"
msgstr "友好 "

msgid "Friendly NPCs don't pickup items inside the zone."
msgstr "友好NPCは区域内のアイテムを拾得しません。"

msgid ""
"Friendly NPCs will investigate unseen sounds only if they come from inside this area."
msgstr "友好NPCはこの区域内から発生する正体不明の音のみを調査します。"

msgid "Friendly NPCs won't investigate unseen sounds coming from this zone."
msgstr "友好NPCはこの区域内から発生する正体不明の音を調査しません。"

msgid "Friendly, Humane Fashion"
msgid_plural "copies of Friendly, Humane Fashion"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/気さくで優雅なファッション)"

msgid "Friendly."
msgstr "友好"

msgid "Friendly: %1$d"
msgstr "友好: %1$d"

msgid "Frog Eyes"
msgstr "カエルの目"

msgid "Frog Metamorphosis"
msgstr "急変(カエル)"

msgid "Frog Mother Hurt Self"
msgstr "ゾンビウシガエル自傷"

msgid "Frog Mutation"
msgstr "変化(カエル)"

msgid "Frog Transformation"
msgstr "変異(カエル)"

msgid ""
"From a water source like this, you can fill any containers you might have.  Examine "
"the dispenser by pressing <keybind:examine>.  Next, press <color_yellow>'c'</color> to "
"fill a container, then select the <color_light_cyan>plastic bottle</color> to put the "
"water into.\n"
"\n"
"The Examine command (<keybind:examine>) can be used for interacting with many types of "
"terrain and furniture.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please fill the plastic bottle with water, drink a little of "
"it (by pressing <keybind:eat> and selecting <color_light_cyan>clean water</color>), "
"and then move to the corridor to the north."
msgstr ""
"このような水源があれば、様々な容器に水を汲み入れることができます。<keybind:examine>を押"
"してウォーターサーバーを調べ、次に<color_yellow>c</color>キーを押してから"
"<color_light_cyan>ペットボトル(500ml)</color>を選択すれば、水を汲めます。\n"
"\n"
"調べるコマンドの<keybind:examine>を押せば、様々な地形や設置物を使った行動を取ることがで"
"きます。\n"
"\n"
"ボトルに水を入れられたら一口飲み(<keybind:eat>を押してから<color_light_cyan>飲料水</"
"color>を選択)、北側の通路に移動してチュートリアルを続けましょう。"

msgid "From above you heard %s"
msgstr "上から%s"

msgid "From below you heard %s"
msgstr "下から%s"

msgid "From catwalk to Cataclysm."
msgstr "大舞台から大変動まで。"

msgid "From cur location: %s"
msgstr "現在地: %s"

msgid "From here you heard %s"
msgstr "すぐ近くで%s"

msgid "From the %1$s you hear %2$s"
msgstr "%1$sで%2$s"

msgid "From the <random_direction> <up_or_down> you hear <random_sound>"
msgstr "<random_direction>の<up_or_down>で<random_sound>"

msgid "From the <random_direction> you hear <random_sound>"
msgstr "<random_direction>で<random_sound>"

msgid "From the Maccabees to the Mishnah"
msgid_plural "copies of From the Maccabees to the Mishnah"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/マカバイ記からミシュナーへ)"

msgid ""
"From the deteriorated state of this undead horse's ghastly features--protruding ribs, "
"off-white skull, and decayed, tattered muscles--it doesn't seem like it should put up "
"much of a fight, but something deep inside gives it power.  Reeking pus drips from its "
"wounds."
msgstr ""
"露出した肋骨、オフホワイトの頭蓋骨、腐ってボロボロになった筋肉。悲惨な姿だけに注目すれ"
"ばとても戦える状態ではないように見えますが、内なる何かがこのゾンビウマに力を与えていま"
"す。傷口からは悪臭を放つ黒い膿が滴り落ちています。"

msgid ""
"From the head of this shower descend a dozen streams of thin black glass, with frozen "
"droplets strung from them like pearls."
msgstr ""
"シャワーヘッドからは黒い半透明のガラスの筋が数十本垂れ下がっており、その下には凍り付き"
"固まった水滴が真珠のように連なっています。"

msgid ""
"From time to time the Mycus requires protection from non-Mycus that, for whatever "
"reason, wish it ill.  We have adapted to better carry out this task - our fibers will "
"grow strong and resilient when such threats present themselves to us."
msgstr ""
"我々はしばしばミカズをミカズならざる者から守護せねばならない。ミカズならざる者にいかな"
"る理由があろうと、我々はそれらが絶滅することを望む。このような脅威と対峙する場合、我々"
"の繊維の強度と弾性は強化される。"

msgid ""
"From what I understand, the creatures you encountered surrounding this relic were "
"unlike anything I've heard of.  It is laughable that I now consider the living dead to "
"be part of our ordinary reality.  Never-the-less, the church must have some "
"explanation for these events.  I have located the residence of a local clergy man, "
"could you go to this address and recover any items that may reveal what the church's "
"stance is on these events?"
msgstr ""
"この遺物を取り囲んでいたという者たちの姿、今までに聞いたこともないよ。笑うかもしれない"
"が、私は以前から生ける屍を現実のものとして真剣に考えていたんだ。教会にはこの事態を説明"
"する義務がある。この町の司祭の住所だ。ここに行けば、この事態に教会はどう対処するのか、"
"それを明らかにする物があるかもしれない。"

msgid ""
"From your high vantage point, you can strike downward and deal more damage.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage while near a wall.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"高い位置から下に向かって攻撃することで、より大きなダメージを与えます。\n"
"\n"
"壁隣接時発動、与ダメージ+10%\n"
"3ターン継続"

