msgid ""
"Frost-dusted pastures and the fringes of a forest in winter sparseness liven this "
"picture, with two grinning men standing in the foreground dressed in khaki pants and "
"matching winter jackets, their arms about one another's shoulders.  In the distance, a "
"herd of deer can be seen clustered by a semi-frozen lake.  The fact that some of the "
"group's fawns seem to sport unnaturally course streaks of black hair and that, you "
"could swear, at least one of them has a second set of eyes between their budding "
"antlers seems to have gone unnoticed by the photo's previous owner."
msgstr ""
"カーキ色のズボンと揃いの防寒ジャケットを着た二人の男性が、互いに肩を組んでニコニコと"
"笑っている写真です。背後には霜が降りた牧草地と葉がまばらな冬の森が広がり、写真に彩りを"
"添えています。遠くには、半分凍った湖に集まるシカの群れが見えます。何頭かの小鹿の毛皮が"
"不自然な縞模様になっており、その内の少なくとも一頭は、伸び始めた角の間に間違いなく余分"
"な二つの目が付いています。以前の写真の所有者は気付かなかったのでしょうか。"

