msgid ""
"Fungi bloom from the crevices in the ossified plates of this ponderous bone titan, and "
"it seems even its eyes are lost to it.  A dust of spores lands on the ground with "
"every sluggish stomp of its heavy legs."
msgstr ""
"巨大な骨の巨人がもつ装甲の割れ目からは真菌の花が咲き、視力も失われているようです。重い"
"足取りでゆっくりと動き回る度に、埃のような胞子が足下に降り注いでいます。"

msgid ""
"Fungi bloom from the crevices in the twisted bone growths that cover this creature.  "
"Spores linger in the air around it."
msgstr ""
"肉体を覆う発達した骨の隙間から菌糸が顔を出しています。周囲には胞子が漂っています。"

msgid "Fungicide"
msgstr "殺菌"

msgid ""
"Fungicide enhanced with sulfur to create sprayable anti-fungal ammo for the chemical "
"thrower.  Best used with some kind of mask or mouth protection."
msgstr ""
"化学物質噴霧器に装填して使う硫黄殺菌剤です。使用の際はマスクなどで口を防護しましょう。"

msgid "Fungus Among Us"
msgstr "紛れ込んだ真菌"

msgid "Fungus grows thick here, obscuring the ground beneath it."
msgstr "真菌が厚く積み重なり、地面を覆い隠しています。"

