msgid ""
"Fur pelts wrapped around the belly.  Usually worn in combination with a chestwrap.  "
"Provides negligible protection against punches to your stomach."
msgstr ""
"腹に巻き付ける毛皮の端切れです。通常はチェストラップと併せて着用します。腹部への攻撃に"
"対して、ごくわずかな防御効果があります。"

msgid ""
"Fur pelts wrapped around the chest.  Preserves your modesty and keeps things out of "
