msgstr ""
"生存者が暮らしている森の中の小屋に向かい、<color_yellow>仲間</color>に加えましょう。"

msgid "Go to the location Helena told you about and see who's there."
msgstr "ヘレナが指定した地点へ行き、どんな人物がいるのか調べましょう。"

msgid "Go to the refueling stop"
msgstr "給油拠点に向かう"

msgid "Go up"
msgstr "上層へ移動"

msgid "Go wild with CBM weapons.  Don't reserve any power for defense or utility CBMs."
msgstr ""
"攻撃用CBMをどんどん使用しろ。防御や多目的CBMのために電力を取っておかなくてもいい。"

msgid "Go wild, you don't need to aim much."
msgstr "がんがんいこう。照準なんて合わせなくていい。"

msgid "Go!  Flee!"
msgstr "行け！逃げよう！"

msgid "Go-kart"
msgstr "ゴーカート"

msgid "Go. Away."
msgstr "早く、行け。"

msgid "God bless you!"
msgstr "神のご加護がありますように！"

msgid ""
"God bless you, <name_g>.  Arturo shouldn't have to worry about his hallucinations for "
"a long time."
msgstr "<name_g>、神の祝福あれ。これでアルトゥーロもしばらくは幻覚の心配をせずに済む。"

msgid "God in Search of Man : A Philosophy of Judaism"
msgid_plural "copies of God in Search of Man : A Philosophy of Judaism "
msgstr[0] "本(一般/人間を探し求める神:ユダヤ教の哲学)"

msgid "Going Mach"
msgstr "マッハゴー"

msgid "Going to catch some shut-eye."
msgstr "ちょっと眠らせてもらうよ。"

msgid "Gold"
msgstr "金"

msgid "Gold member"
msgstr "ゴールド会員"

msgid "Golden monoliths to Sphenocoronae."
msgstr "黄金のモノリスがスフェノコロナに変化します。"

msgid "Golden, jelly-like food with the flavor of apples."
msgstr "リンゴの風味が付いた、黄金色のゼリー状の食品です。"

msgid "Golden-fried potatoes."
msgstr "黄金色のジャガイモ料理です。"

msgid "Golf Cart"
msgstr "ゴルフカート"

msgid "Golf Course"
msgstr "ゴルフ場"

msgid "Golf Course (clubhouse)"
msgstr "ゴルフ場(クラブハウス)"

msgid "Golf Course (mid course)"
msgstr "ゴルフ場(ミドルコース)"

msgid "Golly.  I didn't expect that, but I'm as good as my word.  Let's get going."
msgstr "おや。意外なことだが、約束は守ろう。一緒に行くよ。"

msgid ""
"Goo from inside a mi-go, perhaps some kind of blood?  It's obviously alien, given its "
"pink color and strange, nostril-stinging odor.  It would not be advisable to try to "
"drink it."
msgstr ""
"ミ＝ゴの体内から漏れ出た体液、あるいは血液でしょうか？鼻腔を刺激するピンク色の粘液は、"
"明らかに地球外の物質です。食べようとするのは得策ではありません。"

msgid "Good"
msgstr "やや健康"

msgid "Good Company"
msgstr "素敵な仲間"

msgid "Good Hearing"
msgstr "優れた聴覚"

msgid "Good evening.  Welcome to our safe zone."
msgstr "こんばんは。安全地帯へようこそ。"

msgid "Good evening.  Welcome to the library."
msgstr "こんばんは。図書館へようこそ。"

msgid "Good good."
msgstr "いいね。"

msgid "Good haul.  See you around<punc>"
msgstr "よしいいぞ。じゃあな<punc>"

msgid "Good hit!"
msgstr "見事に命中しました！"

msgid "Good luck out there!"
msgstr "頑張ってくれよ！"

msgid "Good luck with that."
msgstr "上手くいくことを祈っているよ。"

msgid "Good luck with that.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr "幸運を祈っているよ。私はこれで失礼する。"

msgid "Good luck with that.  See you around, Tom."
msgstr "頑張って。また今度、トム。"

msgid "Good luck with that…"
msgstr "上手くいくことを祈っているよ..."

msgid "Good luck!"
msgstr "健闘を祈る！"

msgid "Good news, <name_g>.  One survivor sailed to us recently."
msgstr "いい知らせだ、<name_g>。最近、生存者が一人やって来たんだ。"

msgid "Good night!  Wake me if you need me."
msgstr "おやすみ！何かあったら起こしてくれ。"

msgid "Good night, <name_g>."
msgstr "いい夢を、<name_g>。"

msgid ""
"Good one!  Survivor, you have just passed my test.  I knew you could do it.  Your work "
"shall be rewarded!"
msgstr ""
"いいぞ！テストは合格だ。あんたならできると思ってた。その功績を称えて報酬を贈ろう！"

msgid "Good point, let's find a more appropriate place."
msgstr "そうだな、もう少し話しやすい場所に移ろう。"

msgid "Good start!  Keep it up and move more."
msgstr "好調なスタートですね！その調子でもっと活動しましょう。"

msgid "Good to have some company."
msgstr "仲間がいてくれて良かったよ。"

msgid "Good to hear that."
msgstr "ひとまずは安心だな。"

msgid "Good to hear.  I'm sure everyone will appreciate that place being cleaned up."
msgstr "それはよかった。あの場所が片付けば、きっとセンターの皆も喜ぶに違いない。"

msgid "Good to know."
msgstr "なるほど。"

msgid "Good to know.  Can you perform first aid?"
msgstr "良いことを知ったよ。応急手当はできる？"

msgid "Good to know.  What orders can I give?"
msgstr "良いことを知ったよ。どんな指示が出せるんだ？"

msgid "Good to meet you too.  What are you doing out here?"
msgstr "こちらこそよろしく。ここで何をしているんだ？"

msgid ""
"Good to see people like you in the world.  I'm Sonia, Sonia Greene.  I entertain the "
"people."
msgstr ""
"あなたみたいな人に会えて嬉しいよ。私はソニア、ソニア・グリーン。皆を楽しませて過ごして"
"る。"

msgid "Good to see you again, Reverend.  I wanted to talk."
msgstr "また会えて光栄だ、神父様。話したいことがある。"

msgid "Good to see you again."
msgstr "また会えて嬉しいよ。"

msgid "Good to see you're still around."
msgstr "無事なようで安心したよ。"

msgid "Good to see you, Boris.  Are things looking up for you at all?"
msgstr "会えて嬉しいよ、ボリス。状況はよくなった？"

msgid ""
"Good work, Marshal.  Here's some supplies for your next venture.  Come back to me if "
"you are willing to install more."
msgstr ""
"よくやった、執行官。今後役立ちそうな物資をいくつか用意しておいた。更に接続を手伝ってく"
"れるなら、また私に言ってくれ。"

msgid "Good."
msgstr "よし。"

msgid ""
"Good.  I just need a little stuff: 50 scrap, 6 medium batteries, 5 small high-quality "
"lenses and a radio remote control.  Bring the scrap for now, but don't forget about "
"the rest."
msgstr ""
"よし。必要なのは金属屑50個、中型の充電池6個、小型高性能レンズ5個、そして無線制御装置1個"
"だ。まずは金属屑50個をお願いするよ。残りも集めておいてくれると助かる。"

msgid "Good.  I'll be right behind you."
msgstr "よかった。私は後をついていくからな。"

msgid ""
"Good.  Let's go to the tree and <swear> burn it down!  Oh, bring some tinder so we can "
"start the fire.  I can make the sparks."
msgstr ""
"ああ。その木が生えてる所へ行って、<swear>、火をつけるんだ！火口を持ってきてほしい。火を"
"つける道具はこっちで用意する。"

msgid "Good.  Something else…"
msgstr "いいね。他には..."

msgid "Good.  Take care."
msgstr "うん。お大事に。"

msgid "Goodbye, <name_b>!"
msgstr "お元気で、<name_b>！"

msgid "Goodbye."
msgstr "さようなら。"

msgid "Goopy cheese sauce made by rehydrating cheese powder."
msgstr "水で戻した粘り気のあるチーズソースです。"

msgid "Goopy white wine, made of the Mycus fruit."
msgstr "ミカズフルーツから作られた濃厚な白ワインです。"

msgid "Goosebumps"
msgstr "鳥肌"

msgid ""
"Goosebumps cover your skin as a warp pulse passes through you.  You're only one warp "
"pulse from your deadline."
msgstr ""
"転移パルスが肉体を通り抜け、全身に鳥肌が立ちました。猶予はあと1パルスしかありません。"

msgid "Goosebumps stand across your entire body.  You keep feeling that you're falling."
msgstr "全身の皮膚が粟立ちました。落下し続けているような感覚が消えません。"

msgid "Gore Longitude"
msgid_plural "copies of Gore Longitude"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/ゴア・ロングティチュード)"

msgid "Got a Check-up"
msgstr "健康診断受診"

msgid "Got a haircut"
msgstr "散髪した"

msgid "Got any advice?"
msgstr "何か助言をもらえない？"

msgid "Got any alcohol to spare?  Need to recharge my drives.  Methanol would do."
msgstr ""
"アルコールは余ってない？充電する必要があるんだ。もしあるなら、メタノールがいいな。"

msgid "Got any bread for sale?"
msgstr "パンは売っているか？"

msgid "Got any leads on some survivors?"
msgstr "他の生存者の手掛かりを知らないか？"

msgid "Got any more bread I can trade flour for?"
msgstr "穀粉とパンを交換してもらえないか？"

msgid "Got any more of that?"
msgstr "まだ持ってる？"

msgid "Got any survival advice?"
msgstr "何かサバイバルの助言はあるかな？"

msgid "Got any theories on what happened?"
msgstr "一体何が起きたんだろう？"

msgid "Got any tips about the boss zombie?"
msgstr "ゾンビのリーダーについて他に情報はある？"

msgid "Got any tips about the dragonflies?"
msgstr "巨大なトンボについて他に情報はある？"

msgid "Got anything else I can help out with?"
msgstr "他に何か手伝えることはある？"

msgid "Got anything for sale?"
msgstr "何か売り物はあるかな？"

msgid "Got comfy"
msgstr "くつろいでいる"

msgid "Got it!"
msgstr "分かった！"

msgid "Got it, <name_g>."
msgstr "了解、<name_g>。"

msgid "Got it."
msgstr "分かった。"

msgid "Got it.  Give me some advice on building a camp."
msgstr "分かった。拠点を作るにあたって注意することを教えてほしい。"

msgid "Got it.  Tell me about expansions."
msgstr "なるほど。拡張施設について教えてほしい。"

msgid "Got some gold for me?"
msgstr "金を持ってきてくれた？"

msgid "Got some time to talk?"
msgstr "話をする時間はある？"

msgid "Got something to hide?"
msgstr "何から逃げている？"

msgid "Got the cloth?"
msgstr "草編みブランケットは手に入った？"

msgid "Got the hard drive delivered?"
msgstr "ハードディスクは届けてくれたか？"

msgid "Got the little ones yet?"
msgstr "小さな箱はあった？"

msgid "Got the nails?"
msgstr "釘は手に入れたか？"

msgid "Got the photo?  Should've been in my gun safe."
msgstr "写真は見つかった？武器庫にあるはずなんだ。"

msgid "Got the seeds?  They're important to me."
msgstr "種はあった？とても大事なものなんだ。"

msgid "Got the smokes?"
msgstr "タバコは手に入った？"

msgid "Got this knocked out?"
msgstr "やっつけたか？"

msgid "Got those cattail stalks yet?"
msgstr "ガマの茎(調理済)"

msgid ""
"Got those cattail stalks yet?  Don't forget to bring back my bag and to work on "
"improving your survival skill as well."
msgstr ""
"ガマの茎の収穫はできたか？バッグを持ち帰ってくることと、サバイバルスキルを1レベル上げる"
"ことも忘れずにね。"

msgid "Got time to teach me anything?"
msgstr "もし時間があるなら、何かスキルを教えてもらえないか？"

msgid "Got tips for avoiding trouble?"
msgstr "揉め事を避けるコツは？"

msgid "Gotcha."
msgstr "よし。"

msgid "Gotta bandage this or I'll bleed out.  Give me a sec."
msgstr "包帯を巻いておかないと出血するな。ちょっと待ってて。"

msgid "Gotta earn my keep."
msgstr "生活費を稼ぐためだよ。"

msgid "Gotta get past you, <name_g>."
msgstr "<name_g>、そこを通りたいんだ。"

msgid "Gotta get some fuel soon."
msgstr "早く燃料を手に入れないと。"

msgid "Gotta go through it!"
msgstr "逃げられない！"

msgid "Gotta say, I'm not minding the snow."
msgstr "そうそう、雪は嫌いじゃないんだ。"

msgid "Gotta slurp some slurry in a hurry here!"
msgstr "早くプルトニウム懸濁液を飲み干したい！"

msgid ""
"Gotta start small right?  Little ones for keeping little things safe.  I could use 'em."
msgstr "小さな仕事からこなすか？小さな物を守るための小さな箱が必要だ。持ってきてくれ。"

msgid ""
"Gotta start small right?  Little ones for keeping little things safe.  I could use "
"'em.  I need a bunch of 'em.  Little ones, you know?  Can you bring me like… like… "
"forty?"
msgstr ""
"小さな仕事からこなすか？小さな物を守るための小さな箱が必要だ。持ってきてくれ。たくさん"
"欲しい。小さな物、分かるか？ええっと...そうだな...40個くらい欲しいかな？"

msgid "Gotta stoke the furnace, need some fuel."
msgstr "体内炉に入れる燃料が必要だ。"

msgid "Gotta top up my ethanol reserve."
msgstr "エタノールを補充しないと。"

msgid "Gourmand"
msgstr "大食い"

msgid "Gout"
msgstr "連射"

msgid ""
"Gov assigns names based off numerological conversions of house numbers.  Robert "
"Williamson: 205 W Orchard Avenue.  Robert (78) + Williamson (127) = 205.  Despite the "
"beautiful weather, he keeps the curtains closed and no one has even visited yet.  And "
"he's been here for more than two weeks!  I only ever see him when he's coming or going "
"from work.  I assume it's work, even if the hours are strange sometimes.  Black car, "
"out of state plates, looks brand new.  Fed behavior, if you ask me… Is he actually "
"going somewhere or just trying to convince me he's legitimate?  Is he on the job when "
"he leaves or on the job when he's here?  Further investigation required."
msgstr ""
"政府は番地を数値に変換し、名前を割り当てている。ロバート・ウィリアムソン: オーチャード"
"通り205番地。ロバート(78) + ウィリアムソン(127) = 205。天気も良いのにカーテンを閉めたま"
"まで、訪問者もまったくいない。奴は2週間以上もここにいる！私と会うのは出勤と帰宅の時だけ"
"だ。妙な時間帯の時もあるが、おそらく仕事。黒色、州外のナンバープレート、新車。連邦捜査"
"官のようだ...本当にどこかへ出掛けるのか、それともまともな仕事をしていると思わせたい？仕"
"事場へ出掛けるのか、ここで仕事をしているのか？さらなる調査が必要。"

msgid ""
"Government regulations dictate that since this isn't *technically* ice cream, it can "
