msgstr "ふーん、分かった。"

msgid "Hmm, spirals."
msgstr "うーん、うずまき。"

msgid "Hmm."
msgstr "ふうん。"

msgid ""
"Hmm.\"  Smokes looks thoughtful, rubbing his chin.  \"Well, most of the people "
"downstairs aren't willing to come up for things like that, and a lot of folks that are "
"up here have a lot of bad memories from that.  You could try asking around some of the "
"people we have upstairs, but it'll be tough.  If you have some merch you could spare, "
"though, I could get some people off guard duty and into your little crew for some "
"hazard pay.  You might also have luck asking the Old Guard rep in the southwest bay, "
"near the library - I hear they've got some volunteers lately."
msgstr ""
"うーん...[スモークスは顎に手を当てて考えこんでいる]...まぁ、地下組はそういうことは積極"
"的に手伝わないし、地上組も、裏手の事件で酷い目に遭った奴は多い。掛け合ってみるのは自由"
"だが、難しいだろうな。もし危険手当としてマーチを支払ってくれるなら、片付けを手伝ってや"
"るよ。後は、建物南西にある図書室の近くにはオールドガードの担当者が来ている。最近は志願"
"者も増えたらしいし、一度尋ねてみたらどうだ。"

msgid "Hmm?  Nothing, I guess I just like resting in this place.  I feel good today."
msgstr "うーん？いや、ただここで一休みしてるだけ。今日は気分がいい。"

