msgstr "食料を増やす"

msgid "Increase frequencies in odd steps - local discontinuity!"
msgstr "変則的な段階を踏んで周波数を上げる - 局所的な不連続性！"

msgid "Increase priority"
msgstr "優先度を上げる"

msgid "Increase selected amount for the highlighted item"
msgstr "強調表示アイテムの選択個数を増加"

msgid "Increase skill"
msgstr "スキル上昇"

msgid "Increase value"
msgstr "値を増やす"

msgid ""
"Increased draft increases water drag, and water drag reduces a vehicle's speed in "
"water.  If you want your boat to go fast, make it as light as possible."
msgstr ""
"喫水が高いと流体抗力が増加し、水中での車両の速度が低下します。ボートを速く走らせたいな"
"ら、できるだけ体積を軽くしましょう。"

msgid "Increased storage capacity by %i."
msgstr "蓄電容量が%i増加しました。"

msgid "Increases pain."
msgstr "苦痛が増加します。"

msgid "Increases pain.  Designed for mi-go slaver beam."
msgstr "苦痛を増加させます。ミ＝ゴ・スレイヴァーのビームで使われます。"

msgid ""
"Increases the body's wavelength, allowing the user to quantum tunnel through walls, "
"reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, but each tile "
"tunneled through costs 250 bionic power."
msgstr ""
"使用者の物質波長を増大させることで、量子トンネルをくぐり抜けて壁を通過し、向こう側へ再"
"出現します。待機中の電力消耗は微少ですが、1タイルの通過につき電力を250消費します。"

msgid ""
"Increases your body's wavelength, allowing you to quantum tunnel through walls, "
"reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, but each tile "
"tunneled through costs 250 bionic power."
msgstr ""
"肉体の物質波長を増大させることで、量子トンネルをくぐり抜けて壁を通過し、向こう側へ再出"
"現します。待機中の電力消耗は微少ですが、1タイルの通過につき電力を250消費します。"

