msgid ""
"Initial immersion testing upon establishing a stable destination candidate is to be "
"carried out utilizing a standardized series of six unmanned drones (specifications "
"detailed separately) without any form of wireless capability, connected by an "
"immersion-stable umbilical line to an isolated control terminal primeside operated by "
"a mechanical arm by authorized science staff.  Upon retrieval the first three drones "
"are to be incinerated without sampling, the fourth and fifth disassembled prior to "
"incineration and the sixth (equipped with sampling capabilities) taken to analysis."
msgstr ""
"安定した目的候補地を確立した後の初期浸入試験は、無線機能をもたない標準型ドローン6機(仕"
"様は別途詳述)を用いて実施される。このドローンは主次元の独立した制御端末に浸入安定性の高"
"いケーブルで接続され、権限をもつ研究スタッフがメカニカルアームを使って操作する。帰還"
"後、最初の3機のドローンはサンプリングを行なわずに焼却し、4機目と5機目は分解後に焼却し、"
"サンプリング機能を搭載した6機目は分析に回す。"

msgid ""
