msgid ""
"Intended for the clarification and disinfection of unsafe drinking water while camping "
"or travelling, this sodium dichloroisocyanurate-based purification tablet removes "
"dangerous contaminants using powerful chemicals.  The label says to use one tablet per "
"liter."
msgstr ""
