msgid ""
"Judo is a martial art that focuses on grabs and throws, both defensive and offensive.  "
"You are resistant to most effects that can knock you down and can counter grab and "
"takedown attacks with a strong judo throw."
msgstr ""
"柔道は投げと掴みに重点を置く、攻守を兼ね備えた武術です。打ち倒しに抵抗できるようにな"
"り、カウンター拘束、強力な投げ飛ばし技を習得できます。"

