"Kinda, I guess.  I heard people blaming the riots on some kind of drug, and frankly "
"I'm not sure that's far off base.  That's kinda what it felt like, although the whole "
"time I really felt like myself.  It wasn't until I snapped out of it that I realized "
"how weird it was.  That doesn't explain anything else though: the zombies, the "
"monsters, all this stuff is way off base.  Anything I've tried to guess just sounds "
"like scary stories, like demonic curses or alien weapons kinda stuff."
