msgid ""
"Kneeling in the foreground of this photo, within the overhang of several trees, a "
"camouflaged soldier with a green beret and a rifle strapped across his shoulders "
"crouches, an affectionate grin creasing his unshaven face.  With its broad paws placed "
"within the man's lap, a large German shepherd wearing a Kevlar harness nuzzles against "
"the soldier's chest, the dog cuddling within the military man's arms while its jaws "
"are clamped about a bundle of ragged cloth.  After some scrutiny, you deduce it to "
"have once been the bloodied crotch of a very unfortunate pair of trousers.  In recent "
"penmanship, someone's jotted on the photo's rear.\n"
"\n"
"\"I'm sorry.\""
