msgstr ""
"「空きスペース」を潰して菜園を広げましょう(他の用途に使いたい場合は選択しないでくださ"
"い)。"

msgid ""
"Let's expand the workspace for larger projects and add a drop hammer for productivity "
"with log pillars."
msgstr ""
"丸太壁で広い作業用スペースを作り、ドロップハンマーを追加して生産性を向上しましょう。"

msgid "Let's expand work area with a wall, and add a bookshelf for our reference books."
msgstr "壁を延長して作業場を広げ、参考になる書籍を置く本棚を追加しましょう。"

msgid "Let's extend our storage building with a fifth section."
msgstr "貯蔵庫を五区画まで拡張しましょう。"

msgid "Let's extend our storage building with a fourth section."
msgstr "貯蔵庫を四区画まで拡張しましょう。"

msgid "Let's extend our storage building with a ninth section."
msgstr "貯蔵庫を九区画まで拡張しましょう。"

msgid "Let's extend our storage building with a second section."
msgstr "貯蔵庫をもう一区画拡張しましょう。"

msgid "Let's extend our storage building with a tenth section."
msgstr "貯蔵庫を十区画まで拡張しましょう。"

msgid "Let's extend our storage building with a third section."
msgstr "貯蔵庫を三区画まで拡張しましょう。"

msgid "Let's extend our storage building with an eighth section."
msgstr "貯蔵庫を八区画まで拡張しましょう。"

msgid "Let's extend our storage building with an eleventh section."
msgstr "貯蔵庫を十一区画まで拡張しましょう。"

msgid "Let's extend our storage building with the absolutely very last section."
msgstr "貯蔵庫を最大まで拡張しましょう。"

msgid "Let's extend the north wall to the west and add some storage space."
msgstr "北の壁を西まで伸ばし、収納スペースも追加しましょう。"

msgid "Let's extend the second wall to match the first one."
msgstr "拡張した車両解体場を完成させましょう。"

msgid ""
"Let's extent the garage to hangar size, allowing us to work on monster vehicles or a "
"large number of normal ones."
msgstr ""
"格納庫サイズまで広がった車両解体場を完成させ、超大型車やたくさんの普通車を解体できるよ"
"うにしましょう。"

msgid ""
"Let's finish our storage building with a last section.  We could then go on to double "
"the volume with another six sections, but if that seems excessive we could use the "
"space to unload loot instead."
msgstr ""
"貯蔵庫を完成させましょう。更に6つの区画を追加して広さを2倍にすることもできますが、広す"
"ぎると思うなら、区画を追加せず物資の仮置き場として使ってもいいでしょう。"

msgid "Let's finish the central kitchen."
msgstr "中央の調理場を完成させましょう。"

msgid ""
"Let's finish the garage by building a palisade gate to allow us to close off the outer "
"end."
msgstr "解体場の仕上げとして、屋根がある区画を閉鎖できるように矢来門を設置しましょう。"

msgid "Let's finish the kitchen walls."
msgstr "調理場を完成させましょう。"

msgid "Let's fix up radio tower and controls to improve our recruitment efforts."
msgstr "もっと人を効率的に集められるように、電波塔と制御装置を修理しましょう。"

msgid "Let's forget the world for a while.  How you doin'?"
msgstr "しばらく世界の惨状は忘れよう。調子はどう？"

msgid "Let's furnish the common area."
msgstr "共用スペースに家具を揃えましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the east bedroom with beds."
msgstr "東区画の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the eastern bedroom with a set of beds."
msgstr "東区画の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the glassblower's cottage."
msgstr "硝子吹き作業場に家具を置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the northeast bedroom."
msgstr "北東区画に寝室を作りましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the northwest bedroom with a set of beds."
msgstr "北西区画の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the northwest bedroom with beds."
msgstr "北西区画の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the northwest bedroom."
msgstr "北西区画に寝室を作りましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the pantry and build 2 root cellars."
msgstr "貯蔵穴を2つ作り、食料貯蔵室を確保しましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the pantry."
msgstr "食料貯蔵室を整備しましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the pottery."
msgstr "製陶作業場に家具を設置しましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the southeast bedroom with a set of beds."
msgstr "南東区画の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the southeast bedroom with beds."
msgstr "南東区画の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the southeast bedroom."
msgstr "南東区画に寝室を作りましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the southern bedroom with a set of beds."
msgstr "南区画の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the southern bedroom with beds."
msgstr "南区画の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the southwest bedroom with a set of beds."
msgstr "南西区画の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the southwest bedroom with beds."
msgstr "南西区画の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the southwest bedroom."
msgstr "南西区画に寝室を作りましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the southwestern bedroom with beds."
msgstr "南西の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the tannery."
msgstr "皮革加工場に備品を設置しましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the west bedroom with a set of beds."
msgstr "西区画の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's furnish the west bedroom with beds."
msgstr "西区画の寝室にベッドを2台置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's gather some tools so we can work on cars."
msgstr "車両を修理できるように、工具類を集めましょう。"

msgid "Let's get a boogie on."
msgstr "さて、活動の時間だ。"

msgid "Let's get a move on."
msgstr "さあ、もう行こうか。"

msgid ""
"Let's get a nice workbench built to improve our work.  Place it next to the anvil."
msgstr "作業効率を上げるためにきちんとした作業台を金床の隣に置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's get a shift on."
msgstr "さあ、そろそろ行こう。"

msgid "Let's get back home."
msgstr "わが家へ戻ろうか。"

msgid "Let's get back to it."
msgstr "さて、話はひとまず終わろう。"

msgid "Let's get going."
msgstr "さあ行こう。"

msgid ""
"Let's get moving.  I feel like it's useless worrying who they are when they're some of "
"the only friends we've got…"
msgstr ""
"そろそろ行こう。唯一と言ってもいい、友好的な集団だ。こちらが心配ばかりしていても、仕方"
"がない..."

msgid "Let's get out of here!"
msgstr "ここから逃げよう！"

msgid "Let's get this smoking area covered to protect the workers from the weather."
msgstr "燻製加工室を建てて、風雨を気にせず作業できるようにしましょう。"

msgid "Let's get to it."
msgstr "早速注文しよう。"

msgid "Let's go back to your usual behaviors"
msgstr "普段の行動に戻ろう"

msgid "Let's go."
msgstr "行こう。"

msgid "Let's head out."
msgstr "さあ行こう。"

msgid "Let's hit the road."
msgstr "それじゃあ行こうか。"

msgid "Let's hope it will."
msgstr "その日が来るといいな。"

msgid "Let's install a bellows for our forge and add some more tools."
msgstr "鍛造用のふいごと機械類を追加しましょう。"

msgid ""
"Let's install a bellows for our forge and add some more tools.  This will extend our "
"recipe repertoire."
msgstr ""
"鍛造用のふいごと道具類を追加しましょう。完成すれば、指示できる製作レシピの種類が増加し"
"ます。"

msgid ""
"Let's install a couple of charcoal kilns outside of the smithy.  We'll add a crucible "
"as well.  This will allow us to produce a few additional things."
msgstr ""
"鍛冶場の外に炭焼窯を2台ほど設置し、併せてるつぼも用意しましょう。完成すれば、指示できる"
"製作レシピの種類が増加します。"

msgid ""
"Let's install a metal working forge and a charcoal kiln.  We'll need a few tools too, "
"so we'll include some storage space."
msgstr "金属加工用の炉と炭焼窯を設置し、作業に使う道具類を置く場所も追加しましょう。"

msgid ""
"Let's install a metal working forge in the smithy.  We'll need a few tools too, so "
"we'll include some storage space.  This will provide us with a first couple of "
"primitive crafting recipes."
msgstr ""
"鍛冶場に金属加工用の炉を設置し、必要な道具を置く収納スペースも併せて作りましょう。完成"
"すれば、基本的なレシピの製作を指示できるようになります。"

msgid ""
"Let's install a pair of tanks for salt water to allow for salt production and make "
"hide working easier."
msgstr ""
"塩水を貯めるタンクを2つ設置して塩の生産体制を整え、皮をなめす作業を効率化しましょう。"

msgid "Let's install a still in the brewery."
msgstr "醸造所に蒸留器を設置しましょう。"

msgid ""
"Let's install an anvil in the smithy, some quenching containers and a workbench.  This "
"will allow us to produce a few additional things."
msgstr ""
"鍛冶場に金床と焼き入れ装置、作業台を設置しましょう。完成すれば、指示できる製作レシピの"
"種類が増加します。"

msgid "Let's install an anvil, some quenching containers and a workbench."
msgstr "金床と焼き入れ装置、そして作業台を設置しましょう。"

msgid "Let's install some racks for storage in the brewery."
msgstr "醸造所に収納用の棚を設置しましょう。"

msgid "Let's install some vats in the brewery."
msgstr "醸造所に発酵大桶を設置しましょう。"

msgid "Let's just chitchat for a while, I could use some relaxation."
msgstr "気分転換に、少し雑談でもしようか。"

msgid "Let's just keep moving.  We don't have time for this nonsense…"
msgstr "とにかく動き続けるしかない。こんな下らない話をしている暇があるなんて..."

msgid "Let's keep going!"
msgstr "一緒に行こう！"

msgid "Let's keep going, <name_g>!"
msgstr "さあ行こう、<name_g>！"

msgid "Let's keep moving."
msgstr "動き続けるんだ。"

msgid ""
"Let's keep moving.  This is a topic for another day, when we've actually found some "
"answers…"
msgstr "そろそろ話を切り上げよう。この話は、またいつか、答えが見つかった時にしようか..."

msgid "Let's link in later."
msgstr "後でまた聞くよ。"

msgid "Let's make a butchery area."
msgstr "肉を解体するエリアを作りましょう。"

msgid "Let's make a deal."
msgstr "よし、取り引きしよう。"

msgid "Let's make a dining area."
msgstr "食事をするエリアを作りましょう。"

msgid "Let's make a living room area."
msgstr "居間を作りましょう。"

msgid "Let's make some furniture for the dining hall."
msgstr "食堂に家具を置きましょう。"

msgid "Let's move on."
msgstr "そろそろ他の話をしようか。"

msgid "Let's negotiate some other time."
msgstr "報酬の交渉はまた今度にしよう。"

msgid "Let's never do that again."
msgstr "こんな目に遭うのは二度とごめんだ。"

msgid ""
"Let's not dance around it: I joined the riots, at first.  I don't really remember what "
"I was thinking.  I'd protested stuff like politics before, but this was different.  I "
"didn't go down there expecting to chant and march, I grabbed a rock and went out "
"planning to fuck shit up.  I've never felt so angry before.  The riots had already "
"been going on a while at that point, and to me, it just looked like the man trying to "
"squash the people again."
msgstr ""
"包み隠さず話そう。私は最初、暴動に参加していた。あの時何を考えていたのか覚えていないん"
"だ。それ以前も政治的な抗議活動に参加したことはあるが、あれはそんなもんじゃない。声を上"
"げて行進なんてせずに、石を投げて何もかもぶっ壊すんだ。あんなに腹が立ったのは初めてだ"
"よ。暴動が始まってしばらく経っていた時期だったが、民衆が弾圧されているようにしか感じな"
"かった。"

msgid "Let's not dwell on it.  I'm ready to get a move on…"
msgstr "暗い話を続けてもしょうがない。もうそろそろ出掛けたいんだ..."

msgid "Let's pick this up later, I have to go."
msgstr "証拠を探してこよう。もう行かないと。"

msgid "Let's put a pin in this chat for now."
msgstr "とりあえず、この続きはまた今度にしよう。"

msgid "Let's remove plants from garden and plow a few plots."
msgstr "庭の植物を取り除いて耕し、畑にしましょう。"

msgid "Let's return to discussing upgrades."
msgstr "アップグレードの話題に戻ろう。"

msgid "Let's say that's none of your <swear> business.  Other questions?"
msgstr "<swear>、余計な詮索はするな。他に質問は？"

msgid "Let's see how to get there and go check on them."
msgstr "その地点への経路を確認しておこう。"

msgid "Let's see what you've managed to find."
msgstr "収穫を見せてもらおうか。"

msgid "Let's see…"
msgstr "そうだな..."

