msgid "Lethal Strike"
msgstr "致命の一撃"

msgid ""
"Lethargically resting on its back, this hideous mass of sagging flesh and writhing "
"organs, which used to be a child, twitches feebly as its midsection churns.  Almost "
"bursting from its skin, the child's ribcage has arched outward, forming a hive-like "
"construct covered by severely stretched epidermis.  Through the wretched organism's "
"taut abdominal flesh, you witness small forms swarming within its ribcage—its guts "
"roiling as new beings are sculpted from pilfered flesh and bone.  The creature's limbs "
"rest haphazardly on the ground, contorted in ways that suggest the absence of bones or "
"any interior construct."
msgstr ""
"無気力状態でうずくまっている醜い肉塊です。元は人間の子供だったようですが、今は蠢く腹部"
"以外は弱々しく痙攣するのみです。肋骨が皮膚を突き破りそうなほど大きく膨らんでおり、伸び"
"きった皮の内側にはハチの巣のような構造物が形成されています。分解された肉や骨から新たに"
"生まれた何らかの小さな物体が、腹部や胸部の辺りで群れをなして動いているのが見えます。手"
"足には骨も筋肉も残っていないらしく、無造作に垂れ下がっています。"

msgid "Lets talk about something else."
msgstr "他の話をしよう。"

