msgid ""
"Light emitting diodes surgically integrated into your skin can release a flash "
"comparable to a flashbang grenade, blinding nearby enemies.  Speakers integrated into "
"your body mimic the loud sound, deafening those nearby."
msgstr ""
"外科手術によって、皮膚にLEDとスピーカーを組み込みます。起動すると閃光手榴弾に匹敵する強"
"烈な光と大音量を発生させ、周囲の敵の視覚と聴覚を奪います。"

msgid ""
"Light exercise comparable in intensity to walking, but more focused and methodical."
msgstr ""
"ウォーキングと同程度の運動です。負荷は軽いですが、より集中して入念に取り組めます。"

msgid ""
"Light fur has grown to cover your entire body, providing marginal protection against "
