"Lightweight sandals made from wound cord.  They offer little in the way of protection, "
"but keep you cool during warmer months."
msgstr ""
"寄り糸を巻いて作った軽量のサンダルです。防御面は頼りないですが、暑い季節も涼しく過ごせ"
