msgstr "ロングヘアです。"

msgid "Long pieces of wool that are meant to be wrapped around the hands."
msgstr "鎧の下に着用するウール製の防具のレシピです。"

msgid "Long pink hair style."
msgstr "ピンク色のロングヘアです。"

msgid "Long purple hair style."
msgstr "紫色のロングヘアです。"

msgid "Long red hair style."
msgstr "赤髪のロングヘアです。"

msgid "Long socks that reach above the knees."
msgstr "長さが膝上まで達する綿製の靴下です。寒さを防ぎます。"

msgid "Long sticks stacked well above your head."
msgstr "頭を越える高さまで積み重ねられた長棒の山です。"

msgid "Long trip ahead?  Auto travel and auto drive to your desired destination."
msgstr "長旅ですか？自動移動、自動運転モードで目的地を目指しましょう。"

msgid "Long tube of cardboard, used to conveniently store long sheets of foil."
msgstr "長い筒状の厚紙です。幅の広いアルミ箔の保管に便利です。"

msgid "Long white hair style."
msgstr "白髪のロングヘアです。"

msgid "Long, sharp claws at the tips of the fingers."
msgstr "指先から長く鋭い爪が生えています。"

msgid "Longest Length (%s): %s Weight (%s):"
msgstr "最長(%s): %s 重量(%s):"

msgid "Look"
msgstr "見る"

msgid "Look alive!"
msgstr "しっかりしろ！"

msgid "Look alive, there's something happening."
msgstr "何かが起きている。気を付けろ。"

msgid "Look around"
msgstr "周囲確認"

msgid "Look around position"
msgstr "周囲確認メニュー表示位置"

msgid "Look at"
msgstr "見る"

msgid "Look at that, it's the Crudmobile."
msgstr "見ろよ、きったねぇ車だ。"

msgid "Look at the sky"
msgstr "天候確認"

msgid ""
"Look at the sky before you go for adventure.  You will know what weather to expect.  "
"It's nothing compared to the old meteorology and satellite pictures, but at least you "
"may know if you need the umbrella."
msgstr ""
"冒険に出る前に空を眺めておこう。どんな天気になるか知っておくんだ。気象情報や衛星写真と"
"は比べ物にならないけど、傘を持っていくべきか程度なら分かる。"

msgid "Look at this fuckin' shit we're in, man."
msgstr "まるで地獄じゃないか。"

msgid "Look for the bonds which define you, and act in accord."
msgstr "自己を定義する繋がりを探し、それに基づき行動しなさい。"

msgid ""
"Look how well it all fits together.  Nice, neat lines.  The curves are the best; a "
"million little lines and a million again."
msgstr ""
"ほら、全てが上手く調和しています。整った最高の直線。曲線も最高です。ここにも、あそこに"
"も、無限の小さな直線。"

msgid "Look how you catch the light, now.  Never look away."
msgstr "さあ、光がどのように反射するか見てみましょう。目を逸らしてはいけません。"

msgid "Look out for that"
msgstr "見ろ、あれは"

msgid "Look out!"
msgstr "気をつけろ！"

msgid "Look out!  A"
msgstr "見ろ！"

msgid "Look out!  Exclamation points!"
msgstr "見て！感嘆符です！"

msgid "Look out!  That creature is dangerous!"
msgstr "気をつけろ！あの怪物は危険だ！"

msgid "Look sharp!  Things are heating up."
msgstr "気を付けろ！ヤバくなってきた。"

msgid "Look what you made me do."
msgstr "見なよこの有様。"

msgid "Look, <name_g><punc> let's talk!"
msgstr "なあ、<name_g><punc>話があるんだ！"

msgid ""
"Look, I don't know a better way to put this.  I don't know you, I can't bring some "
"random back with me.  For all I know you're a cannibal psycho or something.  We all "
"saw too much of that during <the_cataclysm>.  Me and mine, we're not looking to expand "
"our tribe just now, OK?"
msgstr ""
"おい、こんなことは言いたかないがな。あんたのことは何も知らないし、危険かもしれない奴は"
"入れたくない。あんたが人食いの狂人って可能性もある。<the_cataclysm>でそんな奴は山ほど見"
"てきた。俺らは仲間を増やす気なんてない、分かったか？"

msgid ""
"Look, I have a family too.  I know how hard it is for you, but I've already told you, "
"rules are rules."
msgstr ""
"私にだって家族はいるさ。納得できないかもしれないが、先ほど言った通り、ルールはルール"
"だ。"

msgid ""
"Look, I have limited manpower these days, and not everyone can go off of a strangers "
"word with no supporting evidence."
msgstr ""
"そりゃ、今は人手が足りないからな。それに、裏付けのない他人の情報なんて、鵜呑みにはでき"
"ないよ。"

msgid "Look, I really need this.  Please let me have it."
msgstr "なあ、本当にこれが必要なんだ。譲ってもらえないか。"

msgid ""
"Look, I'm just a regular God-fearing fella like you.  You gotta have something to keep "
"your mind off stuff.  You'd get mad otherwise.  My passion happens to be collecting "
"trophies."
msgstr ""
"聞けよ、俺はあんたと同じで、信心深いんだ。気持ちを落ち着けるために、何か持っておきた"
"い。そうしないと、とても心が休まらない。そこで、戦利品の収集に情熱を燃やしてるんだ。"

msgid "Look, Ma, I can fly!"
msgstr "アイ・キャン・フライ"

msgid "Look, it's Fanny the Irishman!"
msgstr "見ろ、おもしろアイルランド人だ！"

msgid "Look, some LSD, let's play Cataclysm: Fun Times Ahead!"
msgstr "これは、LSDだな。よし、皆でCataclysm: Fun Times Aheadをプレイしよう！"

msgid "Look, there must be something we can work out."
msgstr "待って、私にも何か協力できることがある筈だ。"

msgid ""
"Look.  You're bleeding snowflakes.  A thousand little parts of you are finding "
"themselves."
msgstr "ほら。傷口から雪の結晶が流れ出ています。何千、何万もの自分自身の一部分です。"

msgid "Looked at photos"
msgstr "写真を見た"

msgid ""
"Looking at first glance like a dull gray privet, this \"hedge\" is really a mass of "
"barbed fungal tendrils, defending the fungal tower."
msgstr ""
"鈍い灰色の低木のような見た目をした「生垣」です。棘が付いた真菌巻髭が大量に集まって、真"
"菌塔を守っています。"

msgid ""
"Looking at this pile of biological tissues with strange smell, you don't know what "
"kind of organs they belong to in medicine.  Of course, you're pretty sure they're not "
"boiled tomatoes."
msgstr ""
"異臭を放つ生体組織の塊を見ただけでは、何の臓器なのかまったく判別できません。しかし、茹"
"でたトマトでないことだけは確かです。"

msgid "Looking good there.  I like your whole setup.  What's your story?"
msgstr "やあどうも。元気そうだな。何かあったか？"

msgid ""
"Looking more like some form of sci-fi prop gun than an actual firearm, this weapon "
"uses a system of three different magazines to field 15 12-gauge shotgun shells within "
"a comparatively compact design.  As the weapon's trigger assembly is situated forwards "
"of the chamber and magazines in what is termed as a 'bullpup' design, the firearm's "
"notably more compact than its peers despite having a higher capacity when compared "
"against more classically designed shotguns."
msgstr ""
"比較的小さな3つの弾倉に12ゲージ弾を合計15発装填できる、SF映画に登場する架空の銃器のよう"
"なデザインのショットガンです。チューブ毎に弾薬を装填しておく必要はありますが、状況に応"
"じて弾種を使い分けることもできます。トリガーを薬室と弾倉の前方に配置した「ブルパップ」"
"と呼ばれる設計のため、一般的なショットガンに比べて装弾数が多く、しかも構造はコンパクト"
"です。"

msgid "Looking similar to a sunflower, this tall plant has a nutritious tuber."
msgstr "栄養価の高い根茎をもつ、ヒマワリに似ている背の高い植物です。"

msgid ""
"Looking something like a large revolver from a cartoon this launcher is capable of "
"firing six grenades in rapid succession.  Its huge cylinder is wound by a clock "
"spring, which hastens firing, but slows reloading, as it must be re-wound.  Needless "
"to say, six well placed shots is an incredible amount of firepower, depending on the "
"cartridges loaded."
msgstr ""
"大型のリボルバーを戯画化したような姿の、6発の擲弾を連続して発射できるランチャーです。巨"
"大なシリンダーはクロックスプリングで巻き上げる構造になっており、発射速度は速いですが装"
"填には時間がかかります。使う弾薬にもよりますが、6発の擲弾が上手く命中すれば信じられない"
"程のダメージを叩き出します。"

msgid "Looks like a deal!  Accept this trade?"
msgstr "いいね！取り引き成立かな？"

msgid "Looks like a fully-functional deathmobile."
msgstr "どこも壊れていないように見えるデスモービルです。"

msgid ""
"Looks like a ton of broken glass was dumped into this pit.  Might not fatal to fall "
"in, but it wouldn't be pleasant to try to crawl out."
msgstr ""
"割れたガラスが大量に敷き詰められた穴です。落ちても命に別状はないでしょうが、この中から"
"這い上がるのはあまり楽しくなさそうです。"

msgid "Looks like that's over."
msgstr "終わったようだ。"

msgid "Looks like the %1$s is out of %2$s."
msgstr "%1$sは%2$s切れのようです。"

msgid "Looks like you are doing well here."
msgstr "ここで上手くやっているようだな。"

msgid ""
"Looks like you suddenly felt pain.  The pain status is indicated on the sidebar and "
"also in the <keybind:player_data> menu.\n"
"\n"
"Small amounts of pain are tolerable, but as it gets worse your stats will drop and you "
"will move much slower.  To reduce pain, take painkillers like "
"<color_light_cyan>codeine</color> on the rack nearby (by activating it with "
"<keybind:apply>), or simply wait it out."
msgstr ""
"急に痛みを感じだしたようですね。苦痛のレベルは、サイドバーや、<keybind:player_data>を押"
"して表示されるメニューで確認できます。\n"
"\n"
"多少の苦痛は我慢できますが、あまりに強い苦痛は能力値を低下させ、動作を鈍らせます。痛み"
"を和らげたいなら、付近の棚に置いてある<color_light_cyan>コデイン</color>などの鎮痛剤を"
"(<keybind:apply>を押して)服用するか、ただひたすら待つことです。"

msgid ""
"Looks like you're hungry!  The hunger status is indicated on the sidebar.  Let's make "
"a <color_light_cyan>peanut butter sandwich</color> from <color_light_cyan>peanut "
"butter</color> and <color_light_cyan>crackers</color> on the counter next to the "
"wall.\n"
"\n"
"To make food, you need to use the <color_light_cyan>Crafting</color> menu.  Press "
"<keybind:craft> to open the menu.  Press <keybind:NEXT_TAB> and <keybind:PREV_TAB> to "
"toggle crafting categories and select the <color_light_cyan>FOOD</color> category.  "
"From there, select peanut butter sandwich and press <keybind:CONFIRM> to start "
"crafting.\n"
"\n"
"Note that you don't need to stand directly near the counter to be able to craft.  The "
"<color_light_cyan>crafting radius</color> is 6 tiles, so while you're standing no "
"farther than 6 tiles from any crafting components and tools, your character is able to "
"still get them in order to use them.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please craft the peanut butter sandwich and then eat it by "
"pressing <keybind:eat>."
msgstr ""
"お腹が空いているようですね！サイドバーに空腹の状態が表示されています。壁際のカウンター"
"に置いてある<color_light_cyan>ピーナッツバター</color>と<color_light_cyan>クラッカー</"
"color>を使って、<color_light_cyan>サンドイッチ(ﾋﾟｰﾅｯﾂﾊﾞﾀｰ)</color>を作ってみましょ"
"う。\n"
"\n"
"料理をするときは、<color_light_cyan>製作メニュー</color>を使います。<keybind:craft>を押"
"して、メニューを開きましょう。<keybind:NEXT_TAB>と<keybind:PREV_TAB>を使って製作カテゴ"
"リーを切り替え、<color_light_cyan>食料</color>カテゴリーを選んでください。一覧の中から"
"サンドイッチ(ﾋﾟｰﾅｯﾂﾊﾞﾀｰ)を選択し、<keybind:CONFIRM>を押せば製作が開始されます。\n"
"\n"
"なお、カウンターに隣接していない場所でも製作は可能です。<color_light_cyan>製作作業範囲"
"</color>は半径6タイルなので、材料や道具がキャラクターから6タイル以内にあれば、それらを"
"利用した製作作業を進められます。\n"
"\n"
"サンドイッチ(ﾋﾟｰﾅｯﾂﾊﾞﾀｰ)を製作し、<keybind:eat>を押して食べたら、チュートリアルを続けま"
"しょう。"

msgid "Looks nice, <name_g>.  Now I need to clean it from <zombies> somehow…"
msgstr "いい感じじゃないか、<name_g>。どうにかして<zombies>を掃除しなけりゃならんが..."

msgid ""
"Loose bits of dried straw and seed casings from winnowed grain.  There are a few "
"fragments of seeds still mixed in, a big enough pile of this stuff could be made into "
"bird food or cattle fodder."
msgstr ""
"乾燥した穀物の茎や穀物から取り除いた細かいもみ殻です。穀物の粒もいくらか混ざっており、"
"大量に集めておけば鳥やウシの飼料として使えそうです。"

msgid ""
"Loose, fine-cut tobacco leaves.  Popular in Europe and among hipsters.  Highly "
"addictive and hazardous to health.\n"
"Can either be rolled into a cigarette with some rolling papers or smoked through a "
"pipe."
msgstr ""
"ヨーロッパの人々や通の間で人気の、巻いていない細かく刻んだタバコの葉です。依存性が高"
"く、健康に有害です。巻紙で巻いたり煙管に詰めたりして利用できます。"

msgid "Loose-fitting pants made for use in martial arts."
msgstr "武道で使用される無地の稽古着です。"

