msgid ""
"Lord no.  I'll be fucked if I let a kid tell me what the hell to do.  I had my horse "
"ready to go, I had a ton of food, and I even had a blunderbuss.  I didn't know what I "
"was supposed to be running from, but I sure as shit didn't run."
msgstr ""
"まさか。ひよっ子に従っていたら、命がいくつあっても足りないよ。私には馬も、大量の食料"
"も、ラッパ銃もあった。何から逃げればいいのかも分からなかったが、逃げなかったのはバカな"
"奴だよ。"

msgid "Loss of Surprise"
msgstr "不意打ち失敗"

msgid ""
"Loss of health - Entire Body\n"
"Your clothing and other equipment may be consumed by the flames."
msgstr ""
"ダメージ: 全身\n"
"衣服や防具は燃えて消失する可能性があります。"

msgid "Loss of red blood cells results in progressively worsening anemia."
msgstr "赤血球が少なくなり、貧血が次第に悪化します。"

