msgid ""
"Made by SIG Sauer, the M11 is a compact semi-automatic, short recoil operated pistol, "
"also known as the P228."
msgstr ""
"P228という名でも知られる、ショートリコイル方式のコンパクトなセミオートピストルです。"

msgid "Made for the Glock 17, this cheap-looking aftermarket magazine holds 22 rounds."
