msgid ""
"Mark a spot for crafting.  Crafting tasks next to this tile will automatically use "
"this location instead of attempting to craft in your hands, with the usual crafting "
"speed penalty for working on the ground.  Does not prevent using a proper workbench, "
"if available.  Deconstruct or smash to remove."
