msgid "May <given_name> and their family rest in peace"
msgstr "<given_name>とその家族が安らかに眠らんことを"

msgid "May God bless you, <name_g>."
msgstr "神のご加護がありますように、<name_g>。"

msgid "May God bless you."
msgstr "神のご加護がありますように。"

msgid "May God protect you."
msgstr "あなたに神のご加護がありますように。"

msgid "May that bastard never get up again."
msgstr "あいつが起き上がることは永遠に無いだろうね。"

msgid "May the Lord bless you."
msgstr "主のご加護がありますように。"

msgid "May the earth flourish beneath our paths."
msgstr "我々の旅路のもとで、大地が繁栄せんことを。"

msgid "May whatever god or spirits that now reign the world protect you."
msgstr "世界を治めている神だか霊だかが、あなたを守ってくれるよう祈っておくよ。"

msgid "May you find your peace, traveler."
msgstr "旅人よ、あなたの平穏をお祈りします。"

msgid "May you never walk again, may I not kill you again"
msgstr "再び歩き出しませんように、再び殺さずに済みますように"

msgid "Maybe I can help you with your problem?"
msgstr "何か私に手伝えることはあるか？"

msgid "Maybe I could change your mind…?~"
msgstr "これで心変わりしてくれたりは...？~"

msgid "Maybe I could help with something?"
msgstr "何か手伝おうか？"

msgid "Maybe I could help you with something?"
msgstr "何か手伝えることはあるか？"

msgid ""
"Maybe I could help.  There are lots of movie discs out there just collecting dust, and "
"you've got electricity."
msgstr ""
"私が協力しよう。この世界には埃を被った映画のディスクがたくさんあるし、電気もある。"

msgid "Maybe I shouldn't have mentioned it…  Let's just get moving."
msgstr "こんなこと言わなきゃよかった...とりあえず、話はこれで終わりだ。"

msgid "Maybe a fire could calm your nerves?"
msgstr "火があれば気を鎮められそうですね？"

msgid "Maybe another time.  I don't really like thinking about it."
msgstr "また今度話すよ。あまり思い出したくないんだ。"

msgid "Maybe another time…"
msgstr "また次の機会に..."

msgid "Maybe bring like a bat or something?"
msgstr "野球バットか何か持っていた方がいいかな？"

msgid "Maybe later."
msgstr "また今度。"

msgid "Maybe next time?"
msgstr "また今度にしない？"

msgid "Maybe not right now, I think I'd better go."
msgstr "今はできそうにない。もう行くよ。"

msgid "Maybe not the best reading material considering the situation."
msgstr "状況によってはあまり良い読み物とは言えませんね。"

msgid "Maybe one day I will."
msgstr "そうかもしれないな。"

msgid ""
"Maybe out there alone, or with a small group, but enough to feed a few dozen other "
"people that aren't helping you?  That just isn't a risk we're willing to take right "
"now.  If you want to trade us supplies or donate something, you're more than welcome "
"to, and it'd be a huge help, but right now, we're far past our comfort zone as it is."
msgstr ""
"一人や二人ならともかく、自分の世話もできない数十人を養っていくんだぞ？今はともかくリス"
"クを負いたくない。物資の取り引きや寄付なら大歓迎だし、とても助かるが、仲間に迎えるのは"
"ちょっと難しいな。"

msgid ""
"Maybe some day.  If you can survive for long enough I may decide to come and stay with "
"you."
msgstr ""
"これから先、もし、おまえがもっと長く生き延びたならば、おまえと共に暮らすこともあるかも"
"しれないな。"

msgid "Maybe some other time.  Changing the topic…"
msgstr "どうだろうな。話を変えよう..."

msgid "Maybe someone could read that to you, but you're deaf!"
msgstr "読み上げてもらうことはできますが、耳が聞こえません！"

msgid "Maybe somewhere they can't see me?  Where I can just be me?"
msgstr "誰の邪魔にもならない場所ってどこだ？自分が自分でいられる場所ってどこだ？"

msgid "Maybe that chef is still alive."
msgstr "まだシェフが生き残っているかもしれません。"

msgid "Maybe that goth is still alive."
msgstr "まだゴス系の生存者がいるかもしれません。"

msgid ""
"Maybe the explanation is more scientific.  Zombies and flesh-eating monsters only come "
"from supervillains and gods in fiction."
msgstr ""
"もしかしたら、科学的に説明できることかもしれない。ゾンビや人を襲う怪物なんて、フィク"
"ションの悪役や超越者からしか生まれない。"

msgid "Maybe the scrapper would have some spare parts?"
msgstr "ジャンク屋なら予備の部品を持っているのでは？"

msgid "Maybe there's something left in that LMOE shelter you heard about."
msgstr "場所を聞いたLMOEシェルターに、もしかすると何かが残っているかもしれません。"

msgid "Maybe there's something left in that cabin you heard about."
msgstr "場所を聞いた山小屋に、もしかすると何かが残っているかもしれません。"

msgid "Maybe these things are what remains of the team we were searching for…"
msgstr "これは、探していた部隊の残骸なんだろうか..."

msgid "Maybe they escaped to one of the camps…"
msgstr "どこかのキャンプに避難したのだろうか..."

msgid "Maybe things will be better by seeing it with new eyes."
msgstr "一新した瞳で周囲を見れば、状況が好転することもあるかもしれません。"

msgid ""
"Maybe this is just the placebo effect, but you feel a little better as the dose "
"settles in."
msgstr "プラシーボ効果かもしれませんが、服用すると少し気分が良くなってきました。"

msgid ""
"Maybe try a farm?  I bet those rural folks were pretty invested in preserving their "
"food."
msgstr "農場を探すのはどうだろう？田舎の方が、食料の保存が盛んな気がするな。"

msgid "Maybe we can find a stick in the woods."
msgstr "火口は森の中で拾った棒から製作できる。"

msgid "Maybe we can reason with that creature!"
msgstr "あの怪物なら話せば分かってくれるかも！"

msgid "Maybe we should start boarding up this place."
msgstr "そうだな、ドアや窓を板張りして、外からの脅威に備えるとよさそうだ。"

msgid "Maybe you can teach me something as payment?"
msgstr "報酬として何かスキルを教えてもらえないか？"

msgid ""
"Maybe.  I guess multiple things could be possible.  You really don't think that "
"there's someone or something behind this?  Someone who flew a little too close to the "
"sun?  Poked the beast?"
msgstr ""
"かもね。複数の要因が絡み合っているんだろう。しかし、この現状の背後に誰か、あるいは何か"
"の思惑があるとは思わないのか？誰かが太陽に近づきすぎたのか？それとも獣を突いて起こして"
"しまったか？"

msgid ""
"Maybe.  Is it worse to be unhappy with a goal or to be unhappy without a goal?  You're "
"all right, I feel like we get each other."
msgstr ""
"そうだろうな。目指す道が分かっていて不幸になるのと、目指す道が見当たらず不幸になるので"
"は、どちらが辛いのだろうか？ふむ、だんだん分かり合えてきたようだ。"

msgid "Mayfield's goat"
msgid_plural "Mayfield's goat"
msgstr[0] "ジャコウウシ"

msgid "Mayfield's goat kid"
msgid_plural "Mayfield's goat kids"
msgstr[0] "ジャコウウシ(幼体)"

msgid "McMillan TAC-50 rifle"
msgid_plural "McMillan TAC-50 rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.50口径BMG/ﾏｸﾐﾗﾝTAC-50)"

msgid "McMillan Tac-338 rifle"
msgid_plural "McMillan Tac-338 rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.338口径/ﾏｸﾐﾗﾝTAC-338)"

msgid "Me go, you stay."
msgstr "私は行く、君は勝手にしろ。"

msgid ""
"Me too!  For now, anyway, that's not really possible for me.  I mean, I guess you know "
"better than me about that.  Man, I used to travel all around.  Saw halfa the States "
"with my guitar on my back.  Now, though, well, I think I'll stay inside til this all "
"flies over."
msgstr ""
"私もだ！ええと、今はちょっと、それは無理なんだ。まったく、分かっている筈だろう。聞いて"
"ほしい。私はずっと旅をしてきた。背負ったギターと共にアメリカを見てきたんだ。でも、"
"まぁ、今は、全部の問題が解決するまではここに居座るつもりだ。"

msgid ""
"Me too!  I did stand-up comedy at a club once.  Well, outside a club anyway.  You know "
"what'd be funny?  Next time one of those stupid ferals starts running around chasing "
"after a squirrel or something, if I had me a guitar I could play the Benny Hill tune "
"and get everybody crackin' up.  Places needs some laughter badly."
msgstr ""
"私もだ！クラブでスタンダップコメディを披露したこともあるんだよ。まぁ、クラブの隣の道端"
"だけど。面白いとはどういうことか知ってるかい？例えばマヌケなゾンビがその辺のリスか何か"
"を追いかけ回すとするだろ、そこですかさず私がギターで「ベニー・ヒル・ショー」のテーマを"
"弾けば、一同揃って笑い転げるって寸法さ。"

msgid ""
"Me too!  Times are hard for folks and that's no laughing matter.  People need some "
"normality in these times.  Some reminders of how things used to be.  I think a sing-"
"along or two could do folks good."
msgstr ""
"私もだ！状況は酷く困難で、笑っている場合じゃない。こんな時にはある程度の日常感が必要"
"だ。かつての世界がどんな様子だったのかを伝えていくってことだな。皆で一緒に歌うっての"
"が、いい方法だと思うのだよ。"

msgid ""
"Me too!  You can understand how folks be wantin' some liveliness in these times.  Some "
"music sure would help with that.  Damn, I miss it.  All I hear is those MP3 players "
"with their tin-can drum machines and whiny vocals.  Help me find a guitar and we'll "
"really get this place smokin'!"
msgstr ""
"私もだ！こんな状況で皆に活気がない原因は明白だ。そんな時は音楽も助けになるんだ。畜生、"
"音楽が恋しい。ここ最近は、MP3プレーヤーに入っていたブリキ缶みたいな音のドラムとメソメソ"
"声のボーカルが入った曲しか聞けていない。ギター探しを手伝ってくれたら、この場所は真に活"
"気あふれる場所になるはずだ！"

msgid "Me too."
msgstr "お互いにな。"

msgid "Me too.  How did you manage to get here?"
msgstr "私もだよ。どうやってここへたどり着いたんだ？"

msgid ""
"Me too.  It's fight a stay afloat in these times.  Some music would lift all spirits, "
"though, don't you think?"
msgstr ""
"私もだ。日々戦い続けるしかない。音楽の中には、戦う気持ちを高めるものもある、そうだろ？"

msgid ""
"Me?  Just standing around, looking scary.  Think I'm doing a good job?\n"
"\n"
"Don't answer that."
msgstr ""
"あ？ただ突っ立って、辺りを睨みつけてるだけだ。楽しいお仕事に見えるのか？\n"
"\n"
"いや、皆まで言うな。"

msgid "Me?  No, I'm just passing through, how about you?"
msgstr "私？いや、単なる通りすがりだ。あなたは？"

msgid ""
"Mean and intimidating looking, the SPAS-12 has the dubious honor of being declared a "
"destructive device and being banned from import by name, adding to its already "
"considerable appeal.  It is a combination pump-action and semi-automatic firearm, with "
"an arm stabilizing hook for one handed shooting."
msgstr ""
"下品で威圧的な外見から有害な銃器であると認定され、輸入禁止の憂き目にあったこともある銃"
"ですが、その威厳に魅力を見出す者も少なくありません。ポンプアクションとセミオート方式を"
"組み合わせた機構を採用しており、片腕での射撃を安定させるアームフックが付いています。"

msgid "Measure Sun altitude"
msgstr "太陽高度測定"

msgid "Measure artifact resonance"
msgstr "アーティファクト共鳴測定"

msgid "Measure light level"
msgstr "明度測定"

msgid "Measured Strike (melee)"
msgstr "正確な一撃(近接武器)"

msgid "Measured Strike (unarmed)"
msgstr "正確な一撃(素手)"

msgid "Measurement Units"
msgstr "計量単位"

msgid "Meat Intolerance"
msgstr "肉食忌避"

msgid "Meat encased in little dough satchels.  Tastes fine straight from the can."
msgstr "肉を小さなパスタ生地で包んだ料理です。缶詰から出してそのまま食べられます。"

msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although it came from muscle tissue, it has a "
"curious swirling grain pattern, and at the center of each grain is a knot of hard, "
"cartilaginous tissue.  It smells offputting."
msgstr ""
"重度の変異を起こした動物から切り落とされた肉です。筋肉組織に奇妙な渦巻き模様を描く粒が"
"混じっており、粒の中心部には硬い軟骨の瘤があります。不快な臭いが漂っています。"

msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although this came from muscle, it has a thick "
"cordlike texture and smells like leather and bread mold."
msgstr ""
"重度の変異を起こした動物から切り落とされた肉です。筋線維が太い紐のような形状に変わって"
"おり、革、あるいはパンに生えるカビのような臭いがします。"

msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  It has an unsettling loose and spongy texture, "
"but smells… mostly normal.  There are strange tangles and formations in it that don't "
"appear natural at all: bits of bone and hair crusted up inside the muscle, as if "
"trying to form another organism.  Still, it seems digestible at least, if you cook it "
"and remove the worst parts."
msgstr ""
"重度の変異を起こした動物から切り落とされた肉です。締まりのないスポンジのような質感が不"
"安ですが...とりあえず臭いは、おおむね普通です。見たこともない奇妙な瘤や器官も混ざってお"
"り、肉の内部に固まった骨や毛を見ると、まるで別の生物を生み出そうとしていたかのように思"
"えます。まったく食用に向かない部分を取り除いて調理すれば、少なくとも消化は可能です。"

msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  This is from muscle, but in the fascial tissue "
"between the muscles, thick spiny hairs have grown.  Foul-smelling, cream-colored fluid "
"gushes out whenever a hair pulls loose."
msgstr ""
"重度の変異を起こした動物から切り落とされた肉です。筋肉と筋肉の間にある筋膜組織から、太"
