msgid ""
"Most I can give is two gold coins.  I've arranged a drop in the nearby woods, put the "
"goods there and you can get your cash with the barkeep here."
msgstr ""
"悪いが、報酬はハブ01金貨2枚だけだ。近くの森に受け渡し地点を作っておいた。サンプルを置い"
"たら、ここのバーテンから報酬を受け取れ。"

msgid ""
"Most animals don't like you, and aggressive animals are more likely to attack you.  "
"This only applies to natural animals such as woodland creatures."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどの動物はあなたを嫌っており、攻撃的な動物が襲ってくる確率が高くなります(森にいる"
"ような一般的な動物に限る)。"

msgid ""
"Most are scavengers like you.  They now make a living by looting the cities in search "
"for anything useful: food, weapons, tools, gasoline.  In exchange for their findings "
"we offer them a temporary place to rest and the services of our shop.  I bet some of "
"them would be willing to organize resource runs with you if you ask."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどは君のように街を漁って暮らしているスカベンジャーだ。狙う獲物は食料、武器、工"
"具、それにガソリンといったところか。代わりに我々は寝床や取引の場を提供しているわけだ。"
"中には協力してくれる人もいるだろうから、話しかけてみるといい。"

msgid ""
"Most bionics require a source of power, and you will need an internal battery to store "
"energy for them.  Your current amount of energy is displayed in the sidebar right "
"below your health.  Replenishing energy can be done in a variety of ways, but all "
"require the installation of a special bionic just for that purpose."
msgstr ""
"大抵のCBMを起動するには電力が必要で、その電力を蓄えるには内蔵型のバッテリーが不可欠で"
"す。現在の電力はサイドバーにあるHPバーの真下に表示されます。電力の供給には様々な方法が"
"ありますが、どの方法をとるにせよ、特定の電力供給機能をもつCBMが必要です。"

msgid ""
"Most cavities in its anatomy seem to have been filled with an acidic solution mixed "
"with a foul black liquid and pieces of its slowly melting tissues."
msgstr ""
"袋のような構造の中には、黒く汚れた粘液と、酸性の溶液、そしてゆっくりと溶解していく組織"
"の破片が入っています。"

msgid "Most damaged (can't repair):"
msgstr "最大損傷(修復不可): "

msgid "Most damaged:"
msgstr "最大損傷: "

msgid ""
"Most gun stores follow pretty similar layouts.  The restricted stuff - SMGs, assault "
"rifles, and most importantly ammo - are always behind the counter."
msgstr ""
"大抵の銃砲店は似たような構造だ。販売制限があるサブマシンガンやアサルトライフル、そして"
"大事な大事な弾薬は、常にバックヤードに保管してある。"

msgid "Most likely."
msgstr "多分そうです。"

msgid "Most medicine doesn't work instantly, so don't swallow a whole bottle of pills."
msgstr "大抵の薬品は飲んでもすぐには効きません。一気飲みは止めましょう。"

msgid ""
"Most monsters will have to smash their way through a closed door.  If a door is locked "
"or partially broken, you can smash it by pressing <keybind:smash> and then a movement "
"key."
msgstr ""
"大抵のモンスターは、通り道を邪魔する閉じたドアを叩き壊そうとします。施錠されている、壊"
"れかけているなどの理由で開かないドアは、<keybind:smash>を押してから移動キーで方向を指定"
"し、叩き壊しましょう。"

msgid ""
"Most of a black glass human figure.  The face and much of the head is missing, as if "
"scooped out, and the inner surface is perfectly smooth."
msgstr ""
"黒いガラスでできた、人間のように見える像です。頭部の大部分は抉られたように欠落してお"
"り、表面は滑らかです。"

msgid ""
"Most of its insides are taken up by the warped organ still humming with electricity.  "
"Cutting into it proves harder than expected, not the least because of the sparks"
msgstr ""
"体内には、電気を帯びた歪な臓器が鎮座しています。未だに火花が散っており、切り取るのは予"
"想以上に大変です"

msgid ""
"Most of the emergency camps have dissolved by now.  The cities are mobbed, the forests "
"crawling with glowing eyes and zombies.  Some insane shit out there, and everyone with "
"a radio seems to feel like documenting their last awful moments."
msgstr ""
"避難キャンプなんて今ごろ影も形もないだろう。街は滅茶苦茶だし、森は怪物やゾンビが目を光"
"らせて這い回っていやがる。無線を持った生き残りはどいつもこいつも恐ろしい死にざまを記録"
"するような気分でいるはずだ。"

msgid ""
"Most of the fruits are beyond consideration, but you pick what you can and discard the "
"rest."
msgstr "出来の悪い果実を取り除き、上手く実ったものを収穫しました。"

msgid ""
"Most of the time your character will be walking when you move.  But sometimes it's "
"useful to change your movement mode to something else.\n"
"\n"
"There are four movement modes:\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Walking</color>: default mode, average movement speed, stamina "
"draining speed, and noise\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Running</color>: <color_light_green>move much faster</color>, but "
"will <color_light_red>drain your stamina quickly</color>\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Crouching</color>: will make your character <color_light_green>less "
"visible to monsters</color> by allowing you to hide behind some obstacles, "
"<color_light_red>decreased movement speed</color> and <color_light_green>noise</"
"color>\n"
"<color_light_cyan>Prone</color>: <color_light_green>even less visibility</color> to "
"monsters, <color_light_red>even less movement speed</color> and "
"<color_light_green>noise</color>\n"
"\n"
"Pressing <keybind:open_movement> will open the <color_light_cyan>Movement Mode</color> "
"menu, which allows you to switch the mode at any time.  There are extra keybindings "
"that can be set to switch to each mode individually for convenience.\n"
"\n"
"To continue the tutorial, please move to the end of the corridor."
msgstr ""
"大抵の場合、あなたのキャラクターは歩行モードで移動します。しかし、別の移動モードを使っ"
"た方がいい状況もあります。\n"
"\n"
"4種類の移動モード\n"
"- <color_light_cyan>歩行</color>: 初期設定されているモードです。移動速度、スタミナ消"
"耗、足音の大きさはどれも平均的です。\n"
"- <color_light_cyan>駆足</color>: キャラクターの<color_light_green>移動速度が上昇</"
"color>しますが、<color_light_red>スタミナ消耗速度が上昇</color>します。\n"
"- <color_light_cyan>中腰</color>: 障害物に身を隠すことで、<color_light_green>モンスター"
"からの視認性が低下</color>します。<color_light_red>移動速度が低下</color>し、"
"<color_light_green>足音が軽減</color>されます。\n"
"- <color_light_cyan>臥位</color>: <color_light_green>モンスターからの視認性が大きく低下"
"</color>し、<color_light_red>移動速度が大きく低下</color>、<color_light_green>足音が大"
"きく軽減</color>されます。\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"<color_yellow>を押すと<color_light_cyan>移動モードメニュー</color>が表示され、いつでも"
"モードを切り替えられます。各モードに割り当てられたキーを押せば、モード切替を更に便利に"
"扱えます。\n"
"\n"
"通路の端まで移動して、チュートリアルを続けましょう。"

msgid ""
"Most of this artichoke's inulin has been converted into fructose after cooking, and it "
"now tastes pleasantly sweet."
msgstr ""
"キクイモを調理することで、含有していたイヌリンのほとんどが果糖に変化し、心地よい甘味を"
"感じられるようになりました。"

msgid ""
"Most of this bear's fur has burnt off and its body looks to be falling apart, not "
"entirely immune to its own acidic fluids.  Despite its weakened state, the strength of "
"a bear hasn't left it."
msgstr ""
"酸液に対して完全な耐性を得ている訳ではないようで、このクマの毛皮はほとんど焼け爛れ、肉"
"体もボロボロになっています。弱っているとはいえ、生来の強さは健在です。"

msgid ""
"Most of your fingers have grown to tremendous length, becoming a broad pair of "
"leathery wings.  This allows you to arrest a fall or glide from a ledge if you aren't "
"too weighed down, but naturally impedes your fine motor skills.  They even keep you "
"warm when you sleep."
msgstr ""
"両手の指が途方もない長さに成長し、各指の間に革の翼のような広い膜ができています。体重が"
"それほど重くなければ、高所からの落下ダメージを防ぎ、滑空できるようになります。当然です"
"が、指先を使った細かい作業は困難です。睡眠時には翼に包まって体温を保ちます。"

msgid ""
"Most styles have a variety of special moves associated with them.  Most have a skill "
"requirement, and will be unavailable until you reach that level of skill.  Those "
"special moves or combos are executed automatically during attacks you make."
msgstr ""
"ほとんどのスタイルは特別な技を持っています。大抵の技は、発動するスキルレベルの要件があ"
"り、スキルが一定レベル以上になるまで使えません。特別なステップやコンボは攻撃中に自動的"
"に発動します。"

msgid "Most trees in this area were uniformly cut down."
msgstr "ほとんどの木々が伐採されています。"

msgid "Most zombies go through cars, not around them.  Remember that when running away."
msgstr ""
"大抵のゾンビは車両にまっすぐ突っ込み、避けようとしません。逃げるときは有効活用しましょ"
"う。"

msgid "Mostly Recovered"
msgstr "完治目前"

msgid ""
"Mostly my family and I have just been mourning.  This isn't the best place to do it.  "
msgstr "家族で喪に服している。ちゃんと喪に服せるような環境でもないけどな。"

