msgstr "%sにはアイテムを収納できるポケットがありません。"

msgid ""
"No point limits are enforced.\n"
"\n"
"Create a character with the intention of telling a story, making things easier, or "
"challenging yourself."
msgstr ""
"ポイント制限はありません。物語を創作するつもりでキャラクターを作るのも、高い難易度に挑"
"戦するのも自由です。"

msgid "No problem, <name_g>."
msgstr "もちろん、<name_g>。"

msgid "No problem, Draco."
msgstr "どういたしまして、ドラコ。"

msgid ""
"No problem, a lot of people are going through some hard times right now.  Honestly, "
"you're doing better than most.  You should follow me, I have a pretty good handle on "
"reality."
msgstr ""
"大丈夫、この状況で辛い思いをしている人はあなた以外にもたくさんいる。正直言って、あなた"
"は結構上手くやれている方だと思う。私にはこの世界を生き抜く力がある。一緒に行こう。"

msgid "No problem."
msgstr "問題ない。"

msgid "No problem.  Bye."
msgstr "問題ない。"

msgid "No problem.  I'm sure one of us will get to it anyway."
msgstr "気にするな。他の誰かに任せるさ。"

msgid "No problem.  See you around."
msgstr "気にするな。また会おう。"

msgid "No problem.  See you."
msgstr "気にするな。また会おう。"

msgid "No problem.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "問題ない。前の話をもう一度聞かせてもらえる？"

msgid "No problemo."
msgstr "それでいい。"

msgid "No radio car connected."
msgstr "ラジコンカーと接続されていません。"

msgid "No ranged attacks against characters"
msgstr "一度もNPCを遠距離攻撃しない"

msgid "No ranged attacks against monsters"
msgstr "一度もモンスターを遠距離攻撃しない"

msgid "No rest for the weary.  See you around, Tom."
msgstr "疲れた者に休息はない、とはこの事か。また今度話そう、トム。"

msgid "No rest for the weary…"
msgstr "疲れた者に休息はない、とはこの事か..."

msgid "No results found within %d tiles."
msgstr "該当するものがありません。"

msgid "No saves for current character yet."
msgstr "現在のキャラクターのセーブファイルがありません。"

msgid "No scaling"
msgstr "無効"

msgid "No seed"
msgstr "種を植えない"

msgid "No slurry?  No power."
msgstr "プルトニウム懸濁液は無いのか？電力が切れてしまう。"

msgid "No starting NPC"
msgstr "開始地点NPCなし"

msgid "No style"
msgstr "なし"

msgid "No sudden movements, got it?"
msgstr "妙な動きはするなよ、分かってるな？"

msgid "No suitable items are located at the drop points…"
msgstr "収集地点に適切なアイテムがありません..."

msgid "No swimming"
msgstr "水泳しない"

msgid "No templates found!"
msgstr "テンプレートがありません！"

msgid "No thank you."
msgstr "礼は要らない。"

msgid "No thanks, I really don't feel like it."
msgstr "止めておこう、そんな気分じゃない。"

msgid "No thanks, I'd better get going."
msgstr "止めておこう、そろそろ行かないと。"

msgid "No thanks, I'm good."
msgstr "いや、大丈夫だ。"

msgid "No thanks.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "止めておく。他の話をしよう。"

msgid "No touching returning probes, even if they beg you to"
msgstr "懇願されたとしても、帰還した調査隊には絶対に触らない"

msgid "No trading, that's my rule."
msgstr "取引はしない、それが私のルールだ。"

msgid "No traits found."
msgstr "特質が見つかりません。"

msgid "No translocator target known."
msgstr "転移する標的が不明です。"

msgid "No true Scotsman would leave home without his kilt."
msgstr "真のスコットランド人はキルトを纏わずに外出しないものです。"

msgid "No turn is too sharp."
msgstr "曲がれないカーブはありません。"

msgid "No valid targets to teleport."
msgstr "転移する有効な標的が見つかりません。"

msgid "No vehicle at grabbed point."
msgstr "掴んだ場所に車両がありません。"

msgid "No vehicle available."
msgstr "対象となる車両がありません。"

msgid "No vehicle controls found."
msgstr "車両の制御装置が見つかりません。"

msgid "No vehicle there."
msgstr "車両がありません。"

msgid "No visitors beyond this point"
msgstr "この先ビジター立ち入り禁止"

msgid ""
"No way in hell.  I'm not going to risk the safety of dozens of people just for some "
"ass.  If you're that desperate, go talk to Alonso."
msgstr ""
"勘弁してくれよ。何十人もの人を危険に晒してまで、自分勝手に動こうとは思わないね。そこま"
"でするなら、アロンソにでも頼んでみろよ。"

msgid "No way man."
msgstr "まさか。"

msgid "No way, that's disgusting!"
msgstr "痛っ、刺されました！"

msgid "No weight difference - superpositional?"
msgstr "重量差なし - 重層化？"

msgid "No world to load."
msgstr "ロードする世界がありません。"

msgid "No worries friend, good luck to you."
msgstr "問題ないよ、お互い頑張ろう。"

msgid "No worries.  Let me know if you want to try again."
msgstr "心配するな。また手伝ってくれるなら言ってくれ。"

msgid "No worries.  They don't grow from trees, but we have time."
msgstr "心配しないで。ギターは木に実ったりしないが、時間はたっぷりある。"

msgid "No!  I can't die now!"
msgstr "駄目だ！今死ぬわけにはいかない！"

msgid ""
"No!  I just got everything together.  I am not leaving, not now.  Everything's finally "
"coming together!"
msgstr ""
"嫌だ！せっかく準備が整ったのに。ここを出て行くものか。まだその時じゃない。全部揃ったん"
"だ！"

msgid "No!  I just know it, they are still alive!"
msgstr "そんなことはない！私にはわかる、あの子はまだ生きてる！"

msgid "No!  Just kidding."
msgstr "ダメだ！いや、冗談だよ。"

msgid "No!  Oh god, no, this can't be happening…"
msgstr "止めろ！嘘だ、こんな、こんなことになるなんて..."

msgid "No, *I'm* sorry, I didn't mean that.  Go do what you want."
msgstr "いや、私が悪かった。そんなつもりじゃなかったんだ。これからは好きに生きればいい。"

msgid ""
"No, I barely got two miles.  I ran into some kind of hell-spawn bio-weapon, a crazy "
"screeching <monster> made of arms and legs and heads from all sorts of creatures, "
"humans too.  I think I killed it.  Grabbed my stuff and ran, after putting a couple "
"bullets into it.  I hope I never see something like that again."
msgstr ""
"いいや、そこから3kmちょっと進むのがやっとだった。恐ろしい生体兵器と衝突してしまったん"
"だ。人間や色んな生物の手足や頭が混ざりあった、狂った金切り声をあげる<monster>さ。とどめ"
"は刺せたと思うんだけど。何発か撃ち込んだ後は、荷物を掴んで逃げ出したよ。またあんな怪物"
"に出くわすのはごめんだね。"

msgid "No, I don't have any."
msgstr "いや、いい知らせはない。"

msgid ""
"No, I don't particularly want to talk about it, but I can I guess.  Before "
"<the_cataclysm> I was an insurance adjuster.  My husband Boris and I were evacuated "
"with my brother Garry, and from our evacuation center we caught a commissioned bus out "
"here.  The bus was attacked by a monster, we lived.  Not everyone on the bus did.  We "
"lost people dear to us, now we're stuck here with little to do but think about it."
msgstr ""
"別に話したいわけじゃないけど、どんなことがあったかな。<the_cataclysm>が来るまでは、私は"
"保険査定の仕事をしていた。パートナーのボリス、それから兄のギャリーと一緒に避難所へ行"
"き、ここへ向かうバスに乗ったんだ。バスは途中で怪物に襲われたけど、私たちは生き残った。"
"乗客全員は助からなかった。大切な人を喪い、やることもなく、ここに留まって延々と考え事を"
"してるって訳さ。"

msgid "No, I don't."
msgstr "いや、さっぱり。"

msgid "No, I just made it up."
msgstr "いいや、私が自分でつけた名前だ。"

msgid "No, I need them now."
msgstr "駄目だ、今すぐ必要だ。"

msgid "No, I wouldn't.  Like I said, we don't have any to spare."
msgstr "いいや、無理だ。さっきも言ったけど、備蓄が足りないんだ。"

msgid "No, I'm a traveler.  What's up with you?"
msgstr "いいや、通りがかっただけだ。調子はどう？"

msgid "No, I'm keeping it.  Try and take it off me, I dare you."
msgstr "嫌だね、貰っていくよ。取り返してみろ、出来るものならな。"

msgid ""
"No, I'm not really with them.  We just got stuck together in the same messed up "
"evacuation place.  This one guy was really nice, but they wouldn't let us stay.  They "
"got there first so they told us we needed to find our own place, but if we got "
"anything they wanted they'd trade some of the stuff they have.  I tried to talk them "
"into helping but they were so cold to me."
msgstr ""
"まあ、厳密に言えばそうなるな。私たちがこうして集まっている理由は、ただ偶然滅茶苦茶な避"
"難所に居合わせて、行く当てもない者同士だったからだ。道中で親切な人にも会ったが、泊めて"
"はもらえなかった。先に着いた者が優先だから、私たちは他の寝床を探さなければならない。何"
"か欲しいものがあるなら、物々交換してくれるとは言っていた。仕事を手伝うと提案してどうに"
"か説得しようとしたが、冷たくあしらわれてしまった。"

msgid "No, I'm still certain about this.  Jeremiah just isn't a good fit."
msgstr "いや、やはり駄目だ。人には向き不向きというものがある。"

msgid "No, but I might be looking to buy some."
msgstr "仕事は受けないが、私もサンプルを購入したい。"

msgid "No, don't set an alarm."
msgstr "設定しない。"

msgid "No, enough is enough.  I am not doing this."
msgstr "もう十分だ。こんなのはこりごりだ。"

msgid "No, go back to sleep."
msgstr "いいや、停止状態のままにしておこう。"

msgid "No, it's rotten!"
msgstr "「見ろ、返事をした！」"

msgid ""
"No, mainly because my whole neighborhood burnt to the ground.  Some scouts went by a "
"while ago.  Nothing there for me but melted plastic miniatures and thousands of hours "
"of gameplay I'll never have."
msgstr ""
"いいえ、近所一帯が焼けちゃってたからね。少し前に偵察に行ったんだ。溶けたプラスチック製"
"のミニチュアたちと何千時間もの思い出以外、何も残ってない。"

msgid "No, my name has been a name here for a very long time too."
msgstr "いいや、私の名前もかなりの年代物だ。"

msgid ""
"No, no I don't, and I'd appreciate you not leaving me hanging on that.  There are "
"fungal zombies?"
msgstr "いや、知らないね。詳しく聞きたい、ぜひ教えてよ。真菌ゾンビってのはどんな奴？"

msgid ""
"No, no!  It's fine, promise.  It's just been a hot minute, and I'm trying to remember "
"it.  It's been a while.  You sure you want to hear it?"
msgstr ""
"いや、問題ない！本当、大丈夫だ。久々にそんなことを聞かれたから、思い出そうとしてただけ"
"だよ。どうだったかな。本当に聞きたいのか？"

msgid "No, not at all."
msgstr "いや、止めておこう。"

msgid ""
"No, not at all.  Just being cautious.  You know how it gets out here.  We're not "
"looking for trouble.  In fact, if you've got anything worthwhile, maybe we could do a "
"little trading."
msgstr ""
"いやいや、滅相もない。用心に越したことはないということさ。ここがどこか知らない訳じゃな"
"いだろう？トラブルはご免だよ。もし何か売れそうなものを持っているなら、取り引きしてもい"
"い。"

msgid "No, not by the government."
msgstr "ああ、でも政府の用意した避難所じゃない。"

msgid ""
"No, not great.  Like all here, I have lost too much.  I do not feel I can ever come "
"back from it.  Can anyone be strong enough?"
msgstr ""
"ああ、その通り。ここにいる他の皆と同じく、私は余りにも多くのものを失った。再起できる気"
"がしないんだ。心が折れない人なんているんだろうか？"

msgid "No, not playing this game."
msgstr "いや、そんな遊びをやっている暇はないんだ。"

msgid ""
"No, not really.  I came here after I was split from my friends by a horde of "
"<zombies>.  They let me in after I gave away some food I found.  The church distrusts "
"my profession; I get by helping Kostas."
msgstr ""
"いや、そうでもない。私は<zombies>の大群のせいで同僚たちとはぐれて、ここに辿り着いた。"
"持っていた食料を譲ったら、入れてもらえたよ。どうも、教会は私の仕事に不信感を抱いている"
"らしい。コスタスの手伝いって名目で、何とか居座らせてもらってる状況だ。"

msgid "No, of course not!  Sorry, I'm leaving."
msgstr "いや、そんなことはない！悪かった、もう行くよ。"

msgid "No, thanks."
msgstr "いや、結構だ。"

msgid "No, that's all."
msgstr "いや、これで全部だ。"

msgid "No, that's messed up."
msgstr "ないよ、気持ち悪い。"

msgid "No, this is not beans."
msgstr "いいえ、これは豆ではありません。"

msgid ""
"No, unfortunately.  They're folks that wanted to join us, but we're too full and we "
"don't have enough to share.  Most people leave and look for their own place when we "
"turn them down, but these ones… didn't.  We've been trying to find them a safe place, "
"but there's a shortage of those these days, for reasons I'm sure you can guess.  Until "
"then, we're letting them crash here as long as they don't mess the place up."
msgstr ""
"残念ながら、ノーだ。メンバーになりたがってはいたが、もう人は十分に集まったし、物資も足"
"りなかった。ほとんどの奴は、断ったら他の避難所を探しに出ていったんだが、あいつらは...そ"
"うしなかった。せめて安全な居場所は作ってやりたいが、十分なスペースすら確保できない。当"
"面の間は、無茶をやらかさないって条件付きで泊めてやることになったんだ。"

msgid "No, we'll be okay here."
msgstr "いや、ここでいい。"

msgid "No, you're right!  I'm sorry for intruding!"
msgstr "いや、その通りだ！失礼なことを言って悪かった！"

msgid "No."
msgstr "いいえ。"

msgid "No.  I can't.  Just, no."
msgstr "いいや。できない。絶対、無理だ。"

msgid ""
"No.  I'd already seen the clouds on the horizon.  Fluffy pink mushroom clouds, and "
"also those insane fiery green hell-clouds.  I've heard that horrible things came out "
"of them.  I decided it was safer in the woods."
msgstr ""
"いいや。その時、不吉なものを見たんだ。漂うピンク色の胞子、そして常軌を逸した量の、緑色"
"に変色した群衆だ。何か恐ろしい事が起きたんだと直感したよ。だから、森の中に留まる方が安"
"全だと判断したんだ。"

msgid "No.  I'll get back to it, bye!"
msgstr "いいや、まだだ。さようなら。"

msgid ""
"No.  In the evacuation shelter, distracted by grief, I forgot it.  We were rushed onto "
"the bus so quickly, and… well, I don't remember much of that time.  His work was all "
"saved on the hard drive, we thought we could download it from the cloud when we "
"arrived but, well, there is no cloud now.  Even if there were, it would only have his "
"writing, not his little games, his silly voice recordings."
msgstr ""
"いいや。悲しみで気もそぞろになっていて、避難シェルターに置いてきてしまったんだ。とにか"
"く急いでバスに乗り込んで、それから...ああ、その時のことはよく思い出せない。息子の作品は"
"すべてノートPCのハードドライブに入っていたんだ。落ち着いたらクラウドからダウンロードで"
"きると思っていたが、この状況ではクラウドも意味がない。もしクラウドに繋げたとしても、"
"残っているのはゲームの形にもなっていない文章や、他愛ない音声ファイルくらいだろう。"

msgid ""
"No.  You seem like you have a chance of surviving in this world.  Plus, you took the "
"time to actually hear me out, so there is a chance one day you'll hear the Song the "
"same way I do."
msgstr ""
"いいや。あんたはこの世界で生き残れる運をもっているようだ。それに、わざわざ私の話も聞い"
"てくれた。いつか私のように、歌を聞く機会がやってくるかもしれないな。"

msgid ""
"Nobody came, <name_g>.  I'm beginning to doubt that anyone else has survived besides "
"us…"
msgstr "<name_g>、誰も来ていないんだ。私たち以外に生き残りは誰も居ないのかもしれん..."

msgid ""
"Nobody really.  I'm old enough to work and get merch for my rations.  Jenny and Rhy "
"look out for me though.  They think I don't notice that they're looking out for me, "
"but I do.  It's okay, they're both cool."
msgstr ""
"面倒なんて誰も見ないよ。ここで仕事をして食費を稼げる歳にはなってるんだから。でもジェ"
"ニーとライはよく気にかけてくれる。2人とも世話をしてるつもりなんて無いみたいだけど、助"
"かってる。大丈夫、2人はとってもいい奴だよ。"

msgid "Nobody told the vending machines that the world ended.  Save those cash cards!"
msgstr ""
"自動販売機は世界が崩壊したことに気付いていないようです。キャッシュカードは残しておきま"
"しょう！"

msgid ""
"Nobody's the same, not even twins.  But I'll tell you something.  The big eye looked "
"at me.  When it did, it heard the voices, and it blinked."
msgstr ""
"たとえ双子でも、同じ人間なんていない。でも、一つ伝えておこう。大きな目が私を見つめて、"
"瞬きすると、声が聞こえたんだ。"

msgid ""
"Nobody's tried to yet.  It can get a little boring sometimes, standing around and "
"doing nothing."
msgstr "今のところは誰もいない。やることもなく立っているだけだと、ちょっと退屈だ。"

msgid "Nodding Off"
msgstr "ログオフ"

msgid "NoisRed"
msgstr "減音"

msgid "Noise"
msgstr "騒音"

msgid "Noise Reduction"
msgstr "減音"

msgid "Noisemaker"
msgstr "騒音発生"

msgid "Noisemaker CBM"
msgid_plural "Noisemaker CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 騒音発生"

msgid "Nomad"
msgstr "流浪者"

msgid "Nomad blueprint abstract"
msgid_plural "Nomad blueprint abstracts"
msgstr[0] "汎用エクゾディ設計図"

msgid "Nomadic restlessness"
msgstr "一か所に留まっていると落ち着かない"

msgid "Nomex"
msgstr "ノーメックス"

msgid "Nomex foot wraps"
msgid_plural "pairs of Nomex foot wraps"
msgstr[0] "布屑(ノーメックス)"

msgid "Nomex patch"
msgid_plural "Nomex patches"
msgstr[0] "端切れ(ノーメックス)"

msgid "Nomex sheet"
msgid_plural "Nomex sheets"
msgstr[0] "生地(ノーメックス)"

msgid "Nomex thread"
msgid_plural "Nomex thread"
msgstr[0] "糸(ノーメックス)"

msgid "Non-Forested Wetland"
msgstr "非森林湿地"

msgid ""
"Non-Mycus sometimes reject the Marloss.  Our colonial efforts flourish with broad-"
"minded guidance."
msgstr ""
"ミカズならざる者の中にマーロスを拒否する者もいる。我々開拓者の尽力は浩然たる指針となっ"
"て繁茂している。"

msgid "Non-Newtonian Fluid"
msgstr "非ニュートン流体"

msgid "Non-dominant leg forward, you know the basics of impaling someone on a spear."
msgstr "利き足と逆の足を一歩踏み出す槍での戦闘の基本的な構えを心得ています。"

msgid ""
"Non-perishables, MREs, canned soup, dehydrated milk, oats/rice, lemon juice, protein "
"powder.  Ammo, in crates if possible - just ask Rachel at RFA?  Large drums (HDPE), "
"reusable containers, spare fuel can.  More novels and TV from home.  Iodine, colloidal "
"silver, gas mask and filters for fallout."
msgstr ""
"保存食、MRE、スープ缶、粉ミルク、燕麦・米、レモンジュース、プロテインパウダー。弾薬、可"
"能であれば箱単位 - RFAのレイチェルに聞いてみる？大型ドラム缶(高密度ポリエチレン製)、再"
"利用できる容器、予備の燃料タンク。家にある小説とテレビ、ヨウ素、コロイド銀、ガスマスク"
"と放射性降下物用フィルター。"

msgid "None"
msgstr "なし"

msgid "None       "
msgstr "なし       "

msgid "None of the items can be moved there."
msgstr "そこにはアイテムを移動できません。"

msgid "None of the mods can be modified."
msgstr "使用できるMODがありません。"

msgid "None of the mods can be removed."
msgstr "取り外せるMODがありません。"

msgid "None of the turrets are ready to fire."
msgstr "射撃できるタレットがありません。"

msgid "None of your business really, is it."
msgstr "あんたには関係ない話だろ。"

msgid "None of your cutting tools are suitable for butchering."
msgstr "解体に適した切断ツールがありません。"

msgid "None of your tools are sharp and precise enough to do that."
msgstr "この作業が可能なほど鋭く精密な道具がありません。"

msgid "None present."
msgstr "なし(なし)"

msgid "None taken.  I guess that makes two of us."
msgstr "大丈夫。私たちは似た者同士だ。"

msgid "None!"
msgstr "何も無い！"

msgid "None."
msgstr "何もない。"

msgid "Nonvalid"
msgstr "特殊"

msgid "Nonviolence"
msgstr "非暴力"

msgid ""
"Nope, although I have a really good claim by the river.  Gonna go fetch them soon, be "
"right back in <interval>."
msgstr ""
"いいや、川辺でちゃんと宣伝してるんだけどな。<interval>後には品物が揃うと思うから、また"
"来るといい。"

msgid ""
"Nope, current run hasn't returned yet.  Come back in <interval>.  You might find "
"something you like."
msgstr ""
"いいや、まだ部隊が遠征中だ。<interval>には戻るだろう。その頃にまた来てくれたら、良いも"
"のが見つかるかもな。"

msgid "Nope, in fact I'm leaving right now."
msgstr "いや、もう行かないと。"

msgid "Nope, it couldn't.  Don't try and <swear> bribe me again, you <swear> <name_b>."
msgstr "いいや、ダメだ。<swear>、賄賂の話は二度とするな、<swear>、<name_b>。"

msgid "Nope, just saying hi."
msgstr "いや、ちょっと挨拶に寄っただけだ。"

msgid "Nope, sorry."
msgstr "知らなくて悪かったな。"

msgid ""
"Nope, you can't do that.  I'd like to help you, but we've already got enough mouths to "
"feed."
msgstr "いや、無理だ。困っているのは分かるけど、ここの人員を養うだけで精一杯だ。"

msgid "Nope."
msgstr "いいや。"

msgid "Nope.  Not mine.  Listen, maybe we shouldn't talk about this right now."
msgstr "違う、私のじゃない。ええと、今は別の話をしたい気分だ。"

msgid "Normal"
msgstr "普通"

msgid "Normal Human"
msgstr "普通の人間"

msgid "Normal Mansion Basement (Random)"
msgstr "通常大邸宅地下(ランダム)"

msgid ""
"Normal damage heals with time.  You heal more during a good sleep, but wounds also "
"heal a bit while you are awake."
msgstr ""
"通常のダメージは時間と共に回復します。ぐっすり眠れば治りも早まりますが、普通に過ごして"
"いても少しずつ治っていきます。"

msgid "Normalize body stats"
msgstr "有効 - 能力値正常化"

msgid "Normally a delicacy, but this style of preparation is missing something."
msgstr "本来は珍味なのですが、この調理方法では何かが物足りませんね。"

msgid ""
"Normally this glossy, ad-filled magazine about cars would be pointless, but it has a "
"series of articles on haggling techniques."
msgstr ""
"普通なら体裁の良い乗用車の広告が満載の雑誌など無価値ですが、この雑誌には交渉技術に関す"
"る一連の記事が掲載されています。"

msgid "North"
msgstr "北"

msgid "North East"
msgstr "北東"

msgid "North Korean flag"
msgid_plural "North Korean flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(北朝鮮)"

msgid "North West"
msgstr "北西"

msgid "North furniture: Not TRANSPARENT"
msgstr "北の設置物: 不透過"

msgid "North furniture: TRANSPARENT"
msgstr "北の設置物: 透過"

msgid "North terrain: Not TRANSPARENT"
msgstr "北の地形: 不透過"

msgid "North terrain: TRANSPARENT"
msgstr "北の地形: 透過"

msgid "North-East"
msgstr "北東"

msgid "North-West"
msgstr "北西"

msgid "Northern Lights jigsaw puzzle"
msgid_plural "Northern Lights jigsaw puzzles"
msgstr[0] "ジグソーパズル(ｵｰﾛﾗ)"

msgid "Norwegian flag"
msgid_plural "Norwegian flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾉﾙｳｪｰ)"

msgid "Not Enough Energy"
msgstr "コスト不足"

msgid "Not Enough Stamina"
msgstr "コスト不足"

msgid "Not Interested"
msgstr "仲間に誘わない"

msgid "Not Welcome"
msgstr "非歓迎"

msgid "Not a bad way to live."
msgstr "悪くない生き方だ。"

msgid "Not a bargain bin kid, the price's the price."
msgstr "特売コーナーで駄々こねるガキじゃないんだから。値段はまけられないよ。"

msgid "Not a bloody chance, I'm going to get left behind!"
msgstr "絶対に嫌だね、付いて行くからな！"

msgid "Not a kitten, but what appears to be a ferret eating a plate of lasagne."
msgstr "子猫ではなく、ラザーニャを食べるフェレットだと思われます。"

msgid ""
"Not a martial art, setting this style will prevent weapon attacks and force punches "
"(with a free hand) or kicks."
msgstr ""
"戦闘スタイルではありませんが、このスタイルに設定すると武器を装備せず、パンチやキック(素"
"手格闘)で戦います。"

msgid "Not a martial art, this is just plain old punching and kicking."
msgstr "武術ではなく、単純にパンチとキックを繰り出しているだけです。"

msgid "Not a problem."
msgstr "大丈夫だ、問題ない。"

msgid "Not a technique at all"
msgstr "我流"

msgid ""
"Not a whole lot, really.  They made me track down and destroy some government "
"documents a while back.  Obviously I read them first, but it wasn't much.  As far as I "
"know, this place had an experimental computer network before everything went to hell.  "
"What's going on in there now is anybody's guess."
msgstr ""
"本当、大した仕事じゃない。前に頼まれたのは、政府文書の在り処を突き止めて処分しろって仕"
"事だった。もちろん処分前に読んではみたが、大した内容でもない。世界が地獄と化すより前、"
"ここには実験的なコンピュータネットワークがあったらしい。それが今どうなっているかは、誰"
"にも分からないけど。"

msgid ""
"Not as big as the back cover suggests, this book still contains lots of information "
"for the reader about key concepts, definitions, diagrams, and doodles about computer "
"science."
msgstr ""
"タイトル通りの完璧とは言えませんが、コンピュータ科学に関する重要な概念や定義、図、小ネ"
"タなど、読者に多くの情報を提供してくれる書籍です。"

msgid ""
"Not as much as I'd like, I'm afraid.  Most of these shelters seemed to have been "
"designed to make people *feel* safer, not to actually keep them safe.  Our radio "
"equipment is terrible… I don't think it was even meant to be used seriously.  I've "
"heard some talk of hordes."
msgstr ""
"残念ながら、希望が見える話は聞いてないね。大抵の避難所の安全性は見せかけだけで、実際に"
"安全を確保できるような代物じゃなかった。無線設備も酷いもので、まともに使えるとは思えな"
"い。ゾンビの群れを見かけたって話も聞いたな。"

msgid "Not assigned missions:"
msgstr "未割り当てのミッション: "

msgid "Not at the moment, check back later perhaps."
msgstr "今の所は何もないな、また今度寄ってくれ。"

msgid "Not at the moment, thanks."
msgstr "今は特にないな、ありがとう。"

msgid "Not attacking the %1$s -- safe mode is on!  (%2$s to turn it off)"
msgstr "%1$sを攻撃していません--セーフモードが有効化されています！(%2$sで無効化)"

msgid ""
"Not bad.  Much better than before.  Pablo and I have privacy, and the folks here "
"actually appreciate my bread instead of paying me a pittance for it and then taking it "
"to the basement without so much as a 'thanks'."
msgstr ""
"悪くないね。いや、ずっと良くなった。パブロと私のプライバシーも保てる。前なんて、はした"
"金を払って「ありがとう」すら言わず地下に引っ込むお客ばっかりだったから。ちゃんと私のパ"
"ンを買って喜んでもらえるのは嬉しいよ。"

msgid "Not dragging any vehicle!"
msgstr "牽引車両が無い！"

msgid "Not enough given what's happening."
msgstr "このような状況では、ヤクはいくらあっても足りないものだ。"

msgid "Not enough money, please refill your cash card."
msgstr "お金が足りません、キャッシュカードにお金を補充して下さい。"

msgid "Not enough space for bionic installation!%s"
msgstr "この生体部品を導入する空間的余裕がありません！%s"

msgid "Not exactly the settlin' type."
msgstr "一つの場所に腰を落ち着けるタイプじゃないんだ。"

msgid ""
"Not exactly.  After a while, I got brave.  I started venturing into the swamps, "
"picking off giant bugs here and there.  I learned about traveling in at night to avoid "
"a bunch, and that got me pretty far.  Eventually I cleared out a cozy little area for "
"myself and started really feeling comfortable.  I guess I got a bit complacent."
msgstr ""
"ちょっと違うな。しばらくして、思い切った事をするようになった。沼地へ分け入って、巨大な"
"虫を捕まえたんだ。夜に動けば虫をやり過ごせることにも気づいて、かなり遠くまで移動した。"
"最終的には、居心地の良い小さな避難所を整備して、快適な生活を送り始めていたんだ。まぁ、"
"所詮は自己満足だったんだけどね。"

msgid "Not if I kill you first!"
msgstr "殺される前に殺してやる！"

msgid "Not in God's Name: Confronting Religious Violence"
msgid_plural "copies of Not in God's Name: Confronting Religious Violence "
msgstr[0] "本(一般/神の名においてではなく:宗教による暴力に立ち向かう)"

msgid ""
"Not in the mood to dance, huh?  Or perhaps you should try wearing something less "
"encumbering.  You know, if you want to."
msgstr ""
"ダンスの気分じゃないのかい？それか、動きやすい服を着てみるのもいいかもな。思い切り踊る"
"なら、試してみるといい。"

msgid "Not interested after all?"
msgstr "あまりそそられないな？"

msgid "Not interested."
msgstr "興味が無いね。"

msgid "Not interested.  I'd better get going."
msgstr "興味をそそる話でもないな。そろそろ行くよ。"

msgid "Not kitten, just a packet of Kool-Aid™."
msgstr "子猫ではなくKool-Aid™のジュース粉末です。"

msgid "Not long"
msgstr "少し後"

msgid "Not many people made it out of the riots alive."
msgstr "暴動に参加して無事に戻ってきた人はあまりいない。"

msgid ""
"Not many travelers come through here these days.  There's not much left to wander too, "
"besides a horde of <zombies>."
msgstr ""
"ここを通りがかる人も滅多に見なくなったよ。<zombies>じゃない放浪者が今も残っているなんて"
"ね。"

msgid ""
"Not many travelers come through here these days.  There's not much left to wander too, "
"besides a horde of <zombies>.  The people here won't be too friendly with you either, "
"so that sucks."
msgstr ""
"ここを通りがかる人も滅多に見なくなったよ。<zombies>じゃない放浪者が今も残っているなんて"
"ね。あなたみたいな人は、ここじゃ歓迎されないよ。残念だけど。"

msgid "Not much fruit juice to make fancy drinks, but I can scrounge up some still."
msgstr "洒落た酒を造れるほど果汁はストックできていないけど、多少なら残ってるよ。"

msgid ""
"Not much is up.  Not enough, in fact.  Here we are stuck in this slum pit with a bunch "
"of strangers, and all we can do is sit around staring at our hands."
msgstr ""
"特に何もないわ。実際、厳しいけどね。こんな貧民街みたいな場所で大勢の赤の他人と過ごし"
"て、できることは、ただ座って手を見つめるだけ。"

msgid ""
"Not much point to rebuilding up in that horribly bright, roofless wasteland.  Now that "
"you've become accustomed to your new digs, there's the beginning of a great empire "
"right here, underground."
msgstr ""
"あんな眩しくて屋根もない、悲惨な不毛の大地に文明を復興しても無意味です。地中を掘り進む"
"のにもすっかり慣れたところで、大帝国建設への第一歩を地下に刻みましょう。"

msgid "Not much survives a hit from a very fast car."
msgstr "時速200kmで走る車に勝てる敵は滅多にいません。"

msgid "Not much to say.  What did you want to hear?"
msgstr "そんなに話すこともないな。何が聞きたいんだ？"

msgid ""
"Not much too it, really.  I came here on that bus with everyone else when "
"<the_cataclysm> happened to stroll by.  I've been servicing everyone's electronics "
"since then."
msgstr ""
"別に話すことないよ、ホントに。<the_cataclysm>が起きてから、バスに乗ってみんなと一緒にこ"
"こへ来た。それ以来、ここにある電化製品の修理をやってる。"

msgid "Not much, just passing through.  Have a good day."
msgstr "ぼちぼちだね。通りがかったから声をかけたんだ。いい一日を。"

msgid "Not much.  I told you not to go for the icons."
msgstr "あんまり。聖画カードは受け取るなって言ったのに。"

msgid "Not my kind of thing."
msgstr "よく分からない料理だ。"

msgid "Not now."
msgstr "今はいい。"

msgid "Not participating:"
msgstr "不参加: "

msgid "Not quite like the summers from before, huh?"
msgstr "以前までの夏とは全然違うと思わないか？"

msgid "Not quite like the winters from before, huh?"
msgstr "以前までの冬とは全然違うと思わないか？"

msgid "Not quite restaurant quality but it'll do."
msgstr "レストラン並みとはいかないけど、これで十分だ。"

msgid ""
"Not really a set, just a sheet of paper with a big '#' drawn at the center, alongside "
"three buttons of a specific color, three others from a different color and a proper "
"container for storing it properly.  You can play tic tac toe indefinitely with that!"
msgstr ""
"セットと言えるほど立派なものではありません。#状に大きく線が引かれた紙と二色のボタン各3"
"個、そして保管用のケースがあるだけです。これがあれば無限に三目並べを遊び続けられます！"

msgid "Not really, just trying to lead my life."
msgstr "いや別に、生きるために必要だからやってるだけさ。"

msgid ""
"Not really, no.  It's old stuff, and there's enough going on.  Let's just say I'm no "
"stranger to loss, either my own or others'."
msgstr ""
"いや、勘弁してくれ。昔のことだし、話したいとも思わない。自分の話だろうが他人の話だろう"
"が、喪失についての話題はもう聞き飽きたよ。"

msgid ""
"Not really.  Government fed us all kinds of conflicting stories, and there was some "
"absolutely heinous stuff going on.  I mean, you can't have missed that video of the "
"woman killing her own baby, right?  God, that still gives me nightmares.  I don't know "
"what it was about it, something about the look on her face.  Worse stuff came out of "
"course, and now we've both seen worse things with our own eyes, but that one still "
"comes back to haunt me.  Anyway, they never could control the riots, and by the time "
"the rioters started turning into undead it was way too late.  I don't know if morale "
"just broke or what but I heard rumors the military and police started turning on each "
"other as much as the crowds.  What actually made the dead come back to life though?  I "
"haven't got a clue."
msgstr ""
"さあね。政府からの情報も矛盾するものばかりだったし、実際に凶悪事件は起きていた。あれだ"
"よ、女が赤ん坊を殺す動画、見ただろう？あぁ、まだ悪夢を見る。あれは何だったんだろうな。"
"あの表情が目に焼き付いて離れない。もちろん、もっと酷い出来事を、この目で実際に見てき"
"た。でも、あの光景が今でも私を悩ませるんだ。とにかく、暴動はいつまで経っても治まらず、"
"暴徒がゾンビになったときは、何もかも手遅れだった。士気が下がっただけなのか、他の原因が"
"あるのかは知らないが、軍と警察も暴徒と同じように同士討ちを始めたって噂を聞いた。死者が"
"生き返った根本的な原因は何かって？何の手掛かりも浮かばないね。"

msgid "Not really.  How is that relevant?"
msgstr "そんなに知らないな。それと何の関係が？"

msgid "Not really.  I'd better get going."
msgstr "特にないね。もう行った方がいいよ。"

msgid ""
"Not really.  The leadership fed us all kinds of conflicting stories, and there was "
"some absolutely heinous stuff going on.  God, I still have nightmares.  I saw this one "
"woman eat her own baby.  I don't know what it was about it, something about the look "
"on her face.  Now we've both seen worse things with our own eyes, but that one still "
"comes back to haunt me.  Anyway, they never could control the riots, and by the time "
"the rioters started turning into undead it was way too late.  I don't know if morale "
"just broke or what but I heard rumors it just became a free for all bloodletting.  "
"What actually made the dead come back to life though?  I haven't got a clue."
msgstr ""
"さあね。指導者からの話も矛盾するものばかりだったし、実際に凶悪事件は起きていた。あれだ"
"よ、女が赤ん坊を殺す動画、見ただろう？あぁ、まだ悪夢を見る。あれは何だったんだろうな。"
"あの表情が目に焼き付いて離れない。もちろん、もっと酷い出来事を、この目で実際に見てき"
"た。でも、あの光景が今でも私を悩ませるんだ。とにかく、暴動はいつまで経っても治まらず、"
"暴徒がゾンビになったときは、何もかも手遅れだった。士気が下がっただけなのか、他の原因が"
"あるのかは知らないが、統制がまったく効かなくなって、血で血を洗うような争いが起きてい"
"るって噂を聞いた。死者が生き返った根本的な原因は何かって？何の手掛かりも浮かばないね。"

msgid "Not really.  What happened with the army?"
msgstr "バリーに何があったんだ？"

msgid "Not right now."
msgstr "今すぐには用意できないな。"

msgid ""
"Not so fast, I think you need to pay for breaking your promise and bothering me.  Give "
"me your shit, now!"
msgstr ""
"おっと、ルールを破って怒らせたんだから、お前には罪を償ってもらう。ふざけやがって！"

msgid "Not sweet like the name would suggest, but delicious all the same!"
msgstr "\"sweetbread\"という名前の割に甘くありませんが、美味しいことは確かです！"

msgid "Not that surprising."
msgstr "そんなこともあるさ。"

msgid "Not that way!  Go left!"
msgstr "もう駄目だ！引き返そう！"

msgid "Not the finest drink you've had, but hey, it's alcohol by the gallon."
msgstr "最上の飲み物ではないでしょうが、ほら、ガロン単位のアルコールだよ。"

msgid "Not to be operated by fuckwits"
msgstr "腐った脳みそで働くな"

msgid "Not today, I have to get going.  Just glad I was able to help."
msgstr "もう行かないと、今日は止めておくよ。手伝いができてよかった。"

msgid ""
"Not unless you pay me.  Try the shopkeep, they can sell our services just like "
"anything else."
msgstr ""
"報酬がないなら動かないよ。商人に聞いてみるといい。あいつは物品だけじゃなく私たちみたい"
"な人材も売ってるんだ。"

msgid ""
"Not where you might think.\"  He sets aside his ledger and pulls out a page of bullet-"
"point notes written in neat block letters.  \"Everyone is on board with the idea and "
"the amount of actual building to get it online is small enough that the carpenters are "
"willing to help out, so I don't need any assistance with design.  For the really short "
"term I basically just need materials.  I've been collecting spare wood, but to get a "
"good wood-fired oven I need to secure a source of firebrick.  In the longer run, Dana "
"knows the principles of milling, but I need a resource book if I want to set up a "
"functioning mill, first a muscle-powered one and then a windmill for long term.  I "
"wish I'd thought of asking Jenny.  She's a mechanical engineer, but she would probably "
"know how to get me started at least.  I'm also still looking into how to make a good "
"vermin-proof cellar.  Longer term, I will need to work my way around our reliance on "
"sugar, salt, and vinegar from before the cataclysm, but our stocks of those will hold "
"out for months while I sort things out."
msgstr ""
"「簡単に手に入るようなものではないね。」彼は台帳を脇に置き、几帳面な字体で書かれた箇条"
"書きのメモを取り出しました。「ここの全ての住人が計画に賛同してくれているし、建設に必要"
"な人員も小規模、大工も喜んで手を貸してくれる。設計面では問題はない。超短期的な観点から"
"見れば、必要なのは資材だけだ。余った木材を集めてはいるけど、いい薪オーブンを作るなら耐"
"熱レンガの供給源を確保しないとな。それから、ダナは確かに製粉の原理を理解しているけど、"
"長期的な構想を練るには、継続して稼働する製粉所を稼働させるための参考資料が要るだろう。"
"最初は人力の製粉機で足りるだろうが、長時間稼働させるなら風車が必要だ。ジェニーに相談で"
"きたらよかったんだけどな。彼女は機械エンジニアだが、製粉所稼働のための指針程度なら示し"
"てくれたかもしれない。そして、害虫を防ぐ完璧な地下倉庫の作り方。これは私もまだ調べてい"
"る最中だ。超長期的な観点から見ると、大変動以前に作られた砂糖、塩、酢への依存から抜け出"
"す必要もあるが、これは結論を出すまでの数ヶ月間は持ちこたえてくれるね。"

msgid "Not within radio range"
msgstr "無線範囲外"

msgid "Not yet."
msgstr "まだだ。"

msgid "Not yet.  I'll get back to it."
msgstr "いいや。また今度。"

msgid "Note colors: "
msgstr "メモに使える色: "

msgid "Note preview"
msgstr "表示プレビュー"

msgid ""
"Note that most painkillers take a little while to kick in.  If you take some oxycodone "
"and don't notice the effects right away, don't start taking more -  you may overdose "
"and die!"
msgstr ""
"大抵の鎮痛剤は効果が出るまで少し時間が掛かります。すぐに効かないからと言って、オキシコ"
"ドンなどを飲み過ぎないようにしましょう。薬物中毒になり、最悪の場合は死に至ります！"

msgid ""
"Note that only %s that existed when you started this game and still exist now will "
"appear here."
msgstr "ゲーム開始時に存在し現在も存在する%sのみが表示されます。"

msgid "Note:"
msgstr "メモ: "

msgid "Note: "
msgstr "メモ: "

msgid ""
"Note: The Auto Inventory Letters setting might still reassign a letter to this item.\n"
"If this is undesired, you may wish to change the setting in Options."
msgstr ""
"注意: 「アイテム/自動キー割当」設定でも、このアイテムにキーが割り当てられることがありま"
"す。\n"
"変更したい場合は「オプション」で設定を変更することをお勧めします。"

msgid ""
"Note: This is an outdated version of TGW's mod and may cause issues until we are able "
"to get it updated.  Use with caution!  An attempt at an entirely new way to play CDDA, "
"inspired by games like Escape from Tarkov and Dark and Darker.  Begin on a floating "
"island in the sky and warp down to random spots on the earth below to conduct "
"expeditions for items you need.  Permadeath is gone - you will return to the island on "
"death but lose any items you had on you.  Build up your stockpile, carry out missions "
"for unique rewards, customize your home island, unlock upgrades, and be prudent about "
"what you take on any given outing.  Be aware that 'PLAY NOW' will NOT work, you MUST "
"make a custom character."
msgstr ""
"Escape from TarkovやDark and Darkerなどのゲームから着想を得た、まったく新しいプレイ方式"
"のCDDAです。空に浮かぶ拠点から地上のランダムな地点に転移し、アイテムを求めて探索しま"
"しょう。パーマデス要素はありません。地上で死亡すると、所持アイテムを全て失い拠点に戻り"
"ます。物資を集め、ミッションを達成してユニーク報酬を獲得し、拠点となる島をカスタマイズ"
"し、アップグレードを解禁し、遠征に何を持っていくか吟味しましょう。ゲーム開始時の「今す"
"ぐ開始！」は機能しないため、注意が必要です。「キャラクターカスタム」からゲームを開始す"
"る必要があります。"

msgid "Noted.  Bye."
msgstr "覚えておこう。さようなら。"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"Skills used: %s\n"
"%s\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"使用スキル: %s\n"
"%s\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Abandon this camp"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"この拠点を放棄します。"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Assign followers to work at this camp."
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"仲間にこの拠点で作業してもらいます。"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Assign repeating job duties to NPCs stationed here.\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Effects:\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Time: Ongoing"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"割り当て済みのNPCに現在の仕事を繰り返すよう指示します。\n"
"難易度: なし\n"
"効果:\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"危険度: なし\n"
"時間: 継続的"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Cancel a current mission and force the immediate return of a companion.  No work will "
"be done on the mission and all resources used on the mission will be lost.\n"
"\n"
"WARNING: All resources used on the mission will be lost and no work will be done.  "
"Only use this mission to recover a companion who cannot otherwise be recovered.\n"
"\n"
"Companions must be on missions for at least 24 hours before emergency recall becomes "
"available."
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"仲間が現在行っている作業を即時に中断し、強制的に帰還させます。作業は取り消されますが、"
"作業で使用した物資は失われます。\n"
"\n"
"警告: 作業は取り消され、作業で使用した全ての物資が失われます。他の方法では帰還が困難な"
"仲間を帰還させる場合のみ利用しましょう。\n"
"\n"
"緊急帰還が利用可能になるには、その仲間が少なくとも24時間以上作業を行っている必要があり"
"ます。"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Distribute food to your followers.  Place the food you wish to distribute in the camp "
"food zone.  You must have a camp food zone, and a camp storage zone, or you will be "
"prompted to create them using the zone manager.\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Increases your faction's food supply value which in turn is used to pay laborers for "
"their time\n"
"\n"
"Must have enjoyability >= -6\n"
"Total faction food stock: %d kcal\n"
"or %d / %d / %d days' rations\n"
"where the days is measured for Extra / Moderate / No exercise levels"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"仲間に配給する食料を備蓄します。備蓄したい食料をあらかじめ「拠点: 備蓄食料」区域に置い"
"ておきましょう。「拠点: 備蓄食料」区域、「拠点: 資材」区域が設定されていない場合、区域"
"管理メニューでそれらを設定するよう警告が表示されます。\n"
"効果:\n"
">派閥の食料ステータスが増加します。任務を任された仲間が配給食料を消費します。\n"
"\n"
"満喫-6以上の食料が必要です\n"
"生鮮食料は、改良の進行と腐敗までの期間によってカロリー減少のペナルティが課されます:\n"
"> 腐敗: カロリーの0%%\n"
"> 2日以内に腐敗: カロリーの60%%\n"
"> 5日以内に腐敗: カロリーの80%%\n"
"\n"
"現在の備蓄量: %dkcal:\n"
"%d/%d/%d日分\n"
"(運動レベル最高/低/なしの場合の日数)"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Expansions open up new opportunities but can be expensive and time-consuming.  Pick "
"them carefully, at most 8 can be built at each camp.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: N/A\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Choose any one of the available expansions.  Starting with a farm is always a solid "
"choice since food is used to support companion missions and minimal investment is "
"needed to get it going.  A forge is also a great idea, allowing you to refine "
"resources for subsequent expansions, craft better gear and make charcoal.\n"
"\n"
"NOTE: Actions available through expansions are located in separate tabs of the Camp "
"Manager window.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Intensity: Moderate\n"
"Time: 3 Hours\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"拡張すれば新たな行動がとれるようになりますが、資材が大量に必要で、時間もかかります。慎"
"重に選択しましょう。拠点は周囲8方向に拡張できます。\n"
"使用スキル: なし\n"
"効果:\n"
"> 拡張地点に建設する施設を選びましょう。食料が仲間の任務に不可欠であること、建設に必要"
"な資材が少なくて済むことを考えると、農場を選ぶのが賢明です。鍛冶場も、その後の拡張に必"
"要な資材の準備や木炭生産に便利です。\n"
"\n"
"メモ: 拡張した施設での行動や任務は、拠点管理ウィンドウの各タブから選択できます。\n"
"\n"
"危険: なし\n"
"運動: 低\n"
"時間: 3時間 \n"
"人員: %d/1\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Harvest any plants that are ripe and bring the produce back.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"実った植物を収穫して集めます。\n"
" \n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Nearby terrain can be turned into fields if it is completely cleared of terrain that "
"isn't grass or dirt.  Doing so makes that terrain eligible for usage for standard base "
"camp expansion.  Note that log cutting does this conversion automatically when the "
"trees are depleted, but not all terrain can be logged.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: N/A\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> If the expansion direction selected is eligible for conversion into a field this "
"mission will perform that conversion.  If it is not eligible you are told as much, and "
"would have to make it suitable for conversion by removing everything that isn't grass "
"or soil.  Mining zones are useful to remove pavement, for instance.  Note that removal "
"of buildings is dangerous, laborious, and may still fail to get rid of everything if "
"e.g. a basement or an opening to underground areas (such as a manhole) remains.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Intensity: Moderate\n"
"Time: 0 Hours\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"草地や地面以外の地形を取り除くことで、近隣の地形を平野に変えます。平野化した地形は通常"
"の拠点拡張に利用できるようになります。伐採の任務を実行した地形も自動的に平野化されます"
"が、伐採が実行できない地形がある点には注意が必要です。\n"
"\n"
"適用スキル: なし \n"
"効果:\n"
"> 選択した方向が平野化可能な場合、任務を実行するとその地形を平野に変換します。平野化で"
"きない場合はその旨が表示されるので、草地や地面以外の地形を全て除去し、平野化に適した状"
"態にしましょう。例えば、舗装道路を除去したい場合は掘削の区域設定が有用です。建物の撤去"
"は手間がかかり、危険も伴います。地下室やマンホールなどの下層へ通じる地形がある場合、全"
"てを除去できない可能性があります。\n"
"\n"
"危険: なし\n"
"運動: 低\n"
"時間: 0 時間\n"
"人員: %d/1\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Plant designated seeds in the spaces that have already been tilled.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"既に耕されている場所に指定された種を植えます。\n"
" \n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Plow any spaces that have reverted to dirt or grass.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"荒廃してしまった草地や地面を全て耕します。\n"
" \n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Push gear out to a hide site or bring gear back from one.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: survival\n"
"Difficulty: 1\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Good for returning equipment you left in the hide site shelter.\n"
"> Gear is left unattended and could be stolen.\n"
"> Time dependent on weight of equipment being sent forward or back.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: Medium\n"
"Intensity: Light\n"
"Time: 1 Hour Base + Travel\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"簡易シェルター内の物資を他のシェルターに移すか、拠点に持ち帰ります。\n"
" \n"
"適用スキル: サバイバル\n"
"難易度: 1\n"
"効果:\n"
"> 簡易シェルターに残した物資を回収するのに便利です。\n"
"> シェルターは無人のため、置いた荷物が盗まれる可能性があります。\n"
"> 物資の重量によって作業時間が変動します。\n"
" \n"
"危険: 中\n"
"運動: 軽微\n"
"時間: 1時間 + 移動時間\n"
"人員: %d/1\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Recruiting additional followers is very dangerous and expensive.  The outcome is "
"heavily dependent on the skill of the companion you send and the appeal of your base.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: social\n"
"Difficulty: 2\n"
"Base Score:                   +%3d%%\n"
"> Expansion Bonus:            +%3d%%\n"
"> Faction Bonus:              +%3d%%\n"
"> Special Bonus:              +%3d%%\n"
"\n"
"Total: Skill                  +%3d%%\n"
"\n"
"Risk: High\n"
"Time: 4 Days\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"新たな仲間を集めるのは非常に危険な仕事で、物資も大量に必要です。成功するかどうかは、派"
"遣する仲間のスキルと拠点の魅力の高さにかかっています。\n"
" \n"
"適用スキル: 社交\n"
"難易度: 2 \n"
"基礎点:                   +%3d%%\n"
"> 拡張ボーナス:            +%3d%%\n"
"> 派閥ボーナス:              +%3d%%\n"
"> 特殊ボーナス:              +%3d%%\n"
" \n"
"合計: スキル                  +%3d%%\n"
" \n"
"危険: 高\n"
"時間: 4日\n"
"人員: %d/1\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion out into the great unknown.  High survival skills are needed to avoid "
"combat but you should expect an encounter or two.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: survival\n"
"Difficulty: 3\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Select checkpoints to customize path.\n"
"> Reveals terrain around the path.\n"
"> Can bounce off hide sites to extend range.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: High\n"
"Intensity: Brisk\n"
"Time: Travel\n"
"Positions: %d/3\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"大いなる未知の世界に仲間を派遣します。戦闘を避けるには高い生存スキルが必要ですが、ある"
"程度の戦闘発生はやむを得ないと考えておきましょう。\n"
" \n"
"適用スキル: サバイバル\n"
"難易度: 3\n"
"効果:\n"
"> 指定した地点までの経路を偵察します。\n"
"> 経路周辺の地形が全体マップに表示されます。\n"
"> 簡易シェルターを設置することで探索範囲を拡大できます。\n"
" \n"
"危険: 高\n"
"運動: 中\n"
"時間: 移動時間\n"
"人員: %d/3\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to a nearby forest to cut logs.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: fabrication\n"
"Difficulty: 2\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> 50%% of trees/trunks at the forest position will be cut down.\n"
"> 100%% of total material will be brought back.\n"
"> Repeatable with diminishing returns.\n"
"> Will eventually turn forests into fields.\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Intensity: Active\n"
"Time: 6 Hour Base + Travel Time + Cutting Time\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"近隣の森に仲間を派遣し、丸太を切ってきてもらいます。\n"
" \n"
"適用スキル: 製作\n"
"難易度: 2 \n"
"効果:\n"
"> 森林に生えている樹木/木の幹の50%%を伐採します。\n"
"> 伐採で得た素材の100%% を入手します。\n"
"> 連続で作業できますが、入手量は減少します。\n"
" \n"
"危険: なし\n"
"運動: 高\n"
"時間: 6時間 + 移動時間 + 作業時間\n"
"人員: %d/1\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to build an improvised shelter and stock it with equipment at a "
"distant map location.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: survival\n"
"Difficulty: 3\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Good for setting up resupply or contingency points.\n"
"> Gear is left unattended and could be stolen.\n"
"> Time dependent on weight of equipment being sent forward.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: Medium\n"
"Intensity: Light\n"
"Time: 6 Hour Construction + Travel\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"離れた場所に仲間を派遣し、即席シェルターの建設と、シェルターへの物資の運搬を頼みま"
"す。\n"
" \n"
"適用スキル: サバイバル\n"
"難易度: 3\n"
"効果:\n"
"> シェルターは移動中や緊急時の物資補給地点に適しています。\n"
"> シェルターは無人のため、置いた物資が盗まれる可能性があります。\n"
"> 物資の重量によって作業時間が変動します。\n"
" \n"
"危険: 中\n"
"運動: 軽微\n"
"時間: 6時間(建設作業) + 移動時間\n"
"人員: %d/1\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to clear a nearby forest.\n"
"Note that it's likely both forest and field roads look exactly the same after having "
"been cleared.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: fabrication\n"
"Difficulty: 1\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> 95%% of trees/trunks at the forest position will be cut down.\n"
"> 0%% of total material will be brought back.\n"
"> Forest should become a field tile.\n"
"> Useful for clearing land for another faction camp.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Intensity: Active\n"
"Time: 6 Hour Base + Travel Time + Cutting Time\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"近隣の森に仲間を派遣し、木を切ってもらいます。\n"
" \n"
"適用スキル: 製作\n"
"難易度: 1 \n"
"効果:\n"
"> 森林に生えている樹木/木の幹の95%%を伐採します。\n"
"> 伐採で得た素材の0%% を入手します。\n"
"> 森林の地形は平野に変化します。\n"
"> 新たな拠点の設置場所を確保するのに便利です。\n"
" \n"
"危険: なし\n"
"運動: 高\n"
"時間: 6時間 + 移動時間 + 作業時間\n"
"人員: %d/1\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to do low level chores and sort supplies.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: fabrication\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Material left in the unsorted loot zone will be sorted into a defined loot zone.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: None\n"
"Time: 3 Hours\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"仲間に拠点内の消耗品類を整頓する簡単な雑用を頼みます。\n"
" \n"
"適用スキル: 製作\n"
"難易度: なし \n"
"効果:\n"
"> 「分類: 分類対象」区域に置かれたアイテムは、設定済みの分類区域に移動されます。\n"
"\n"
"危険: なし\n"
"時間: 3時間\n"
"人員: %d/1\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to forage for edible plants.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: survival\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Foraging Possibilities:\n"
"> wild vegetables\n"
"> fruits and nuts depending on season\n"
"May produce less food than consumed!\n"
"Risk: Very Low\n"
"Intensity: Light\n"
"Time: 4 Hours, Repeated\n"
"Positions: %d/3\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"仲間を派遣して、食べられる植物を集めてきてもらいます。\n"
" \n"
"適用スキル: サバイバル\n"
"難易度: なし \n"
"入手予定:\n"
"> 山菜\n"
"> 季節の果物と木の実\n"
"入手できる食料が消費した食料を下回る場合もあります！\n"
"危険: 軽微\n"
"運動: 軽微\n"
"時間: 4時間、連続作業可能\n"
"人員: %d/3\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to gather light brush and stout branches.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: survival\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Gathering Possibilities:\n"
"> stout branches\n"
"> withered plants\n"
"> splintered wood\n"
"\n"
"Risk: Very Low\n"
"Intensity: Light\n"
"Time: 3 Hours, Repeated\n"
"Positions: %d/3\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"仲間を派遣して、枯れ草や頑丈な短枝などを集めてきてもらいます。\n"
" \n"
"適用スキル: サバイバル\n"
"難易度: なし \n"
"拾得予定:\n"
"> 頑丈な短枝\n"
"> 枯れ草\n"
"> 裂けた木材\n"
" \n"
"危険: 軽微\n"
"運動: 軽微\n"
"時間: 3時間、連続作業可能\n"
"人員: %d/3\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to gather materials for the next camp upgrade.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: survival\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Gathering Possibilities:\n"
"%s\n"
"Risk: Very Low\n"
"Intensity: Light\n"
"Time: 3 Hours, Repeated\n"
"Positions: %d/3\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ: \n"
"キャンプ地の改良に使う資材を集めてきてもらいます。\n"
" \n"
"使用スキル: サバイバル\n"
"難易度: なし\n"
"収集予定:\n"
"%s\n"
"危険度: 軽微\n"
"運動: 軽微\n"
"時間: 3時間、連続作業可能\n"
"人員: %d/3\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to hunt large animals.\n"
"\n"
"Skills used: Marksmanship, Survival\n"
"Stats used: Perception\n"
"Difficulty: Medium\n"
"Hunting Possibilities:\n"
"> small, medium, or large animal corpses\n"
"May produce less food than consumed!\n"
"Risk: Medium\n"
"Intensity: Moderate\n"
"Time: 18 Hours\n"
"Positions: %d/1\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"仲間を派遣して、大型動物を猟で仕留めてもらいます。\n"
" \n"
"適用スキル: 射撃\n"
"難易度: なし \n"
"入手予定:\n"
"> 小型/中型/大型動物の死体\n"
"入手できる食料が消費した食料を下回る場合もあります！\n"
"危険: 中\n"
"運動: 低\n"
"時間: 6時間、連続作業可能\n"
"人員: %d/1\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to purge the wasteland.  Their goal is to kill anything hostile they "
"encounter and return when their wounds are too great or the odds are stacked against "
"them.\n"
"\n"
"Skill used: survival\n"
"Difficulty: 4\n"
"Effects:\n"
"> Pulls creatures encountered into combat instead of fleeing.\n"
"> Select checkpoints to customize path.\n"
"> Can bounce off hide sites to extend range.\n"
"\n"
"Risk: Very High\n"
"Intensity: Brisk\n"
"Time: Travel\n"
"Positions: %d/3\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"仲間を派遣して荒野の大掃除をしてもらいます。派遣した仲間は敵対的なモンスターを殺し、受"
"けた傷が大きすぎるか戦力差が開きすぎたときに帰還します。\n"
" \n"
"適用スキル: サバイバル\n"
"難易度: 4\n"
"効果:\n"
"> モンスターと遭遇した場合、逃げずに戦闘します。\n"
"> 指定した地点までの経路を偵察します。\n"
"> 簡易シェルターを設置することで探索範囲を拡大できます。\n"
" \n"
"危険: 最高\n"
"運動: 中\n"
"時間: 移動時間\n"
"人員: %d/3\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Send a companion to set traps for small game.\n"
"\n"
"Skills used: Devices, Survival\n"
"Stats used: Perception\n"
"Difficulty: Low\n"
"Trapping Possibilities:\n"
"> small and tiny animal corpses\n"
"May produce less food than consumed!\n"
"Risk: Low\n"
"Intensity: Light\n"
"Time: 14 Hours\n"
"Positions: %d/2\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"仲間を派遣して、小動物を罠猟で仕留めてもらいます。\n"
" \n"
"適用スキル: 精密作業\n"
"難易度: なし \n"
"入手予定:\n"
"> 超小型/小型動物の死体\n"
"入手できる食料が消費した食料を下回る場合もあります！\n"
"危険: 低\n"
"運動: 軽微\n"
"時間: 6時間、連続作業可能\n"
"人員: %d/2\n"

msgid ""
"Notes:\n"
"Switch to follower.\n"
"<color_yellow>You will switch to playing as one of your faction members.</color>\n"
"Difficulty: N/A\n"
"Risk: None\n"
msgstr ""
"メモ:\n"
"拠点の新たなリーダーを選びましょう。\n"
"<color_yellow>新リーダーをプレイヤーキャラクターとして操作します。</color>\n"
"難易度: なし\n"
"危険度: なし\n"

msgid ""
"Nothin' much, just sitting around and biding my time, getting any work I can.  I might "
"play something to cheer everyone up, if my guitar wasn't busted."
msgstr ""
"ぼちぼちだね。ただ座って時間を潰すか、できる限りの仕事をするだけ。ギターが壊れていな"
"かったら、何か音楽でも奏でて、皆を元気づけられるんだけどな。"

msgid "Nothing"
msgstr "無効"

msgid "Nothing Burned"
msgid_plural "copies of Nothing Burned"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/もう炎上なんてしない)"

msgid "Nothing affects your morale"
msgstr "意欲への影響なし"

msgid "Nothing at (%d,%d,%d) to knockback!"
msgstr "そこ(%d,%d,%d)にはノックバックするものがありません！"

msgid "Nothing at grabbed point %d,%d,%d or bad grabbed object type."
msgstr "座標%d,%d,%dには掴める物が無いか、掴むのに適さない地形です。"

msgid "Nothing can be harvested from this plant in current season"
msgstr "今の季節中はこの植物から何も収穫できません。"

msgid "Nothing can be harvested from this plant in the current season."
msgstr "現在の季節はこの植物から何も収穫できません。"

msgid ""
"Nothing can kill you if everything is already dead.  Well, except cold, hunger, and… "
"never mind."
msgstr ""
"あらゆるものが既に死んでるなら、誰にも殺されずに済むんじゃないかな。まぁ、寒さや飢え、"
"他にも...この話は止めようか。"

msgid "Nothing found."
msgstr "何も見つかりませんでした。"

msgid ""
"Nothing gets you down!  You savor the joys of life, ignore its hardships, and are "
"generally happier than most people."
msgstr ""
"悩みが無いのが取り柄です！人生に喜びを感じており、困難をものともしません。普通の人より"
"も幸せを強く感じています。"

msgid "Nothing happens."
msgstr "何も起きませんでした。"

msgid ""
"Nothing hurts anymore.  Those bites tickle and the wounds itch a bit, but that's it."
msgstr ""
"もう痛みを感じません。咬傷はくすぐったく、少し疼きますが...大した事はありません。"

msgid ""
"Nothing is scarier than an angry scorpion.  Your attacks can keep others at bay.\n"
"\n"
"+1 dodge attempt.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"怒ったサソリほど恐ろしいものはありません。攻撃中は誰も近寄れません。\n"
"\n"
"回避発動+1\n"
"1ターン継続"

msgid "Nothing legible on the sign."
msgstr "看板の文字が判別できません。"

msgid "Nothing much.  Just passing through."
msgstr "いいや。通りがかっただけだ。"

msgid "Nothing of interest is here."
msgstr "興味深いものは特にありません。"

msgid ""
"Nothing optimistic, at least.  Had a pal on the road with a ham radio, but she's gone "
"and so is that thing.  Kaput."
msgstr ""
"少なくとも楽観的ではない。よくアマチュア無線をやってた仲間がいたんだが、彼女はもう死ん"
"じまった。ぶち壊しだ。"

msgid "Nothing optimistic?"
msgstr "楽観的でない？"

msgid "Nothing quite like clean water."
msgstr "飲料水に勝るものは無いね。"

msgid "Nothing relevant here."
msgstr "適切なものがありません。"

msgid "Nothing selected!"
msgstr "何も選択していません！"

msgid ""
"Nothing to it.  Before <the_cataclysm>, it didn't take much to find yourself here.  "
"And I guess it just made sense to stay.  We seem to be doing better than most, anyway."
msgstr ""
"何もないさ。<the_cataclysm>以前も、ここからほど近い場所で暮らしてたんだ。シェルターに来"
"られたんだから、結果オーライだね。上手く生き延びられてる方だと思うよ。"

msgid "Nothing to see here!"
msgstr "そこには何もありません！"

msgid "Nothing to see here."
msgstr "この呪文は表示されません。"

msgid "Nothing to take off or put on the rack is nearby."
msgstr "ラックに着脱できるものが付近にありません。"

msgid "Nothing to trade, sorry <name_g>."
msgstr "取り引きできるものはないな。<name_g>、申し訳ない。"

msgid "Nothing to unload."
msgstr "何も見つかりませんでした。"

msgid ""
"Nothing too exciting.  I was in trade college, learning to be a computer technician.  "
"Those skills aren't too helpful, but when I was a kid I was an Eagle scout.  I learned "
"all kinds of useful stuff about plants and foraging, and that's come in pretty handy."
msgstr ""
"面白い話はないよ。商業学校でコンピューター技師の勉強をしていたんだ。これはあまり便利な"
"技能じゃないが、子供の頃はボーイスカウトの模範生だった。色々な植物や探索活動を学んだこ"
"とは、かなり役に立ってるよ。"

msgid ""
"Nothing too fancy.  We have a rota of anyone able bodied that can handle themselves."
msgstr "簡単な話さ。自分の世話を自分で焼ける屈強な奴は皆当番表に組み込まれるんだ。"

msgid "Nothing, just saying hi."
msgstr "いいや、ちょっと挨拶をしに来た。"

msgid "Nothing, nothing.  Can we talk about something else?"
msgstr "ああいや、何も問題ない。何か他の話をしようか？"

msgid "Nothing, really."
msgstr "いや、まだだ。"

msgid "Nothing.  Let's get back to work."
msgstr "何でもない。さあ行こうか。"

msgid "Nothing.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "何でもない。他の話をしよう。"

msgid "Nova"
msgstr "ﾉｳﾞｧ"

msgid ""
"Now I don't mean to upset you but I'm not sure what I can do with the accounting "
"ledger at the moment.  We do have a new lead though, the ledger has a safe deposit box "
"under the regional manager's name.  Guess what, dumb sucker wrote down his "
"combination.  Come with me to retrieve the box and you can keep any of the goodies in "
"it that I can't use to press charges against these bastards."
msgstr ""
"君がしてくれたことを否定するわけではないが、今すぐにこの帳簿で何かできるというわけでは"
"ないんだ。だが帳簿から新たな手がかりは得られた。地域担当マネージャーの貸し金庫だ。なん"
"と、馬鹿が一行めに暗証番号を書いてくれていた。一緒に行って開けよう。何が出て来ても、ク"
"ソッタレどもを告発するのに必要なもの以外は全部君にやるよ。"

msgid "Now beat it, you <name_b>."
msgstr "ほら行けよ、<name_b>。"

msgid "Now get out of here"
msgstr "ここから立ち去れ。"

msgid "Now my nightmares are let loose upon the shivering land."
msgstr "もうダメだ。私の悪夢が震える大地に解き放たれてしまった。"

msgid "Now reading %s, %s to stop early."
msgstr "%sを読んでいます。中断するには%sを押して下さい。"

msgid ""
"Now repeat after me… I do solemnly swear that I will support and defend the "
"Constitution of the United States against all enemies, foreign and domestic… that I "
"will bear true faith and allegiance to the same… that I take this obligation freely, "
"without any mental reservation or purpose of evasion… and that I will well and "
"faithfully discharge the duties of the office on which I am about to enter.  To "
"establish justice, insure domestic tranquility, provide for the common defense, "
"promote the general welfare and secure the blessings of liberty.  So help me God.  "
"Congratulations Marshal, don't forget your badge and gun.  As a marshal all men or "
"women assisting you are considered deputy marshals so keep them in line."
msgstr ""
"では復唱しなさい...私は厳粛に、合衆国憲法を支持し国内外すべての敵から守ることを誓う..."
"同様に、真実の信頼と忠誠を誓う...これらの義務を精神的な抑制や条件を伴わず自由意思で果た"
"すこと、そしてこれから就く職務での役割を良好かつ忠実に果たすことを誓う。正義を確立する"
"ために、国内の平穏を保証し、共同防衛に備え、福祉全般を促進し、自由の恵みを確保する。神"
"も照覧あれ。おめでとう執行官、バッジと銃を忘れずに持っていけ。執行官に付き従うすべての"
"者は執行官代理人とみなされる。しっかりと指揮を取ることだ。"

msgid "Now some protocol tests for brain damage.  Please stare at the light over there…"
msgstr "さて、脳の損傷がないか検査をしないと。ここの光ってるところを見つめて..."

msgid "Now teleporting back home.  Please wait…"
msgstr "転移中です。しばらくお待ちください..."

msgid ""
"Now that I've got that motor, I can get my compressor mostly built.  I will need a "
"tank though."
msgstr "モーターが手に入ったら圧縮機は完成したも同然。次に必要なのはタンクだね。"

msgid "Now that it's been fried, this SPAM is actually pretty tasty."
msgstr "スパムは揚げて食べると、結構美味しいんですよ。"

msgid ""
"Now that it's been properly cooked, this salsify tastes vaguely like oysters.  Makes a "
"great side dish."
msgstr ""
"しっかり火を通したサルシファイはどことなくオイスターのような味わいがして、副菜にも最適"
"です。"

msgid ""
"Now that the clay kiln is set up, we could use 100 units of clay to get production "
"going."
msgstr "完成した陶芸窯で製作を始めるために、材料となる粘土が100単位必要なんだ。"

msgid ""
"Now that the forge is set up, we could use 2000 units of sand to get production going."
msgstr "完成した窯で製作を始めるために、材料となる2000単位の砂が必要なんだ。"

msgid ""
"Now that things are cleaned up in the back, is there anything holding you back from "
"working?"
msgstr "建物の裏手は片付いた。他に何か仕事の妨げになっていることはあるか？"

msgid ""
"Now that we have some canning pots from Helena, we can start storing foodstuffs more "
"easily around here.  Recycling our old tin cans is great and all, but if we get a big "
"influx of new foods, then we can't properly store it all.  As such, if you could find "
"about 100 more empty tin cans for me, I'd really appreciate it."
msgstr ""
"ヘレナから寸胴鍋が支給されたから、ここの食料をもっと楽に保存できるな。使い終えたブリキ"
"缶をリサイクルするのも結構だが、食料が更にたくさん入ってきたら、全部をちゃんと保存でき"
"そうになり。ブリキ缶Mを100個ほど探してきてもらえると、とても助かるんだ。"

msgid ""
"Now that we have some cover, let's build some counters and racks for tools and parts, "
"allowing us to use the Chop Shop."
msgstr ""
"屋根ができたので、次はカウンターや棚を作って工具や部品を置き、解体場としての実用性を高"
"めましょう。"

msgid ""
"Now that we have some cover, we should add some storage and a root cellar in our "
"kitchen area."
msgstr "屋根ができたので、調理場に保管場所と貯蔵穴を追加しましょう。"

msgid ""
"Now that we have some cover, we should build 2 fireplaces for cooking and grab a pot."
msgstr "屋根ができたので、調理場と食堂に鍋を置ける暖炉を作りましょう。"

msgid "Now that we have some cover, we should build 2 stoves for cooking and grab a pot."
msgstr "屋根ができたので、鍋を置ける調理用の薪ストーブを2つ作りましょう。"

msgid ""
"Now that we have some cover, we should build a fireplace and throw a pot over it to "
"cook with.  Let's put it in that dining area."
msgstr "屋根ができたので、鍋を置ける調理用の暖炉を作り、調理場を広げましょう。"

msgid ""
"Now that we have some cover, we should build a fireplace for cooking and grab a pot."
msgstr "屋根ができたので、鍋を置ける調理用の暖炉を作りましょう。"

msgid ""
"Now that we have some cover, we should build a stove and throw a pot over it to cook "
"with.  Let's put it in that dining area."
msgstr "屋根ができたので、鍋を置ける調理用の薪ストーブを作り、調理場を広げましょう。"

msgid "Now that we have some cover, we should build a stove for cooking and grab a pot."
msgstr "屋根ができたので、鍋を置ける調理用の薪ストーブを作りましょう。"

msgid ""
"Now that we have some cover, we should build basic cooking facilities in the northeast "
"shack."
msgstr "屋根ができたので、北東の小屋に基本的な調理設備を作りましょう。"

msgid ""
"Now that we have some cover, we should build basic cooking facilities in the northeast "
"tent."
msgstr "屋根ができたので、北東の小屋に基本的な調理設備を作りましょう。"

msgid ""
"Now that we have some cover, we should reorganize that dining area into our kitchen."
msgstr "屋根ができたので、食事スペースを調理場に作り替えましょう。"

msgid ""
"Now that we have some cover, we should set up a brazier and throw a pot over it to "
"cook with.  Let's put it in that dining area."
msgstr "屋根ができたので、鍋を置ける調理用の火鉢を置き、調理場を広げましょう。"

msgid ""
"Now that we're able to work on long vehicles, let's extend the garage to allow for "
"really long ones, or multiple vehicles."
msgstr ""
"長い車両も停められるようになりました。もっと長い車両や複数車両にも対応できるように、解"
"体場のサイズを更に広げましょう。"

msgid ""
"Now that we're able to work on short vehicles, let's extend the garage to allow for "
"long ones."
msgstr ""
"短い車両は停められるようになりました。長い車両にも対応できるように、解体場のサイズを広"
"げましょう。"

msgid ""
"Now that we've got a steady supply of water, I've been thinking about raising some "
"livestock.  I'm starting with some chickens I found on a farm the other day, but I "
"don't have a coop for them.  If you can get me 150 nails, I can start building one."
msgstr ""
"水も安定供給できるようになったし、家畜を飼おうかと考えてるんだ。この間農場で見つけたニ"
"ワトリを飼いたいが、まだ鶏小屋がない。釘が150本あれば、すぐにでも作れるんだがな。"

msgid ""
"Now that we've got the wall done, we decided to move out of these old tents.  We still "
"have some leftover nails but we need more wood.  So, if you could get us 150 planks, "
"we'd be grateful."
msgstr ""
"壁が完成したから、この古いテントから引っ越すことにしたんだ。まだ釘は残ってるけど、木材"
"はもっと必要だった。150枚用意してもらえると助かるよ。"

msgid ""
"Now that work on the island bunker has begun, a large central room would be ideal.  "
"With all the loot you'll be scavenging on expeditions, it could make a useful "
"storeroom and crafting center.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Main Room 1.  A hollow chamber beneath the island's center to serve as "
"a multipurpose space, with tons of room to expand."
msgstr ""
"島の下層の開発が始まりましたが、中央に大きな部屋があれば役立ちそうです。遠征で集めた"
"様々なアイテムを集めて、便利な倉庫や作業場として使えるかもしれません。\n"
" 新たなレシピを習得しました。このアーティファクトを製作し、島を永続的にアップグレードし"
"ましょう。\n"
"\n"
"効果: メインルーム1が建設されます。島の下層にある何もない部屋です。多目的スペースとして"
"機能し、拡張できる余地は豊富にあります。"

msgid "Now that you are here, everything.  Is there anything Alonso can… *do for you*?"
msgstr ""
"今、君がここにいる、それが全てだ。*君のためになること*...それ以外アロンソにできることは"
"ないよ？"

msgid ""
"Now that you have a bunker under the island, you have a place to live.  But the small "
"glass roof doesn't let in a lot of light; a larger skylight would be ideal.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: Central Skylight 2.  A larger skylight over the main room."
msgstr ""
"島の下層の開発が始まりましたが、中央に大きな部屋があれば役立ちそうです。遠征で集めた"
"様々なアイテムを集めて、便利な倉庫や作業場として使えるかもしれません。\n"
" 新たなレシピを習得しました。このアーティファクトを製作し、島を永続的にアップグレードし"
"ましょう。\n"
"\n"
"効果: メインルーム1が建設されます。島の下層にある何もない部屋です。多目的スペースとして"
"機能し、拡張できる余地は豊富にあります。"

msgid ""
"Now that you have corridors snaking beneath your island, you could build rooms in "
"various areas.  The eastern quadrant might be a good place for another room.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: East Room 1.  A hollow chamber to the east of the island's center to "
"serve as a multipurpose space, with tons of room to expand."
msgstr ""
"島の下層の開発が始まりましたが、中央に大きな部屋があれば役立ちそうです。遠征で集めた"
"様々なアイテムを集めて、便利な倉庫や作業場として使えるかもしれません。\n"
" 新たなレシピを習得しました。このアーティファクトを製作し、島を永続的にアップグレードし"
"ましょう。\n"
"\n"
"効果: メインルーム1が建設されます。島の下層にある何もない部屋です。多目的スペースとして"
"機能し、拡張できる余地は豊富にあります。"

msgid ""
"Now that you have corridors snaking beneath your island, you could build rooms in "
"various areas.  The northern quadrant might be a good place for another room.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: North Room 1.  A hollow chamber to the north of the island's center "
"with one wall a long window to look down on the world, with tons of room to expand."
msgstr ""
"島の下層の開発が始まりましたが、中央に大きな部屋があれば役立ちそうです。遠征で集めた"
"様々なアイテムを集めて、便利な倉庫や作業場として使えるかもしれません。\n"
" 新たなレシピを習得しました。このアーティファクトを製作し、島を永続的にアップグレードし"
"ましょう。\n"
"\n"
"効果: メインルーム1が建設されます。島の下層にある何もない部屋です。多目的スペースとして"
"機能し、拡張できる余地は豊富にあります。"

msgid ""
"Now that you have corridors snaking beneath your island, you could build rooms in "
"various areas.  The western quadrant might be a good place for another room.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"New Structure: West Room 1.  A hollow chamber to the west of the island's center to "
"serve as a multipurpose space, with tons of room to expand."
msgstr ""
"島の下層の開発が始まりましたが、中央に大きな部屋があれば役立ちそうです。遠征で集めた"
"様々なアイテムを集めて、便利な倉庫や作業場として使えるかもしれません。\n"
" 新たなレシピを習得しました。このアーティファクトを製作し、島を永続的にアップグレードし"
"ましょう。\n"
"\n"
"効果: メインルーム1が建設されます。島の下層にある何もない部屋です。多目的スペースとして"
"機能し、拡張できる余地は豊富にあります。"

msgid "Now that you mention it, it does seem rather strange."
msgstr "そう言われると、何だかおかしく思えてきた。"

msgid ""
"Now that you've got your tools and shop set up, do you think you could teach me a "
"thing or two about construction?"
msgstr "道具と仕事場の準備も終わったし、建設について何か教えてもらえないか？"

msgid "Now that your guitar is fixed, could you play something for me?"
msgstr "ギターは直ったし、何か一曲披露してもらえないか？"

msgid ""
"Now that's a wild story.  I owe my life to this kid Chloe, really.  I'll let her tell "
"the tale."
msgstr ""
"振り返ってみるとあれは滅茶苦茶だったね。私はこの子、クロエに命を救われたんだ。話を聞い"
"てみるといいよ。"

msgid "Now that's an archaic belief.  I'll see you around."
msgstr "古臭いルールだな。それじゃあ、また。"

msgid ""
"Now that's some enthusiasm, pal.  Ever since our water supply shut off, we've been "
"using the nearby river for most of our water needs.  Who knows how many bloated "
"corpses have decayed in that.  I want to construct a well, but I'm missing some "
"building materials - eight pipes to be exact."
msgstr ""
"さて、やりがいのある仕事だぞ。水道が止まっちまって以来、ここでは近くの川の水を使って"
"る。あんな川、上流にどれだけ腐った死体が溜まってるか分かったもんじゃない。そこで、井戸"
"を作ろうと思い立ったんだが、材料が足りない。具体的には、パイプが8本足りないんだ。"

msgid ""
"Now up the top o' Mount Greenwood there used to be a nice campin' place, that woulda "
"been before you were born.  Whole area burnt up that one year, they said it were "
"lightnin' but you an' I both know it were just kids partyin'.  Rusty G an' I left ol' "
"yeller behind and wen' in to check it out.  Burnt out woods looked haunted, we "
"figgered there were some o' them damn kids rummagin' around in there, neckin' or "
"whatnot.  Rusty G brought his boom stick, and lucky thing cuz o' what we saw."
msgstr ""
"さて、グリーンウッド山の頂上には、あんたが生まれる前は素晴らしいキャンプ場があったが、"
"ある年に焼け落ちてしまった。落雷のせいだと言う者もおるが、ガキどものパーティーが原因だ"
"ということはご存知の通りだ。ラスティGと私は黄色い老犬を置いて、その焼け跡を見に行った。"
"焼け残った残骸は気味が悪く、中はガキどもに散々荒らされたようだった。ラスティGがブームス"
"ティックを連れてきていたのは幸運だったね。"

msgid ""
"Now up the top o' Mount Greenwood there used to be a ranger station, that woulda been "
"before you were born.  It got burnt down that one year, they said it were lightnin' "
"but you an' I both know it were college kids partyin'.  Rusty G an' I left ol' yeller "
"behind and wen' in to check it out.  Burnt out ol' husk looked haunted, we figgered "
"there were some o' them damn kids rummagin' around in it.  Rusty G brought his 18 "
"gauge, and lucky thing cuz o' what we saw."
msgstr ""
"さて、グリーンウッド山の頂上には、あんたが生まれる前は森林警備隊の詰め所が立っておった"
"が、ある年に焼け落ちてしまった。落雷のせいだと言う者もおるが、大学生のガキどもの乱痴気"
"騒ぎが原因だということはご存知の通りだ。ラスティGと私は老いぼれ犬を停めて、その焼け跡を"
"見に行った。焼け残った残骸は気味が悪く、中はガキどもに散々荒らされたようだった。ラス"
"ティGが18ゲージを連れてきていたのは幸運だったね。"

msgid ""
"Now we can get in touch with a lot more people, see what's out there.  Thank you, "
"<name_g>."
msgstr ""
"これでたくさんの人と連絡を取って、外の様子をもっと知れるようになる。ありがとう、"
"<name_g>。"

msgid "Now we learned that death is a gift"
msgstr "死は贈り物だということを学んだ"

msgid "Now with 95 percent fewer dolphins!"
msgstr "内容物の95%はマグロですが、わずかにイルカ肉が含まれています！"

msgid ""
"Now with ONE POUND of meat and ONE POUND of carbs!  Not as appetizing as it would be "
"if heated up."
msgstr ""
"1ポンドの肉と1ポンドの炭水化物を、さあ召し上がれ！温めずにそのまま食べるものではありま"
"せん。"

msgid ""
"Now with ONE POUND of meat and ONE POUND of carbs!  Now that it's been heated up, it's "
"much tastier but will also spoil more quickly."
msgstr ""
"1ポンドの肉と1ポンドの炭水化物を、さあ召し上がれ！加熱調理して美味しく食べられる状態に"
"なりましたが、腐敗も早まります。"

msgid ""
"Now you can emulate those zombies you love so much!  Preparing brain for eating is "
"challenging, and this doesn't seem to be the best way to do it."
msgstr ""
"これで大好きなゾンビを真似ることができますね！脳を食べるというのは非常に挑戦的な行為で"
"すが、この調理法が最良とは言えません。"

msgid "Now, now!  Let the games begin!  <spirals>"
msgstr "さあ、さあ！ゲームの始まりだ！<spirals>"

msgid "Now, to find a quiet pond and settle for the wait…"
msgstr "さて、静かな池でも探して、身を落ち着けることにしましょうか..."

msgid "Nuclear Power Plant"
msgstr "原子力発電所"

msgid "Nuclear missile disarmed!"
msgstr "核ミサイルを無効化しました！"

msgid "Nuclear missile launch aborted."
msgstr "核ミサイルの発射を中止しました。"

msgid "Nuclear missile launched!"
msgstr "核ミサイルを発射しました！"

msgid "Nuclear missile remains active."
msgstr "核ミサイルは点火状態のままです。"

msgid "Nudist"
msgstr "ヌーディスト"

msgid "Null"
msgstr "無効化"

msgid "Null mission"
msgstr "無効なミッション"

msgid "Null string ID.  If you see this and you're not using debug, it's a bug."
msgstr ""
"NPCは目的地に到達するために地形を破壊しません。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが"
"発生しています。"

msgid "Numb"
msgstr "無感情"

msgid "Number of additional sessions required: %i"
msgstr "追加作業の必要数: %i"

msgid "Number of bombs:"
msgstr "爆弾の数: "

msgid "Number of game turns between autosaves."
msgstr "設定したターンが経過する度に自動保存します。"

msgid "Number of messages to preserve in the history, and when saving."
msgstr "履歴やセーブデータに保存するメッセージ数を設定します。"

msgid "Number of realtime minutes between autosaves."
msgstr "現実での一定分数が経過する度に自動保存します。"

msgid ""
"Number of turns after which a message will be removed from the sidebar log.  0 = "
"disabled."
msgstr ""
"サイドバーにログが表示されてから消えるまでのターン数を設定します。設定値を0にすると無効"
"化されます。"

msgid ""
"Number of turns after which safe mode is reactivated.  Will only reactivate if no "
"hostiles are in 'Safe mode proximity distance.'"
msgstr ""
"セーフモードが再度有効化されるターン数を設定します。「接近距離」で設定した範囲内に敵が"
"いない状況でのみ機能します。"

msgid ""
"Number of turns an ignored monster stays ignored after it is no longer seen.  0 "
"disables this option and monsters are permanently ignored."
msgstr ""
"セーフモードで無視したモンスターが視認できなくなった後、無視を継続するターン数を設定し"
"ます。 0にすると一度無視したモンスターを永続的に無視します。"

msgid "Number of turns during which similar messages are hidden.  0 = disabled."
msgstr ""
"同一のログを非表示にする期間をターン数で設定します。設定値を0にすると無効化されます。"

msgid "Numbers"
msgstr "数値"

msgid "Numbers; slim"
msgstr "数値; スリム"

msgid "Numpad ON"
msgstr "テンキー移動オン"

msgid "Nurse"
msgstr "看護師"

msgid "Nurse Practitioner"
msgstr "診療看護師"

msgid "Nursery"
msgstr "種苗場"

msgid "Nut"
msgstr "木の実"

msgid "Nutrient-rich granules for plants."
msgstr "植物のための栄養がたっぷり入った粒剤です。"

msgid ""
"Nutrition range cannot be calculated accurately due to <color_red>recipe loops</color>."
msgstr "<color_red>レシピループ</color>が原因で養分を正確に計算できません。"

msgid "Nutrition will <color_cyan>vary with chosen ingredients</color>."
msgstr "養分は<color_cyan>材料によって変動</color>します。"

msgid "Nyctophobia"
msgstr "暗所恐怖症"

msgid ""
"Nylon pads with bulky armor inserts protecting the deltoid and upper arm.  "
"Specifically designed to be attached to a heavy plate carrier."
msgstr ""
"肩と上腕部を柔らかい素材で覆って守る、ナイロン製の防具です。軍用重装ボディアーマーと併"
"せて着用できる作りになっています。"

msgid "O NEG"
msgstr "O-"

msgid "O POS"
msgstr "O+"

msgid "OA-93 pistol"
msgid_plural "OA-93 pistols"
msgstr[0] "ハンドガン(.223口径/OA-93)"

msgid "OBEY ME!"
msgstr "命令に従え！"

msgid "OBSOLETE MODS"
msgstr "廃止されたMOD"

msgid "OFF"
msgstr "オフ"

msgid "OG-7V 40mm rocket"
msgid_plural "OG-7V 40mm rockets"
msgstr[0] "弾薬(66mm/M74)"

msgid "OK"
msgstr "OK"

msgid "OK (-%.f%%)"
msgstr "OK (-%.f%%)"

msgid "OK <name_g>, how are you coping?"
msgstr "分かったよ、<name_g>。調子はどう？"

msgid "OK, I understand.  Sorry for being nosy."
msgstr "オーケー、分かった。お節介なことを言って悪かった。"

msgid "OK, I'll talk to them too."
msgstr "分かった。彼らを説得してみる。"

msgid ""
"OK, fine.  Can you at least tell me what you remember about the events leading up to "
"now?"
msgstr ""
"よし、分かった。これまでの経験の中で、覚えていることだけでいいから、教えてもらえるか？"

msgid "OK, let's get to work."
msgstr "よし、作業に取り掛かろう。"

msgid "OK, maybe it'll stop me from freezing in this weather."
msgstr "いいよ。話していれば凍えずに済むからな。"

msgid ""
"OK, so, the first dream I had every night for three weeks.  I dreamed that I was "
"running through the woods with a stick, fighting giant spiders.  For reals!  Every "
"night."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、ええと、最初の夢は三週間ぐらい同じものだった。手に棒を持って森の中を逃げ回"
"り、巨大なクモと戦う夢だ。本当だって！毎晩見たんだ。"

msgid "OK, that doesn't seem that unusual though."
msgstr "いや、そんなに珍しい夢じゃないだろう。"

msgid "OK, that's enough social time.  You'd really rather be alone now."
msgstr "他者との交流はもう十分です。一人で過ごしたいと感じています。"

msgid ""
"OK, that's just, like, the beginning though.  So, a week before it happened, after the "
"spider dream, I would get up and go pee and then go back to bed 'cause I was kinda "
"freaked out, right?  And then I'd have this other dream, like, where my boss died and "
"came back from the dead!  And then, at work a few days later, my boss' husband was "
"visiting and he had a heart attack and I heard the next day that he'd come back from "
"the dead!  Just like in my dream, only it was a different person!"
msgstr ""
"待て、これはだな、そう、始まりに過ぎない。大変動が起きる一週間前、私はクモの夢の途中で"
"起きてトイレに行き、また眠ったんだ。ちょっとビビッてたからね？その後、別の夢を見たん"
"だ。そう、上司が死んで、その死体が蘇る夢さ！それから数日後、職場を訪ねてきたその上司の"
"夫が心臓麻痺で倒れたんだけど、次の日には生き返ったって話を聞いたんだ！人はちょっと違う"
"けど、私が見た夢と全く同じだろ！"

msgid ""
"OK, that's just, like, the beginning though.  So, a week before it happened, after the "
"spider dream, I would get up and go pee and then go back to bed 'cause I was kinda "
"freaked out, right?  And then I'd have this other dream, like, where my friend died "
"and came back from the dead!  And then, a few days later, my friend's husband was "
"visiting and he got sick and I heard the next day that he'd come back from the dead!  "
"Just like in my dream, only it was a different person!"
msgstr ""
"待て、これはだな、そう、始まりに過ぎない。大変動が起きる一週間前、私はクモの夢の途中で"
"起きてトイレに行き、また眠ったんだ。ちょっとビビッてたからね？その後、別の夢を見たん"
"だ。そう、友達が死んで、その死体が蘇る夢さ！それから数日後、その友達の家族が旅先で病死"
"しちまって、次の日には生き返ったそうなんだ！人はちょっと違うけど、私が見た夢と全く同じ"
"だろ！"

msgid "OK, then hand it over."
msgstr "よし、それをもらおうか。"

msgid "OK, then hand them over."
msgstr "よし、じゃあ渡してくれ。"

msgid ""
"OK, this is gonna sound crazy but I, like, I knew this was going to happen.  Like, "
"before it did.  You can even ask my psychic except, like, I think she's dead now.  I "
"told her about my dreams a week before the world ended.  Serious!"
msgstr ""
"OK、変だと思うだろうけど、私は、こうなることを知っていたんだ。以前からね。この話は知人"
"の霊能者にしか打ち明けていないが、彼女も既に死んでしまっただろう。世界が終わる一週間"
"前、私は見た夢について、その霊能者に話したんだ。これは真面目な話だよ！"

msgid "OK."
msgstr "分かった。"

msgid "OK.  For now let's talk about something else."
msgstr "分かった。とりあえずは、他の話をしよう。"

msgid "OK…"
msgstr "オーケー..."

