msgid ""
"Peeking down from a pole mount, this segment of security camera footage films the apex "
"of a bridge overpass's boarding ramp.  A number of large police and military vehicles "
"loom at the concrete incline's foot, with a low line of sandbags forming a makeshift "
"checkpoint behind which several armed national guardsmen and police officers stand at "
"attention.  The view, however, is mainly taken up by a veritable metal wall of "
"civilian vehicles crawling in a haphazard line across the bridge, disheveled groups of "
"exhausted men, women, and children flitting alongside the slow procession of "
"evacuating vehicles.  The footage proceeds in this fashion for several minutes, with "
"new groups of refugees being waved through by the soldiers, before a distant sonic "
"boom resounds through the audio.  Gradually coming to a halt, with the heads of "
"civilians and personnel alike inclined skyward and tense expressions adorning unkempt "
"faces, the stream stands in collective puzzlement as the sound of powerful jet engines "
"can be heard in the background, steadily rising in volume.  The collective apathy "
"dissolves into utter, terrified pandemonium as a large shadow rapidly darkens the "
"overpass and an officer suddenly screams, \"CLEAR THE BRIDGE!\"\n"
"\n"
"With a number of fresh whistling sounds dominating the newly overwhelmed soundscape, "
"soldiers grab those they can and race clear of the checkpoint as panicked civilians "
"fling themselves off the overpass, rapidly joined by the occupants of those vehicles "
"on the edges of the stagnated convoy.  In the last few shots, you can see the drivers "
"of cars at the procession's heart struggle to abandon their vehicles before a sleek "
"form streaks from the sky, the start of an ear-splitting explosion rips through the "
"muddled audio, and the view goes white."
msgstr ""
"ポールの先端から下を覗くように、陸橋のスロープの上部を映した防犯カメラ映像です。コンク"
"リート製の傾斜の頂上には大型の警察車両や軍用車両が何台も並び、その背後には土嚢が低く積"
"まれた臨時の検問所があり、武装した数人の州兵や警察官が待機しています。しかし、それより"
"も目につくのは、陸橋の上にまるで金属壁のように隙間なく詰まり、無秩序な列を作っている自"
"家用車の群れです。ほとんど止まっているような速度の車列の脇では、疲れ切った顔の男女や子"
"供が右往左往しています。この風景が数分間映し出され、新たな避難者の集団が兵士に誘導され"
"た後、どこか遠くからソニックブームの大音響が轟きました。一般人も職員も恐る恐る動きを止"
"めて空を仰ぎ、緊張のあまり固着した表情で立ち尽くす中、背後から力強いジェットエンジンの"
"音が近付いてきます。突然、大きな影が陸橋を覆い尽くし、警官が「橋から退け！」と叫び、恐"
"怖と混乱が瞬く間に伝染しました。\n"
"\n"
"あらゆる音が無数の悲鳴で塗り潰され、パニックになった市民が陸橋から身を投げ、兵士たちが"
"できる限り多くの人を抱えて検問所を越えていきます。停滞した避難車両の列に残っていた人々"
"も、次々と車から降りてきます。行列の中心部に取り残された車のドライバーが脱出しようと奮"
"闘している丁度そのとき、空から滑らかな形状の何かが降ってきました。そして耳をつんざく爆"
"発音が鳴り響き、視界が白く染まり、映像が途切れました。"

