msgid_plural "issues of Popular Mechanics"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ポピュラーメカニクス)"

msgid ""
"Popularized during the Vietnam War, chest rigs like these are typically plain, "
"barebones affairs consisting of three or more pouches in a row, with straps to secure "
"them on your chest.  This one can hold four magazines in its pouches."
msgstr ""
"ベトナム戦争中に普及したチェストリグは、通常は胸元にポーチを3つ以上固定できるストラップ"
"が付いた必要最小限の装備です。ポーチには弾倉を4個収納できます。"

msgid "Popup Distractions"
msgstr "警告文を表示する"

msgid "Popup window when achievement completed"
msgstr "実績獲得時ポップアップ"

msgid "Porcelain"
msgstr "磁器"

msgid ""
"Porkbelly in the process of becoming fully cured with salt and sugar, capable of "
"becoming bacon.  The flavor is slowly developing at this stage, and is significantly "
"unpleasant due to the residual salt.  Activate it once completed to make use of the "
"final product."
msgstr ""
"塩と砂糖で漬けて脱水している途中の豚バラ肉です。水が抜ける段階でゆっくりと風味が増しま"
"すが、今の状態では塩味が強すぎて美味しくありません。脱水が完了した状態で使用すると、生"
"ベーコンブロックが完成します。"

msgid ""
"Porkbelly that has been preserved and flavored with salt and sugar to draw out the "
"moisture from the first layer.  Still raw, it is ready for smoking into bacon."
msgstr ""
"表面から水分を抜くために塩と砂糖で漬けて、風味を付けた豚バラ肉です。まだ生の状態であ"
"り、燻製すればベーコンになります。"

msgid "Portal"
msgstr "ポータル"

msgid "Portal In"
msgstr "ポータル流入"

msgid "Portal Isolation Chamber"
msgstr "ポータル隔離チャンバー"

msgid "Portal is here."
msgstr "ポータルがあります。"

msgid ""
"Portions of the spine and surrounding bones have grown and fused into a single piece, "
"presumably to hold up the creature's bulk - but even then, it still shows signs of "
"strain."
msgstr ""
"脊椎の一部とその周囲の骨が肥大し、融合して単一構造となっています。この怪物の肉体を支え"
"る強度はあったようですが、かなり無理をしていたように思えます。"

msgid "Portions: "
msgstr "分量: "

msgid "Portland Head Light jigsaw puzzle"
msgid_plural "Portland Head Light jigsaw puzzles"
msgstr[0] "ジグソーパズル(ﾎﾟｰﾄﾗﾝﾄﾞﾍｯﾄﾞ灯台)"

msgid ""
"Portland is most likely long gone, but its memory persists in cement.  This ubiquitous "
"binder can be used for all kinds of advanced masonry.  Just add water."
msgstr ""
"ポルトランドセメントが発明されてから幾年も経ちましたが、その栄光は今なお続いています。"
"この万能接合材はあらゆる石を繋ぎ合わせます。ただ水を加えるだけで効果を発揮します。"

msgid "Portuguese flag"
msgid_plural "Portuguese flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ﾎﾟﾙﾄｶﾞﾙ)"

msgid "Possible infinite loop in EOC %s.  Stop execution?"
msgstr ""
"%sの条件付き効果によって無限ループが発生する可能性があります。実行を停止しますか？"

msgid ""
"Possibly the most popular pistol in existence, the Glock 19 can be summed up as being "
"fundamentally a more compact brother to the full-sized Glock 17 pistol.  Sporting a "
"mainly polymer-based design, the Glock 19 is often derided for its plastic "
"construction which lends the handgun a deceptively flimsy feel.  Even so, the Glock 19 "
"remains both a remarkably reliable firearm and a quite shootable gun in its own right."
msgstr ""
"フルサイズのグロック17を小型化した、現存するハンドガンの中で最も普及している銃です。ポ"
"リマー素材を主材料に使ったデザインは、プラスチック構造が安っぽい印象を与えると揶揄され"
"ることもありますが、信頼性の高さと撃ちやすさが最大の利点です。"

msgid ""
"Possibly, but we can never know for sure.  Sometimes bad things gather into "
"uncontrollable avalanches."
msgstr ""
"可能性はあるが、確かなことは分からない。悪いことが重なって、制御不能な雪崩を引き起こす"
"ことだってあるだろう。"

msgid "Post to which wall?"
msgstr "延長に使うケーブルを選択"

msgid "Post-Human"
msgstr "人間"

msgid ""
"Post-mortem revivification of subject T3D was arrested by an immediate autopsy per "
"Hub-40's new protocol: we weren't looking to study zombies today.  The internal "
"changes were significant, with large parts of the subject's internal anatomy replaced "
"with new or duplicated organs.  Dr. Versed over in Entomology is convinced some of his "
"organs are scaled-up derivations of fruit fly anatomy now."
msgstr ""
"XEDRA-40の新プロトコルに従い、蘇生した被験体T3Dは拘束され直ちに解剖が行われた。まさかゾ"
"ンビの研究をすることになるなんて。被験体内の変化は重篤であり、臓器の大部分が刷新もしく"
"は複製されていた。昆虫学を専門とするベルセド博士は、臓器の一部がショウジョウバエの器官"
"の派生物に変異したと考えている。"

msgid "Posters promoting movies that were in theaters when the Cataclysm hit."
msgstr "大変動が起きた時期に公開されていた映画の宣伝用ポスターです。"

msgid ""
"Potassium superoxide powder, used as oxygen regenerating agent in rebreathers.  Keep "
"away from water."
msgstr ""
"リブリーザーの酸素生成剤として使われる超酸化カリウムの粉末です。水気のない場所で保管し"
"ましょう。"

msgid "Potent Venom"
msgstr "生体毒"

msgid "Pottery"
msgstr "陶芸"

msgid "Pottery Cottage Camp"
msgstr "拠点(陶芸工房)"

msgid "Pottery Glazing"
msgstr "施釉"

msgid "Pouch sized for a hydration pack."
msgstr "ウォーターパックを収納するポーチです。"

msgid "Pouch to store multiple items."
msgstr "複数のアイテムを収納できるポーチです。"

msgid "Pouf"
msgstr "真菌発生(死亡効果)"

msgid "Pouf!"
msgstr "ポフッ！"

msgid "Pouf."
msgstr "ポフッ。"

msgid "Pounce"
msgstr "ネコの跳躍"

