msgstr "地面に注ぐ"

msgid "Pour out"
msgstr "中身をこぼす"

msgid ""
"Poured concrete with methodically placed rebar sticking out, which isn't practical for "
"supporting roofs or shelter.  It needs more resources before it could be considered "
"complete."
msgstr ""
"コンクリートから一定間隔で配置した鉄筋が突き出ています。屋根やシェルターを支えるにはま"
"だ不十分です。作業を完了するには、より多くの資材が必要です。"

msgid "Powder"
msgstr "粉末"

msgid "Powdered caustic soda, also known as sodium hydroxide."
msgstr "苛性ソーダ、別名水酸化ナトリウムの粉末です。"

