msgid_plural "Power Storage Mk. II CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 蓄電装置Mk.II"

msgid "Power at epicenter: "
msgstr "中心威力: "

msgid ""
"Power for the motors will be provided by a salvaged truck battery, you need not bring "
"additional mechanical components."
msgstr ""
"電源はトラックのバッテリーを抜き取って使う予定だ。電気モーターだけ持ってきてくれればい"
"い。"

msgid "Power move.  You can take control and play as your NPC follower."
msgstr ""
"これがプレイヤーの力です。操作キャラクターを仲間NPCに切り替えて、自由に動かすことができ"
"ます。"

msgid "Power off."
msgstr "操作を終了する"

msgid "Power usage"
msgstr "消費電力"

msgid "Power usage: %s"
msgstr "消費電力:  %s"

msgid "Power's nearly out, need a top up."
msgstr "電力がもうすぐ切れてしまう。充電が必要だ。"

msgid "Power/Safe Mode"
msgstr "電力/ｾｰﾌﾓｰﾄﾞ"

msgid "Power: %d"
msgstr "権力: %d"

msgid "Power: <color_light_blue>%1$d %2$s</color> / <color_light_blue>%3$d kJ</color>"
msgstr "電力: <color_light_blue>%1$d %2$s</color> / <color_light_blue>%3$d kJ</color>"

msgid "Power: <color_light_gray>%+8d</color>"
msgstr "電力: <color_light_gray>%+8d</color>"

msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this extremely expensive "
"little light will provide just enough light to read by for at least a decade.  It is "
"also available with a cute cartoon bear cover to turn it into a nightlight for a very "
"wealthy child with a fear of the dark.  The cover is closed.  Use it to open the cover "
"and show the light."
msgstr ""
"放射性崩壊と低電力LEDの魔法で動き、少なくとも10年は読書に十分な光源として活躍する高級ラ"
"ンプです。大変動前は、防災意識を周囲に見せつける最も高価なアイテムでした。実際に使って"
"みても、結構いい感じです。カバーは閉じています。使用するとカバーを開けて周囲を照らしま"
"す。"

msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this extremely expensive "
"little light will provide just enough light to read by for at least a decade.  It is "
"also available with a cute cartoon bear cover to turn it into a nightlight for a very "
"wealthy child with a fear of the dark.  Use it to close the cover and hide the light."
msgstr ""
"放射性崩壊と低電力LEDの魔法で動き、少なくとも10年は読書に十分な光源として活躍する高級ラ"
"ンプです。大変動前は、防災意識を周囲に見せつける最も高価なアイテムでした。実際に使って"
"みても、結構いい感じです。使用するとカバーを閉じて照明を隠します。"

msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this very expensive lamp "
"will emit a small amount of light for at least a decade.  Before the Cataclysm, it was "
"mostly an expensive way to show off your preparedness.  Now, it's actually really "
"useful.  The cover is closed.  Use it to open the cover and show the light."
msgstr ""
"放射性崩壊と低電力LEDの魔法で動き、少なくとも10年は小さな光を放ち続ける高級ランプです。"
"大変動前は、防災意識を周囲に見せつけるだけの超贅沢品でしたが、実際に使ってみると、非常"
"に便利です。現在カバーは閉じています。使用するとカバーを開けて周囲を照らします。"

msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of nuclear decay and low-energy LEDs, this very expensive lamp "
"will emit a small amount of light for at least a decade.  Before the Cataclysm, it was "
"mostly an expensive way to show off your preparedness.  Now, it's actually really "
"useful.  Use it to close the cover and hide the light."
msgstr ""
"放射性崩壊と低電力LEDの魔法で動き、少なくとも10年は小さな光を放ち続ける高級ランプです。"
"大変動前は、防災意識を周囲に見せつけるだけの超贅沢品でしたが、実際に使ってみると、非常"
"に便利です。使用するとカバーを閉じて照明を隠します。"

msgid ""
"Powerful heatsinks and supermaterials are surgically woven into your flesh.  While "
"powered, this system will prevent heat damage up to 2000 degrees Fahrenheit.  Note "
"that this does not affect your internal temperature."
msgstr ""
"外科手術によって、強力な超耐熱合金で作られたヒートシンクを肉体に移植します。電源が入っ"
"ている間、このシステムは摂氏約1000度までの熱によるダメージを防ぎます。体温の上昇に対し"
"ては機能しないため注意が必要です。"

msgid ""
"Powerline and other maintained public utility corridors and associated facilities, "
"including power plants and their parking areas."
msgstr ""
"送電線などの稼働している供給網、それらの関連施設、発電所とその駐車場が該当します。"

msgid "Powerline/Utility"
msgstr "送電/公益施設"

msgid "Practical Eskrima"
msgid_plural "copies of Practical Eskrima"
msgstr[0] "本(武術/実践的なエスクリマ)"

msgid "Practical Pugilism"
msgid_plural "copies of Practical Pugilism"
msgstr[0] "本(武術/実践的なボクシング)"

msgid ""
"Practical experience building electrical circuits, and a grasp of the principles of "
"electrical continuity, current, voltage, and resistance."
msgstr ""
"電気回路を作る実務経験があり、電気的導通、電流、電圧、抵抗の原理を理解しています。"

msgid ""
"Practicality is far less important than style.  Your morale is improved by wearing "
"fashionable and attractive clothing."
msgstr ""
"実用性よりも品位を保つ事が最も重要です。流行に乗った魅力的な衣服を着用すると意欲が上昇"
"します。"

msgid ""
"Practice advanced persuasion and negotiation techniques while acting out both sides of "
"a dialogue in front of a mirror."
msgstr "鏡の前で一人二役の対話練習をして、高度な説得や交渉のテクニックを磨きます。"

msgid "Practice attaching and detaching wheels to vehicle frames."
msgstr "車両のフレームにホイールを着脱する練習をします。"

msgid "Practice basic knapping by hammering some rocks into rough shapes."
msgstr "石をハンマーで叩いて粗く形を整え、石工の基礎的な技術を練習します。"

msgid ""
"Practice basic leatherworking skills by cutting and punching holes in leather, and "
"stitching together leather patches."
msgstr ""
"革を切ったり、穴を開けたり、縫い合わせたりして、基本的な革細工の技術を練習します。"

msgid ""
"Practice basic mechanics by using a pre-Cataclysm edutainment set.  Learn about "
"engines."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前に流通していた教育キットを使い、機械整備の基本を理解します。エンジンについて"
"学びましょう。"

msgid ""
"Practice basic mechanics by using a pre-Cataclysm edutainment set.  Learn about "
"hydraulics."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前に流通していた教育キットを使い、機械整備の基本を理解します。水力学について学"
"びましょう。"

msgid ""
"Practice basic mechanics by using a pre-Cataclysm edutainment set.  Learn about robots."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前に流通していた教育キットを使い、機械整備の基本を理解します。ロボット工学につ"
"いて学びましょう。"

msgid ""
"Practice building electronic circuits using standard IC chips for voltage regulation, "
"timing, logic, and simple processing."
msgstr ""
"電圧調整、タイミング、ロジック、簡単な処理などの機能をもつ標準的なICチップを使って、電"
"子回路を作る練習をします。"

msgid "Practice calisthenics using specialized equipment."
msgstr "専門知識を活用した自重トレーニングを実践します。"

msgid "Practice cutting and sewing together advanced polymers like Kevlar or Nomex."
msgstr "ケブラーやノーメックスなどの高度ポリマーの裁断、縫製を練習します。"

msgid ""
"Practice designing and building simple electrical circuits, such as a battery-powered "
"motor or light bulb, and measuring their properties to understand the flow of current."
msgstr ""
"電池で動くモーターや電球など、簡単な電気回路を設計・製作し、それらの特性を調べることで"
"電流について理解できるよう練習します。"

msgid "Practice firing unfletched arrows at a spot on the wall."
msgstr "棒矢を狙った地点へ命中させる練習をします。"

msgid "Practice firing unfletched bolts at a spot on the wall."
msgstr "矢羽のないボルトを狙った地点へ命中させる練習をします。"

msgid ""
"Practice knitting whatever comes to your mind, from simple forms to elaborate and rich "
"designs."
msgstr "シンプルな形状から凝った華美なものまで、思い付くままに編み物を練習します。"

msgid ""
"Practice more advanced knapping by shaping some rocks into precise forms and shapes."
msgstr "石をハンマーで叩いて正確に形を整え、より高度な石工技術を練習します。"

msgid "Practice parkour using a complex obstacle course."
msgstr "複雑な形状の障害物コースを使ってパルクールの練習をします。"

msgid "Practice picking simple locks."
msgstr "簡単な錠前の開け方を練習します。"

msgid ""
"Practice prototyping circuits using transistors for switching or amplifying electrical "
"signals."
msgstr "電気信号の切り替えや増幅機能をもつ、トランジスタを使った回路を試作します。"

msgid "Practice setting and disarming booby traps and mines safely."
msgstr "ブービートラップや地雷を安全に設置・解除する練習をします。"

msgid "Practice setting booby traps safely."
msgstr "ブービートラップを安全に設置する練習をします。"

msgid "Practice soldering and de-soldering wires and electronic components."
msgstr "ワイヤーや電子部品のはんだ付け、はんだ除去を練習します。"

msgid "Practice some basic calisthenics like pushups, squats, dips and crunches."
msgstr "腕立て伏せ、スクワット、ディップスなどの基礎的な筋力トレーニングを行います。"

msgid ""
"Practice speaking in front of a mirror to improve your poise and eloquence and project "
"confidence."
msgstr "鏡の前で自信満々に話す練習をして、会話時の落ち着きと雄弁さを磨きます。"

msgid "Practice the basics of using a computing device."
msgstr "コンピュータを使うための基本的な練習をします。"

msgid ""
"Practice the beautiful art of quilting by efficiently sewing a pair of padded sheets "
"together in different patterns."
msgstr ""
"シーツ2枚に内綿を詰めて様々なパターンで手早く縫い合わせ、美しいキルティングの技法を練習"
"します。"

msgid "Practice the best ways of firing fletched arrows into a target."
msgstr ""
"矢羽付きの矢を洗練された動作で命中させる練習をします。それなりの品質の弓を用意する必要"
"があります。"

msgid "Practice the best ways of firing fletched bolts into a target."
msgstr ""
"矢羽付きのボルトを洗練された動作で命中させる練習をします。それなりの品質の弓を用意する"
"必要があります。"

msgid ""
"Practice the correct cut and sewing of big leather patches in clothing making, using "
"your knowledge to give it practical forms."
msgstr ""
"知識を生かした実用的なものが作れるように、大きな革の生地を正確に裁断、縫製する練習を積"
"みます。"

msgid ""
"Practice the making of articulated joints in clothing by sewing some gloves and other "
"basic cloth joints with several layers of cloth patches for rigidity."
msgstr ""
"グローブなど間接構造が必要で単純な作りの衣類に端切れを当てて縫うことで強度を高め、間接"
"構造をもつ衣類を上手く縫い上げる練習をします。"

msgid ""
"Practice the principles of garment closures by sewing some buttons and similar "
"fasteners to some cloth patches."
msgstr "端切れにボタンなどの留め具を縫い付けて、基本的な留め具付けの方法を学びます。"

msgid ""
"Practice the principles of sealing garments and fabric against water by making a basic "
"waterproof layer from plastic sheets duct taped together, you will need some water and "
"a rag."
msgstr ""
"ビニールシートをテープで貼り合わせて防水層を作り、衣類や布地を防水する実践的な方法を学"
"びます。練習するには水と布が必要です。"

msgid ""
"Practice the use of batons and similar weapons against a training dummy.  You will "
"need something to mark the striking points while you train."
msgstr ""
"訓練用のダミー人形を相手に、警棒などの打撃武器の扱いを練習します。命中箇所に目印をつけ"
"るための道具が必要です。"

msgid ""
"Practice the use of chitin as an armor component by shaping and attaching several "
"pieces together."
msgstr ""
"アーマーの部品としてキチンを活用できるように、キチン質を縫い合わせて組み上げる練習を積"
"みます。"

msgid ""
"Practice the use of software exploits to gain elevated privileges on computer systems."
msgstr "コンピュータシステム上の権限を昇格させる攻撃方法を学びます。"

msgid ""
"Practice the use of spears and similar stabbing weapons against a training dummy.  You "
"will need something to mark the striking points while you train."
msgstr ""
"訓練用のダミー人形を相手に、槍などの刺突武器の扱いを練習します。命中箇所に目印をつける"
"ための道具が必要です。"

msgid ""
"Practice the use of stretch fabric in clothing by making and modifying some basic "
"garment forms with spandex patches."
msgstr ""
"ライクラの端切れを使って基本的な衣服の縫製やリメイクを練習し、伸縮性の高い生地を衣服に"
"用いる方法を学びます。"

msgid ""
"Practice the use of the sword and similar weapons against a training dummy.  You will "
"need something to mark the striking points while you train."
msgstr ""
"訓練用のダミー人形を相手に、剣などの斬撃武器の扱いを練習します。命中箇所に目印をつける"
"ための道具が必要です。"

msgid ""
"Practice using the command line, writing and running scripts making use of common "
"algorithms and data structures."
msgstr ""
"コマンドラインを使って一般的なアルゴリズムやデータ構造を利用したスクリプトを組み、実行"
"する練習をします。"

msgid ""
"Practice your shooting by using a set of practice targets and a laser aiming module."
msgstr "練習用の的とレーザーポインターを使って、射撃の練習をします。"

msgid "Practicing"
msgstr "練習"

msgid ""
"Praying mantis eggs glued to each other inside a strange-looking case.  It resembles a "
"trilobite or a woodlouse."
msgstr ""
"三葉虫やワラジムシにも見える不思議な形状の卵鞘の中には、カマキリの卵が大量に付着してい"
"ます。"

msgid "Pre-requisites"
msgstr "習得条件"

msgid ""
"Precious GASOLINE.  The former world bowed to their petroleum god as it led them to "
"their ruin.  There's plenty left over to fuel your inner road warrior.  If this gas "
"dispenser doesn't give up the goods for free, you may have to pay at a nearby terminal."
msgstr ""
"ガソリンは貴重です。この神殿に導いてくれた旧世界のガソリンの神に跪きましょう。仲間の道"
"路戦士に燃料を供給できるだけの十分な量が残っています。この装置が無料で燃料を提供してく"
"れない場合は、付近の端末で料金を支払う必要があります。"

msgid "Precise"
msgstr "狙撃(レベル3)"

msgid "Precise Strike"
msgstr "精密攻撃"

msgid "Precise shot"
msgstr "狙撃(レベル3)"

msgid "Predator"
msgstr "捕食者"

msgid ""
"Predominantly (> 25%) shrub cover, and some immature trees not large or dense enough "
"to be classified as forest.  It also includes areas that are more permanently shrubby, "
"such as heath areas, wild blueberries or mountain laurel."
msgstr ""
"土地の25%を超える範囲が低木に覆われており、森林ほどの大きさや密度に達しない成長途中の樹"
"木が生えている地帯が該当します。ヒースや野生のブルーベリー、カルミア属などの低木が恒久"
"的に群生している土地も含まれます。"

msgid "Prefers prey capable of vocalization -- implanted speakers work but no repeats"
msgstr "声を出す獲物を好む -- 埋め込み型スピーカーは使える、繰り返しは不可"

msgid "Prefix"
msgstr "行頭"

msgid "Pregnant Roach Death"
msgstr "巨大ゴキブリ(幼体)生成(死亡効果)"

msgid "Premium Shooting Brake"
msgstr "高級ショートワゴン"

msgid "Preoccupation with finding kitten prevents you from investigating further."
msgstr "子猫を探すことに夢中になっていると、更なる探査ができなくなってしまいます。"

msgid "Preparation to Hit"
msgstr "攻撃準備"

msgid "Prepare IFF protocol override"
msgstr "IFFプロトコル上書き"

msgid "Prepare a row of farm plots."
msgstr "1列目の耕作地を整備しましょう。"

msgid "Prepare a second row of farm plots."
msgstr "2列目の耕作地を整備しましょう。"

msgid "Prepare another pair of rows of farm plots."
msgstr "もう一組の耕作地を整備しましょう。"

msgid "Prepare for your next show"
msgstr "次のショーに備える"

msgid ""
"Prepare subject with 1500 U purifier, IV route\n"
"Observe for 16 hours\n"
"Results: Subject showed no visual changes whatsoever.  Subject reported a nausea and "
"chest pain\n"
"Long term results: No long-term changes."
msgstr ""
"1500単位の変異原物質を摂取した被験体を用意\n"
"プライマー注入せず\n"
"6時間の経過観察\n"
"結果: 被験体に視覚的な変化は見られなかったが、吐き気と胸の痛みを訴えた。\n"
"長期的な結果: 変化なし。"

msgid ""
"Prepare subject with 2000 U mutagen, IV route\n"
"Observe for 16 hours\n"
"Results: The subject felt a painful headache\n"
"Long-term results: the subject developed a heavy form of psychosis, including heavy "
"hallucinations, delirium, and schizophrenia.  The subject was neutralized during an "
"attempt to pull a sidearm from a security guard's holster."
msgstr ""
"2000単位の変異原物質を摂取した被験体を用意\n"
"500単位のプライマーを注入\n"
"6時間の経過観察\n"
"結果: 被験体は強い頭痛を発症\n"
"長期的な結果: 被験体は重度の幻覚、せん妄、統合失調症などの症状を伴う重度の精神疾患を発"
"病。警備員の着用しているホルスターから銃を引き抜こうとしたため、無力化。"

msgid ""
"Prepare subject with 2500 U mutagen, IV route\n"
"Observe for 16 hours\n"
"Results: Subject expired after long period of pain\n"
"Long term results: N/A."
msgstr ""
"2500単位の変異原物質を摂取した被験体を用意\n"
"500単位のプライマーを注入\n"
"6時間の経過観察\n"
"結果: 被験体は苦痛を訴え続け、後に死亡。\n"
"長期的な結果: なし。"

msgid ""
"Prepare subject with 300 U mutagen, IV route\n"
"Observe for 16 hours\n"
"Results: No observable changes.  Subject asked for more food.\n"
"Long term results: the size of subject's stomach was increased by 50%."
msgstr ""
"300単位の変異原物質を摂取した被験体を用意\n"
"300単位のプライマーを注入\n"
"6時間の経過観察\n"
"結果: 目立った変化なし。被験体は食事を増やすよう要求。\n"
"長期的な結果: 被験体の胃の容積が50%増加。"

msgid ""
"Prepare subject with 500 U mutagen, IV route\n"
"Observe for 16 hours\n"
"Results: Subject expired shortly after injection\n"
"Long term results: N/A."
msgstr ""
"500単位の変異原物質を摂取した被験体を用意\n"
"2500単位のプライマーを注入\n"
"6時間の経過観察\n"
"結果: 被験体は注射の直後に死亡。\n"
"長期的な結果: なし。"

msgid ""
"Prepare subject with 800 U mutagen, IV route\n"
"Observe for 16 hours\n"
"Results: Subject rapidly grew feathers across whole body, including hands, arms, "
"armpits, back and neck.  Some grew in unexpected places, including a few around "
"subject's eyes, but were safely removed by the subject\n"
"Long term results: subject found themselves able to split their vision."
msgstr ""
"800単位の変異原物質を摂取した被験体を用意\n"
"500単位のプライマーを注入\n"
"6時間の経過観察\n"
"結果: 被験体の両手、両腕、腋、背中、首を含む全身で羽毛が急速に成長。一部は被験体の目の"
"周囲など、予期しない部位に生えたが、被験体自ら安全に除去することができた。\n"
"長期的な結果: 被験体は自らの視野を左右で個別に認識できるようになった。"

msgid "Prepare to die!"
msgstr "死ぬ準備をしろ！"

msgid "Prepare to die,"
msgstr "死ぬ準備をしろ、"

msgid "Prepare to meet your end, <npc_name>.  *Attack <npc_name>.*"
msgstr "<npc_name>、最期を迎える準備をしろ。*<npc_name>を攻撃する*"

msgid "Prepare to use"
msgstr "有効化する"

msgid "Prepare yourself!  We have a"
msgstr "覚悟を決めろ！あれは"

msgid "Prereqs, 2d:"
msgstr "前提, 2d: "

msgid "Prereqs:"
msgstr "前提: "

msgid ""
"Prerequisite for this option not met!\n"
"(%s)"
msgstr ""
"以下の設定の前提条件が満たされていません！\n"
"(%s)"

msgid "Presbyterian Cross necklace"
msgid_plural "Presbyterian Cross necklaces"
msgstr[0] "聖なる象徴(プレスビテリアンクロス)"

msgid "Presentation Computer"
msgstr "PC: ユーザー"

msgid "Preservation of Sustenance"
msgstr "食料備蓄"

msgid ""
"Preserved fish that has been dried in a lye solution.  Vile and soap-like yet highly "
"nutritious, it is reminiscent of the afterbirth of a dog or the world's largest chunk "
"of phlegm."
msgstr ""
"乾燥させた魚をアルカリ溶液に漬け込んだ、ゼリー状の保存食です。まるで石鹸のような食べら"
"れそうにない見た目ですが、養分がたっぷり詰まっています。イヌの胎盤や世界一大きな痰の塊"
"のようにも見えます。"

msgid "Preset Name: %s"
msgstr "プリセット名: %s"

msgid "Preset already exists, overwrite?"
msgstr "プリセットが既に存在しています。上書きしますか？"

msgid "Press "
msgstr " "

msgid "Press %c to execute action\n"
msgstr "%cを押して操作を実行\n"

msgid "Press %s to accept your fate…"
msgstr "'%s'を押して運命を受け入れる..."

msgid "Press %s to assign this follower to this camp."
msgstr "%sを押して仲間をこの拠点での作業に割り当てる。"

msgid "Press %s to change this workers job priorities."
msgstr "%sを押してこの仲間の作業優先度を変更する。"

msgid "Press %s to inspect this follower."
msgstr "%sを押してこの仲間を調べる。"

msgid "Press 'q' or ESC to exit."
msgstr "qかESCで戻る"

msgid ""
"Press <color_light_green>%1$s</color> to change Cataclysm start date, "
"<color_light_green>%2$s</color> to change fall of civilization date, "
"<color_light_green>%3$s</color> to change game start date, <color_light_green>%4$s</"
"color> to reset calendar."
msgstr ""
"<color_light_green>%1$s</color>: 大変動の発生日を変更　<color_light_green>%2$s</"
"color>: ゲーム開始日を変更　<color_light_green>%3$s</color>: 日付をリセット"

msgid "Press <color_light_green>%s</color> to decrease value.\n"
msgstr "<color_light_green>%s</color>で値を減らす\n"

msgid "Press <color_light_green>%s</color> to increase value.\n"
msgstr "<color_light_green>%s</color>で値を増やす\n"

msgid "Press <color_light_green>%s</color> to reset value.\n"
msgstr "<color_light_green>%s</color>で初期値に戻す\n"

