msgstr "<color_light_green>%s</color>: キー割当の表示と編集。"

msgid ""
"Press <color_light_green>%s</color> to view and alter keybindings.\n"
"Press <color_light_green>%s</color> / <color_light_green>%s</color> to select skill.\n"
"Press <color_light_green>%s</color> to increase skill or <color_light_green>%s</color> "
"to decrease skill.\n"
"Press <color_light_green>%s</color> to go to the next tab or <color_light_green>%s</"
"color> to return to the previous tab."
msgstr ""
"<color_light_green>%s</color>でキー割り当ての表示と変更。\n"
"<color_light_green>%s</color> / <color_light_green>%s</color>でスキルの選択。\n"
"<color_light_green>%s</color>でスキルレベル増加、<color_light_green>%s</color>でスキル"
"レベル減少。\n"
"<color_light_green>%s</color>で次のタブに移動、<color_light_green>%s</color>で前のタブ"
"に移動。"

msgid ""
"Press <color_light_green>%s</color> to view and alter keybindings.\n"
"Press <color_light_green>%s</color> / <color_light_green>%s</color> to select stat.\n"
"Press <color_light_green>%s</color> to increase stat or <color_light_green>%s</color> "
"to decrease stat.\n"
"Press <color_light_green>%s</color> to go to the next tab or <color_light_green>%s</"
"color> to return to the previous tab."
msgstr ""
"<color_light_green>%s</color>でキー割当の表示と変更。\n"
"<color_light_green>%s</color> / <color_light_green>%s</color>で値の選択。\n"
"<color_light_green>%s</color>で値の増加、<color_light_green>%s</color>で値の減少。\n"
"<color_light_green>%s</color>で次のタブに移動、<color_light_green>%s</color>で前のタブ"
"に移動。"

msgid ""
"Press <color_light_green>%s</color> to view and alter keybindings.\n"
"Press <color_light_green>%s</color> or <color_light_green>%s</color> to select pool "
"and <color_light_green>%s</color> to confirm selection.\n"
"Press <color_light_green>%s</color> to go to the next tab or <color_light_green>%s</"
"color> to return to main menu."
msgstr ""
"<color_light_green>%s</color>でキー割当の表示と変更。\n"
"<color_light_green>%s</color>/<color_light_green>%s</color>で値を選択し、"
"<color_light_green>%s</color>で選択を決定。\n"
"<color_light_green>%s</color>で次のタブに移動、<color_light_green>%s</color>でメインメ"
"ニューに戻る。"

msgid "Press <color_light_green>%s</color> when done selecting time point."
msgstr "<color_light_green>%s</color>を押して開始日時を選択。"

msgid ""
"Press <color_white>C</color> (or <color_white>c</color>) to copy this message to the "
"clipboard."
msgstr ""
"<color_white>C</color>(または<color_white>c</color>)を押すとこのエラーメッセージをコ"
"ピーします。"

msgid ""
"Press <color_white>I</color> (or <color_white>i</color>) to also ignore this "
"particular message in the future."
msgstr ""
"<color_white>I</color>(または<color_white>i</color>)を押すと今後はこのエラーメッセージ"
"を無視します。"

msgid "Press <color_white>space bar</color> to continue the game."
msgstr "<color_white>スペースキー</color>を押すとゲームを続行します。"

msgid "Press [%1$s] to quickly toggle debug mode."
msgstr "[%1$s]を押すとデバッグモードを切り替えられます。"

msgid "Press [<color_c_yellow>%s</color>] to randomize the world name."
msgstr "[<color_c_yellow>%s</color>]で世界名をランダム選択。"

msgid "Press [<color_red>%s</color>] to clear filter."
msgstr "[<color_red>%s</color>] でフィルター解除。"

msgid "Press [<color_red>%s</color>] to show unavailable constructions."
msgstr "Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] で非表示項目を表示。"

msgid "Press [<color_yellow>%s or %s</color>] to tab."
msgstr "[<color_yellow>%s or %s</color>] でタブ切替。"

msgid ""
"Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] or [<color_yellow>%s</color>] to cycle through search "
"results."
msgstr "[<color_yellow>%s</color>]または[ <color_yellow>%s</color>]で検索結果の切替。"

msgid "Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] to confirm."
msgstr "[<color_yellow>%s</color>]で確認。"

msgid "Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] to hide unavailable constructions."
msgstr "Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] でこの場に建設できない項目を非表示。"

msgid ""
"Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] to pick a random name for your world.\n"
"Navigate options with [<color_yellow>directional keys</color>] and confirm with "
"[<color_yellow>%s</color>].\n"
"Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] to see additional control information."
msgstr ""
"[<color_yellow>%s</color>]を押して世界名をランダムで決定。\n"
"[<color_yellow>方向キー</color>]を押して世界設定を選択し、[<color_yellow>%s</color>]を"
"押して確定。\n"
"[<color_yellow>%s</color>]を押してその他のキー割当を表示。"

msgid "Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] to quit."
msgstr "[<color_yellow>%s</color>]で終了。"

msgid "Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] to search."
msgstr "[<color_yellow>%s</color>] で検索。"

msgid "Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] to show next stage(s)."
msgstr "[<color_yellow>%s</color>]で次の工程を表示。"

msgid "Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] to show previous stage(s)."
msgstr "[<color_yellow>%s</color>]で前の工程を表示。"

msgid "Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] to view and edit keybindings."
msgstr "[<color_yellow>%s</color>] キー割当の表示と編集。"

msgid "Press again to confirm."
msgstr "再度押して自動移動を実行。"

msgid "Press any key and shut down."
msgstr "キーを押してシャットダウンする"

msgid "Press any key to continue…"
msgstr "続けるには何かキーを押して下さい..."

msgid "Press any key to start."
msgstr "始めるには何かキーを押して下さい。"

msgid "Press any key."
msgstr "キーを押す。"

msgid "Press any key…"
msgstr "何かキーを押して下さい..."

msgid "Press blue button"
msgstr "青いボタンを押す"

msgid "Press enter to recall from their mission"
msgstr "エンターキーで任務からの帰還を指示"

msgid "Press enter to rename this camp"
msgstr "エンターキーで拠点の名称変更"

msgid "Press enter to talk to this follower "
msgstr "エンターキーで仲間と会話"

msgid "Press green button"
msgstr "緑のボタンを押す"

msgid "Press on in search of a reaction."
msgstr "反応するまで粘り強く呼びかける。"

msgid "Press red button"
msgstr "赤いボタンを押す"

msgid "Press space, choose a facing direction for the new %s and confirm with enter."
msgstr "スペースを押し、方向キーで%sの向きを選びEnterキーを押して確定してください。"

msgid "Press tightly to ears"
msgstr "耳に押し当てる"

msgid "Press ~ to add a default ruleset to get started."
msgstr "~を押すと開始時の初期設定ルールを追加します。"

msgid ""
"Pressed against the liver is a swollen gland the size of a golfball, still somewhat "
"functioning, pumping out acrid fluids."
msgstr ""
"肝臓にゴルフボールほどのサイズの膨らんだ腺が張り付いています。まだある程度機能が残って"
"いるのか、刺激臭を放つ液体が漏れ出ています。"

msgid ""
"Pressed from fresh apples, tasty and nutritious.  This is a non-alcoholic beverage, "
"which sometimes confuses foreigners.  It's instead called 'hard cider' when alcohol is "
"involved."
msgstr ""
"新鮮なリンゴを搾って作った、美味しく栄養価の高いノンアルコール飲料です。リンゴ酒をこの"
"名称で呼ぶ国もあるため、外国人にとっては混乱の元です。アメリカ国内でリンゴ酒は「ハード"
"サイダー」と呼ばれています。"

