msgid ""
"Ragged, unclear, and altogether hurriedly developed, this photograph appears to depict "
"the gloomy interior of what once was a living room, with window blinds thickly drawn "
"and boards nailing down any cracks through which external observation could be "
"possible.  The entire space looks alive: some manner of spongy vegetation coats its "
"surfaces and thick tendrils and quivering mounds of mold subsume most of the "
"furniture.  Reclined within the misshapen gray lump that might have been a sofa, a "
"pale-skinned woman lounges, her spine arched, head thrown back, and a look of "
"rapturous ecstasy visible on the parts of her face not caked by the fungus that's "
"extending in wet stalks from her open mouth.  Smiling contentedly, with dainty "
"tendrils spreading across her face, entwining in her hair, and burrowing into the "
"ruptured sockets where eyes used to reside, the woman is embracing a bulging cocoon of "
"gray resting in her lap, small bits of fur peeking through cracks in the fungal "
"shell.  In bold and crude calligraphy, text has been scrawled on the back of the "
"image.\n"
"\n"
"\"Do not be afraid, for our beauty is all-encompassing and rests beyond your sight.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Do not be afraid, for we speak the word of blissful hegemony.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Do not be afraid, for this is our mission, and you will be a part of it.\""
msgstr ""
"急いで現像されたように見える、傷の多い不鮮明な写真です。陰気な室内を写しており、窓のブ"
"ラインドは完全に閉まり、外から見られそうな隙間全てに板張りが施されています。かつてはリ"
"ビングルームだったのでしょうが、空間全体がスポンジ状の植物質で覆われており、生物の体内"
"のようにも見えます。ソファのようにも見える不格好な灰色の塊の上では、色白の女性が力なく"
"横たわっています。背筋は反り返り、首は背後に傾き、全身に濡れた菌糸がこびりついていま"
"す。唯一露出している顔は、開ききった口から細い糸が顔全体に伸び、髪に絡みつき、目玉が収"
"まっていた筈の穴に潜り込み、それでもどこか陶酔した、満足そうな表情を浮かべています。膝"
"の上には灰色の繭が乗っており、卵の殻が割れて孵化するように、あちこちにヒビが入っていま"
"す。写真の裏側に、大きく粗雑な文字で走り書きが残されています。\n"
"\n"
"「恐れるな。我々の美は全てを包み込み、あなたの視界の及ばぬ場所で安らぐ」\n"
"\n"
"「恐れるな。我々は至福と繁栄の言葉を語る。」\n"
"\n"
"「恐れるな。これは我々の使命。あなたは我々となる。」"

