msgid ""
"Recognized the world over as one of the first practical self-loading pistols, the "
"Mauser C96 and its derivatives are nearly universally regarded as some of the most "
"classic and rugged guns in history, with the model being praised as a true marvel of "
"industrial craftsmanship.  However, what rests before you is not an original "
"production C96, but rather a modern American spin on the original Mauser recipe.  "
"Feeding from detachable box magazines rather than an internal clip, the M714 is "
"crafted out of a mix of modern and surplus parts, being chambered for 9x19mm rounds, "
"with some other models being offered in the Mauser's own 7.63x25mm cartridge."
msgstr ""
"実用的な自動装填式ピストルとして世界にその名を知られるモーゼルC96とその派生モデルは、驚"
"異的な工業技術の粋を集めた史上最も頑丈なクラシックガンとして高い評価を受けています。こ"
"のM714はオリジナルのC96ではなく、現代アメリカのエッセンスを足した復刻品です。オリジナル"
"の部品と新造部品の組み合わせによって作られており、クリップではなく着脱できる箱型弾倉で"
"装填します。9x19mm弾を使いますが、モーゼル独自の7.63x25mm弾を使う別モデルも存在している"
"ようです。"

