msgctxt "Shot as damage"
msgid "SHOT"
msgstr "射撃"

msgid ""
"Shot within an indoor shooting range, a lanky young lady with Slavic features stands "
"in the foreground of this photo, her flowing brunette hair all but concealed beneath a "
"modified pot-helmet with an attached camera and flip-down infrared eyepiece.  "
"Enveloped within a vest to which is attached a contraption that looks like the end "
"product of a machine gun and a motorcycle being crashed together, the woman's posing "
"with the weapon cradled at her hip.  At the picture's left-most echelons, clearly "
"intended to serve as a target, a 7-foot-tall insectoid creature cast from black foam "
"crouches, its plastic fangs bared and its second jaw extended.\n"
"\n"
"On the photo's backside, the caption \"LA, 2019\" has been scrawled in looping "
"handwriting.  In more recent script, a large x has been scored through the caption, "
"while the term \"game over man\" has been jotted in its place."
msgstr ""
"屋内射撃場で撮影された、スラブ系の顔立ちをした若い痩せ身の女性の写真です。ベストを着用"
"し、カメラとフリップダウン赤外線接眼レンズが付いた改造ポットヘルメットの下から艶やかな"
"ブルネットの髪が覗いており、機関銃とオートバイを掛け合わせたようなデザインの銃器を腰だ"
"めに構えています。写真の左端に写っているのは、恐らく標的として使われていると思われる、"
"黒い発泡ブロックで作られた全長約2.1mの昆虫のような模型です。身をかがめ、第二の顎を伸ば"
"してプラスチック製の牙を剥き出しにしています。\n"
"\n"
"写真の裏に筆記体で「LA、2019」と走り書きされていますが、その上から大きな×が付けられ、"
"「ゲームオーバーだ」と書き足されています。"

msgid "Shotgun Arm"
msgstr "ショットガンアーム"

msgid "Shotgun Arm CBM"
msgid_plural "Shotgun Arm CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: ショットガンアーム"

msgid ""
"Shotguns are easy to shoot and can inflict massive damage, but their effectiveness and "
"accuracy decline rapidly with range.  Slugs can be loaded into shotguns to provide "
