"on a vehicle.  You can even create a vehicle entirely from scratch, by using the "
"Construction (<press_construction>) menu to 'Start Vehicle Construction' when you have "
"a frame available.  Tuning a vehicle for speed, fuel consumption, offroad capacity, "
"protection against threats, and cargo capacity is a complicated process."
