msgid "Sorry to ask."
msgstr "悪いことを尋ねてしまったな。"

msgid "Sorry to hear that.  I'll leave you be."
msgstr "申し訳ない。無理強いはしないよ。"

msgid "Sorry to hear that.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "それは辛いな。ところで、さっきの話は何だったかな？"

msgid "Sorry we couldn't save you"
msgstr "助けられなくて申し訳ない"

msgid "Sorry we failed you"
msgstr "私たちが見捨ててしまった"

msgid "Sorry, I can't hear you."
msgstr "ごめん、よく聞こえない。"

msgid "Sorry, I didn't mean anything by it.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr "ごめん、悪気はなかった。そろそろ行くよ。"

msgid "Sorry, I didn't mean anything by it.  What's up?"
msgstr "ごめん、悪気はなかった。調子はどう？"

msgid "Sorry, I didn't mean to offend you…"
msgstr "すみません、怒らせる気は無かったんです..."

msgid "Sorry, I don't know what I was thinking.  Tell me about you coming here."
msgstr ""
"ごめん、ちょっと呆けていたようだ。あなたをこちらへ呼び寄せる方法について教えてほしい。"

msgid "Sorry, I don't think I can help you."
msgstr "申し訳ないが、お役には立てないな。"

msgid "Sorry, I gotta go."
msgstr "失礼、そろそろ行かないと。"

msgid "Sorry, I had to find someone else since you didn't come through."
msgstr "中々来ないもんだから、他の人に頼んだよ。悪いね。"

msgid "Sorry, I have people of my own to look out for.  I can't leave them in the lurch."
msgstr "悪いね、こっちも世話してる奴らがいて、放って出て行く気にはなれないんだ。"

msgid "Sorry, I won't ask again."
msgstr "悪かった、もう妙なことは言わない。"

msgid "Sorry, I'm nobody.  Enjoy your freedom, I guess."
msgstr "失礼、私には関係ないことだ。存分に自由を満喫してくれ。"

msgid "Sorry, I'm only willing to extend you %s in credit."
msgstr "悪いけど、%sしか渡せないんだ。"

msgid "Sorry, Jeremiah.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr "失礼、ジェレミア。また今度話そう。"

msgid "Sorry, Jerry.  What's up?"
msgstr "失礼、ジェリー。調子はどう？"

msgid "Sorry, but I don't know you that well and I'd rather not go into that."
msgstr "あんたのこともよく知らないんだ、悪いけど言えないね。"

msgid "Sorry, but it doesn't seem I have anything to teach you."
msgstr "悪いけど、教えられることはもう何もないようだ。"

msgid "Sorry, but that's all I have time for at the moment.  Darius is waiting outside."
msgstr "申し訳ない、あまり時間がないんだ。ダリウスを外で待たせているからね。"

msgid "Sorry, but you can only take %d point of advantages."
msgid_plural "Sorry, but you can only take %d points of advantages."
msgstr[0] "長所に使えるのは最大で%dポイントです。"

msgid "Sorry, but you can only take %d point of disadvantages."
msgid_plural "Sorry, but you can only take %d points of disadvantages."
msgstr[0] "短所で得られるのは最大で%dポイントです。"

msgid "Sorry, but you couldn't pay me enough to go back there."
msgstr "悪いけど、あそこへ行かせるならもっと報酬を積んでくれないと。"

msgid "Sorry, but you have to go down,"
msgstr "悪いけど、ここで死んでもらうよ、"

msgid "Sorry, didn't mean to intrude."
msgstr "申し訳ない、そんなつもりじゃなかったんだ。"

msgid "Sorry, forgot to grab the drive.  I'll return with it."
msgstr "失礼、ハードディスクを忘れてきた。取りに行ってくる。"

msgid ""
"Sorry, it's not something I can bend on.  I don't make a big profit off this, I use "
"what I get to make more bread.  If I cut you a deal, I'll run out of supplies."
msgstr ""
"申し訳ないけど、安くはできないよ。別にがっぽり儲けようって訳じゃないんだ。得たものを"
"使ってもっとたくさんパンを焼くだけさ。"

msgid "Sorry, not interested."
msgstr "悪いけど、興味ないね。"

msgid ""
"Sorry, not quite yet.  Landough was in pretty rough shape.  No fault of yours, it was "
"no good having him cooped up in a dank fridge for that long… and I think my apprentice "
"baker may have fucked with him before the Cataclysm too.  He'd better hope he's a "
"zombie now, because if I see him alive… anyway, it's gonna take a few more feeds "
"before I can get him ready for prime time, check back in a couple days."
msgstr ""
"ごめんなさい、まだまだね。サワー種が荒れてるみたい。あなたのせいじゃない、長い間冷蔵庫"
"に入れっぱなしだったのが良くなかったか...弟子のパン職人が大変動前にサワー種を弄ったのが"
"原因かもしれないね。弟子がゾンビになってることを願うよ。もし生きてたら...とにかく状態が"
"良くなるまでもう少し寝かせる必要があるね。数日後にまた来てちょうだい。"

msgid "Sorry, something went wrong."
msgstr "申し訳ありません、何らかの問題が発生しています。"

msgid "Sorry, there's nothing I can learn from you."
msgstr "申し訳ない、学べることが何もなさそうだ。"

msgid "Sorry, what?"
msgstr "失礼、今なんて？"

msgid "Sorry, you had it coming"
msgstr "悪いけど、当然の報いだ"

msgid "Sorry."
msgstr "すまない。"

msgid "Sorry.  Could you tell me more about them?"
msgstr "悪かった。ハチについて詳しく教えてもらえないかな？"

msgid ""
"Sorry.  I didn't notice which dialogue option I was selecting.  I'll just back away "
