msgid ""
"Starting a camp doesn't take much time, and you can use a faction camp to keep your "
"companions fed without needing to regularly give them food, so it's a good idea to "
"establish a minimal camp anywhere you intend to be for a while.\n"
"  How much you want to expand your camps is up to you.  A modular field camp can be "
"very resource intensive, but building one up allows you to send companions off to hunt "
"and farm for you, so there's quite the pay-off.  What kind of camp (or camps) you want "
"to build depends both on what you intend to focus on and whether you want to be "
"stationary or roaming with stops in areas only for some time before moving on.  If "
"nothing else, you should consider building a water well as soon as you can, which may "
"require you to perform construction prerequisites.\n"
"  If you have access to a fire station or evac shelter, you may want to build your "
"camp in them.  Both of those camps are are very compact, but have much of the same "
"functionality as an upgraded field camp without requiring so many resources.\n"
"  If you are adding expansions to your camp, consider starting with a farm, canteen, "
"or fabrication workshop.  The farm makes it easy to grow your own food if you don't "
"have any ready plowed farms nearby, the canteen provides you with a well and root "
"cellars after some upgrades, while the fabrication workshop can allow you to craft "
"some of the resources you need to upgrade your camp.\n"
"  The livestock area, storage area, and saltworks probably shouldn't be your first "
"expansions, but they all have their uses."
msgstr ""
"拠点を作るのは、それほど時間がかからない。それに、拠点に備蓄食料を置けば、仲間に定期的"
"に食事を渡す手間も省ける。だから、しばらく滞在する予定の場所には、最小限の拠点を作って"
"おくことをお勧めするよ。\n"
" 拠点をどこまで発展させるかは、あなた次第だ。モジュール式平野拠点は大量の資材を消費する"
"かもしれないが、改良を重ねれば仲間に狩猟や農業の任務を割り当てられるようになり、かなり"
"の見返りが期待できる。拠点を発展させる方針は、あなたが何に重点を置くか、どれくらいの期"
"間留まる予定なのかによって違ってくる。あえて一つ挙げるなら、井戸はできるだけ早く作った"
"方がいい。\n"
"  消防署や避難シェルターを見つけたら、そこを拠点にするのもいいだろう。どちらもかなり狭"
"いけど、資材を少し用意するだけで、改良した平野の拠点と同程度の機能が使えるようにな"
"る。\n"
"  拡張施設を作れる段階になったら、農場か食堂、あるいは作業場をまず作るといい。近くに耕"
"された土地がないとき、農場は簡単に食料を育てられて便利だし、食堂は何度か改良を重ねれば"
"井戸と貯蔵穴を設置できるようになる。作業場では拠点の改良に必要な資材の一部を製作でき"
"る。\n"
"  牧場、大型倉庫、製塩所などは、優先して作るべきってほどじゃないけど、便利な拡張施設"
"だ。"

