msgid "Swirling vortex"
msgstr "奇妙な渦"

msgid ""
"Swirling with a head-spinning meld of spurting reds and fleshy pinks, the sky looms "
"over a windswept street, the jittering view seemingly recorded by a private property's "
"security camera.  Bulging and receding, as though it were the face of a storm-ravaged "
"ocean, a road-facing lawn fills the foreground.  A school bus rocks beyond the "
"distorted greenery, the giggles of children clear over the squeals of the vehicle's "
"suspension and the deformed whispers that tickle the edges of audibility.  The bus is "
"coated in a carpet of writhing, flopping, and quivering torsos and limbs, all "
"seemingly from children.  Rolling, through some indeterminate agency, along the "
"vehicle's sides, wiggling across its roof, and at times merging straight through the "
"metal, the bleeding body parts frolic across the bus.  Smiling and laughing, the heads "
"attached to the torsos revolve in ways that would break regular necks, their jaws "
"clamping about the faces of cohorts that they wriggle into, both parties gnawing at "
"each other's skulls before they merge strait through one another.\n"
"\n"
"As the road buckles and an abyssal vortex twists into being beyond the bus, all the "
"flailing legs assemble beneath the chassis and lift the vehicle from the ground, the "
"children's eyes bursting from their sockets and wriggling to the bus's front as the "
"rest of the body parts assume positions upon the seats.  The red-splattered distortion "
"of children on a field trip sprints into the portal, the children's heads still "
"laughing."
msgstr ""
"この不穏な動画は、私有地の監視カメラに記録された映像のようです。強風が吹きすさぶ街中"
"で、迸る赤色と肉感的なピンク色の何かが混じり合い、渦を巻いています。道路に面した芝生の"
"広場は、まるで嵐で荒れる海面のように膨らみ、波打っています。歪む緑色の上ではスクールバ"
"スのような形が揺れ、サスペンションの軋む音やかろうじて耳に届く何者かの囁き声、子供たち"
"の賑やかな笑い声が聞こえてきます。バスの表面は子供のものと思われる手足や胴体がびっしり"
"と覆い尽くし、悶え、震え、揺らいでいます。その肉塊は原理不明の力によって車両の側面を這"
"い回り、ルーフの上で小刻みに揺れ、時には金属部品の隙間を縫うように通り抜けながら、血液"
"を撒き散らし、はしゃぎまわっています。胴に付いたままの子供の頭部はにっこりと微笑み、通"
"常であればねじ切れるような角度で首を回し、周囲の他の子供の頭部に噛み付き、喰らい、やが"
"て一つに溶け合います。\n"
"\n"
"道路がぐにゃりと変形し、バスの前方に捻じれた渦が現れると、子供たちの足はバタバタと"
"シャーシの下に集合して車両を持ち上げました。頭部の眼窩からは次々と目玉が飛び出して同様"
"に車両の前面に集まり、残った肉塊は全てシートに収まりました。赤い肉塊は遠足にでも行くか"
"のようにポータル目掛けて走り出し、子供たちの笑い声が止まることはありません。"

