"Take a full minute of concentration, pay one warp shard, and return to the safety of "
"your home base."
msgstr "転移の欠片を1個消費して1分間精神を集中させ、安全な拠点へ帰還します。"

msgid "Take a nap if you need it"
msgstr "疲れたら眠っていい"

msgid "Take a photo"
msgstr "写真を撮る"

msgid "Take anticonvulsant"
msgstr "抗けいれん薬を摂取する"

msgid "Take care of yourself out there."
msgstr "気を付けて行けよ。"

msgid ""
"Take care of yourself out there.  And listen, when you bring my sourdough back, I "
"don't want to see a scratch on him, you understand?"
msgstr "気をつけて。それから、くれぐれもサワー種スターターに傷を付けないようにね？"

msgid ""
"Take care of yourself out there.\"  She jots down directions to her bakery and hands "
"them to you.  \"His name is Landough, Landough Calrisean.  He'll be in the right-hand "
"fridge, in a jar with a picture of the Millennium Falcon on it.  And listen, when you "
"bring my sourdough back, I don't want to see a scratch on him, you understand?"
msgstr ""
"気を付けてね。」彼女はパン屋への道順をメモし、手渡しました。「種にはランド・カルリジア"
"ンって名前が付いてるんだ。入って右側の冷蔵庫の中、ミレニアム・ファルコンのシールが貼っ"
"てある瓶だよ。それから、これが一番大事なことだ。サワードウが滅茶苦茶の傷だらけだった"
"ら、持ってきてくれても全部台無しだよ、分かるね？"

msgid "Take control of RC car"
msgstr "ラジコンカーを操縦する"

msgid "Take control of a vehicle."
msgstr "車両の運転を始める"

msgid "Take down appliance"
msgstr "取り外す"

msgid "Take down the %s"
msgstr "%sを取り外す"

msgid "Take down the %s?"
msgstr "%sを取り外しますか？"

msgid "Take it easy and put your hands up now, <name_g>."
msgstr "落ち着いて、今すぐ両手を挙げるんだ、<name_g>。"

msgid "Take it easy now, or come back soon.  All the same to me."
msgstr "ひとまずゆっくり休むか、すぐに戻ってくるといい。私にとってはどちらも同じさ。"

msgid ""
"Take my dog whistle; if the dog starts running off, blow it and he'll return to your "
"side."
msgstr ""
"この犬笛を持っていって。もし子犬が逃げ出しても、これを使用すればきっとついてくるから。"

msgid ""
"Take note that bionic installation or removal require narcosis, immobilization of the "
"patient, and only then the operation - which may take hours.  So you have to make sure "
"that you will be safe during this process."
msgstr ""
"CBMを移植・除去する際、患者の身体は固定され、麻酔をかけられ、外科手術は数時間に及びま"
"す。手術中の安全を確保しておきましょう。"

msgid "Take off"
msgstr "外す"

msgid "Take off item"
msgstr "脱ぐアイテムを選択"

msgid "Take off worn item"
msgstr "着用中アイテムを脱ぐ"

msgid "Take out a few more before you die!"
msgstr "死ぬ前にもう何匹か倒しておけ！"

msgid "Take out dish"
msgstr "料理を取り出す"

msgid "Take screenshot"
msgstr "出力 - スクリーンショット撮影"

msgid "Take the anchor and leave the coin.  Do we have a deal?"
msgstr "アンカーを貰って、コインは置いておこう。これで取り引き成立かな？"

msgid "Take the anchor."
msgstr "5点法アンカーを貰っておこう。"

msgid "Take this USB drive.  Use the console, and download the software."
msgstr ""
"このUSBメモリを持って行ってくれ。目的地に着いたら端末を調べて、ソフトウェアをダウンロー"
"ドして欲しい。"

msgid ""
"Take this pet carrier; if you can get close to a cat, you can put it inside.  If "
"you're having problems, try befriending it with cat food."
msgstr ""
"ペットキャリーを使えば捕獲できる。ネコに近づけば中に入れられるはずだ。警戒しているよう"
"なら、キャットフードで仲良くなればいいよ。"

msgid "Take this thing, put it in that thing, and voila."
msgstr "これをそこに置いて、あれをそれに入れたら、はい出来上がり。"

msgid "Take your time, aim carefully."
msgstr "時間をかけて、慎重に照準を合わせろ。"

msgid "Takedown"
msgstr "テイクダウン"

msgid ""
"Taking a hit will not slow you down.  You will outlast your opponent and win this "
"fight.\n"
"\n"
"Bash damage increased by 25% of Strength, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 5 seconds."
msgstr ""
"攻撃を受けても動きは鈍りません。相手を長期戦に巻き込み勝利しましょう。\n"
"\n"
"筋力x25%の打撃与ダメージ上昇、筋力x50%のブロック時ダメージ軽減\n"
"5ターン継続"

msgid "Taking it easy (Stop what they are working on)"
msgstr "自由行動(作業の停止)"

msgid "Taking the basics of curdled milk and making it delicious."
msgstr "牛乳を凝固させる基本的な技術を応用して、チーズを美味しく仕上げます。"

msgid "Talk"
msgstr "話す"

msgid "Talk to %s"
msgstr "%sと会話する"

msgid ""
"Talk to Darius if you want to know about Darius.  He's a good man, and he won't bite-- "
"ugh, sorry, that's a turn of phrase we should probably retire, hey?  Anyway.  I don't "
"know if we'd have made it through the first days without him.  He gets a bit jumpy "
"around crowds since the riots though, so he's out watching our stuff."
msgstr ""
"ダリウスのことが知りたいなら、直接聞いてみればいい。いい奴だし、噛んだりしない...おっ"
"と、失礼、この発言は聞かなかったことにしてくれよ？ともかく、あいつがいなかったら、最初"
"の数日を無事に乗り切れた気がしない。暴動のせいで人混みがちょっと苦手だから、今は外で荷"
"物を見張ってくれてる。"

msgid "Talk to Smokes about finding Dave a place to call home."
msgstr "デイブの居場所についてスモークに相談する"

msgid ""
"Talk to one of the bosses about that.  You'd have to pay me to go back there though, "
"that's gonna be a hell of a job."
msgstr ""
"そういう話は上司にしてくれ。きっと大変な仕事だろうし、報酬を支払ってもらうことになるだ"
"ろうな。"

msgid "Talk to whom?"
msgstr "誰と話しますか？"

msgid "Talk to you later."
msgstr "後でまた話そう。"

msgid "Talk to…"
msgstr "会話..."

msgid "Talkative"
msgstr "お喋り"

msgid ""
"Talking to your friends for hours while having a couple drinks, just good times, until "
"you wake up alone and sober."
msgstr ""
"友人たちと酒を酌み交わしながら何時間も談笑し、ただただ楽しい時間を過ごす夢を見ました。"
"目を覚ますと友人たちも酔いも消えていました。"

msgid "Tall grass"
msgstr "草むら"

msgid ""
"Tall green stalks with what looks like hair growing out of nodes along its length.  "
"You're pretty sure this is corn."
msgstr ""
"背が高い緑色の植物の節々に、長い毛を生やした実がなっています。これは間違いなくトウモロ"
"コシですね。"

