msgid ""
"That's what the news said, anyway.  It was only about a 20-minute trip from my "
"apartment and sometimes I'd drive past it, so I was curious and I did some research "
"into it.  The only info I could find about it online said that it was a NASA lab for "
"computer research, but that was probably bullshit.  I mean, do you see any NASA "
"logos?  Sure, we got huge steel doors and 15-foot concrete walls, but not a logo in "
"sight.  The building probably goes underground, right?  It's way too small to be a "
"whole laboratory up here."
msgstr ""
"確かニュースで、そんなことを言ってたような。うちのアパートから車で20分程度だし、時々前"
"を通るから、気になって調べてみたんだ。ネット検索したら、NASAのコンピュータ研究所としか"
"出てこなかったが、きっとデタラメだ。NASAのロゴがどこにもないだろう？巨大な鉄のドアと4m"
"超のコンクリ壁は確かにある。でもロゴがない。活動拠点は地下にあるのかもな？研究所にして"
"は狭すぎる。"

msgid "That's where you took it from!"
