"This survivor has extensive experience in culinary arts, a professional chef or "
"equivalent."
msgstr "調理学についてプロのシェフと同等の様々な経験を積んでいます。"

msgid ""
"This survivor has extensive experience in electrical engineering: an EngD, extensive "
