msgid ""
"Turns out that ant meat you got us wasn't actually too bad.  A little tough, sure, but "
"perfectly edible.  The problem now is we need a way of preserving it.  One of those "
"portable charcoal smokers would be really great.  Heck, you might even wanna buy some."
msgstr ""
