msgstr "苦痛 *****"

msgid "Unbelievable"
msgstr "超屈強"

msgid "Unbound globally!"
msgstr "未割当(グローバル)！"

msgid "Unbound keys"
msgstr "未割当キー"

msgid "Unbound locally!"
msgstr "未割当(ローカル)！"

msgid "Unbound locally!  Underlying global."
msgstr "未割当(ローカル)！グローバル割当済"

msgid "Unbreakable"
msgstr "超屈強"

msgid "Uncanny Dodge"
msgstr "超回避システム"

msgid "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
msgid_plural "Uncanny Dodge CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 超回避システム"

msgid ""
"Uncle Sam's still kicking!  Yes, I was just as surprised as y'all listening probably "
"are.  That is, unless you happen to be an uncle named Sam, in which case I'm DJ "
"Dustbowl, this is my canine co-host, who's also Sam, and we want to tell you good job "
"for making it this far.  Jesus fuck, Sam, I think that was our most brain-dead intro.  "
"Anyways, moving swiftly along, members of the federal government are still out there, "
"folks.  Just this morning, a big old heli flew past, pretty as can be.  I managed to "
"hail them and found out that they were ferrying some supplies over to what they're "
"calling the \"Old Guard's First Fleet.\"  Tap some wood, people, but it sounds like a "
"bunch of Navy and private ships are tootling along the coastline, cruising and looking "
"to clear some safe zones."
msgstr ""
"アンクルサムは生きていた！ああ、ラジオを聴いてるみんなと同じ気持ちだよ。驚いたね。おっ"
"と、サムって名前の叔父さんのことじゃないぞ。こちらはDJダストボウル、隣にはアシスタント"
"犬、こいつの名前もサムだ。サム、本当によくここまで生き残っててくれたよ。なあサム、今ま"
"でで一番能天気なタイトルコールだったな。さて、早速本題に移ろう。アメリカ合衆国連邦政府"
"は今も生きている。ちょうど今朝、とにかく立派で大きなヘリが飛んでたんだ。どうにかしてヘ"
"リの連中と連絡を取ってみたら、「オールドガード第一艦隊」ってところに物資を運んでいる最"
"中だった。怪しいもんだよな。でもさ、どうやら海軍と民間の船が海岸線沿いに集まって、安全"
"地帯を探そうとしてるらしいんだ。"

msgid "Uncomfortable"
msgstr "着心地が悪い"

msgid "Uncomfortable gear"
msgstr "着用アイテムの着心地が悪い"

msgid ""
"Uncomfortable static forces you to ground yourself multiple times during your work."
msgstr "作業中に不快な静電気が何度も発生し、その度にアースを取る羽目になりました。"

msgid ""
"Uncountable jagged spikes, cleaving reality as they fly through its invisible seams."
msgstr ""
"鋭く尖った大量の棘が、空間上の見えない亀裂を通り抜け、現実世界に突き刺さろうとしていま"
"す。"

msgid "Undamaged"
msgstr "損傷なし"

msgid ""
"Undeath has not been kind to the children of the apocalypse.  This one is little more "
"than a reanimated membrane of skin stretched across tiny brittle bones."
msgstr ""
"この不死者は他の黙示録の申し子たちからも疎まれているようです。この個体はサイズが小さ"
"く、再生したばかりの皮膚が細く脆い骨によって引き延ばされています。"

msgid "Under Operation"
msgstr "手術中"

msgid "Under the Hood"
msgid_plural "copies of Under the Hood"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ボンネットの内部)"

msgid "Under the carapace of this mutant is a bristly, velcro-like material"
msgstr "この変異体の外殻の下には、マジックテープのような剛毛が生えています"

msgid ""
"Under the skin, crushing against the ribcage, you find a thick growth of flesh and "
"Kevlar formed from a mutated diaphragm."
msgstr ""
"胴体の皮膚の下には、変異した横隔膜とケブラー素材が分厚い装甲を形作っており、胸郭を押し"
"潰すように広がっています。"

msgid ""
"Under the stomach you notice a wrinkled fruit that you can't help but think somewhat "
"appetizing despite where you found it."
msgstr ""
"胃の中に皺だらけの果実が入っていました。こんなところに入っていたにもかかわらず、どこか"
"美味しそうに見えます。"

msgid "Under this pomegranate's spongy skin lie hundreds of fleshy seeds."
msgstr "スポンジ状の皮を剥くと、果肉を付けた何百もの種が入っています。"

msgid "Underbrush grows into a tree, and it pierces <npcname>'s %s!"
msgstr "足元の茂みが成長して<npcname>の%sを貫通しました！"

msgid "Underfed"
msgstr "栄養不足"

msgid "Underground"
msgstr "地下"

msgid "Underground spaces like basements or caves stay cool year-round."
msgstr "地下洞窟や地下室は年中涼しく過ごせます。"

msgid "Underlift Tow Truck"
msgstr "アンダーリフトレッカー車"

msgid ""
"Underneath the chitin you find bundles of small, floating pearls, each held in place "
"by a single strand of sinew"
msgstr ""
"キチン質の下には一本の腱が通っており、小さく不揃いな真珠粒のような物質がそれに連なるよ"
"うに実っています"

msgid ""
"Underneath the surface, there are small plates of chitin dotted about, much harder "
"than the rest"
msgstr ""
"外皮をめくると、他の部分よりもはるかに硬いキチン質の小さな装甲があちこちで見つかりまし"
"た"

msgid ""
"Understanding of man-made armors and ways to exploit them.  You're able to find "
"openings in certain kinds of body armor."
msgstr ""
"人工的な装甲の仕組みや弱点を理解しており、ボディアーマーなどの隙間を狙うことができま"
"す。"

msgid "Understood, <name_g>."
msgstr "承知した、<name_g>。"

msgid "Understood."
msgstr "理解したよ。"

msgid "Understood.  Back to business."
msgstr "よく分かった。私も参加できるか？"

msgid "Understood.  Can I join you?"
msgstr "よく分かった。私も参加できるか？"

msgid "Understood.  I'll get those antibiotics."
msgstr "分かった。抗生物質を手に入れる。"

msgid "Undertaker"
msgstr "葬儀屋"

msgid ""
"Underwater fishing device, this speargun has set of two rubber bands.  It doesn't make "
"you able to load two spears, but it can put a bit more power into shot.  While highly "
"effective when used underwater, it is nearly useless on dry land."
msgstr ""
"2本のゴムを使って水中で銛を発射する漁具です。銛を2本まとめて装填することはできません"
"が、威力は多少向上します。水中では非常に効果的ですが、陸上ではほとんど役に立ちません。"

msgid ""
"Underwear designed to be worn by women.  Preserves your modesty in desperate times."
msgstr "女性用の下着です。これを履けば、絶望的な時代でも淑やかさを維持できそうです。"

msgid "Underweight"
msgstr "痩せぎみ"

msgid "Undo move"
msgstr "元に戻す"

msgid "Uneasy"
msgstr "少し不安がある"

msgid "Unequip selected armor"
msgstr "選択アイテムを脱ぐ"

msgid "Unexplored"
msgstr "未探索"

msgid ""
"Unfermented Marloss wine.  A soft pinkish mess, made from Marloss berries.  It has a "
"strong aroma, but you're not quite sure if it's a good or bad one.  You need to put it "
"in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr ""
"発酵していないマーロスワインです。マーロスの果実から作られた薄桃色の液体からは強い香り"
"が漂っていますが、出来の良し悪しはよく分かりません。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented Mycus wine.  A goopy white mess, made from Mycus fruit.  It smells sweetly "
"of mushrooms.  You need to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr ""
"ミカズフルーツを原料とする、発酵前の濃厚な白ワインです。キノコの甘い香りがします。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented burdock wine.  A sticky mixture of water, sugar, yeast, and burdock "
"roots.  You need to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr ""
"ゴボウの根を使った未発酵のワインです。水と砂糖、酵母、ゴボウの根を混ぜて作った、粘り気"
"のある液体です。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented dandelion wine.  A sticky mixture of water, sugar, yeast, and dandelion "
"petals.  You need to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr ""
"タンポポの花を使った未発酵のワインです。水と砂糖、酵母、タンポポの花を混ぜて作った、粘"
"り気のある液体です。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented fruit wine.  A sweet, boiled juice made from berries or fruit.  You need "
"to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr "未発酵の果実酒です。果物やベリーの搾り汁を煮沸した甘いジュースです。"

msgid "Unfermented gin mash.  Fermenting it will produce gin."
msgstr "未発酵のジンです。発酵させると酒になります。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented homebrew beer.  A boiled and chilled mash of malted barley, spiced with "
"some fine hops.  You need to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr ""
"未発酵の自家醸造ビールです。大麦の麦芽もろみを煮沸してから冷やし、新鮮なホップで味を調"
"えました。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented hopped mead.  Diluted honey cooked with hops for a bitter note, then "
"cooled down and infused with yeast.  You need to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr ""
"未発酵のホップ入り蜂蜜酒です。希釈した蜂蜜をホップと共に煮込んで苦味を出し、冷やしてか"
"ら酵母を加えています。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented moonshine.  Just some water, sugar and corn, like good ol' auntie's "
"recipe.  Using pumpkin instead of corn would reduce the amount of extra sugar you need "
"to add.  You need to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr ""
"未発酵の自家醸造酒です。水と砂糖とトウモロコシしか使っていない、おばあちゃんが作る昔な"
"がらの酒です。トウモロコシの代わりにカボチャを使えば、砂糖の含有量を減らせます。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented pine wine.  A sticky mixture of water, sugar, yeast, and pine resin.  You "
"need to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr ""
"松脂を使った未発酵のワインです。水と砂糖、酵母、松脂を混ぜて作った、粘り気のある液体で"
"す。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented plain mead.  Diluted honey and yeast.  You need to put it in a fermenting "
"vat to brew it."
msgstr "希釈した蜂蜜に酵母を加えた、未発酵の蜂蜜酒です。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented rum.  Sugar caramel or molasses brewed into sweet water.  Basically a "
"saccharine soup.  You need to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr ""
"未発酵のラム酒です。カラメルと糖蜜を水に溶かして仕込んでいます。まだ単なる甘ったるい液"
"体です。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented seltzer.  A boiled and chilled mash of refined sugar and fruit.  You need "
"to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr "精製した砂糖と果物を煮詰めて冷やした、未発酵のハードセルツァーです。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented spiced mead.  Diluted honey infused with spices and yeast.  You need to "
"put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr "希釈した蜂蜜に酵母を加えた、未発酵の香辛料入り蜂蜜酒です。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented vodka.  Water with sugar from the enzymatic breakdown of malted grains, or "
"just added in pure form.  You need to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr ""
"発酵を終えていないウォッカです。酵素分解された麦芽や未分解の麦芽が混ざってできた甘い液"
"体です。"

msgid ""
"Unfermented whiskey.  The base of a fine drink.  Not the traditional preparation, but "
"you don't have the time.  You need to put it in a fermenting vat to brew it."
msgstr ""
"未発酵のウイスキーです。上質の酒を造る基礎になります。伝統的な仕込みの業も時間もないの"
"が残念です。"

msgid "Unfinished task: %s, %d%% complete"
msgstr "未完成のタスク: %s(%d%%)"

msgid "Unfinished task: %s, %d%% complete here, continue construction?"
msgstr "未完成のタスク: %s(%d%%)、建設を続けますか？"

msgid "Unfold"
msgstr "展開する"

msgid "Unfold Collapse"
msgstr "折り畳む"

msgid "Unfolded"
msgstr "展開する"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately the data you got was incomplete and mostly encrypted.  There may be a "
"way to get encryption codes, though.  I found a complaint by the infosec team that "
"they were unable to deliver critical security updates to one research site.  It was "
"some kind of more restricted secondary site hidden beneath a town, they weren't "
"allowed in.  That means it should have unsecured computers we can get the codes from.  "
"I couldn't secure any funding for this due to a lack of obvious results, but if you "
"believe in this enough, maybe we can convince them otherwise?"
msgstr ""
"残念ながら、入手できたデータのほとんどは暗号化されていて、不完全なものだった。でも、暗"
"号化コードを探し出す方法があるかもしれない。セキュリティ上重要なアップデートを送信でき"
"なかったという情報セキュリティ班からの苦情を見つけたんだ。問題のコンピュータは、街外れ"
"にある秘匿された予備システムのことらしい。つまり、暗号化コードを盗み出せるセキュリティ"
"保護の弱い端末がそこにあるって事さ。"

msgid "Unfortunately they were overpowered by the undead…  I'm sorry."
msgstr "スカベンジャー部隊は不運にも敵の数に圧倒されてしまったようだ...残念ながら。"

msgid "Unfortunately you don't have anything sharp to place an inscription on the grave."
msgstr "残念ながら、墓に文字を刻める鋭い道具を所持していません。"

msgid "Unfortunately your device is not waterproof."
msgstr "残念ながらこのデバイスは防水ではありません。"

msgid "Unfortunately, I don't have anything that can help."
msgstr "残念ながら、お役に立てそうにないね。"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately, I'm still gathering resources and cooking new stuff.  Maybe ask again "
"after <interval>."
msgstr ""
"残念ながら、まだ素材を集めて作ってるところだよ。<interval>後にまた来て貰えるかな。"

msgid ""
"Unfortunately, some responsible killjoy poured concrete in the barrel of this historic "
"cannon to make it safe for display."
msgstr ""
"心無い責任者が砲身にコンクリートを注ぎ込んでしまったため、この歴史的な大砲は安全な状態"
"で展示されています。"

msgid "Unfreq: "
msgstr "中確率: "

msgid "Unhappy"
msgstr "不満"

msgid "Unhealthy"
msgstr "HP"

msgid "Unhindered"
msgstr "全力攻撃"

msgid "Unicycle"
msgstr "一輪車"

msgid "Unidentified Illness"
msgstr "正体不明の病"

msgid "Unified Power Supply"
msgstr "UPS"

msgid "Unified Power System"
msgstr "統合電源システム"

msgid "Unified Power System CBM"
msgid_plural "Unified Power System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 統合電源システム"

msgid "Uniform Boy"
msgid_plural "copies of Uniform Boy"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/ユニフォームの少年)"

msgid "Uninstall weapon"
msgstr "武器を取り付ける"

msgid "Unique Id: %s"
