msgid ""
"Unique, adaptable, and extremely retro, the Kel-Tec P50 is a truly bizarre semi-"
"automatic pistol.  Having been regarded as possibly one of the most innovative "
"firearms from Kel-Tec's entire line-up of guns, the P50 makes use of the high velocity "
"5.7x28mm cartridge, and feeds from standard FN P90 magazines.  Boasting ambidextrous "
"controls, an AR-15-like T-shaped charging handle, and a reload which involves swinging "
"the receiver and barrel assemblies up and away from the frame to insert the magazine "
"horizontally over the grip, this weapon lends a decidedly retro-futuristic touch to "
"almost any situation."
msgstr ""
"デザインが独特で、融通が利き、非常にレトロな外観をした、実に奇妙なセミオートピストルで"
"す。ケルテック社の全製品の中でも革新的な銃とされるP50は、5.7x28mm高速弾を標準的なFN P90"
"弾倉から糾弾します。利き手を問わない操作部、AR-15に似たT字型のチャージングハンドル、レ"
"シーバーと銃身を開いて弾倉をグリップと水平に装填する方式など、各要素からレトロフュー"
"チャーな雰囲気が漂っています。"

