"run the show here, but I try to stay out of those politics and just focus on building "
"stuff.  I don't see much good coming of it.  Alonso is fine, he's clearly interested "
"in me, and also in every other single person here.  Not my thing, in a group this "
"small.  John is a walking stereotype, I imagine there must be more depth to him, but I "
"haven't seen it yet."
