msgid "What about the pregnancy?"
msgstr "妊娠していた奥さんはどうなったんだ？"

msgid ""
"What about the rooftop?  There's a stair access there, I can see it from outside, and "
"he'd probably be able to do a bit of a lookout job."
msgstr ""
"屋上はどうだろう？階段で行き来できるし、外も見えるから、デイブを見張りとして働かせるこ"
"ともできる。"

msgid "What about the woman you mentioned - Brigitte - what happened to her?"
msgstr "そのブリジットという女性はどうなったんだ？"

msgid "What about things other than zombies?"
msgstr "ゾンビ以外の敵については？"

msgid "What about when the goods dry up?  Won't that happen eventually?"
msgstr "物資はいつか枯渇するだろう？そうしたらどうするんだ？"

msgid "What about when things went bad?"
msgstr "ゾンビ以外の敵については？"

msgid "What about you, how're you doing?"
msgstr "あなたの調子はどう？"

msgid "What about you, what's your story?"
msgstr "あなたの話を聞かせてもらえる？"

msgid "What about your family, stuff like that?"
msgstr "あなたの家族はどうしているんだ？"

msgid "What about your helicopter?"
msgstr "シェルターは今どうなっているんだ？"

msgid "What about your parents?"
msgstr "両親はどうしている？"

msgid "What about your shelter?"
msgstr "シェルターは今どうなっているんだ？"

msgid "What am I getting out of this?"
msgstr "報酬は貰えるのか？"

msgid ""
"What appeared to be insect hairs on the chitin of this creature look more like tiny "
"feathers as you pare them back.  Inside is a bundle of bubble-like tissue sacs that "
"appear to be floating, which doesn't fit with what you know about real bees."
msgstr ""
"この生物に生えていたキチン質の毛のような素材を剥がすと、非常に小さな羽のような形をして"
"いることが分かります。体内には、浮遊しているように見える泡のような塊があり、よく知るハ"
"チが持っている一般的な器官だとは思えません。"

msgid ""
"What appears to be a single, enormous insect with a swollen abdomen is actually the "
"unholy union of two dragonflies in the act of mating, bodies still locked into the "
"telltale heart shape.  The remains of their wings and abdomens form an egg sac they "
"sluggishly pull between them, periodically dropping a handful of glistening eggs."
msgstr ""
"腹部が膨らんだ単一の巨大な昆虫のように見えますが、実際には2匹のトンボが交尾している姿で"
"あり、それぞれが連結してハート型を形作っています。翅と腹部の辺りから卵嚢がダラダラと出"
"てきており、定期的に艶やかな卵塊を生み落とします。"

msgid "What are the advantages of being a dorm leader?"
msgstr "寮監になって良かったことは？"

msgid "What are they hiding?"
msgstr "非公開情報"

msgid "What are you actually trying to accomplish?"
msgstr "何を目指していたんだ？"

msgid "What are you doing here?"
msgstr "ここで何をしているんだ？"

msgid "What are you doing in this deathtrap?"
msgstr "こんな危険な場所で何をしているんだ？"

msgid "What are you doing out here?"
msgstr "ここで何をしている？"

msgid "What are you doing?"
msgstr "何をしているんだ？"

msgid "What are you going to do with all that cardboard now?"
msgstr "これからその段ボール箱をどうするつもりだ？"

msgid ""
"What are you going to do with that back bay area now that I've cleaned it out for you?"
msgstr "建物の裏手の区画は掃除したが、今後あそこで何をするつもりなんだ？"

msgid "What are you planning on doing in the future?"
msgstr "これから先はどうするつもりなんだ？"

msgid "What are you shopping for?"
msgstr "何か目当ての商品があるのか？"

msgid "What are you up to?"
msgstr "何をしようとしているんだ？"

msgid "What are you working on?"
msgstr "どんな仕事を任されているんだ？"

msgid "What are your other ideas?"
msgstr "他にはどんな考えがある？"

msgid "What are your parents like?"
msgstr "ご両親はどんな人なんだ？"

msgid "What are your plans after <the_cataclysm>?"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>後は何をしようと思っている？"

msgid ""
"What better choice do you have?  It's not like it would be just you and me, the others "
"out here can come too."
msgstr "他に良い方法があるか？あなただけじゃない。ここにいる他の人も一緒に来ればいい。"

msgid ""
"What birds eat.  Mainly made of seeds, silage or legumes.  It's perfect for small "
"birds."
msgstr "鳥用の餌です。主成分は種子や牧草、マメ科の草であり、小鳥に最適の飼料です。"

msgid "What brings you around here?"
msgstr "何か用があって来たのか？"

msgid "What brings you around here?  We don't see a lot of new faces."
msgstr "どうやってここへ来たの？新顔なんて珍しいわね。"

msgid "What brought you here?"
msgstr "どうしてここに来たんだ？"

msgid "What came of it?"
msgstr "それから何が起きたんだ？"

msgid "What can I do for you, <name_g>?"
msgstr "<name_g>、何か用か？"

msgid "What can I do for you?"
msgstr "ご用件は？"

msgid "What can I do to help you out?"
msgstr "何を手伝えばいいんだ？"

msgid "What can I do ya for?"
msgstr "何か用か？"

msgid "What can I help you with?"
msgstr "私に何か用か？"

msgid "What can you sell me?"
msgstr "何を売ってくれるんだ？"

msgid "What can you sew?"
msgstr "何が作れるんだ？"

msgid "What can you tell me about what they were doing there?"
msgstr "恐竜について教えて？"

msgid ""
"What cattle eat.  Mainly made of grass, silage or legumes.  It's perfect for ruminants."
msgstr ""
"ウシ用の餌です。主成分は牧草とイネ科やマメ科の草であり、反芻動物に最適の飼料です。"

msgid "What cause is that?  What do you do with the bones?"
msgstr "何が原因なんだ？あなた達は骨を使って何をしている？"

msgid ""
"What color the minimap background should be.  Either based on color theme or (0,0,0) "
"black."
msgstr "ミニマップの背景色を、色テーマに応じた色か黒(0,0,0)のどちらかに設定します。"

msgid "What could I possibly have that could help?"
msgstr "困ってるんだ、どうにかならないか？"

