msgstr "最近も幻覚を見るのか？"

msgid "What do you think about Helena?"
msgstr "ヘレナのことをどう思う？"

msgid "What do you think happened to the world?"
msgstr "この世界に何が起こったと思う？"

msgid "What do you think happened?"
msgstr "自分の身に何が起こったと思う？"

msgid ""
"What do you think happened?  You must have some interesting theories on why everything "
"went to shit."
msgstr ""
"世界に何が起きたと思う？何故こんな酷い事態になったのか、あなたは面白そうな理論を語って"
"くれそうだ。"

msgid "What do you think happened?  You see them around anywhere?"
msgstr "一体何が起きたんだろう？他の場所でもそいつらを見かけた？"

msgid "What do you think the Cataclysm even was?"
msgstr "結局大変動って何だったんだろうな？"

msgid "What do you think the president is doing right now?"
msgstr "今、大統領は何をしてると思う？"

msgid "What do you trade?"
msgstr "何を取引しているんだい？"

msgid "What do you want me to teach?"
msgstr "何を教えればいい？"

msgid "What do you want to change:"
msgstr "変更: "

msgid "What do you want to consume?"
msgstr "消費するアイテムを選択"

msgid "What do you want to do?"
msgstr "何をしますか？"

msgid "What do you want to emote?  (This will have no in-game effect!)"
msgstr "身振りを入力(ゲーム内での効果はありません！)"

msgid "What do you want to play?"
msgstr "どれをプレイしますか？"

msgid "What do you wish to learn?"
msgstr "何を確認しますか？"

msgid "What does LIXA even mean?"
msgstr "どんな酒がある？"

msgid "What does a dorm leader do exactly?"
msgstr "寮監は具体的にどんな仕事をするんだ？"

msgid "What doesn't kill you, makes you stranger"
msgstr "死ぬような目にあった奴はイカレる"

msgid "What else do you have available?"
msgstr "他の話題はある？"

msgid "What exactly did he do?"
msgstr "彼は具体的に何をしたんだ？"

