msgstr "そんな嘘をついて何になる？"

msgid "What good does this do us?"
msgstr "そんな嘘をついて何になる？"

msgid "What good is this?"
msgstr "そんな嘘をついて何になる？"

msgid "What got you out of the house?"
msgstr "どうして家を出たんだ？"

msgid "What got you out of the subway?"
msgstr "何故地下鉄路線から外へ出たんだ？"

msgid "What got you out of the woods?"
msgstr "どうして森から出たんだ？"

msgid "What got you out of there?"
msgstr "どうして家を出たんだ？"

msgid ""
"What had you working at the university bookstore in the first place?  Are you an "
"academic yourself?"
msgstr "そもそも、大学の本屋で何の仕事をしていたんだ？学者だったのか？"

msgid "What happened after that?"
msgstr "その後どうなったんだ？"

msgid "What happened after the acid mist?"
msgstr "酸性ガスが漂った後はどうなったんだ？"

msgid "What happened in Newport?"
msgstr "ニューポートで何があったんだ？"

msgid "What happened next?"
msgstr "それからどうなったんだ？"

msgid "What happened on your sick day?"
msgstr "病欠した日に何が起きたんだ？"

msgid "What happened then?"
msgstr "それからどうなったんだ？"

msgid "What happened to Barry?"
msgstr "バリーに何があったんだ？"

msgid "What happened to the other crash survivors?"
msgstr "一緒にいた他の生存者はどうなったんだ？"

msgid "What happened to the others that made it?"
msgstr "一緒に脱出した他の人はどうなったんだ？"

msgid "What happened to you after that?"
msgstr "その後どうなったんだ？"

msgid "What happened to you?"
msgstr "それからどうなったんだ？"

msgid "What happened to your friend?"
msgstr "あなたの友達はどうしたんだ？"

msgid "What happened to your original crew?"
msgstr "君の仲間に何があったんだ？"

msgid "What happened when you went out?"
msgstr "出掛けてからは何があったんだ？"

msgid "What happened with your leadership run?"
msgstr "リーダーになってから何があった？"

msgid "What happened with your professor job?"
msgstr "教授の仕事はどうなったんだ？"

msgid "What happened?"
msgstr "何があったんだ？"

msgid ""
"What happened?  I'm not really sure.  You must know about the riots and all that, that "
"the leadership totally failed to contain.  I don't have a good guess what caused "
"that.  I thought it was the usual stuff at first, and I gotta admit, I was sort of "
"excited and scared it was the start of a revolution.  Not excited enough to join in "
"though, and I guess anyone who was is probably dead now.  I tried to wait it alone, "
"packed a little bag, but I saw a rioter get back up and fight with crazy injuries.  I "
"don't know how many people really believed it at first, but I took that as my sign and "
"ran for a nearby cave I knew.  I don't know exactly what happened after that.  I "
"thought others would be there but it was just me."
msgstr ""
"何があったかって？よく分からないな。知っての通り、指導者は暴動なんかを含めたあらゆる騒"
"動を完全に抑え込めなかった。原因はよく分からない。最初はよくある事だと思ったけど、そう"
"じゃなかったんだ。ちょっと興奮したし、革命の始まりだと思って恐ろしくもなった。でも参加"
"しようと考えるほど熱狂もしなかった。もし参加したら死んでいただろうね。とりあえず自宅に"
"籠って、小さな鞄を用意していた時、酷い傷を負って倒れた暴徒が立ち上がってそのまま暴れ出"
"したのを見てしまったんだ。初めてそれを見て信じた奴がどれだけいるのかは知らないが、それ"
"がきっかけで、私は街を捨てて近所の洞窟へ向かった。その後何が起きたのかは、正確には分か"
"らない。洞窟には他の人も来ていると思ったのに、誰もいなかったんだ。"

msgid ""
"What happens beyond death might be a mystery to the unlearned, but with careful use of "
"a crystal ball, available for purchase on our website, you too can see beyond the veil."
msgstr ""
"死後の世界について一般人は何も知りませんが、著者のサイトで販売している水晶玉を使うこと"
"で、誰でもベールの向こう側を見られるようになります。"

msgid "What has made you friends with Dana, Draco, and Aleesha?"
msgstr "ダナ、ドラコ、アリーシャとは何がきっかけで仲良くなったんだ？"

msgid "What have you found out?"
msgstr "何か発見はありましたか？"

msgid "What have you lost, if it's okay for me to ask?"
msgstr "もし差し支えないなら、失ったものについて聞かせてくれないか？"

msgid "What if I want to hurt you?  I'm so good at it and I've had so much practice."
msgstr "危害を加えたいと言ったらどうする？たくさん練習してきたから、腕には自信がある。"

msgid "What if I want you to build an organized camp?"
msgstr "拠点を作ってほしい場合はどうすればいい？"

msgid ""
"What if he is right?  Maybe what you do isn't enough and he's the only one to do what "
"it takes."
msgstr ""
"もし彼が正しかったとしたら？きっとあなたの手法では不十分なんだ。やるべきことをしている"
"のは彼だ。"

msgid "What if you're wrong?"
msgstr "もしあなたの意見が間違っていたとしたら？"

msgid "What if, I just took one more?"
msgstr "もう一回だけ、摂取してみたらどうだろう？"

msgid "What in blazes is this?"
msgstr "何だこれ？"

msgid ""
"What is 'up'?  Less than I would like, it seems.  I am better when I am busy, and I am "
"not at all busy."
msgstr ""
"調子はどう、だって？思ってた以上に最悪って感じだな。忙しければ気も紛れるだろうが、ここ"
"最近は暇で仕方がない。"

msgid "What is a forest for a man with an axe?"
msgstr "斧を持った人間にとっての森とは何でしょうか？"

msgid "What is it, friend?"
msgstr "何だい、友よ？"

msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "何だい？"

msgid "What is making that sound?  I can hear"
msgstr "何の音だ？今聞こえたのは"

msgid "What is that noise?"
msgstr "何の音だ？"

msgid "What is the Decalogue?"
msgstr "十戒とは何だ？"

msgid "What is the maximum stack size to unload?"
msgstr "抜き取るアイテムの最大量を設定(推奨値20)"

msgid "What is this place?"
msgstr "この場所は何？"

msgid "What is this robot, and what does it look like?"
msgstr "そのロボットはどこの製品で、どんな外見なんだ？"

msgid "What is this unbearable sound!?"
msgstr "この耳障りな音は何だ！？"

msgid "What is your job here?"
msgstr "ここで何の仕事をしているんだ？"

msgid "What kind of board games do you play?"
msgstr "どんなボードゲームで遊ぶんだ？"

msgid "What kind of gaps?"
msgstr "足りないものというのは？"

msgid "What kind of jobs do you have for me?"
msgstr "何か頼みたい仕事はあるか？"

msgid "What kind of news?"
msgstr "どんな話を聞いた？"

msgid "What kind of stuff was in the evidence lockup?"
msgstr "証拠保管室にはどんなものがあったんだ？"

msgid "What kind of tasks do you have for me?"
msgstr "何か頼みたい仕事はあるか？"

msgid "What kind of work are you looking for?"
msgstr "どんな仕事を探しているんだ？"

msgid ""
"What looks to be a loose mass of worm-like appendages reveals a solid body beneath, a "
"great maw of rows of serrated fangs taking up most of the body.  It is either very "
"lethargic or stalking prey, sitting in place without much obvious motion."
msgstr ""
"ワームのような紐状の肉塊が落ちていますが、その下には鋸歯状の牙を大量に生やした大口をも"
"つ強力な本体が潜んでいます。まったくその場で動かないか、目立たないようじわじわと獲物に"
"忍び寄るように動きます。"

msgid "What made that noise?"
msgstr "何の音がしたんだ？"

msgid "What made this trailer so good?"
msgstr "このトレーラーは性能がいいのか？"

msgid "What made you come back?"
msgstr "何がきっかけで正気に戻ったんだ？"

msgid ""
"What may once have been a dog is now a grotesquely swollen monstrosity, standing on "
"four limbs as wide as trash cans and showing massive, jagged teeth."
msgstr ""
"かつてはイヌだった生物が、今ではゴミ箱ほどの太さの四肢と巨大で鋭い歯を見せつける、膨れ"
"上がった恐ろしい怪物に変貌しています。"

msgid "What needs killing?"
msgstr "何を倒せばいいんだ？"

msgid "What needs to be done?"
msgstr "何をすればいい？"

msgid "What nightmare?"
msgstr "悪夢とは？"

msgid ""
"What passes for blood in this creature is a clear fluid, but there isn't a lot of it "
"outside of sacs distributed around the body."
msgstr ""
"この死体の体内には、血液の代わりに透明な液体が流れていたようです。体中に点在している嚢"
"の内部によく溜まっています。"

msgid ""
"What proof do you have <name_b>?  Nothing is what you got, and your the only one here "
"who's full of shit."
msgstr ""
"証拠はどこにあるんだ、<name_b>？証拠もなしに難癖を付けるなんて、詐欺師はどっちだってん"
"だ。"

msgid "What questions do you have?"
msgstr "何かご質問が？"

msgid ""
"What remains of a researcher lost to the portal storms, twisted and enervated by the "
"presences that lurk beneath natural perception.  It unnaturally skitters on four bone-"
"plated spikes, its every motion trailing an aura of energetic distortion."
msgstr ""
"ポータルの嵐に屈した研究者の死体が、通常の知覚の裏に隠れた存在によって歪められ蘇りまし"
"た。骨の鎧を纏った4本の爪を使って異常に素早く動き回っており、その軌跡には歪んだ強烈な"
"オーラが残ります。"

msgid ""
"What remains of a researcher lost to the portal storms, twisted and enervated by the "
"presences that lurk beneath natural perception.  It walks and stumbles in a stuttered "
"manner, and is granted tenuous corporality only by grace of the experimental gear it "
"wore when it died."
msgstr ""
"ポータルの嵐に屈した研究者の死体が、通常の知覚の裏に隠れた存在によって歪められ蘇りまし"
"た。時折つまづきながらフラフラと歩き、生前に装着していた実験装置の恩恵によってなんとか"
"肉体を維持しています。"

msgid "What should I expect to go up against?"
msgstr "現場でどんなことを想定しておくべき？"

msgid "What should be worked on?"
msgstr "何の作業を指示しますか？"

msgid "What should we do now?"
msgstr "何をすればいいんだろう？"

msgid "What song?"
msgstr "何の歌だ？"

msgid "What sort of \"evidence\" did you have in mind?"
msgstr "どんな「証拠」を持ってきたらいい？"

msgid "What sort of changes have you seen?"
msgstr "どんな変化が見つかったんだ？"

msgid "What sort of defenses do you want?"
msgstr "どのように防御を固めるつもりなんだ？"

msgid "What sort of ideas does Chris have?"
msgstr "クリスはどう思っているんだ？"

msgid ""
"What the gas mask does should be obvious; we'll provide you with a cartridge, of "
"course.  The environment suit is full-body, and protects you from water, harmful "
"radiation, and environmental hazards.  It's also rated to protect from electric shocks "
"of up to twelve thousand volts.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Bear in mind that the suit isn't armor.  It will keep you safe from the environment, "
"but it's just Nomex and it won't protect you from anything stronger than a punch.  The "
"modular defense system is designed to fit over it, so I'd urge you to bring them both "
"if fighting is unavoidable."
msgstr ""
"ガスマスクの機能は知ってるだろう。もちろん、フィルターも用意してある。環境防護スーツは"
"全身を覆い、水や有害な放射線、化学物質から肉体を守るスーツだ。最大1万2000Vの電撃も防い"
"でくれる。」\n"
"\n"
"「忘れないでほしいのが、このスーツは防具じゃないってことだ。環境防護機能はあるが、ノー"
"メックス製だから、ただのパンチより強い衝撃からは身を守れない。モジュラーディフェンスシ"
"ステムを上に着用できる作りになっているから、戦闘が避けられない場合は併用するといい。"

msgid "What the heck is a merch?"
msgstr "マーチとは一体何だ？"

msgid "What the heck.  How's life been treating you?"
msgstr "そりゃいいや。最近調子はどう？"

msgid "What the hell are you talking about?"
msgstr "一体何のことを言っている？"

msgid "What time is it?"
msgstr "今何時？"

msgid "What to do with %s?"
msgstr "%sに何をしますか？"

msgid "What to do with camera?"
msgstr "カメラ操作"

msgid "What to do with template \"%s\"?"
msgstr "テンプレート「%s」をどうしますか？"

msgid "What to do with the %s?"
msgstr "%sをどうしますか？"

msgid "What to do with the %s?%s"
msgstr "%s管理 %s"

msgid "What to do with the %s?%s%s"
msgstr "%s管理 %s%s"

msgid "What to do with the existing module?"
msgstr "既存のモジュールはどうしますか？"

msgid "What to do with the mill?"
msgstr "製粉機操作"

msgid "What to do with the radio control?"
msgstr "無線制御装置設定"

msgid "What to do with the remote vehicle control:"
msgstr "車両遠隔操作: "

msgid "What to do with the smoking rack:"
msgstr "燻製ラック操作:"

msgid "What to do with your %s?"
msgstr "%sをどうしますか？"

msgid ""
"What to do with your %s?\n"
"Hunger: Famished"
msgstr ""
"%sの世話\n"
"給餌: 飢餓"

msgid ""
"What to do with your %s?\n"
"Hunger: Full"
msgstr ""
"%sの世話\n"
"給餌: 満腹"

msgid ""
"What to do with your %s?\n"
"Hunger: Hungry"
msgstr ""
"%sの世話\n"
"給餌: 空腹"

msgid "What to do with your activated RC car?"
msgstr "ラジコンカー操作"

msgid "What was <the_cataclysm> like for you?"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>はどんな状況だった？"

msgid "What was it like, at the beginning?"
msgstr "最初の頃はどんな感じだったんだ？"

msgid "What was it like, surviving out there with an injury?"
msgstr "ケガをした状態でどうやって生き残ったんだ？"

msgid "What was it that 'broke' you?"
msgstr "何が原因で「壊れてしまった」んだ？"

msgid "What was it you said before?"
msgstr "大変動が起きた時、あなたはどうしていたんだっけ？"

msgid "What was it you said earlier?"
msgstr "以前は何と言っていたっけ？"

msgid "What was it you were saying before?"
msgstr "前に言っていた話は何だったかな？"

msgid ""
"What was once a child has bent and twisted into a bloated carcass with blackened skin "
"and massive bloodshot eyes"
msgstr ""
"かつては子供だった、黒い皮膚と巨大な目玉を持つ突然変異獣です。この醜悪で下劣な化け物"
"は、まるで嘲笑する人間のような顔つきをしています。"

msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing foil has had its electrical plunger assembly "
"removed and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still lacks a cutting "
"edge, it is now somewhat more lethal, yet still familiar to the practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"ほとんど有害性のなかったフルーレから電気スイッチを取り外し、先端を粗く尖らせました。完"
"璧な刺突武器には至っていませんが、威力がやや増して実戦でも多少は役に立つでしょう。"

msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing saber has had its rounded tip snapped off and "
"has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still lacks a cutting edge, it is "
"now considerably more lethal, yet still familiar to the practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"ほとんど有害性のなかったサーブルから電気スイッチを取り外し、丸まった先端を切断して粗く"
"尖らせました。完璧な刺突武器には至っていませんが、威力がかなり増して実戦でも多少は役に"
"立つでしょう。"

msgid ""
"What was once a mostly-harmless fencing épée has had its electrical plunger assembly "
"removed and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still lacks a cutting "
"edge, it is now considerably more lethal, yet still familiar to the practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"ほとんど有害性のなかったエペから電気スイッチを取り外し、先端を粗く尖らせました。完璧な"
"刺突武器には至っていませんが、威力がかなり増して実戦でも多少は役に立つでしょう。"

msgid ""
"What was once a service member has been lost to the madness that devoured the world.  "
"Tense, dirty hands grip a combat knife as their bloodshot eyes scan for threats."
msgstr ""
"この狂人は高度な訓練を受けた軍人のようです。軍服の上から装甲付きベストを身に着け、汚れ"
"が付着しこわばった手でコンバットナイフを握り、血走った目で辺りの脅威を探っています。"

msgid ""
"What was once a small shrub has grown wild, each of its branches twisting into "
"delicate glass spirals."
msgstr "小さなガラスの低木が野放図に成長し、枝は螺旋を描くように細く伸びています。"

msgid ""
"What was once a wonderfully addictive tube of dried tobacco leaf is now just a smelly "
"piece of trash.  What a tragedy!\n"
"The leftover tobacco in a few of these could probably be used to roll another "
"cigarette.  If you're willing to go that far…"
msgstr ""
"かつては非常に中毒性の高いタバコの葉を包んだ筒だったものです。悲しい事に今や唯のゴミで"
"しかありません！\n"
"しかし、燃え残った部分をいくつか纏めれば、新たに一本のタバコを作り出せます。そこまでし"
"て吸う価値があるのでしょうか..."

msgid "What was that about cardboard?"
msgstr "段ボールの話は何だっけ？"

msgid ""
"What was that old advertisement?  'Paint the planet'?  That might be a good long-term "
"goal, but for now…"
msgstr ""
"昔の広告だかで「惑星を水で満たそう」みたいなのがあったような？現状では、ちょうど良い長"
"期目標になりそうですね..."

msgid "What was that?"
msgstr "何だ？"

msgid "What was that?  Oh god, oh god!"
msgstr "今の音は？ああ、勘弁してほしいな！"

msgid "What was the Cataclysm like for you?"
msgstr "大変動が起きた時はどんな感じだった？"

msgid "What was working for the Free Merchants like?"
msgstr "自由商人に雇われていた頃はどんな仕事をしていたんだ？"

msgid "What was working for the Old Guard like?"
msgstr "オールドガードに雇われていた頃はどんな仕事をしていたんだ？"

msgid "What was your father like?"
msgstr "あなたのお父さんはどんな人だったんだ？"

msgid "What went wrong with your staging area?"
msgstr "その区画は何が不味いんだ？"

msgid "What were they here for?"
msgstr "3人組は何をしに来たんだ？"

msgid "What were you doing before all of this?"
msgstr "前の話をもう一度聞かせてもらえないかな？"

msgid "What were you in for in the first place?"
msgstr "そもそも何の罪を犯したんだ？"

msgid "What were you in for?"
msgstr "何の罪だったんだ？"

msgid "What were you saying about goop?"
msgstr "ドロドロについての考えをもう一度聞かせて？"

msgid "What were you saying before that?"
msgstr "前の話をもう一度聞かせてもらえないかな？"

msgid "What were you saying before?"
msgstr "さっきの話をもう一度聞かせてもらえないか？"

msgid "What were you studying?"
msgstr "何の研究をしていたんだ？"

msgid "What were your dreams?"
msgstr "どんな夢を見たんだ？"

msgid "What will it do for me?"
msgstr "どんな機能がある装備品なんだ？"

msgid "What will you do then?"
msgstr "これからどうするんだ？"

msgid "What will you do, then?"
msgstr "それで、これからどうするんだ？"

msgid "What would it cost to hire you?"
msgstr "雇いたい。報酬はいくら要る？"

msgid "What would you do for some coke, right now?"
msgstr "今すぐコカインをキメたいとは思いませんか？"

msgid "What would you like to discuss?"
msgstr "何か用か？"

msgid "What would you like to do?"
msgstr "御用は何ですか？"

msgid "What would you like to teach?"
msgstr "何を教えたい？"

msgid "What would you like?"
msgstr "用事は何だ？"

msgid ""
"What you saw as a homogenous light from a distance was the result of myriad strands of "
"glowing chitin crisscrossing just beneath the carapace"
msgstr ""
"甲羅が単色で光っているように見えた原因は、甲羅の下で絡み合っている無数の輝くキチンの糸"
"でした"

msgid ""
"What you think are muscles aren't too dissimilar from that of animals, if you're "
"looking at it from a very general perspective and disregard the pale color and rubbery "
"texture."
msgstr ""
"体内には筋肉のような物質が残っていますが、淡い色をしたゴムのような質感の肉は、一般的な"
"動物の筋肉とは全くの別物です。"

msgid ""
"What you thought was shuddering chitinous fuzz on the creature's back is, in reality, "
"thousands of miniature copies of its main wings, flapping in unison"
msgstr ""
"死体の背中にある毛の生えたキチン質が震えているように見えましたが、よく見ると主翼と寸分"
"違わぬ微小なコピーが一斉に羽ばたいていました"

msgid ""
"What you thought were black veins under the skin are actually some sort of elastic "
"net, snapping apart with a loud \"TWANG\" when your tool cuts them"
msgstr ""
"皮下に張り巡らされていた黒い管は伸縮性のあるネットのような作りになっており、道具を当て"
"ると、「ビィン」と大きな音を立てて切れました"

msgid "What'd you do?"
msgstr "それからどうしたんだ？"

msgid "What'll ya have?"
msgstr "何にする？"

msgid "What's a Transistor?"
msgid_plural "copies of What's a Transistor?"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/トランジスタとは？)"

msgid ""
"What's better than a hot dog?  A hot dog smothered in ground meat and chopped onions, "
"of course!"
msgstr ""
"ホットドッグより美味しいものは？そう、挽肉と刻んだタマネギをたっぷり挟んだホットドッグ"
"です！"

msgid "What's boudin?"
msgstr "ブーディンって何？"

msgid "What's for dinner?"
msgstr "晩御飯は何？"

msgid "What's going on over there?"
msgstr "そこで何が起きているんだ？"

msgid "What's going on?  Like, big picture, what the hell happened?"
msgstr "どうなってるんだ？世界で何が起きているんだ？"

msgid "What's hangin'?"
msgstr "ああ、調子はどう？"

msgid "What's happening?"
msgstr "何が起きたんだ？"

msgid ""
"What's in that RV of yours?  Couldn't be anything you need, so hand over your stuff."
msgstr "そのキャンピングカーに何を積んでいる？もう不要だろ、こっちに寄越せ。"

msgid "What's in the safe?"
msgstr "金庫の中身は何だ？"

msgid "What's it like living here?"
msgstr "ここでの生活はどんな感じ？"

msgid ""
"What's left of some zombie's limb.  Most likely a leg based on the proportions.  "
"Though it's rotted, there is quite a bit of meat still on it."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビの肢の残骸です。形状から見て脚かもしれません。腐ってはいるものの、まだ肉がかなり"
"残っています。"

msgid ""
"What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton and "
"armor of a police bot."
msgstr ""
"警官ロボットから全ての稼働部品と電子機器を取り除いて残った、骨組みと装甲部品です。"

msgid ""
"What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the skeleton of a "
"turret."
msgstr "タレットから全ての稼働部品と電子機器を取り除いて残った骨組みです。"

msgid "What's left when you strip an android body from its components."
msgstr "人型ロボットから全ての部品を取り除いて残った骨格です。"

msgid "What's next on the list?"
msgstr "リストには何が必要と書いてあるんだ？"

msgid "What's on your mind?"
msgstr "どうした？"

msgid "What's that about activities?  Like what, you can farm for me?"
msgstr "色々な作業って？例えば、農作業はできる？"

msgid "What's that about giving instructions?"
msgstr "どうやって指示を出したらいいんだ？"

msgid "What's that about training?"
msgstr "訓練とは何だ？"

msgid "What's that noise?"
msgstr "何の音だ？"

msgid "What's that sound?"
msgstr "何の音？"

msgid "What's that sound?  I heard"
msgstr "何の音だ？今聞こえたのは"

msgid ""
"What's the alternative?  You take the hand you're dealt.  I've given eulogies for two "
"of the people I love most on this earth, and the third wrote me off.  I've already "
"been through the end of the world.  Came out the other side with my bits intact.  And "
"you know, I've been pretty lonely since my wife passed.  Here I've got friends.  We "
"might be hungry but we're close.  Reena's been teaching me math and science, Luo is "
"one of the smartest folks I've ever met - she's got a doctorate you know - and Yusuke "
"is the only one here that can beat me at poker.  And Dave, well, he's Dave.  There's "
"more goin' on under the surface there, mark my words.  We may be unfit, but we aren't "
"worthless."
msgstr ""
"他にどうしろって言うんだ？配られた手札で勝負するしかない。私は地球上で最も愛する2人を失"
"い、3人目には見限られた。もう世界は終わったも同然さ。ちっぽけな私を残して、どこかへ行っ"
"てしまった。知っての通り、妻を亡くしてからはとても孤独だった。でもここで友人ができた。"
"腹は減ってるが、仲間はいる。リーナは数学と科学を教えてくれるし、ルオは今まで会った人の"
"中で一番賢い...博士号も持っているそうだ。ユウスケはここで私に勝てる唯一のポーカープレイ"
"ヤーだ。それから、デイブは、ええと、デイブはデイブだな。もっと言いたいことはあるが、よ"
"く聞いてくれ。確かにはみ出し物かもしれないが、私たちは無価値じゃないんだ。"

msgid "What's the deal with the closed-off areas of the building?"
msgstr "建物内の閉鎖された区画はどうなってるんだ？"

msgid "What's the deal with this written-on paper money you guys use?"
msgstr "この字が書いてあるマーチとかいう紙は何なんだ？"

msgid ""
"What's the difference between a good and a bad choke point?  The good one has another "
"back door behind you."
msgstr "良い閉所と悪い閉所の違いは何かって？背後に抜け道が確保してあるのが良い閉所だ。"

msgid "What's the harsh reception about?"
msgstr "随分と手厳しい対応だな？"

msgid "What's the insults for?"
msgstr "どうしてそんな酷いことを言うんだ？"

msgid "What's the matter?"
msgstr "どうした？"

msgid "What's the point of fighting?"
msgstr "戦うことに何の意味がある？"

msgid "What's the point of studying?  (%s)'s morale is too low!)"
msgstr "%sの意欲が低すぎる！"

msgid "What's the point of studying?  (Your morale is too low!)"
msgstr "意欲が低すぎる！"

msgid "What's the point of surviving if you're all alone?"
msgstr "これからずっと一人で過ごすなら、生き残る意味などあるのでしょうか？"

msgid "What's the poor attitude about?"
msgstr "どうしてそんな態度をとるんだ？"

msgid "What's the price?"
msgstr "値段は？"

msgid "What's the rush?"
msgstr "何を急いでるんだ？"

msgid "What's the story behind this place?"
msgstr "この場所は何？"

msgid "What's the use of walking away, they'll track you down eventually."
msgstr "逃げてどうするんだ、いずれ追いつかれるさ。"

msgid "What's there?  I heard"
msgstr "何だ？今の音は"

msgid "What's this I hear about you having a doctorate?"
msgstr "博士号を持っていると聞いたんだけど、どうなんだ？"

msgid "What's this token you gave me?"
msgstr "このトークンは何だ？"

msgid ""
"What's this, some kinda Back to the Future thing?  How could you not know what "
"happened?  The world damn well ended, that's what.  And it didn't start with an "
"earthquake, birds, snakes, or airplanes.  It started with riots, and they had to "
"dispatch cops and then the military to take care of the <swear> criminals.  The "
"government tried to pad it claiming it was some kind of mind control, but I didn't see "
"too much different from the usual bullshit: entitled babies looking for an excuse to "
"break the law.  It just got way worse, this time, until it was time to get out of "
"dodge.  I heard rumors they were even bombing some of the urban centers to try to "
"control it - which, I have to admit, is maybe a bit too hard-core."
msgstr ""
"あれだよ、バック・トゥ・ザ・フューチャーみたいなものだろ？世界が終わった、それだけさ。"
"地震も鳥も、ヘビも飛行機も関係ない。暴動から始まって、犯罪者を始末するために警察が、そ"
"して軍が派遣されたってだけだ、<swear>。政府は洗脳攻撃だって主張して時間稼ぎをしようとし"
"たけど、まあそれはいつものことさ。政府なんてのはのは法を破る口実を探してる、権利を持っ"
"た赤ん坊だ。結果的に今回は特に酷い状況になって、逃げるしかなかったんだろう。暴動を鎮圧"
"するために都市の中心部を爆撃しているなんて噂も聞いた。流石にそれは極端すぎるって思った"
"よ。"

msgid "What's up doc?  Hunting wabbits?"
msgstr "どったのセンセー？ウハギ狩り？"

msgid "What's up with the interference in this thing?"
msgstr "通信装置の具合はどうだ？"

msgid "What's up, <name_g>?"
msgstr "調子はどうだい、<name_g>？"

msgid ""
"What's up, people of <the_cataclysm>?  I'm DJ Dustbowl, this is my canine partner in "
"crime, Sam, and you're listening to Dark Days Radio, but… let me shut my mouth for a "
"bit.\n"
"\n"
"\"Hey hey, this is Anarchy, former writer, now turned apocalypse survivor and wearer "
"of oven-derived sheet metal armor.\"\n"
"\n"
"Aren't you forgetting, \"Driver of a hatchback turned death brick?\"\n"
"\n"
"\"Yes.  That's an important part of my zombie-trashing credentials.\"\n"
"\n"
"So yeah, ladies and gentlemen, if you didn't catch my last broadcast, I did the "
"impossible: I found, quite possibly, the only other living, breathing nerd operating a "
"radio on the eastern seaboard.\n"
"\n"
"\"Truly, we are an endangered species.\"\n"
"\n"
"That we are, but, Anarchy, please enlighten the people bunkering down on how you got "
"here.\n"
"\n"
"\"Let's just say… a lot of zombies got introduced to the front grill of the death "
"brick.\"\n"
"\n"
"Metal.  Now, folks, I'm going to step out for a smoke, and I'll leave y'all in "
"Anarchy's hands.  I'm not responsible for anything that gets said.\n"
"\n"
"\"OK, so I'm going to be bringing you whatever music I feel like playing, as well as "
"tips, tricks, and excerpts from whatever I've been writing in this apocalyptic "
"hellscape.  But before we launch, I'd like to give some dad advice.  Don't forget to "
"work on your personal projects, people.  I know you've got plenty of time sitting in "
"those shelters of yours.\""
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>のみんな、元気してる？こちらはDJダストボウル、そしてアシスタント犬のサム"
"だ。ダークデイズラジオをお聞きのみなさん、今日は...俺はちょっと黙ってるから、この声を聞"
"いてみてくれ。\n"
"\n"
"「ヘイヘイ、こちらアナーキー。元ライターで、今は終末世界の立派なサバイバーだ。オーブン"
"から引っぺがした板金で鎧を作ったりしてる。」\n"
"\n"
"あとこれも忘れちゃダメ。「ハッチバックを改造して装甲車デス・ブリック号を作った」だ"
"ろ？\n"
"\n"
"「ああ。ゾンビ退治に欠かせない相棒だ。」\n"
"\n"
"さて、前回の放送を聞き逃した紳士淑女のみんなに手っ取り早く説明すると、奇跡が起こったん"
"だ。東海岸でおそらくただ一人の、このラジオを聞いてる無線オタクな生存者とコンタクトが取"
"れたってわけ。\n"
"\n"
"「実際、こういう人間は絶滅危惧種と言っていいだろうな。」\n"
"\n"
"確かにね。アナーキー、きみがどうやってここまで来たのか、避難所で籠ってるみんなに教えて"
"あげて。\n"
"\n"
"「簡単に言うと...デス・ブリックのフロントグリルにゾンビを山ほど飾り付けつつ運転してき"
"た。」\n"
"\n"
"最高。じゃあみんな、放送はアナーキーに任せて、ちょっと一服してくるよ。彼が何を言ったと"
"しても、責任は取らないからな。\n"
"\n"
"「よし、ここから先は、この地獄の底みたいな世界で生き抜くための知識、経験、私の著作のあ"
"らすじ、そして私がかけたい音楽、とにかく自由に放送させてもらう。だが何よりもまず、パパ"
"から大事なアドバイスを一つ。自分で思い付いたプロジェクトに取り組み続けろ。シェルターに"
"ぼんやり座っている時間で、何かできることがある筈だ。」"

msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "調子はどう？"

msgid "What's with that guy in the tent?"
msgstr "あのテントの中の人は誰だ？"

msgid "What's with the accent?"
msgstr "その口調は何だ？"

msgid "What's with the trailer?"
msgstr "このトレーラーは一体どうしたんだ？"

msgid "What's with these 'Free Merchant certified notes'?"
msgstr "この「マーチ」という紙は何だ？"

msgid "What's with these people in the lobby?  Are they with you?"
msgstr "ロビーにいる人たちは何なんだ？ここのメンバーか？"

msgid "What's with your ears?"
msgstr "その耳はどうした？"

msgid "What's wrong with me, if you could say?"
msgstr "私が何か気に障ることをしたか？"

msgid "What's wrong with rats?"
msgstr "ラットが引っ越しとどう関係するんだ？"

msgid "What's wrong with you?"
msgstr "何か困っているのか？"

msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr "どうした？"

msgid "What's your deal here?"
msgstr "ここで何をしているんだ？"

msgid "What's your job here?"
msgstr "ここでのあなたの仕事は何？"

msgid "What's your name?"
msgstr "名前は？"

msgid "What's your situation here?"
msgstr "どうしたんだ？"

msgid "What's your story, anyway?"
msgstr "それでは、あなたの話を聞かせて？"

msgid "What's your story?"
msgstr "あなたの話を聞かせて？"

msgid "What's your take on the situation here?"
msgstr "今の状況をどう思う？"

msgid "What's yours is mine, <name_g>."
msgstr "貰っていくよ、<name_g>。"

msgid "What, <no>!"
msgstr "なにっ、<no>！"

msgid ""
"What, don't you remember?  No, sorry, that's not fair, it was a weird time.  OK, well, "
"I guess this all started with the riots, didn't it?  We were just leading our lives, "
"doing our jobs, and then people started rioting.  Not the usual protests that turned "
"violent or anything, either, people just left their houses and started breaking shit.  "
"The news tried to downplay it but they couldn't keep it off the internet.  I don't "
"know what caused it, they said it was some kind of drug or toxin in the water?  Still, "
"I didn't really realize how bad it was getting at first.  Somewhere along the way the "
"\"rioters\" started getting up and walking around with holes in their chests, and "
"that's when the real panic took over.  The next few days - or weeks, not really sure - "
"are a blur to me.  You'd have to ask someone else how we got from there to total "
"collapse."
msgstr ""
"何、そんなことも知らないのか？いや、申し訳ない、これじゃ不公平だな。不気味な事件だった"
"よ。始まりは暴動だった、よな？普通に人生を送り、仕事をしていたら、人々が暴動を起こし始"
"めたんだ。一般的な抗議行動とも、暴力的なものとも違う。ただ外に出て、滅茶苦茶暴れ出し"
"た。ニュースは無視しようとしてたけど、インターネット上はそうもいかなかい。何が原因かは"
"分からないが、水道水に薬だか毒が混入したとか言われてたかな？それでも、最初はこんなに酷"
"くなるとは思いもしなかった。途中で倒れた「暴徒」が立ち上がり、胸に穴が空いたまま歩き出"
"したのが本当の混乱の幕開けさ。その出来事の数日後、いや数週間後か...そこから先が、ぼやけ"
"ているんだ。他の誰かに、世界が完全に崩壊するまでの状況を尋ねる必要があるな。"

msgid ""
"What, don't you remember?  No, sorry, that's not fair, it was a weird time.  OK, well, "
"I guess this all started with the riots, didn't it?  We were just leading our lives, "
"doing our jobs, and then people started rioting.  Not the usual protests that turned "
"violent or anything, either, people just started breaking shit.  Some people tried to "
"downplay it but I saw what I saw I think.  I don't know what caused it, they said it "
"was some kind of drug or toxin in the water?  Still, I didn't really realize how bad "
"it was getting at first.  Somewhere along the way the \"rioters\" started getting up "
"and walking around with holes in their chests, and that's when the real panic took "
"over.  The next few days - or weeks, not really sure - are a blur to me.  You'd have "
"to ask someone else how we got from there to total collapse."
msgstr ""
"何、そんなことも知らないのか？いや、申し訳ない、これじゃ不公平だな。不気味な事件だった"
"よ。始まりは暴動だった、よな？普通に人生を送り、仕事をしていたら、人々が暴動を起こし始"
"めたんだ。一般的な抗議行動とも、暴力的なものとも違う。ただ外に出て、滅茶苦茶暴れ出し"
"た。気にすることじゃないと言う人もいたが、私は一目見ただけで異常だと思ったよ。何が原因"
"かは分からないが、水に薬だか毒が混入したとか言われてたかな？それでも、最初はこんなに酷"
"くなるとは思いもしなかった。途中で倒れた「暴徒」が立ち上がり、胸に穴が空いたまま歩き出"
"したのが本当の混乱の幕開けさ。その出来事の数日後、いや数週間後か...そこから先が、ぼやけ"
"ているんだ。他の誰かに、世界が完全に崩壊するまでの状況を尋ねる必要があるな。"

msgid "What, this?  It's not the same one, you are mistaken."
msgstr "何、これか？あなたの物ではないよ、勘違いしてるんだ。"

msgid "What?"
msgstr "何？"

msgid ""
"What?  How could you say something like that?  I can't believe you'd look at all this "
"and think it could be anything but the end-times.  The dead are walking, the gates of "
"Hell itself have opened, the Beasts of the Devil walk the Earth, and the Righteous "
"have all be drawn up into the Lord's Kingdom.  What more proof could you possibly ask "
"for?"
msgstr ""
"何だって？どうしてそんなことを言うんだ？この有様を見ても終末を信じないとはな。死者が蘇"
"り、地獄の門が開き、悪魔の獣が地上を闊歩し、そして正しき者は皆神の王国へと導かれる。こ"
"れ以上の証拠を出せって言うのか？"

msgid ""
"What?  I'd never do anything like that!  Dammit… if she thinks I did that, that would "
"explain why she's not willing to work with me.  Maybe there's still some hope she'll "
"understand what's necessary."
msgstr ""
"何？私がそんなことをするものか！クソったれ...だから彼女は一緒に仕事をしたがらなかったの"
"か。しかし、まだ希望はある。何が必要か理解してくれるはずだ。"

msgid ""
"What?  I'm a barber… I cut hair.  There's demand for cheap cuts and a shave out here."
msgstr ""
"うん？ 私は床屋だよ... 髪を切るんだ。安価な散髪や髭剃りの需要があるみたいなんでね。"

msgid ""
"What?  Of course it does.  They started with a bioweapon and then it went full "
"nuclear.  Only the weapons we had now were a lot worse than H-bombs.  Uncle Sam "
"managed to beat back the really nasty stuff, but I guess it was with his dying breath."
msgstr ""
"何？あれも同じさ。手法が生物兵器から核兵器になったんだ。水爆よりもっと酷い奴さ。アメリ"
"カはなんとかして鎮圧しようとしたけど、もう手遅れだったんだ。"

msgid ""
"What?  Of course it does.  They started with a weapon and then it got even worse.  "
"Only the weapons we had now were like nightmares.  The leadership managed to beat back "
"the really nasty stuff, but I guess it was with their dying breath."
msgstr ""
"何？あれも同じさ。武器がもっとヤバいものになっただけだ。今出回っているものなんて、まる"
"で悪夢だ。指導者たちはなんとかして鎮圧しようとしたけど、もう手遅れだったんだ。"

msgid "What?  Pandora's box?"
msgstr "何？パンドラの箱？"

msgid "What?  When?  How even…"
msgstr "何？いつ？なんて..."

msgid ""
"What?  You're not content with me being a personal tutor, now you want to start a post-"
"apocalyptic university?"
msgstr ""
"何だって？私を家庭教師にするのに飽き足らず、終末世界で大学でも設立しようってのかい？"

msgid "What?!  I oughta whip your ass."
msgstr "何だと！？ケツをひっぱたいてやろうか。"

msgid "What?!  I out'ta whip your ass."
msgstr "何だと！？尻をひっぱたいてやろうか。"

msgid "What?!  Please, <ill_die> without your help!"
msgstr "何だって？！頼む、あんたの助けが無ければ<ill_die>！"

msgid "What?!  Please, <ill_die> without… your help!"
msgstr "何だって？！頼む、あんたの助けが無ければ<ill_die>！"

msgid "What?!  You liar!"
msgstr "何だって？！嘘つきめ！"

msgid "What?!  You're lying, I can tell!  Did you even bring back my cage?"
msgstr "何だって？！嘘でしょ！ケージだけでも返してくれない？"

msgid "What?!  You're lying, I can tell!  Ugh, forget it!"
msgstr "何だって？！嘘だろ！あー、もういい！"

msgid ""
"Whatever XE037 is, or is not, it's contagious, but it seems to only have an interest "
"in biomatter, and a much higher affinity to biomatter from planes at the X locus along "
"the theta axis.  A new team is being formed and siloed out to research it in more "
"detail."
msgstr ""
"XE037の正体は分からないが、伝染性があり、生体物質にしか伝染しない。その中でも、シータ軸"
"に沿ったX点の次元由来の生体物質と特に親和性が高いようだ。より詳細な調査を行うために新た"
"なチームが編成され、極秘裏に活動している。"

msgid ""
"Whatever caused the end of the world affected you in a horrible way.  Your wounds will "
"never heal on their own and your broken limbs will never mend."
msgstr ""
"世界が崩壊した原因は分かりませんが、取り返しのつかない影響を受けてしまいました。ダメー"
"ジが自然治癒することはなく、折れた手足も絶対に治せません。"

msgid ""
"Whatever this is, it doesn't look dead so much as staying still.  You still feel like "
"it's looking at you, even as you cut it apart"
msgstr ""
"これが何であれ、死んでいるようにも、眠っているようにも見えません。解剖されてもなお、こ"
"ちらを認識しているような気がします"

msgid "Whatever this is, it would take an extremely long time to wield."
msgstr "これが何であれ、装備するには非常に時間がかかります。"

msgid "Whatever you want to do with milk, you will probably find it in this book."
msgstr "牛乳を使ってできることは、大抵がこの本に書かれています。"

msgid "Whatever's in that map benefits both of us."
msgstr "その地図はそんなに価値があるのか。"

msgid "Whatever, I don't have time for creepy stuff."
msgstr "馬鹿げてるな。そんなくだらない意見を聞いてる暇はない。"

msgid ""
"Whatever, I don't have time for whatever this is.  Try not to get your face eaten I "
"guess."
msgstr ""
"おっと、呑気に話しこんでいる場合じゃないな。顔を食いちぎられないよう気を付けた方がい"
"い。"

msgid "Whatever, I had another question."
msgstr "それはともかく、他にも聞きたいことがある。"

msgid "Whatever, I'll keep twiddling my thumbs then."
msgstr "だったら、手持ち無沙汰でじっとしてるしかないわね。"

msgid "Whatever.  Bye."
msgstr "あっそう。じゃあね。"

msgid "Whatever.  I'm leaving."
msgstr "どうでもいいね。私はもう行くよ。"

msgid "Wheat"
msgstr "穀物"

msgid "Wheat Snack Bread, a delicious snack made from wheat."
msgstr "小麦で作った美味しい菓子パンです。"

msgid ""
"Wheat with the chaff still mixed in.  It will have to be winnowed before it's usable."
msgstr "もみ殻が混ざっている小麦粒です。何かに使うなら、もみ殻を取り除く必要があります。"

msgid "Wheel Diameter"
msgstr "車輪直径"

msgid "Wheel Width"
msgstr "車輪幅"

msgid "Wheelbarrow"
msgstr "手押し車"

msgid "Wheels/boat: %s/%s"
msgstr "タイヤ/ボート:       %s/%s"

msgid "Wheels: %s"
msgstr "タイヤ:              %s"

msgid "When <bold>carried</bold> this item provides:"
msgstr "<bold>所持中</bold>:"

msgid "When <bold>wielded</bold> this item provides:"
msgstr "<bold>装備中</bold>:"

msgid "When <bold>worn</bold> this item provides:"
msgstr "<bold>着用中</bold>:"

msgid "When Bad Things Happen to Good People"
msgid_plural "copies of When Bad Things Happen to Good People"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/なぜ私だけが苦しむのか)"

msgid ""
"When Beth's career as a pro steeplechase jockey threatens to divide her from her "
"lover, Beth has to act fast.  Will she ever find a man that can keep up with her "
"racing heart?"
msgstr ""
"障害馬術競技騎手としてのキャリアが恋人と親密になれない原因ではないかと気付き、ベスはす"
"ぐに行動を起こしました。競技で鍛えた心臓に耐えられる男は、果たして見つかるのでしょう"
"か？"

msgid ""
"When I broke a leg few years ago they had this great machine at the hospital that set "
"the bones in place.  I'd hate to break a limb in this apocalypse, but it's something "
"to remember.  You never know."
msgstr ""
"数年前に脚を骨折したんだけど、その時に病院ですごい機械を使って治療してもらったんだ。こ"
"の状況で腕や脚を折るなんて考えたくないけど、覚えておいた方がいい。"

msgid ""
"When I get my hands on you…\n"
"\n"
"+2 bash damage.\n"
"Lasts 2 seconds.  Stacks 5 times."
msgstr ""
"どう料理してやりましょうか...\n"
"\n"
"打撃与ダメージ+2\n"
"2ターン継続、最大蓄積数5"

msgid ""
"When I was playin' with the terminal for the one I ran into it kept asking for an ID "
"card.  Finding one would be the first order of business."
msgstr ""
"あの端末をいじってみた事はあるが、とにかくIDカードを出せとしか言わないんだ。まずはID"
"カードを見つけることだな。"

msgid ""
"When I was younger, I used to go to church with my family.  When I started growing up, "
"I saw all this evil around me, people hating and persecuting others, despite the "
"teachings of Jesus; I just stopped going one day, decided to make my own way.  I "
"joined the NECC a few years back to rekindle my relationship with God, get back to who "
"I was."
msgstr ""
"子供の頃は、よく家族と一緒に教会へ行っていた。大人になってから、イエス様の教えとは裏腹"
"に、他人を憎み迫害する人間をたくさん目の当たりにして、道は自分で切り開くしかないと思い"
"詰め、ある日を境に教会通いを止めた。ニューイングランド教会コミュニティの一員になったの"
"は今から数年前だな。神との関係をもう一度蘇らせて、本来の自分を取り戻そうと思ったんだ。"

msgid ""
"When Jackson gains the mystical talent to alter his appearance on command, will he be "
"able to recognize himself in his own mirror?"
msgstr ""
"呪文によって外見を変えられる不思議な能力を手に入れたジャクソン。鏡の中の自分はどんな姿"
"に映るのでしょうか？"

msgid ""
"When a therapist's daughter transfers to a new school, she decides to change her "
"personality type.  As her social life begins to blossom, can she maintain a healthy "
"boundary between her home life and her public persona?"
msgstr ""
"セラピストの娘が転校をきっかけに性格を変えようと決意する物語です。社会生活は充実してき"
"ましたが、家と外でのふるまいを上手く使い分けられるのでしょうか？"

msgid ""
"When active, this bionic eliminates all light within a 2 tile radius through "
"destructive interference."
msgstr ""
"光を阻害する物質を散布する装置です。破壊的な干渉によって半径2タイル以内に光が届かなくな"
"ります。"

msgid ""
"When active, this bionic eliminates all light within a 2-tile radius of the user "
"through destructive interference."
msgstr ""
"起動すると周囲に相殺的干渉を生じさせ、半径15タイル内にあらゆる光が届かなくなります。"

msgid ""
"When active, this bionic will amplify existing light, allowing you to see in the dark."
msgstr "起動すると、目が光を増幅するよう改造され 暗闇の中で見渡せる範囲が広がります。 "

msgid "When active, turns engines on and off automatically."
msgstr "有効な場合はエンジンを自動的に起動/停止します。"

msgid ""
"When attached to a gun, <good>allows</good> making <info>reach melee attacks</info> "
"with it."
msgstr "銃器に取り付けると<info>2タイル長柄攻撃</info>が<good>可能</good>になります。"

msgid "When do you plan on starting that apprenticeship?"
msgstr "いつから弟子入りするつもりなんだ？"

msgid ""
"When do you think you realized the world was ending?  For me, it was that damned "
"YouTube video with the lady killing the baby.  Holy shit, you know?"
msgstr ""
"世界が終わるんだと実感したのはいつだった？私は、YouTubeで赤ん坊を殺す女を見たときだ。酷"
"いもんだよ、なぁ？"

msgid ""
"When fleeing, friendly NPCs will attempt to retreat toward this zone if it is within "
"60 tiles."
msgstr "友好NPCが逃走する際、周囲60タイル内の退避区域へ退避します。"

msgid ""
"When her fiancee names a star for her Wanda begins to wonder if an astronomer's wife "
"can ever compete with the allure of the cosmos."
msgstr ""
"天文学者である婚約者はワンダのために星に名前を付けました。しかしワンダは、結婚しても宇"
"宙の魅力に自分が負けてしまうのではないか、という不安を抱きます。"

msgid "When is the next shipment?"
msgstr "次の商品入荷はいつ頃？"

msgid ""
"When it all happened, the Cataclysm, something… changed.  You can see it in all "
"creatures, most of all in their bones.  They break, morph, rise again, over and over - "
"a never-ending cycle.  The dead walk again, horrors rip and tear each other apart.  "
"And within each one… the quiet hum of raw strength.  Only by taking the bones does the "
"cycle end - their story, their song, their strength; they become yours to use."
msgstr ""
"大変動が始まった時、あらゆるものが...変化した。変化はあらゆる生物、とりわけその骨の中に"
"見出すことができる。破壊され、変化し、再び立ち上がる、無限の輪廻だ。死人が生き返り歩き"
"だし、化け物たちが互いを引き裂きあう。それらの中から、野蛮な力が静かに震えている音が聞"
"こえるはずだ。骨を奪えば、輪廻の輪は断ち切られる。その物語や、歌や、力がおまえのものと"
"なる。"

msgid ""
"When it comes to footwear, you've got two basic choices as far as I see it; sneakers, "
"for running extra fast, or boots for durability.  Depends on your style, I guess."
msgstr ""
"靴を選ぶとき、私が知る限り2つの選択肢がある。動きやすいスニーカーか、耐久力のブーツか。"
"君のスタイルに応じて決めよう。"

msgid ""
"When leaving from the warp obelisk, you can now guarantee you will begin your "
"expedition in a basement.  Not glamorous, but at least it ensures you won't be "
"stranded out in some desolate field."
msgstr ""
"転移のオベリスクから出発する際に、地下室から開始する遠征を選べるようになりました。地下"
"室に貴重なものはなさそうですが、少なくとも荒涼とした平原に取り残されることはなくなりま"
"す。"

msgid ""
"When leaving from the warp obelisk, you can now guarantee you will begin your "
"expedition on some rooftop.  Dangerous, perhaps, but it ensures proximity to points of "
"interest, and besides, there are all kinds of buildings this might land you on."
msgstr ""
"転移のオベリスクから出発する際に、屋上から開始する遠征を選べるようになりました。恐らく"
"危険ですが、調べておくべき様々な施設に近い位置から探索を始められそうです。"

msgid "When life's got you down, there's always sugar."
msgstr "くじけそうな時、いつも傍に居てくれるのは甘味料です。"

msgid "When looking around, use T to move to a destination or item automatically."
msgstr "周囲確認中にTキーを押すと、指定した地点やアイテムのある位置に自動で移動します。"

msgid ""
"When looting, try to fill your inventory as much as possible without being "
"overloaded.  You never know when you might need an item, most are good to sell, and "
"you can easily drop unwanted items on the floor.  But don't go looting empty-handed; "
"you never know what might happen, so have your most crucial survival items with you."
msgstr ""
"探索中は、荷物が過重にならない程度に、できるだけ所持容積いっぱいまで所持しましょう。そ"
"のアイテムが必要になる時が来るかもしれません。どんなアイテムでも大抵は取り引きに使えま"
"すし、もし不要になっても簡単に捨て置けます。しかし、手ぶらで探索に向かうのは危険です。"
"何が起こるか分かりません。生存するのに最低限必要なアイテムは持っていきましょう。"

msgid ""
"When mounted on an engine and the engine is on it will provide up to <color_green>%sW</"
"color> of electrical power to the vehicle."
msgstr ""
"取り付けてあるエンジンが起動している時、車両に最大<color_green>%sW</color>の電力を供給"
"します。"

msgid ""
"When open, this part lets you move from inside the vehicle to outside or vice versa.  "
"When closed, it prevents people from entering or leaving the vehicle."
msgstr "開けると車両への乗降が可能になり、閉じると乗降を妨げます。"

msgid ""
"When outnumbered or forced to pull back, my scavengers have been taught to throw "
"Molotov cocktails to keep monsters from chasing them.  We go through one or two on "
"every mission, so we can always use a few more.  Would you be willing to make us a "
"dozen?  I'm willing to pay you what I can for your assistance."
msgstr ""
"敵が多すぎる時、あるいは後退を余儀なくされた時は、火炎瓶を投げて群れから距離を取るよう"
"教えている。一度の出撃で最低でも1本か2本使うし、常に備蓄もしておきたい。火炎瓶を1ダース"
"ほど作ってもらえないか？相応の礼はしよう。"

msgid "When the cheese starts flowing, Kraft gets your noodle going."
msgstr ""
"”When the cheese starts flowing, Kraft gets your noodle going.”「チーズが溶けたら、召し"
"上がれ」(訳注: Kraft社のマカロニチーズのCMの1フレーズ)"

msgid ""
"When the devil falls in love with a warlock, his proposal must be infernally wicked.  "
"Will hooves, horns, and the scent of sulfur condemn love's flames to hellfire?"
msgstr ""
"悪魔が魔法使いに一目惚れしましたが、邪悪な提案を持ちかけられます。蹄と角と硫黄の香り"
"が、愛の灯火を地獄の炎に変えてしまうのでしょうか？"

msgid ""
"When the portal storms started, the government issued an evacuation order for critical "
"personnel and sent convoys to retrieve them, with our head of AI research among the "
"recalled.  We recently discovered that he died when the convoy transferring him was "
"ambushed in the initial chaos, but his corpse and belongings might remain intact "
"enough to benefit from his research.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We want you to travel to the convoy and locate the body, if possible.  His "
"evacuation protocol included retrieving and storing as much of the data from his "
"facility as possible, to be stored in a code-locked hard case.  If this hard case is "
"present, retrieve it, and bring it back here.\"\n"
"\n"
"\"We offer the standard hazard pay of 4 HGC for this contract."
msgstr ""
"ポータルの嵐が始まった頃、政府はXEDRAの重役に避難命令を出し、救援部隊を送った。その避難"
"者の中には、うちのAI研究チームの責任者もいたんだ。事態悪化の初期段階で救援部隊の車列が"
"襲撃を受けて全滅していたことが、最近ようやく判明した。もしかすると、研究者の遺体や遺品"
"が、今後の研究に生かせる状態で残っている可能性もある。」\n"
"\n"
"「どうにかして救援部隊が全滅した地点まで向かい、遺体を探し出してもらいたい。事前に決め"
"てあった避難プロトコルでは、研究者は研究施設内のデータを可能な限り回収し、パスコードで"
"ロックされたハードケースに保存することになっている。現場にハードケースがあった場合は、"
"ここへ持ってきてくれ。」\n"
"\n"
"「危険手当てレートに基づいて、今回の契約が無事履行された場合は4HCGが支給される。"

msgid ""
"When the sword is once drawn, the passions of men observe no bounds of moderation."
msgstr ""
"ひとたび剣が抜かれれば、人間の激情というものは、中庸という抑止力を利かせなくするもので"
"ある。"

msgid ""
"When the virtual joystick is centered, how fast should input events repeat, in "
"milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"仮想ジョイスティックが中央にある際の、イベント入力のリピート間隔(ミリ秒)を設定します。"

msgid ""
"When the virtual joystick is fully deflected, how fast should input events repeat, in "
"milliseconds."
msgstr ""
"仮想ジョイスティックが完全に傾いた際の、イベント入力のリピート間隔(ミリ秒)を設定しま"
"す。"

msgid ""
"When the whole town is one big supermarket, a shopping cart becomes your best friend."
msgstr ""
"街全体が大きなスーパーマーケットだと考えれば、ショッピングカートは大いに活躍します。"

msgid ""
"When things got bad I got out with some others immediately.  That got me out before "
"the worst part.  The group of evacuees I was with was useless… me, a couple others, a "
"couple of days of food, and a few grass blankets.  Not even close to enough to go "
"around.  The evacuees split down the middle into a few camps, and infighting started.  "
"I ran into the woods nearby with a few others.  We got away, had a little camp going.  "
"They tried to make me their leader, thought I knew more about things than I did "
"because I'd come so prepared.  Like I said, I'm not that kind of scientist, but they "
"didn't seem to understand.  I… I did my best."
msgstr ""
"状況が悪くなったらすぐに、他の人と一緒に避難したよ。そのお陰で最悪の事態は避けられた"
"が、私たちのグループはとても順調とは言えなかった...数人の避難者がいたが、そいつらの荷物"
"は2日分の食料と、草で編んだブランケット数枚だけだ。とてもじゃないが足りないよ。分かれて"
"野宿するようになり、何日かすると仲間割れが始まった。私は他の何人かと共に森へ逃げ、小さ"
"な野営地を作った。皆は私をチームのリーダーにしたいようだった。私が荷物をちゃんと準備し"
"ていたせいで、この事態について詳しいと勘違いされたんだ。先ほど言ったように、私はそうい"
"う研究をしている訳では無いんだけど、誰も理解してくれなかった。とにかく...ベストは尽くし"
"たよ。"

msgid "When this bionic is active, you can block hearing completely."
msgstr "このCBM起動中は、聴覚を完全に遮断できます。"

msgid ""
"When this bionic is active, your hearing will be drastically improved, allowing you to "
"hear ten times better than the average person.  Additionally, high-intensity sounds "
"will be automatically dampened before they can damage your hearing."
msgstr ""
"聴覚を常人の10倍まで強化します。 更に鼓膜にダメージを与えるような大音量も、自動的に音量"
"を下げて、聞き取る事が可能です。"

msgid "When this is enabled, player won't wield things unless explicitly told to."
msgstr "有効にすると、あえて何かを装備しない限り素手を保ちます。"

msgid ""
"When three teenage girls ditch class to drive cross-country together, they get a "
"strong dose of life lessons on the road.  This work of young adult fiction explores "
"how friendships evolve in early adulthood."
msgstr ""
"10代の少女3人がクロスカントリー競技に憧れて授業をサボり、コース上で厳しい人生のレッスン"
"を受けます。成人間近の子供たちの友情の進展を綴ったヤングアダルト小説です。"

msgid "When turned on, it will stop the vehicle unless it has a strong engine."
msgstr "電源がオンになっていると、エンジンが弱い車両は停止します。"

msgid ""
"When turned on, this device drains <color_red>%sW</color> from the vehicle's batteries."
msgstr "起動すると車両バッテリーの電力を<color_red>%sW</color>消費します。"

msgid "When was the last time I had a drink?"
msgstr "最後に飲み物を口にしてからどれぐらい経つだろうな？"

msgid "When we drinkin'?"
msgstr "いつ飲み物を口にするの？"

msgid "When we eatin'?"
msgstr "いつ食事にする？"

msgid ""
"When we skipped town during <the_cataclysm>, most of us left our possessions behind.  "
"We only have a few Bibles here for all of us, and they're starting to fall apart.  If "
"you could get ten more of the King James version, I'd pay well for them."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>で街から避難してきた人は大抵、着の身着のまま逃げるしかありませんでした。"
"ここに聖書は数冊しかなく、しかもかなり傷んできています。欽定訳聖書を20冊持ってきてもら"
"えたら、高く買い取りますよ。"

msgid "When we sleepin'?"
msgstr "いつ寝ればいいんだい？"

msgid "When will all your suffering end?"
msgstr "この苦しみはいつ終わるんだろう？"

msgid "When will they be ready?"
msgstr "いつ完成する？"

msgid "When will you be leaving?"
msgstr "いつ出発する？"

msgid "When will you have new material?"
msgstr "商品はいつ頃入荷する？"

msgid "When will you have new stuff in stock?"
msgstr "物資はいつ頃入荷する？"

msgid "When will your cows produce again?"
msgstr "牧場の商品はいつ頃入荷する？"

msgid ""
"When you are in great danger you may flip a chemical switch in your brain and for a "
"cost in hunger, fatigue, and thirst your nervous system will process things around you "
"slightly faster.  Giving you better reaction times that you can pay for later if you "
"survive."
msgstr ""
"大きな危険に晒されている状況で生き延びる可能性を高めるために、脳内の化学物質を分泌させ"
"て神経系の処理速度を高めます。空腹や口渇、倦怠感が増す副作用があります。"

msgid "When you are prone, you use the bipod of a rifle for better accuracy."
msgstr "伏せてライフルを撃つなら、二脚を使って命中精度を高めましょう。"

msgid ""
"When you assign a companion to a faction camp mission, they'll disappear while they go "
"do whatever you want them to do.  When the duration of the mission has elapsed, you'll "
"see a new mission on the bulletin board to have them return and complete the mission "
"by upgrading your camp, returning their hunting kills, dropping off whatever they were "
"crafting, or whatever else the mission results are.\n"
"  There are all kinds of faction camp missions: building up the camp, recruiting new "
"allies, hunting and trapping game, scrounging for materials, farming, disassembling "
"cars, and more.  Not all activities can be done at every camp - you may need to build "
"some additional buildings, or expand the camp, to get access to some missions.\n"
"  Some faction camp missions can be duplicated by companion activities, but building "
"up the camp can only be done via faction camp missions, as only completion of camp "
"construction missions are recognized as fulfillment of those goals.\n"
"  You assign missions by interacting with the bulletin board.  You'll see a list of "
"available missions for your central camp tile.  If your camp has expansions, you can "
"tab through the expansions to see the available missions at each expansion.\n"
"  Remember, companions on camp missions need to be fed, and will become angry if they "
"complete a mission but there isn't any food in the larder.\n"
"  There is one special mission called 'Emergency Recall'.  You can use this to "
"retrieve any companion on a faction camp mission, but this cancels the mission and "
"wastes any resources used on it.  Only use it to recover allies when something has "
"gone really wrong with your camp and you can't get them to come back any other way."
msgstr ""
"拠点の任務を割り当てられた仲間は、任務中は姿を消す。任務の期間が過ぎると、掲示板に仲間"
"を呼び戻すという項目が追加される。それを選択すれば任務は完了となって、拠点の改良、狩り"
"や製作で得たアイテムの入手など、任務の結果が反映され、仲間も戻ってくる。\n"
"  拠点で割り当てられる任務は、拠点改良、新たな仲間の勧誘、狩猟や罠猟、資材調達、農作"
"業、車両解体など様々だ。でも、全ての任務がすぐにできる訳じゃない...例えば特定の建物の建"
"設や拠点の拡張を先にこなさないとできない任務もある。\n"
"任務の中には、仲間に直接話しかけて同じような仕事を頼めるものもあるが、拠点の構築に関す"
"る任務は拠点でしか指示できないし、建物などは複数の任務をすべて完了して初めて完成したこ"
"とになる。\n"
"  任務は拠点内の掲示板を使って割り当てる。掲示板を調べれば、中央拠点の任務一覧が表示さ"
"れるはずだ。拠点を拡張しているなら、タブキーを押せば各拡張施設の任務一覧が表示され"
"る。\n"
"  任務を遂行する仲間には備蓄食料が不可欠だ。任務を終えて帰ってきても、備蓄食料が不十分"
"だと不満に思うことは忘れないで。\n"
"  任務の中には「緊急帰還」という特殊なものがある。これを実行すれば任務中の仲間はすぐに"
"帰ってくるが、任務はキャンセルされ、それまでに任務で消費した資源などは帰ってこない。拠"
"点で何か問題が発生して、他に帰還手段がない場合のみ、この任務を選択して仲間を帰還させよ"
"う。"

msgid ""
"When you grab one particularly bristled organ, it writhes and nearly escapes your "
"grasp before you can smash it.  You find developing wings in the paste"
msgstr ""
"硬い毛が生えた器官を掴むと身を捩って逃げ出そうとしたため、慌てて潰しました。潰れた肉の"
"中に翅のようなものが残っています"

msgid ""
"When you kill a monster it will often leave behind a corpse.  Corpses can be important "
"sources of food, but you must butcher them by standing on the corpse and pressing "
"<keybind:butcher>.  You'll need a bladed weapon in your inventory, preferably a small, "
"very sharp one.  An unskilled butcher may only get a few pieces of meat, or none at "
"all.  Note that many monsters, such as zombies, leave tainted meat, unsuitable for "
"consumption."
msgstr ""
"モンスターを殺すと、大抵は死体が残ります。死体は貴重な食料源ですが、まず死体があるタイ"
"ル上で<keybind:butcher>を押して解体する必要があります。解体には(できれば小型で鋭い)刃物"
"を所持している必要があります。作業に慣れていないと、肉が少ししか採れない、あるいはまっ"
"たく採れないこともあります。ゾンビなどの多くのモンスターの肉は汚染されており、食用に適"
"さないことは覚えておきましょう。"

msgid "When you need to scoop some soup, this is the utensil for you."
msgstr "スープを掬う時に必要な調理器具です。"

msgid "When you see a swarm of zombies coming it's time to run!"
msgstr "ゾンビの大群が向かって来たら、すぐに逃げよう！"

msgid ""
"When you sever the vestigial wings, a spurt of mud-thick fluid gushes up and every leg "
"twitches"
msgstr "翅を切り離すと体内から泥のような液体が噴き出し、肢が一斉に痙攣しました"

msgid ""
"When you take damage from almost any source, you'll start to feel pain.  Pain slows "
"you down and reduces your stats, and finding a way to manage pain is an early "
"imperative.  The most common is drugs: aspirin, codeine, tramadol, oxycodone, and more "
"are all great options.  Be aware that while under the influence of many painkillers, "
"the physiological side effects may slow you down or reduce your stats."
msgstr ""
"ダメージを受けると苦痛を感じ、苦痛によって行動速度や能力値が低下します。序盤において苦"
"痛を抑制する方法を見つけるのは必須事項です。手っ取り早いのはアスピリン、コデイン、トラ"
"マドール、オキシコドンなどの鎮痛剤を摂取することです。ただ、これらの鎮痛剤が効いている"
"間は薬物摂取の副作用として行動速度や能力値が低下することに注意しましょう。"

msgid ""
"When you take damage, it will change the status of the affected body part, as shown in "
"the sidebar.  Its overall wellness is represented by a series of bars that will "
"deplete and change color the more damage you take.  If the accumulated damage is more "
"than the body part can suffer, it will break.  If that happens to a critical body part "
"(i.e., your torso or head), you will die.  For other body parts, it means broken "
"bones, significant penalties, and a long process of healing - after placing the "
"affected limb in a splint."
msgstr ""
"ダメージを受けると、サイドバーに表示される身体部位の表示が変わります。HPが万全の時は長"
"いバーとして表現されており、ダメージを受ける度にバーが縮みます。部位のHPが0以下になる"
"と、その部位は完全に破壊されます。特に重大な部位(すなわち、胴や頭)が破壊されれば、死ん"
"でしまいます。その他の部位の破壊は骨折を意味し、重大なペナルティを受けますが、骨折部位"
"に添え木を着用した状態で長期間過ごしていれば治療できます。"

msgid ""
"When you turn your head, you can hear the wet click of tendons in your neck.  How "
"dreadful.  It won't be a problem, soon."
msgstr ""
"首を動かすと、腱がミチリと湿った音を立てました。とても恐ろしいことですが、すぐに問題な"
"くなります。"

msgid "When you wake up you panic about drowning from being out of water."
msgstr "目覚めた水中ではなかった為、窒息しないかと狼狽しています。"

msgid "When you want to hit your target nine times with one shot."
msgstr "1発で9回命中させるのも夢ではありません。"

msgid ""
"When you were escaping an evacuation point that was overrun, you had to leave your "
"rifle behind.  Shame on you, what's a hunter without their hunting rifle?  You have to "
"find one immediately."
msgstr ""
"避難所が襲われ、ライフルを置いたまま逃げ出してしまいました。まったく残念です。狩猟用ラ"
"イフルを持たない狩人なんてものがいるのでしょうか？すぐに代わりを探し出すべきです。"

msgid "When's your next doctor's appointment?"
msgstr "次の診察日はいつだっけ？"

msgid "Where am I again?"
msgstr "ここが何の場所なのか、もう一度聞きたい。"

msgid "Where am I?"
msgstr "ここは何の場所だ？"

msgid ""
"Where applicable, use blacklists, whitelists, and filters for a better quality of life."
msgstr ""
"必要に応じてブラックリストやホワイトリスト、フィルターを使い、質の高い暮らしを目指しま"
"しょう。"

msgid "Where are they?  I don't believe you."
msgstr "どこにあるんだ？実物を見なければ信じないよ。"

msgid "Where are you guys located?  Can I join up too?"
msgstr "他の人たちはどこにいるんだ？私もその仲間に加われないか？"

msgid "Where are you headed next?"
msgstr "次はどこへ向かうつもりなんだ？"

msgid "Where are you?!"
msgstr "どこに居る？"

msgid "Where can I find Carlos?"
msgstr "カーロスにはどこで会える？"

msgid "Where can I find Chris?"
msgstr "クリスにはどこで会える？"

msgid ""
"Where did my lighter go again?  Manage your containers to store specific items in them."
msgstr "ライターはどこに入れたっけ？収納を管理して、特定の所にアイテムを収納しましょう。"

msgid "Where did things go from there?"
msgstr "それからどうなったんだ？"

msgid "Where did you come from?"
msgstr "どこから来たんだ？"

msgid "Where did you go from there?"
msgstr "それからどこへ向かったんだ？"

msgid "Where did you go then?"
msgstr "それからどこへ向かったんだ？"

msgid "Where did you leave your ride?"
msgstr "どうして隠れ家から出てきたんだ？"

msgid "Where did you say you were going again?"
msgstr "次はどこへ行くんだ？"

msgid "Where do you think your parents are now?"
msgstr "ご両親は、今どこにいるんだろう？"

msgid "Where does the energy come from?"
msgstr "このエネルギーはどこから来ている？"

msgid ""
"Where else?  I can't fight those things out there.  I'm in terrible physical "
"condition, don't have any useful skills, and I'm terrified of <zombies> and violence.  "
"How am I supposed to find a safe place?"
msgstr ""
"移るってどこへ？野外で戦うなんて無理だ。体調も最悪だし、有用な技能もまったく持ってない"
"し、何より<zombies>と暴力が怖い。どうやって安全な場所を見つけろって言うんだ？"

msgid "Where is 'home'?"
msgstr "その「家」というのはどこにある？"

msgid "Where is everyone?"
msgstr "ほぼ無人"

msgid "Where is it?"
msgstr "どこにあるんだ？"

msgid "Where is my kid?"
msgstr "私の子供はどこだ？"

msgid "Where is the creature to harness?"
msgstr "どの動物に車両接続ハーネスを付けますか？"

msgid "Where is the desired overmap?"
msgstr "どの方向の全体マップに瞬間移動しますか？"

msgid "Where is this manufacturer?"
msgstr "その会社の場所はどこ？"

msgid "Where is your brother's place?"
msgstr "あなたの兄弟はどこにいるんだ？"

msgid "Where might your friends be?"
msgstr "仲間はいるのか？"

msgid "Where new log messages should show."
msgstr "最新メッセージの表示位置を切り替えます。"

msgid "Where should I start?"
msgstr "何から始めればいい？"

msgid "Where the hell am I?"
msgstr "ここは一体どこ？"

msgid ""
"Where to place mark of the favorited item (asterisk): before item's name (prefix) or "
"after item's name (suffix)."
msgstr "お気に入りマーク(*)を付ける位置を設定します。: 行頭、行末"

msgid "Where was that?"
msgstr "それはどこだ？"

msgid "Where was the bunker at?"
msgstr "その掩体壕はどの辺りにあった？"

msgid "Where were they at?"
msgstr "その人とはどの辺りで出会った？"

msgid "Where would we be without music?"
msgstr "音楽が無かったらどうなってしまうんだ？"

msgid ""
"Where you came to expect smooth chitin you find exposed flesh, shot with a web of "
"hardened strands"
msgstr ""
"滑らかなキチン質が摂れると思いきや、現れたのは硬い繊維質の網が絡みついた筋肉でした"

msgid "Where's Buck now?"
msgstr "犬のバックはどうなったんだ？"

msgid "Where's that building at, exactly?"
msgstr "その施設はどこにあるんだ？"

msgid "Where's your family now?"
msgstr "あなたの家族はどこにいるんだ？"

msgid "Where's your pack?  How will you survive without them?"
msgstr "群れの仲間はどこへ行ったのでしょう？孤独に生きていけるのでしょうか？"

msgid "Wherever we end up, at least we're still alive, right?"
msgstr "どこまで行こうがきっと生き延びられる、そう思うだろう？"

msgid ""
"Whether by a serious accident, birth defect, or other means, you have lost your left "
"arm.  As such, you cannot use anything you normally could with it, like lifting with "
"two hands."
msgstr ""
"重大な事故、先天的な障害、あるいはその他の理由で左腕を失いました。両手でものを持ち上げ"
"るといった通常は可能な動作ができません。"

msgid ""
"Whether by a serious accident, birth defect, or other means, you have lost your left "
"leg.  You can hobble around, but will likely need a wheelchair or other means of "
"locomotion to get somewhere far."
msgstr ""
"重大な事故、先天的な障害、あるいはその他の理由で左脚を失いました。片脚で何とか歩くこと"
"もできますが、車椅子などの移動手段を確保しなければ遠くまで行くのは困難です。"

msgid ""
"Whether by a serious accident, birth defect, or other means, you have lost your right "
"arm.  As such, you cannot use anything you normally could with it, like lifting with "
"two hands."
msgstr ""
"重大な事故、先天的な障害、あるいはその他の理由で右腕を失いました。両手でものを持ち上げ"
"るといった通常は可能な動作ができません。"

msgid ""
"Whether by a serious accident, birth defect, or other means, you have lost your right "
"leg.  You can hobble around, but will likely need a wheelchair or other means of "
"locomotion to get somewhere far."
msgstr ""
"重大な事故、先天的な障害、あるいはその他の理由で右脚を失いました。片脚で何とか歩くこと"
"もできますが、車椅子などの移動手段を確保しなければ遠くまで行くのは困難です。"

msgid ""
"Whether due to a lifetime of exposure or through simple willpower, it's harder for you "
"to become addicted to substances, and easier to rid yourself of these addictions."
msgstr ""
"単純に意志が強いだけか、中毒物質に触れる機会がなかったからかは分かりませんが、依存症に"
"なり難い身体をしています。また、依存症になっても抜け出すのが容易になります。"

msgid ""
"Whether due to injury or age, your knees aren't particularly strong or flexible.  "
"Moving over rough terrain will slow you down more than normal."
msgstr ""
"怪我や加齢などの理由に関係なく、膝が弱く柔軟性がありません。起伏の多い地形では、移動が"
"通常よりも遅くなります。"

msgid ""
"Whether due to lack of exercise and poor diet, or due to a natural disinclination to "
"physical endurance, you tire due to physical exertion much more readily than others."
msgstr ""
"運動不足と怠惰な食生活の結果か、それとも生来の素質なのか、普通の人より運動によって疲労"
"しやすい体質です。通常よりスタミナと心肺強度が減少しています。"

msgid ""
"Whether or not you ever wondered what would happen if one was to attach a shotgun atop "
"a sword, the result of such an inquiry now rests before you in all its metallic "
"glory.  Coming outfitted with a large 17 inch sword bayonet and a wooden heat shield "
"to protect the user's hands from the barrel when it heats up during firing, this pump-"
"action shotgun practically drips menace and looks like it's straight out of the "
"trenches of World War I.  There aren't any more trenches to clear, so the next zombie-"
"infested town will have to suffice."
msgstr ""
"剣とショットガンを合体させたらどうなるか考えた人がいるかどうかは知りませんが、その結果"
"はメタリックな輝きを放ちながら目の前に存在しています。長さ約43cmの大型銃剣と、発射時に"
"発熱する銃身から手を守る木製ヒートシールドが付属している、第一次世界大戦時の塹壕から"
"やってきた威圧感のあるポンプアクションショットガンです。もう掃討すべき塹壕はありませ"
"ん。次はゾンビが蔓延る街に繰り出しましょう。"

msgid ""
"Whether to trigger a popup window when completing an achievement.  First: when "
"completing an achievement that has not been completed in a previous game."
msgstr ""
"実績獲得時のポップアップ表示を設定します。初獲得: 以前に獲得していない実績を獲得したと"
"きのみ表示。"

msgid ""
"Whether yer hunting varmints, fixing up the ranch, or heading into the sunset, this is "
"the hat for the job."
msgstr "害獣駆除、農地整備、夕陽に向かって歩き出す、そんな時はこの帽子の出番です。"

msgid ""
"Whether you're hunting boar or hunting zombies, you know how to stab with your spear."
msgstr "イノシシだろうがゾンビだろうが、槍で上手く指す方法を心得ています。"

msgid "Whew… smells like skunk!"
msgstr "ヒューッ...ハッパの臭いだ！"

msgid "Which bionic do you wish to uninstall?"
msgstr "どのCBMを摘出して欲しい？"

msgid "Which craft or disassembly to work on?"
msgstr "作業を再開するアイテムを選択"

msgid "Which job?"
msgstr "どの依頼の話だ？"

msgid "Which module to attach to the %s?"
msgstr "%sに取り付けるモジュールを選択"

msgid "Which part to refill?"
msgstr "補充を実行する部品を選択"

msgid "Which part to siphon from?"
msgstr "抜取を実行する部品を選択"

msgid "Which plants do you want to have harvested?"
msgstr "どの作物を収穫しますか？"

msgid "Which seeds do you wish to have planted?"
msgstr "どの種を植える？"

msgid "Which signal should activate the item?"
msgstr "どの信号でアイテムを有効化しますか？"

msgid "Which trait?"
msgstr "どの依頼の話だ？"

msgid "While %s was framing a building, one of the walls began to collapse…"
msgstr "%sが建物の骨組みを組み立てている最中に、壁の一部が崩れ始めました..."

msgid "While %s, a skulking figure approaches %s…"
msgstr "%s中の%sに、何かが忍び寄ります..."

msgid ""
"While Cataclysm: The Last Generation has more tasks to keep track of than many other "
"games, the modern setting of the game makes some tasks easier.  Firearms, medications, "
"and a wide variety of tools are all available to help you survive."
msgstr ""
"Cataclysmは他のゲームよりも多くの作業を必要としますが、近未来が舞台なので、現代世界より"
"簡単にこなせる作業もあります。銃器や薬物など、多種多様なアイテムが揃っており、文明崩壊"
"後の世界を生き延びるのに役立ちます。"

msgid ""
"While activated, your muscles will be greatly enhanced, increasing your strength by 20."
msgstr "起動すると筋肉が大幅に増強されます。発動中は筋力に+20のボーナスを得ます。"

msgid ""
"While active, a tiny device in your inner ear periodically generates ultrasonic pulses "
"which aid in navigation, provided you are underwater and able to hear."
msgstr ""
"起動すると、聴覚が正常な状態で水中にいる際に、定期的に周囲を探査する超音波パルスを放出"
"します。"

msgid ""
"While cutting through the skin of the creature you notice a resemblance to both "
"mushroom skin and animal skin.  Odd."
msgstr ""
"死体の表皮を切り裂きました。キノコの表皮にも動物の皮にも似ている、奇妙な感触です。"

msgid ""
"While dreaming you look into a mirror and see a frighteningly insectoid reflection."
msgstr "夢の中で鏡を見ると、虫のような恐ろしい姿になっていました。"

msgid "While dreaming, a reflection of yourself appears almost like an octopus."
msgstr "夢の中で、身体のほとんどがタコのような姿になっていました。"

msgid "While dreaming, you see a distinctively lizard-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr "夢の中で、自分はトカゲのような姿になっていました。"

msgid "While dreaming, you see a distinctively rabbit-like reflection of yourself."
msgstr "夢の中で、自分はウサギのような姿になっていました。"

msgid "While dreaming, you see yourself dressed in a hospital gown, receiving treatment."
msgstr "夢の中で、自分は病院のガウンを羽織り、治療を受けていました。"

msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see yourself in a pond, your face has widened and is covered in "
"mucus."
msgstr "池の中にいる夢を見ました。顔は平らになり、全身が粘液で覆われていました。"

msgid ""
"While dreaming, you see yourself weighted down under massive backpack/tent upon your "
"back, as you pass by a mirrored surface."
msgstr ""
"巨大なリュックサック、あるいはテントのようなものを背負い、鏡面を移動する夢を見ました。"

msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed against a warm-blooded opponent, there is a chance that a "
"successful hit will drain body heat, inflicting a small amount of extra damage and "
"recharging the user's bionic power reserves slightly."
msgstr ""
"温血生物への素手攻撃が命中すると、一定確率で与ダメージがわずかに増加し、敵の熱を吸収し"
"て自身の電力へと変換します。"

msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed against a warm-blooded opponent, there is a chance that a "
"successful hit will drain body heat, inflicting a small amount of extra damage, and "
"increasing your power reserves slightly."
msgstr ""
"温血生物に対して素手で攻撃を成功させれば、 少ない追加ダメージを負わせ、体温を吸収して電"
"力を増やすチャンスがあります。"

msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed, or with a weapon that conducts electricity, there is a chance "
"that a successful hit will shock the user's opponent, inflicting extra damage and "
"disabling them temporarily at the cost of some energy."
msgstr ""
"素手での格闘時、または導電性の武器を用いた戦闘時、敵に近接攻撃が命中すると一定確率で電"
"撃が発生し、電力を若干消費して敵に追加ダメージを与え一時的に麻痺させます。"

msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed, or with a weapon that conducts electricity, there is a chance "
"that a successful hit will shock your opponent, inflicting extra damage and disabling "
"them temporarily at the cost of some energy."
msgstr ""
"素手での格闘時、または導電性の武器を用いた戦闘時、敵に近接攻撃が命中すると確率で電撃攻"
"撃を発生させます。 成功した場合、電力を若干消費して敵に追加ダメージと一時的な麻痺を与え"
"ます。"

msgid "While foraging, a beast began to stalk %s…"
msgstr "食料調達の道中、野獣が %s  を追跡し始めました..."

msgid ""
"While its individual fingers appear to be losing their dexterity, the zombie's flexor "
"muscles are tense and swollen."
msgstr ""
"指の一本一本は器用に動きそうに思えませんが、折り曲げるための筋肉だけは大きく発達してい"
"ます。"

msgid ""
"While magazines and clips are often firearm-specific, on some occasions a magazine/"
"speedloader is compatible with several other firearms or calibers.  Below are some "
"examples of calibers that might share magazines or speedloaders:\n"
"\n"
".380 ACP and 9mm Luger,\n"
".40 S&W and 10mm Auto,\n"
".45 ACP and .460 Rowland, and\n"
".45 Colt and .454 Casull."
msgstr ""
"弾倉やクリップは大抵各銃器に固有のものですが、場合によっては複数の銃器や口径と互換性が"
"あります。以下は、共通の弾倉やスピードローダーを装填できる可能性のある口径の例です。\n"
".380口径ACP弾と9mmパラベラム弾\n"
".40口径S&W弾と10mmオート弾\n"
".45口径ACP弾と.460口径ローランド弾\n"
".45口径コルト弾と.454口径カスール弾"

msgid ""
"While many survivors would have focused on trying to bring back electric lights, "
"whoever lives here has apparently decided to make use of the changes wrought by the "
"Cataclysm to provide light.  This vivarium contains soil, strange plants you don't "
"recognize immediately, and most strikingly, a giant mutant firefly."
msgstr ""
"大抵の生存者は電気を使って照明を復旧しようとするものですが、ここの住人は、大変動による"
"環境変化を利用して光源を確保することにしたようです。飼育容器の中には、土と見たこともな"
"い奇妙な植物、そして驚くべきことに、変異した巨大なホタルが入っています。"

msgid ""
"While not quite as cool by itself as the name might imply, this large wooden cabinet "
"can store a variety of things, like a TV and media systems, with shelving space and "
"cupboards for anything that'll fit."
msgstr ""
"この家具自体に格好いい要素はありませんが、テレビやメディアシステムなど、様々なものを収"
"納でき、食器を置くスペースや棚も付いています。"

msgid ""
"While outwardly plant like, the creature's muscles look surprisingly similar to those "
"of normal animals."
msgstr "外見は植物のように見えますが、体内の筋肉は驚くほど動物のものにそっくりです。"

msgid ""
"While scavenging, %s's party suddenly found itself set upon by a large mob of undead…"
msgstr "収集活動中、%s の部隊が突然大量のゾンビの群れに見つかってしまいました..."

msgid ""
"While some parts of the blackened brain have lost their wrinkles, in others the "
"wrinkles are surprisingly uniform."
msgstr ""
"黒ずんだ脳のある部分の皺が消えていますが、他の部分には驚くほど均一な皺が入っています。"

msgid ""
"While still formidable, this furry hide has lost a lot of its bulk to better endure "
"the summer months."
msgstr ""
"密集していることには変わりありませんが、夏の暑さに負けないよう毛がかなり抜け落ちまし"
"た。"

msgid ""
"While the roots of the plant creature contain muscles and veins, they also contain "
"finer networks indicating a use for nutrient uptake when the roots are lodged into the "
"soil."
msgstr ""
"この植物の根には筋肉と葉脈が編み込まれていますが、更に細い管も通っています。根を土に刺"
"して栄養を吸収するために使っていたのでしょう。"

msgid ""
"While the shortnose sturgeon is still large, it is nothing compared to its cousin - "
"the lake sturgeon.  What really sets it apart, however, is its signature shorter snout."
msgstr ""
"ウミチョウザメは大型ですが、近縁種であるミズウミチョウザメには及びません。非常に妙な形"
"状の短い鼻が特徴的です。"

msgid ""
"While there's not much to loot, gas stations are a good source for gasoline, to power "
"tools or to make Molotov cocktails."
msgstr ""
"そこまで多く見かけないが、ガソリンスタンドは燃料や電動工具、火炎瓶の素材集めにぴったり"
"だ。"

msgid ""
"While these are certainly imbued with warp, they don't seem to have any supernatural "
"powers beyond just growing quickly.  A nice option if you want to re-plant grass on "
"your island, for decoration's sake."
msgstr ""
"転移の力が染み込んだ草の種ですが、生長が早いこと以外に特別な力はないようです。空島に草"
"を植えて装飾したいときに役立ちます。"

msgid ""
"While this bionic is active, the user's hearing will be drastically improved, allowing "
"them to hear ten times better than the average person.  Additionally, high-intensity "
"sounds will be automatically dampened before they can damage the user's hearing."
msgstr ""
"起動中は聴覚を常人の10倍まで強化します。 更に、鼓膜にダメージを与えるような大音量も、問"
"題なく聞き取れるように自動的に減衰させます。"

msgid ""
"While this book claims crystals can be used to cast offensive spells, you suspect it "
"might be more effective to just throw them."
msgstr ""
"水晶は攻撃呪文を唱えるのに使えると書いてありますが、正直に言えば、投擲した方が効果的な"
"武器になる気がします。"

msgid ""
"While this seems like it would be very useful in this situation, the sheer amount of "
"misinformation present makes it practically useless."
msgstr ""
"現在のような状況にこそ必要な本に思えますが...内容のほとんどが誤った情報なので実際は役に"
"立ちません。"

msgid ""
"While this system is powered, the user's body will produce very little odor, making it "
"nearly impossible for creatures to track them by scent."
msgstr ""
"電源が入っている間は身体がほとんど匂いを発しなくなり、匂いを辿って追跡され辛くなりま"
"す。"

msgid ""
"While this system is powered, your body will produce very little odor, making it "
"nearly impossible for creatures to track you by scent."
msgstr ""
"このシステムに電力が供給されている間は、身体からほとんど匂いを発しなくなります。生物が"
"匂いで追跡する事を困難にします。"

msgid ""
"While touching the screen, wait this long before showing the virtual joystick and "
"repeating input, in milliseconds.  Also used to determine tap/double-tap detection, "
"flick detection and toggling quick shortcuts."
msgstr ""
"画面をタッチしてから仮想ジョイスティックが表示され入力操作が繰り返されるまでの時間を、"
"ミリ秒単位で設定します。この設定値はタップ/ダブルタップ検出、フリック検出、クイック"
"ショートカット切り替えにも使用されます。"

msgid ""
"While using the virtual joystick, deflecting the stick beyond this distance will "
"trigger directional input.  Specified as a percentage of longest screen edge."
msgstr ""
"仮想ジョイスティック使用時に、設定値より大きくスティックを傾けると方向が入力されます。"
"画面の端から端までを100としてパーセントで指定します。"

msgid ""
"While using the virtual joystick, deflecting the stick by this much will repeat input "
"at the deflected rate (see below).  Specified as a percentage of longest screen edge."
msgstr ""
"仮想ジョイスティック使用時に、設定値より大きくスティックを傾けると入力が繰り返されます"
"(下記参照)。画面の端から端までを100としてパーセントで指定します。"

msgid ""
"While we are blessed with a bountiful stock, we need a way to preserve our newer food, "
"mainly those potatoes Darryl's growing.  Fortunately, he brought a book on canning "
"things.  We need five canning pots to get the setup going in full fashion."
msgstr ""
"食料の備蓄は増えてきましたが、生鮮食品、特にダリルが育てているジャガイモの保存方法を考"
"えなければなりません。幸いなことに、彼は保存食作りの本を持っていました。本格的な保存食"
"を作るには、食料を瓶に詰めるための寸胴鍋が5つは必要なのだそうです。"

msgid ""
"While we chat, what say you we open a beer and just… pretend the world isn't ending."
msgstr "雑談中にビールを空ければ...世界の崩壊について悩まずにいられそうだな。"

msgid ""
"While we've managed to secure day to day food supplies, it's very much hand to mouth.  "
"Our reserves would barely last a few days if something kept our people locked in.  We "
"need a stockpile to avoid that.  Thanks to our outpost we have a bit of meat and "
"vegetables coming in, but we need a better way to preserve them.  Some of our people "
"know enough about food canning that if we had a good stock of canning jars, we could "
"make pickles and canned meats to get us set for the winter.  I'll pay you a premium "
"rate if you can bring us around a hundred jars to get us started."
msgstr ""
"毎日の配給食料は確保できたが、それも一時しのぎに過ぎない。外へ出られない状況になった"
"ら、食料はほんの数日しか持たないだろう。もっと備蓄食料が必要だ。拠点のお陰で肉や野菜も"
"少しずつ入ってくるが、長持ちさせる方法を考えないとな。瓶詰のやり方に詳しい奴はいるか"
"ら、密閉できる瓶さえたくさんあれば、冬に向けて肉の塩漬けや酢漬けを作っておける。瓶を100"
"個持ってきてくれたら、報酬をたっぷり支払おう。"

msgid ""
"While wielded, this item allows you to mine through rocks and other hard obstacles by "
"moving into tiles with them.  Note that automatic mining option should be set to true "
"for this to work."
msgstr ""
"このアイテムの装備中、岩などの障害物があるタイルに移動しようとすると、それらを掘削でき"
"るようになります。この機能を使うには、オプションの自動掘削をtrueに設定する必要がありま"
"す。"

msgid ""
"While you are cutting into it, the creature suddenly moves and grabs one of your "
"limbs.  Despite considerable effort, you are unable to pry open the creature's iron "
"grip and resign yourself to chop off the hand instead."
msgstr ""
"切り刻んでいた怪物の手が突然動き、がっちりと掴まれてしまいました。必死に引き剥がそうと"
"しましたが、万力のように締め付けられて外れそうにありません。仕方なく、怪物の腕の付け根"
"から切り落としました。"

msgid ""
"While you might be forgiven for expecting instructions for party decorating, it is in "
"fact a novel about baseball.  In the final climactic game a young star proves to "
"himself that he is ready for the big leagues."
msgstr ""
"バンティング(三角旗)の飾り方を学べると期待している人もいるかもしれませんが、これは野球"
"に関する小説です。決勝戦の試合で、若いスター選手が大リーグも狙えるほどの高い技術を見せ"
"つけます。"

msgid "While you were partying, I studied the blade."
msgstr "お前がパーティーを楽しんでいる間、ずっと刃物の研究をしていたんだ。"

msgid "Whilst dreaming, you see a disturbingly bestial version of yourself."
msgstr "夢の中で、気味の悪い野獣のような姿に変身していました。"

msgid "Whipping Tongue"
msgstr "舌の鞭"

msgid "Whirling Strikes"
msgstr "酩酊拳"

msgid "Whirrrr"
msgstr "ブゥン。"

msgid "Whiskers"
msgstr "頬髭"

msgid "Whiskey"
msgstr "ｳｨｽｷｰ"

msgid "Whistle at your animals pulling vehicles to follow you."
msgstr "口笛を吹いて動物の注意を引き、車両を牽引させました。"

msgid "Whistle at your animals pulling vehicles to stop following you."
msgstr "口笛を吹くのを止め、車両の牽引を止めさせました。"

msgid "Whistle of Tindalos"
msgid_plural "Whistles of Tindalos"
msgstr[0] "ティンダロスの笛"

msgid "White Bird Wings"
msgstr "鳥翼"

msgid "White Dye"
msgstr "白い死神、"

msgid "White Feathers"
msgstr "白い死神、"

msgid "White House jigsaw puzzle"
msgid_plural "White House jigsaw puzzles"
msgstr[0] "ジグソーパズル(ﾎﾜｲﾄﾊｳｽ)"

msgid ""
"White feathers have grown to cover your entire body, providing a marginal protection "
"against attacks and minor protection from cold.  They also provide a natural "
"waterproofing."
msgstr ""
"きらびやかな虹色の羽根が全身を覆っています。多少の攻撃と寒さを防ぎます。天然の防水機能"
"があります。"

msgid "White hair threaded with beads."
msgstr "エメラルドをあしらった光り輝く銀のティアラです。"

msgid ""
"White polymer lines painted on the pavement which indicate places where pedestrians "
"should cross the road."
msgstr "歩行者が車道を横断する場所を示す、舗装道路に塗られた白い樹脂塗料の線です。"

msgid "Whitelist"
msgstr "許可"

msgid "Whitelist enemy"
msgstr "ホワイトリスト登録"

msgid "Whitelist/blacklist category"
msgstr "ホワイトリスト/ブラックリスト(分類)"

msgid "Whitelist/blacklist item"
msgstr "ホワイトリスト/ブラックリスト(アイテム)"

msgid "Who"
msgstr "乗員"

msgid ""
"Who I was is gone, dead… died when I put down the monsters wearing the face of my "
"friends.  Ever since then, I've felt nothing but disgust for myself.  Let's not "
"<swear> reminisce."
msgstr ""
"私だったものはもう、死んだ...友人の顔をした化け物を倒した時に死んだんだ。それ以来、自分"
"自身には嫌悪感しか浮かばない。<swear>、過去の話は止めだ。"

msgid ""
"Who I was is gone.  All that stuff burned away in <the_cataclysm>.  Got it?  Who I am "
"now started two days into it.  I was on the run from a big-ass hell zombie, running "
"like I'd always been doing, when I found a stick laying on the ground.  I took it as a "
"sign and beat that gooey bastard to a pulp… and that's when I became me.  I still run, "
"because who doesn't, but I stand my ground now."
msgstr ""
"かつての私は死んだ。<the_cataclysm>で全部燃え尽きた。分かるか？私が生まれてまだ2日しか"
"経っていない。バカみたいにデカいゾンビから、いつもやってるみたいに逃げてた時、丁度いい"
"棒が落ちてるのを見つけたんだ。それが啓示だった。そのクソゾンビを肉片に変えてやった...そ"
"して今の私が生まれた。私はまだ逃げ続けている、当然だ。でも、今の私は自分の足で立ってい"
"る。"

msgid "Who are the Old Guard?"
msgstr "オールドガードとは誰だ？"

msgid "Who are you again?"
msgstr "あなたは誰だっけ？"

msgid "Who are you, and what are you doing here?"
msgstr "誰だ？ここで何をしている？"

msgid "Who are you, exactly?"
msgstr "それで、あなたは誰だ？"

msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr "あなたは誰だ？"

msgid "Who are you?  Are you real?"
msgstr "誰だ？幻覚じゃないのか？"

msgid "Who are you?  This is a refugee center, right?"
msgstr "あなたは誰だ？ここは避難センター、で間違いないか？"

msgid "Who are you?  Where am I right now?"
msgstr "あなたは誰だ？ここは何の場所なんだ？"

msgid "Who are you?  Would you like to trade?"
msgstr "誰だ？物資の取り引きか？"

msgid ""
"Who can say, really?  I don't really have a strong plan.  Depends on how this trip "
"goes.  Once my vehicle is full up, I'll have to head back to my hideout and check on "
"everyone there.  I don't like being gone too long."
msgstr ""
"目的地なんて、分からないさ。しっかりした計画は立てていない。その時の状況次第で決めるん"
"だ。車の燃料が満タンになったら、皆の様子を見に拠点に帰らないといけないし、そこまで長く"
"ふらつくつもりはないよ。"

msgid ""
"Who cares what's up with me?  You're the new one here.  Let me put it another way: "
"what have you seen out there?  I'm talking about the monsters that lurk deep in the "
"woods.  Have you witnessed them with your very own eyes?"
msgstr ""
"俺の話なんざ誰が喜ぶんだ？折角新入りが来たのに。分かりやすく言おうか。外で何を見た？森"
"の奥に潜む怪物のことだよ。その目で見たのか？"

msgid "Who do you want to send?"
msgstr "派遣する仲間を選択"

msgid "Who exactly are you?"
msgstr "あなたは何者なんだ？"

msgid "Who goes there?"
msgstr "誰かいる？"

msgid "Who is \"everyone\"?"
msgstr "「皆」とは誰のことだ？"

msgid "Who is \"you and yours\"?"
msgstr "「皆の分」ってことは、誰かと一緒なのか？"

msgid "Who is this Tindalos guy?"
msgstr "ティンダロスって誰？"

msgid "Who keeps spinning the world around?"
msgstr "世界を回し続けているのは誰だ？"

msgid ""
"Who knew you could mix maple syrup and peanut butter to create yet another tasty "
"sandwich?"
msgstr ""
"メープルシロップとピーナッツバターを混ぜると美味しいサンドイッチができるなんて、一体誰"
"が考えたのでしょう？"

msgid ""
"Who made the Bermuda Triangle?  How did they build Stonehenge?  What did the alien "
"king whisper in Cleopatra's ear that passionate night in the dunes?  These answers and "
"more in the Alien Theorists' latest exposé."
msgstr ""
"バミューダトライアングルは誰が作ったのか？ストーンヘンジはどうやって作られたのか？情熱"
"的な砂漠での夜、エイリアンの王はクレオパトラの耳に何をささやいたのか？これらの答えは、"
"エイリアン研究家の著者が記したこの本を読めば明らかになります。"

msgid "Who needs rebar?"
msgstr "誰が鉄筋を欲しがるんだ？"

msgid "Who needs skin when you can have a hard carapace?"
msgstr "硬い甲羅があるのに、どうして皮膚なんか必要なのでしょうか？"

msgid "Who ordered a dirt nap for"
msgstr "葬式の準備をしないとな、"

msgid "Who put you in charge of what I do?"
msgstr "どうして私に命令するんだ？"

msgid "Who said that?"
msgstr "何か言った？"

msgid "Who should follow you?"
msgstr "誰が追従しますか？"

msgid "Who should guard here?"
msgstr "誰がここを見張りますか？"

msgid "Who should move?"
msgstr "移動を指示する仲間を選択"

msgid "Who should participate in the training seminar?"
msgstr "訓練セミナーの参加者を選択"

msgid "Who should participate?"
msgstr "参加者を選択"

msgid "Who should return?"
msgstr "帰還させる仲間を選択"

msgid "Who should we assign?"
msgstr "誰に作業を任せますか？"

msgid "Who takes care of you here?"
msgstr "誰に面倒を見てもらってるんだ？"

msgid "Who the fuck are you?  How did you get down here?  Security!"
msgstr "どこのバカだ？どうやってここへ来た？警備員！"

msgid "Who was this person, and what do they look like?"
msgstr "目当ての人物は何者で、どんな外見なんだ？"

msgid ""
"Who watches the watchmen?  Pirate Jenny, that's who!  This swashbuckling adventure "
"novel will make you feel swell."
msgstr ""
"誰が見張りを見張るのか？それは海賊ジェニー、彼女だ！この剣戟アドベンチャー小説が、あな"
"たを感情の渦に巻き込みます。"

msgid "Who would have these sorts of things?"
msgstr "誰が帳簿を管理しているんだ？"

msgid "Who's Jeremiah?"
msgstr "ジェレミアとは誰だ？"

msgid "Who's Katherine?"
msgstr "キャサリンとは誰だ？"

msgid "Who's in charge here?"
msgstr "ここの責任者は誰だ？"

msgid "Who's still standing?  Me."
msgstr "まだ生きてるな？"

msgid "Who's there?"
msgstr "誰だ？"

msgid ""
"Whoa!  Your terminal is tiny!  This game requires a minimum terminal size of %dx%d to "
"work properly.  %dx%d just won't do.  Maybe a smaller font would help?"
msgstr ""
"おおっと！画面が小さすぎます！このゲームが正常に動作するには%dx%dより大きい画面サイズが"
"必要です。%dx%d丁度では動作しません。フォントサイズをもっと小さくしてみては？"

msgid "Whoa, calm down, no reason to get heated."
msgstr "まあまあ、落ち着いてくれ。そんなに興奮することはない。"

msgid ""
"Whoah whoah, calm down.  Yikes.  Yeah fine, we're good.  Just stop making that face, "
"it's too much for me.  Gives me feelings."
msgstr ""
"おい、落ち着け。うわっ、ああ、やめろ、もう十分だ。そんな顔で見るな、勘弁してくれ。感情"
"が昂ってしまう。"

msgid ""
"Whoah whoah, calm down.  Yikes.  Yeah fine, we're good.  Just stop trying to spook me, "
"I don't like it."
msgstr ""
"おい、落ち着け。うわっ、ああ、やめろ、もう十分だ。わたしを怖がらせようとするな、勘弁し"
"てくれ。"

msgid ""
"Whoever decided to transcribe my lab reports into farcical entries of the 'SCP "
"Foundation' and proceeded to distribute the edited reports across the lab should be "
"aware that: not only did I not find this 'joke' funny, but that such actions are also "
"considered to be in breach of your confidentiality agreement.  A breach that I will "
"see appropriately punished.\n"
"\n"
"------\n"
"Dr. Ethan Catherwood\n"
"Physics Department"
msgstr ""
"私の研究レポートを「SCP財団」の馬鹿げた項目の一つとして転載し、編集を施したレポートをラ"
"ボ全体にばら撒こうとした者は、この文章をよく読むこと。私はこのような「ジョーク」を面白"
"いとはまったく思っていないし、秘密保持契約に違反する行為だと見なしている。違反行為は適"
"切に罰せられることになるだろう。\n"
"------\n"
"物理部門\n"
"イーサン・キャザウッド博士"

msgid "Whole Gale"
msgstr "全強風(24.5m～28.5m)"

msgid "Whole Room"
msgstr "部屋全体"

msgid "Whole Room for a Cost"
msgstr "部屋全体(コスト)"

msgid "Whole fresh eggs, dehydrated into an easy to store powder."
msgstr "新鮮な卵を乾燥させ、保存しやすい粉末状にした食材です。"

msgid "Whole fruits preserved in 40 proof or higher alcohol."
msgstr "20度以上のアルコールで漬けた果実です。"

msgid ""
"Whole wheat or barley kernels that have been boiled in water.  Very bland on their "
"own, but will do if you can't prepare them in a different way."
msgstr ""
"小麦や大麦などの粒を丸ごと茹でたものです。そのままでは非常に淡泊な味ですが、他に調理が"
"できないならこれでも十分食べられます。"

msgid ""
"Whole-grain wheat cereal.  It's surprisingly good, and allegedly good for your heart."
msgstr "全粒穀シリアルです。非常に美味しく、元気が湧く食事だと宣伝されています。"

msgid ""
"Whoo-ee, someone was living under a rock, huh?  It was all over the news.  Video on "
"YouTube, it was a livestream of one of the riots in Minneapolis.  A mom was…\"  They "
"hesitate.  \"I don't want to go into detail, but it was real bad.  Real bad.  That's "
"what set off people panicking."
msgstr ""
"えっ、洞窟にでも棲んでたのか？ニュースでやってただろう。YouTubeの動画、ミネアポリスでの"
"暴動を撮ったライブストリーミングだよ。母親が子を...」クランベリーは続きを言うのをためら"
"いました。「詳しくは言いたくない、本当に酷かった。本当にね。それがパニックを広げたん"
"だ。"

msgid "Why are you camped out here if they won't let you in?"
msgstr "中に入れてもらえないにしても、どうしてここで寝泊りしているんだ？"

msgid "Why are you following me?"
msgstr "どうして付いてくるんだ？"

msgid "Why are you living here then?"
msgstr "どうしてこんなところで寝泊まりしているんだ？"

msgid "Why are you repeating 'spirals' over and over again?"
msgstr "どうして「うずまき」としか言わないんだ？"

msgid "Why are you sitting out here?"
msgstr "どうしてこんな所に座っているんだ？"

msgid "Why are you smoking crack cocaine?"
msgstr "高純度コカインなんて吸ってるのか？"

msgid "Why are you such a horrible leader?"
msgstr "どうしてこんな奴がリーダーを務めているんだ？"

msgid "Why are you touching this when you should be finding kitten?"
msgstr "なんでこんなものに構っているんです？子猫を探すべきでは？"

msgid "Why aren't you wearing any pants?"
msgstr "どうしてズボンを履いていないんだ？"

msgid "Why cardboard?"
msgstr "どうして段ボールなんだ？"

msgid "Why cornmeal, jerky, and fruit wine?"
msgstr "なぜコーンミールと、ジャーキーと、果実酒なんだ？"

msgid "Why did Brigitte say you're dangerous?"
msgstr "ブリジットはあなたを危険人物だと言っていた。何故だろう？"

msgid "Why did the hit go that way?"
msgstr "衝撃を感じましたが、何だったのでしょうか？"

msgid "Why did you join the Church?"
msgstr "この教会の一員になった理由は？"

msgid "Why did you leave me?"
msgstr "どうして置き去りにするんだ？"

msgid "Why did you leave your bunker?"
msgstr "どうして地下壕から出てきたんだ？"

msgid "Why did you leave your hideout?"
msgstr "どうして隠れ家から出てきたんだ？"

msgid "Why didn't you hunt these trophies yourself?"
msgstr "どうして戦利品を自分で狩りに行かなかったんだ？"

msgid "Why didn't your parents raise you?"
msgstr "どうして両親に養育されなかったんだ？"

msgid "Why do you ask?"
msgstr "どうしてそんな事を聞くんだ？"

msgid "Why do you gather these bones again?"
msgstr "どうして骨を集めるんだ？"

msgid "Why do you kill people?"
msgstr "どうして人々を殺すんだ？"

msgid "Why do you say that?"
msgstr "どうしてそんなことを言うんだ？"

msgid "Why do you still use cash?"
msgstr "どうして未だに現金を使うんだ？"

msgid "Why do you want me to do it?"
msgstr "どうして私にやらせるんだ？"

msgid "Why don't I come back to your hideout?"
msgstr "あなたの拠点へ行ってもいい？"

msgid "Why don't you blow this joint and come with me?"
msgstr "ここを出て私と一緒に来ないか？"

msgid "Why don't you come with me?"
msgstr "一緒に来ないか？"

msgid "Why don't you go back there?"
msgstr "実家に戻らないのか？"

msgid "Why don't you go somewhere else?"
msgstr "どうして他の場所に移らないんだ？"

msgid "Why don't you hunt these trophies yourself?"
msgstr "どうして戦利品を自分で狩りに行かないんだ？"

msgid "Why don't you leave this place?  Come with me, I could use some help out there."
msgstr "どうしてここに留まるんだ？私と一緒に来て、手伝ってほしい。"

msgid "Why don't you put your hands up for me <name_g>."
msgstr "ちょっと手を上げてもらえないか、<name_g>。"

msgid "Why don't you scavenge your own food?"
msgstr "どうして食べ物を探しに行かないんだ？"

msgid ""
"Why else would I ask about your shelter?  I don't need your gear.  I don't need your "
"help.  Look around you!  I'm tracking down the last free thinkers who have been "
"putting the puzzle pieces together.  It's YOU I'm after!"
msgstr ""
"他にシェルターのことを聞く理由があるか？ここの道具など必要ない。お前の助けも必要ない。"
"考えても見ろ！私はパズルのピースを組み立てているんだ。自由思想家の生き残りを追い詰める"
"ためにな。そう、お前のことだよ！"

msgid "Why have you failed us?!"
msgstr "私を裏切ったのですか！？"

msgid "Why haven't they gone anywhere else?"
msgstr "どうして他の場所に移ろうとしないんだ？"

msgid "Why is it so cold in here?  And so hot, at the same time?"
msgstr "どうしてこんなに寒気がするのでしょう？どうして熱さも感じているのでしょう？"

msgid "Why live out here?"
msgstr "どうしてここで寝泊まりしているんだ？"

msgid "Why not move to the Tacoma Commune?"
msgstr "タコマ生活共同体へ移るのはどうだ？"

msgid ""
"Why not?  Everyone else does, so I suppose that's all that matters.  My ATM over there "
"still works, connected to the bank servers and everything."
msgstr ""
"逆にどうして使わない？皆が現金を使う、それが重要なのさ。私のATMは銀行などのあらゆるサー"
"バーに接続されているんだ。"

msgid "Why not?  I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "断るわけにはいかないな？できる限りのことをやってみよう。"

msgid ""
"Why not?  Now that it's all finally come to a head, maybe some of your theories are "
"right."
msgstr "どうして？陰謀が真実だったと証明できる状況がようやく訪れたかもしれないのに。"

msgid ""
"Why not?  Oversharing is kind of my thing anyway.  Got any more interview questions?"
msgstr ""
"どんどん聞いてよ？個人情報バラ撒きは私の趣味みたいなものだからさ。何かインタビューした"
"いことある？"

msgid "Why should I host a training seminar?"
msgstr "どうして訓練セミナーを開く必要があるんだ？"

msgid "Why should I share my equipment with you?"
msgstr "どうして持ち物をあげないといけないんだ？"

msgid "Why should I teach you?"
msgstr "どうして教えなきゃならないんだ？"

msgid "Why should I travel with you?"
msgstr "何故、一緒に旅をする必要があるんだ？"

msgid ""
"Why spend so much effort keeping it locked down?  I thought you mentioned they weren't "
"able to help."
msgstr "何故そこまでして守るんだ？下の階の住人は戦闘の役にも立たないんだろう。"

msgid "Why stay here of all places?"
msgstr "何故こんなところに居座っているんだ？"

msgid "Why stay out here then?"
msgstr "どうしてここに留まり続けるんだ？"

msgid "Why walk when you can use a car?  Or a bike?  Or rollerblades?"
msgstr "徒歩ではなく車で移動してみては？それとも自転車？ローラーブレードはどうでしょう？"

msgid ""
"Why was a guy with your skillset guarding a warehouse?  Must've been some warehouse."
msgstr "能力が高そうな君がどうして倉庫なんて警備していたんだ？"

msgid ""
"Why was someone with your skillset guarding a warehouse?  Must've been some warehouse."
msgstr "能力が高そうな君がどうして倉庫なんて警備していたんだ？"

msgid ""
"Why waste time with 'doctors' or 'medicine'?  This guide will teach you to harness the "
"innate healing power of crystals and nurture your soul."
msgstr ""
"まだ「医者」や「医療」で時間を無駄にしているのですか？このガイドブックでは、水晶のもつ"
"本質的な癒しの力を利用して魂をはぐくむ方法をご紹介します。"

msgid "Why waste your time on that insignificant speck?"
msgstr "なぜそんな些細なことを気にかけるんだ？時間の無駄では？"

msgid ""
"Why were you looking though?  I kid, I know she is hard to miss!  In English, the "
"special package she is a woman no?  No.  I see.  And so do you it seems.  Yes.  There "
"was such a clown, a clown of enormous physical beauty.  The pale, perfect skin, the "
"ruby red lips, amazing hair, and what a sense of humor.  I laugh still, though I have "
"lost everything.  My pants, my money, my many illegal imported triple magnum condoms I "
"stole from a priest.  All lost to that one beautiful night.  The candles, the "
"balloons, the singing.  It was the most romantic children's birthday party you could "
"hope to imagine.  I would do it all again, and there was so much we did.  It was the "
"end of that party, but the beginning of something beautiful, for several hours in that "
"open minivan we found.  But you do not want to hear of such pleasures, I do not want "
"to get you excited, for what can I do when I look so foolish, and lack the protection "
"needed for more serious excitement.  Though and you must understand, Alonso's tongue "
"is good for more than just the telling of long and saucy stories yes?"
msgstr ""
"何を見てるんだい？いや冗談さ、彼女を放ってはおけなかったからね！ええと、この言語だとイ"
"チモツがある奴を彼女とは呼ばないんだっけ？呼ばないか。なるほど。そういうことね。よし。"
"あるところに、大柄で美しいピエロがいた。白く傷一つない肌、ルビーレッドの唇、艶やかな"
"髪、更にユーモアのセンスまで持っていた。私は今も笑顔は忘れていないが、他の全てを失っ"
"た。ズボン、お金、ある司祭から盗み取った大量の密輸トリプルマグナムコンドーム。全てを、"
"あの美しい夜に失ったんだ。ロウソク、風船、歌声。想像しうる中で最もロマンチックな子供向"
"けの誕生日パーティーだった。もう一度やり直したいが、そうするにはやるべきことが多すぎ"
"る。パーティーは終わり、私とピエロは開けっ放しのミニバンに乗り込んで、素敵な時間が始"
"まった。でも、君はそういう悦楽については聞きたくないようだな。私も君を興奮させるつもり"
"はない。バカげた話だけど、安全が確保できてない状況で深く興奮なんてできないからね。私に"
"はどうしようもない。知っておいてほしいのは、アロンソの舌は長いということだ。気の利いた"
"長話をする以外の使い道もあるんだよ？"

msgid "Why would someone leave a gun store open in all this chaos?"
msgstr "こんな状況で、どうして銃砲店が開けっ放しだったんだろう？"

msgid "Why would that be?"
msgstr "何故だろう？"

msgid "Why would they have an issue with each other?"
msgstr "ジェレミアとキャサリンはどうして上手くいっていないんだ？"

msgid "Why would you do that?"
msgstr "なぜそんなことを？"

msgid "Why'd you move out here?"
msgstr "どうしてロードアイランドを離れたんだ？"

msgid "Why, where were you before?"
msgstr "以前はどこにいたんだ？"

msgid ""
"Wicked.  Been around the old road long enough ta know how ta handle myself in a "
"pinch.  Knew my way around a gun ever since my da taught me when I was a kid, so ya "
"don't have ta worry about me doing my part."
msgstr ""
"ケッ。昔っから道端で生きてきたんだ。ピンチの時にどう動けばいいかは分かってるさ。銃の使"
"い方も子供の頃に親父から教わった。ちゃんと自分の役目は果たすさ、心配すんなって。"

msgid "Wickerworking"
msgstr "木材加工"

msgid "Wide Mouth"
msgstr "大きな口"

msgid "Wide Mouth Bite"
msgstr "大きな口"

msgid "Wide Strike"
msgstr "一掃攻撃"

msgid "Wide move down"
msgstr "下へ大移動"

msgid "Wide move left"
msgstr "左へ大移動"

msgid "Wide move right"
msgstr "右へ大移動"

msgid "Wide move up"
msgstr "上へ大移動"

