msgid "Wienermobile"
msgstr "ウィンナーモービル"

msgid "Wiggle your big toe."
msgstr "動け、でっかいつま先。"

msgid "Wild burdocks that have been battered and deep-fried.  Very tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "野生のゴボウに衣をつけて揚げたものです。非常に美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

msgid "Wild dandelion flowers that have been pan fried.  Very tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "野生のタンポポの花を揚げたものです。非常に美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

msgid ""
"Wild dandelions and burdocks that have been battered and deep-fried.  Very tasty and "
"nutritious."
msgstr "野生のタンポポとゴボウに衣をつけて揚げたものです。非常に美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

msgid "Wilderness"
msgstr "野外活動"

msgid "Wilhelm Tell?  Never heard of."
msgstr "ウィリアム・テル？知らない人ですね。"

msgid "Will Not Bash"
msgstr "破壊禁止"

