msgstr "いいよ、<name_g>。"

msgid "Will do, thanks!"
msgstr "そうするよ、ありがとう！"

msgid "Will do."
msgstr "そうしよう。"

msgid "Will get wet:"
msgstr "水没:"

msgid "Will heal injuries all over your body."
msgstr "全身の傷を治癒します。"

msgid "Will never buy this"
msgstr "売却不可"

msgid "Will not buy back their own gear"
msgstr "売った商品は買い戻さない"

msgid "Will not buy filthy items"
msgstr "不潔なアイテムは売却できない"

msgid "Will of the Island"
msgid_plural "Will of the Islands"
msgstr[0] "空島の意志"

msgid "Will they be bothering us any longer?"
msgstr "悩みを解決してくれたかい？"

msgid "Will this weapon work on other robots, as well?"
msgstr "この銃は、他のロボットに対しても使えるのか？"

msgid "Will try to kill you or flee from you if you reveal yourself."
msgstr "あなたが近づけば殺そうか逃げようとしています。"

msgid ""
"Will you be able to place the arrow right into the bullseye?  It is not that easy, but "
"once you know how it's done, you will have a lot of fun with archery."
msgstr ""
"君は的の中心に矢を当てられますか？もちろん、それは簡単な事ではありません。しかし、弓術"
"を正しく学べば、多くの楽しみが待っていますよ。"

msgid ""
"Will you have a future?  Will any new generations be born… your pounding head is full "
"of worry."
msgstr ""
"これからどうしましょう？新世代は生まれるのでしょうか...頭の中に心配事が次々と浮かびま"
"す。"

msgid "Will your burrow be warm enough for the family in winter?"
msgstr ""
"この巣穴で冬の間家族と快適に過ごせるでしょうか？不安がよぎった瞬間目が覚めました。"

msgid "Willa"
msgstr "ｳｨﾗ"

msgid "William G. Morgan, the Godfather of Volleyball"
msgid_plural "copies of The Godfather of Volleyball"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/ウィリアム・G・モーガン:バレーボールの父)"

