msgstr "息切れ(右脚)"

msgid "Windowed borderless"
msgstr "ウィンドウ(ふち無し)"

msgid "Windows"
msgstr "窓"

msgid ""
"Wine that has been distilled to a higher proof.  Great as an after-dinner drink, but "
"packs a punch."
msgstr ""
"果実酒を蒸留して作られる度数の高い酒です。食後酒として好まれますが、なかなかガツンと効"
"きます。"

msgid "Winemaking"
msgstr "ワイン製造"

msgid "Winemaking for Beginners"
msgid_plural "copies of Winemaking for Beginners"
msgstr[0] "本(学習/ワイン醸造入門)"

msgid "Winemaking is an art form.  This book teaches you how to crayon within the lines."
msgstr "ワイン造りは芸術です。この本には典型的なワイン醸造の手順が書かれています。"

msgid "Wing Chun"
msgstr "詠春拳"

msgid ""
"Wing Chun is a Chinese martial art that began by selecting the easiest-to-learn "
"effective techniques from the various Shaolin animal forms.  It has a high stance, "
"with one's weight resting entirely on the rear leg.  Wing Chun focuses on sensitivity "
"to the opponent's direction of force, and flowing around it to create opportunities "
"for attack."
msgstr ""
"詠春拳は、少林拳に伝わる動物を模した形の中から特に習得しやすく効果的な技を選りすぐった"
"中国拳法です。姿勢を正し、前後に開いた足の後部に体重をかけて構えます。力の向きを鋭敏に"
"感じ取り、円を描くような動きで敵の攻撃を逸らして反撃に移ります。"

msgid "Wing Slap"
msgstr "武装弾き"

msgid "Wing Stubs"
msgstr "翼状突起"

msgid ""
"Winners don't do drugs.  They're too valuable.  Winners trade drugs for more bullets."
msgstr ""
"勝者は注意深く慎重であり、ドラッグに手を出しません。勝者はドラッグを売って弾薬をたっぷ"
"り手に入れます。"

msgid "Winnie"
msgstr "ｳｨﾆｰ"

msgid "Winston"
msgstr "ｳｨﾝｽﾄﾝ"

msgid "Winter"
msgstr "冬"

msgid ""
"Winter claims the last few vestiges of your flowers, leaving your crown bare of "
"adornment."
msgstr "冬の寒さによって花の痕跡が奪い取られ、頭部が寂しい状態になりました。"

msgid ""
"Winter is a harsh lady.  You need fire to survive, to heat yourself and your water and "
"food.  Keep a cooking device to melt what is frozen, and a thermos for the liquids."
msgstr ""
"冬は過酷な季節だ。生き残るには、自分の身体と水と食べ物を温める火が必要になる。凍ったも"
"のを溶かせる調理器具と液体を保存できる魔法瓶を用意しておこう。"

msgid ""
"Winter is harsh.  Liquids and food may freeze, and you may need to defrost them using "
"a cooking appliance.  Placing them by a lit fire might also help.  Basements are "
"warmer in winter and cooler in summer, so they are frequently good places to store "
"your excess food.  Most food decays with time, and that process can be sped up or "
"slowed down by the temperature.  Frozen food will not rot.  It you are able to bring a "
"freezer or a fridge back to life, it will help you in the long run.  If these are out "
"of your reach, think about constructing a root cellar."
msgstr ""
"冬は厳しい季節です。飲食物の中には、凍ってしまうと調理器具を使って解凍しない限り食べら"
"れないものもあります。火の傍に置いておけば解決するかもしれません。地下室は冬暖かく夏涼"
"しいため、食料の備蓄場所にうってつけです。大抵の食料は時間が経つと腐りますが、腐敗まで"
"の速度は温度によって変化します。凍ったままの食べ物は腐敗しません。冷凍庫や冷蔵庫が機能"
"すれば長期的な生活で役立ちますが、そんな文明の利器に手が届かないと言うなら、貯蔵穴を建"
"設してみてはいかがでしょうか。"

msgid "Wire Making"
msgstr "ワイヤー加工"

msgid "Wire-Induced Stiffness"
msgstr "稼働阻害配線"

msgid "Wire-Induced Stiffness CBM"
msgid_plural "Wire-Induced Stiffness CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 稼働阻害配線"

msgid "Wired Reflexes"
msgstr "反射神経活性化"

msgid "Wired Reflexes CBM"
msgid_plural "Wired Reflexes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "CBM: 反射神経活性化"

msgid "Wiry Whiskers"
msgstr "硬い頬髭"

msgid "Wish I could, <name_g>."
msgstr "それができたらいいんだけどね、<name_g>。"

msgid "Wish granted.  Wish for more or hit [%s] to quit."
msgstr "願いは叶えられました。まだ願い事をするか、[%s]で終了します。"

msgid ""
"Wisps of iridescent energy spark around this immense stone like miniature fireworks, "
"leaving behind a satisfying showers of pebbles.  Clay and soil shift around its base, "
"erupting in slow motion yet never overflowing.\n"
"\n"
"The power of this stone allows you to produce rocks and natural earthen items from "
"material tokens via the crafting menu.\n"
"Just one of these could last forever."
msgstr ""
"巨石の周囲で虹色のエネルギーの粒子が花火のように輝き、小石を大量に噴き出し続けていま"
"す。底の辺りでは粘土と土がゆっくりと湧き出し、流れ続けていますが、決して溢れることはあ"
"りません。\n"
"\n"
"この岩石の力によって、製作メニューから資材トークンを大地から採れる資材に変えることがで"
"きます。\n"
"一個でも置かれていれば永遠に利用し続けることができます。"

msgid "Witchcraft Today"
msgid_plural "copies of Witchcraft Today"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/今日の魔女術)"

msgid "Witchcraft for Beginners"
msgid_plural "copies of Witchcraft for Beginners"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/呪術入門)"

msgid ""
"With Fast Scroll option enabled, shift view on the overmap and while looking around by "
"this many squares per keypress."
msgstr ""
"高速スクロール有効時の、カーソルを上下左右斜めに移動させた際の移動タイル数を設定しま"
"す。"

msgid "With a beep, the empty vending machine shuts down."
msgstr "ビープ音が鳴り、空の自動販売機が運転を停止しました。"

msgid "With a clang and a shudder, the %s pump goes silent."
msgstr "大きな音を立てながら何度か振動した後、%sのポンプは静かになりました。"

msgid "With a few deft slices you take the skin from the corpse."
msgstr "死体から手際よく皮を剥ぎ取りました。"

msgid "With a few determined moves you put out the fire in the %s."
msgstr "%sの火を消しました。"

msgid ""
"With a few quick steps, you can completely change your orientation and dodge attacks "
"easier.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill.\n"
"Lasts 1 second.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"最小限の動きで勢いよく方向転換し、攻撃をたやすく回避します。\n"
"\n"
"回避スキル+1.0\n"
"1ターン継続、最大蓄積数2"

msgid "With a loud buzz, the <npc_name> roars to life!"
msgstr "大音量と共に、<npc_name>が生き生きと動き出しました！"

msgid "With a loud crack the piston extends, sending %s reeling"
msgstr "轟音と共にピストンが%sに叩きつけられました！"

msgid "With a roar, the <npc_name> screams to life!"
msgstr "唸り声をあげて、<npc_name>が生き生きと動き出しました！"

msgid "With a roar, the chainsaw screams to life!"
msgstr "咆哮をあげてチェーンソーが生き生きと動き出しました！"

msgid "With a roar, the corded electric chainsaw screams to life!"
msgstr "咆哮をあげて電動チェーンソーが生き生きと動き出しました！"

msgid "With a roar, the electric chainsaw screams to life!"
msgstr "咆哮をあげて電動チェーンソーが生き生きと動き出しました！"

msgid "With a roar, the hedge trimmer leaps to life!"
msgstr "咆哮をあげてヘッジトリマーが躍りだしました！"

msgid "With a roar, the pole saw screams to life!"
msgstr "咆哮をあげてポールソーが生き生きと動き出しました！"

msgid "With a satisfying click, the lock and the display case opens."
msgstr "カチッと音がして、陳列ケースの鍵が開きました。"

msgid "With a satisfying click, the lock on the cabinet opens."
msgstr "カチッと音がして、キャビネットの鍵が開きました。"

msgid "With a satisfying click, the lock on the door opens."
msgstr "カチッと音がして、ドアの鍵が開きました。"

msgid "With a satisfying click, the lock on the gate opens."
msgstr "カチッと音がして、門の鍵が開きました。"

msgid "With a satisfying click, the lock on the gun safe door opens."
msgstr "カチッと音がして、銃保管庫の鍵が開きました。"

msgid "With a satisfying click, the lock on the safe opens!"
msgstr "カチッと音がして、金庫の鍵が開きました！"

msgid "With a satisfying click, the lock opens."
msgstr "カチッと音がして、鍵が開きました。"

msgid "With a satisfying click, the locked glass panel opens."
msgstr "カチッと音がして、ガラスパネルの鍵が開きました。"

msgid ""
"With a seat or saddle, you drive from here.  You can 'e'xamine the tile to access the "
"controls, or use the vehicle control key (default '^')."
msgstr ""
"座席やサドルに座り、ここから車両を運転します。このタイルを調べる(e)か車両運転を開始する"
"(^)と車両の運転が可能になります。"

msgid "With a snarl, the <npc_name> screams to life!"
msgstr "咆哮をあげて、<npc_name>が生き生きと動き出しました！"

msgid ""
"With a stinger the size of a kitchen knife, this dog-sized insect's black and yellow "
"markings warn you to leave it undisturbed."
msgstr ""
"キッチンナイフのような針をもつ、イヌほどのサイズの昆虫です。黒と黄色の縞模様は近寄る者"
"に警告するサインです。"

msgid ""
"With a terrible shriek the mercenary falls off the spike and begins to move.  It "
"stares right at you before vanishing.  In the distance you can hear a radio squelch:\n"
"\"Target acquired.  Falling back, regroup and prepare to attack the intruder.\""
msgstr ""
"傭兵は恐ろしい悲鳴と共に柱の中から抜け出し、しばらくこちらをじっと見つめ、やがて消えま"
"した。どこからか無線機の音が聞こえてきます。\n"
"『目標を捕捉。後退し、部隊を再編制せよ。侵入者への攻撃に備えろ。』"

msgid ""
"With all that's been going on, it's been more and more difficult to find a smoke.  My "
"stash has been running low for a while now.  Think you could help me out here?  A few "
"packs is all I need."
msgstr ""
"こんな状況じゃ、タバコを探すのも大変だ。私の持っている分もだいぶ少なくなってきた。"
"ちょっと助けてもらえないかな？タバコをいくつか持ってきてくれるだけでいいんだ。"

msgid ""
"With all this glass, you expected it to be brighter here.  It's not.  That's okay, it "
"would have hurt your eyes otherwise."
msgstr ""
"これ程ガラスがあるならもっと光を透過しそうですが、周囲はそこまで明るくありません。目を"
"傷める心配はせずに済みそうです。"

msgid "With byproduct"
msgstr "副産物"

msgid ""
"With cuts and pulls equally similar to both extraction and vandalism, you scrape "
"together the most important parts of the creature."
msgstr ""
"肉を切り裂き、引き抜き、採取とも破壊ともとれる作業を経て、生物の構成要素を集めました。"

msgid ""
"With each cut, the stinger springs from its sheath, tip bending ever so slightly "
"towards your leg"
msgstr "刃を入れる度に針が体内から飛び出し、足を狙っているかのように先端が動きます"

msgid ""
"With every cut the creature shifts slightly, splayed limbs inching closer to how it "
"looked when it was…alive?  Whatever the right word is you hope it stopped, if only for "
"now"
msgstr ""
"肉塊は刃を入れる度にピクピクと動き、広がった肢が形を変え...正常な動物だった頃の姿に戻っ"
"ているのでしょうか？確信はできませんが、見ていて楽しいものではありません"

msgid "With friends"
msgstr "仲間と遊ぶ"

msgid "With great power…"
msgstr "大いなる力には..."

msgid ""
"With its claim to fame being its ease of portability when compared to other "
"conventional rifles and carbines, the Kel-Tec SUB-2000 is a uniquely-designed pistol "
"caliber carbine sporting an integral folding mechanism and chambered for 9x19mm "
"cartridges, making use of regular Glock compatible magazines.  With its mechanism "
"engaged, the barrel assembly swings rearwards and causes the firearm to fold to half "
"its regular length, packing up into a very compact package with ergonomics "
"unfortunately having to take a backseat to allow for the weapon's extreme "
"portability.  With a mainly polymer constructed receiver, the carbine is relatively "
"light and incredibly transportable when fully folded."
msgstr ""
"他のライフルやカービンに比べて携帯性に優れており、折り畳み機構や9x19mm弾倉、グロック弾"
"倉との互換性など、ユニークなデザインが特徴的なピストルカービンです。銃身を後方に折り畳"
"むと通常の半分の長さになり、人間工学に基づいた非常にコンパクトなデザインが携帯性の高さ"
"を実現しています。機関部は主にポリマー素材でできているため比較的軽く、完全に折り畳めば"
"驚くほど持ち運びやすくなります。"

msgid ""
"With its gray skin swollen to near-rupture with putrid gas, this cyst-covered zombie "
"looks like it could violently burst under the slightest of disturbances."
msgstr ""
"腫瘍に覆われたこのゾンビは、灰色の皮膚が腐敗ガスで破裂しそうなほど膨れ上がっています。"
"少しの衝撃を与えただけでも破裂してしまいそうです。"

msgid ""
"With its joints in odd places and angles, this humanoid creature prowls across the "
"landscape with surprising speed.  Its teeth and arms are sharpened into fine points, "
"and greasy putrescence constantly seeps from its shredded skin."
msgstr ""
"奇妙な位置に奇妙な曲がり方の関節があるこの人間型クリーチャーは、驚くべきスピードで辺り"
"を動き回ります。その歯と腕は鋭くとがり、筋肉の間からは黒いドロドロが漏れ出しています。"

msgid ""
"With its swollen gray skin overgrown by thick layer of mold, this balloon-like fungal "
"zombie looks like it could violently burst into a cloud of noxious spores at any "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"真菌に覆われたこのゾンビは、灰色の皮膚が破裂しそうなほど膨れ上がっており、少しの衝撃を"
"与えただけでも有害な胞子をまき散らしそうです。"

msgid ""
"With my brains and your brawn we'll make an excellent team.  A regular solar panel "
"will do just fine."
msgstr ""
"知力担当の私と体力担当のあなた、きっといいチームになるはず。ああ、ソーラーパネルは普通"
"の性能の奴で十分だよ。"

msgid ""
"With near non-existent recoil and inexpensive ammunition, rifles like this one are "
"popular introductory firearms.  It has a built in magazine, capable of holding an "
"impressive amount of its small cartridges.  You could take small game with this, but "
"anything bigger might not even notice."
msgstr ""
"反動がほぼないことと弾薬が安価なことから、入門者に人気が高いライフルです。弾倉は一体化"
"しており、小さな弾薬を大量に装填できます。小動物であれば狩れそうですが、大型動物は撃た"
"れたことにも気づかないかもしれません。"

msgid ""
"With over 10 million made, the Remington 870 is one of the most popular shotguns on "
"the market, and finds use with hunters and law enforcement agencies alike thanks to "
"its high accuracy and muzzle velocity.  This one is a 28 inch barreled model for "
"hunting fowl and game."
msgstr ""
"1000万丁以上製造されている、市場で最も人気の高いショットガンの一つです。精度と初速に優"
"れているため、狩猟や法執行機関での運用にも適しています。このモデルの銃身は約71cmあり、"
"鳥などの野生動物の狩猟に適しています。"

msgid ""
"With over 10 million made, the Remington 870 is one of the most popular shotguns on "
"the market, and finds use with hunters and law enforcement agencies alike thanks to "
"its high accuracy and muzzle velocity.  This one is an 18.5 inch barreled defensive "
"model."
msgstr ""
"1000万丁以上製造されている、市場で最も人気の高いショットガンの一つです。精度と初速に優"
"れているため、狩猟や法執行機関での運用にも適しています。このモデルの銃身は約47cmあり、"
"護身用に適しています。"

msgid ""
"With plates of asymmetrical bone tissue overlapping its body, this ignoble steed needs "
"no rider for you to fear its approach.  Completing its ghoulish look is an overgrown "
"skull which, judging by the flattened and battered forehead, has become its main "
"weapon."
msgstr ""
"骨の鎧が左右非対称に重なり合った、頑強そうな骨の獣です。乗り手はいませんが、近付く者に"
"恐怖を抱かせる姿をしています。特に目につくのは大きく成長した頭蓋骨です。額の部分は何度"
"も衝撃を受けたように平たく潰れており、この怪物が頭蓋骨を主な武器として戦っていることが"
"分かります。"

msgid ""
"With practiced movements, <npcname> transitions from a failed strike into another "
"strike."
msgstr "<npcname>は攻撃を外しましたが、洗練された所作で素早く次の攻撃に移りました。"

msgid ""
"With practiced movements, you transition from a failed strike into another strike."
msgstr "攻撃は外れましたが、洗練された所作で素早く次の攻撃に移りました。"

msgid ""
"With some basic survival and crafting skills, you should be able to make them with "
"little effort."
msgstr "基本的なサバイバルと製作のスキルがあれば、簡単に用意できるはずだが。"

msgid "With some effort, you pull your weapon free."
msgstr "現実すら凌駕する知恵を手にしました。"

msgid ""
"With some success under your belt, you feel ready to tackle more ambitious "
"expeditions, and the island seems to know it.\n"
"A new recipe has been learned.  Craft this artifact to permanently upgrade the "
"island.\n"
"\n"
"EFFECT: You will be able to select Large Expeditions when leaving via the warp "
"obelisk.  Large Expeditions last 2x as long, but mission targets and exit points are "
"significantly farther away."
msgstr ""
"順調に成功を重ねています。更に野心的な遠征に取り組む準備ができたと感じており、空島もそ"
"れを理解しているようです。\n"
"新たなレシピを習得しました。このアーティファクトを製作し、島を永続的にアップグレードし"
"ましょう。\n"
"効果: 転移のオベリスクから出発する際に、長期遠征を選択できるようになります。長期遠征は"
"制限時間が通常の2倍に延びますが、ミッション目標と帰還地点までの距離がかなり遠くなりま"
"す。"

msgid "With spinnerets like THESE, who needs rope?!  Activate to produce rope."
msgstr ""
"こんな立派なロープを排出できるなんて、いったい誰が使うんでしょうか！？有効化するとロー"
"プを生成します。"

msgid ""
"With the barn entrances enclosed, the refugees moving in there should feel safer, but "
"the weather can be bitter here.  We're going to need to build makeshift beds in the "
"stalls to ward off disease and frostbite.  We can take care of the frames, but will "
"need your help looting blankets.  We'd need 25 blankets to provide the most basic "
"sleeping accommodations."
msgstr ""
"入口を強化したことで、納屋はずっと安全になった。しかし、このままでは天候に無防備だ。病"
"気や凍傷の発生を防ぐため、納屋に簡易ベッドを設置して寝床を調えておきたい。木材はこちら"
"でなんとかするから、君にはブランケットを集めてきてほしい。差し当たり25枚もあれば、それ"
"なりの寝床になるだろう。"

msgid "With the black box in hand, we need to find a lab."
msgstr "ブラックボックスが手に入ったなら、今度は研究所を探そう。"

msgid "With the creature dead, its carapace comes away surprisingly easily"
msgstr "既に死んでいるためか、外殻は驚くほど簡単に剥がれました"

msgid "With the right amount of glue, there is nothing I can't do."
msgstr "接着剤さえ用意できれば不可能はありません。"

msgid ""
"With the source of the radio tower's interference fixed, return to Hub 01 with "
"Cranberry."
msgstr ""
"電波塔の電波が干渉を受ける原因を取り除き、クランベリーと共にハブ01へ戻りましょう。"

msgid ""
"With the supplied recipe, you will be able to expand the capacity of your secure "
"container to its maximum size.\n"
"\n"
"EMPTY YOUR SECURE CONTAINER FIRST!  Anything left inside when upgrading will be lost "
"forever!"
msgstr ""
"習得した製作レシピを利用して、保護コンテナの容量を最大まで拡張できます。\n"
"\n"
"必ず、現在の保護コンテナの内容物を全て取り出した後に製作してください！制作時に内部に"
"残っていたアイテムは全て永久に失われます！"

msgid ""
"With the supplied recipe, you will be able to expand the capacity of your secure "
"container.\n"
"\n"
"EMPTY YOUR SECURE CONTAINER FIRST!  Anything left inside when upgrading will be lost "
"forever!"
msgstr ""
"習得した製作レシピを利用して、保護コンテナの容量を拡張できます。\n"
"\n"
"必ず、現在の保護コンテナの内容物を全て取り出した後に製作してください！制作時に内部に"
"残っていたアイテムは全て永久に失われます！"

msgid ""
"With the well's completion, we are rapidly closing the sustainability gap.  In order "
"to expand from here, we will need massive quantities of lumber to construct "
"fortifications and new buildings.  We have already begun work on a manually operated "
"sawmill, but we will need two electric motors to control the actual blades.  We were "
"hoping you might be able to secure the motors for us."
msgstr ""
"井戸が完成したお陰で、ここの暮らしは格段に安定したよ。更なる拡大と発展に向けて、防衛の"
"強化や新しい建築物のために大量の木材が必要になるだろう。簡単な製材所はもう作り始めてい"
"るのだが、君には製材機のブレードを動かす電気モーターを2つ調達してきて欲しい。"

msgid ""
"With things as they are you probably won't just find a boat lying around.  Maybe make "
"one?  Maybe swim?"
msgstr ""
"この辺りでボートを見つけるのは難しいだろうな。自作してみては？それがだめなら、泳いで行"
"くのはどうだ？"

msgid ""
"With this upgrade, you're guaranteed to begin your expedition at an underground lab.  "
"Be aware that you will need to have a Labs Catalyst on you when activating the warp "
"obelisk, and these will be consumed on leaving."
msgstr ""
"このアップグレードによって、地下研究所から開始する遠征を選べるようになりました。研究触"
"媒を所持した状態で転移のオベリスクを調べる必要があり、研究触媒は出発時に消費されます。"

msgid ""
"With this we'll be able to convince others to invest in the commune.  Thank you, "
"here's your money.  We also managed to get a manual crank hooked up to the garage in "
"the back, so feel free to make use of that - you've been a great help to us."
msgstr ""
"日曜大工全書があれば、共同体の運営を手伝うよう他の皆を説得できるだろう。ありがとう、謝"
"礼を渡そう。裏手のガレージに手回しクランクを取り付けたから、その区画も自由に使ってく"
"れ。本当に助かったよ。"

msgid "With this, you'll be fixing those bugs faster than ever!"
msgstr "これなら更に素早くバグを修正できるかもしれません！"

msgid "With two, we should be able to repair one if it breaks."
msgstr "2つ必要だ。溶接機が壊れたら、修理するには溶接機が要るだろう？"

msgid "Withdraw Money"
msgstr "引出"

msgid "Withdraw how much?  Max: %d cent.  (0 to cancel) "
msgid_plural "Withdraw how much?  Max: %d cents.  (0 to cancel) "
msgstr[0] "引出金額を入力　最大: %dセント(0で取消) "

msgid "Withdrawal"
msgstr "禁断症状(アヘン)"

msgid "Within %s of %s (%s remaining)"
msgstr "%s以内にモンスターを殺害する(%s時点から計測、残り%s)"

msgid "Within %s of %s (passed)"
msgstr "%s以内にモンスターを殺害する(現在%sから目標時間経過済み)"

msgid "Within interaction range"
msgstr "会話範囲内"

msgid ""
"Within moments you're ready and up.  You don't feel like anything could stop you today!"
msgstr ""
"元気一杯に寝床から跳ね起きました。今日のあなたは誰にも止められません！そんな気がしま"
"す！"

msgid "Within radio range"
msgstr "無線範囲内"

msgid "Without Hunger"
msgstr "食欲無効"

msgid "Without a doubt."
msgstr "間違いありません。"

msgid ""
"Without extra fuel it might burn yet for between %s to %s, but might also go out "
"sooner."
msgstr "%sから%sは燃え続けそうですが、焚物を追加しなければすぐに消えてしまいます。"

msgid "Without extra fuel it might burn yet for maybe %s, but might also go out sooner."
msgstr "%sは燃え続けそうですが、焚物を追加しなければすぐに消えてしまいます。"

msgid "Without extra fuel it will burn for %s."
msgstr "焚き木を追加しなくても%sは燃え続けそうです。"

msgid "Without extra fuel it will burn for between %s to %s."
msgstr "焚物を追加しなくても%sから%sは燃え続けそうです。"

msgid ""
"Without glasses, your seeing radius is severely reduced!  However, you are guaranteed "
"to start with a pair of glasses."
msgstr "メガネなしでは視界が大幅に狭まります！開始時の所持品にメガネが追加されます。"

msgid ""
"Without me, my rifle is useless.  Without my rifle, I am useless.  I will keep my "
"rifle clean and ready, even as I am clean and ready.  We will become part of each "
"other."
msgstr ""
"我なくして銃役立たず。銃なくして我役立たず。我的確に銃を撃つなり。我が銃を常に清く保ち"
"備えん。我が体を常に清く保ち備えるがごとく。我らは共に一体とならん。"

msgid ""
"Without reading glasses, you are unable to read anything, and take penalties on melee "
"accuracy and electronics/tailoring crafting.  However, you are guaranteed to start "
"with a pair of reading glasses."
msgstr ""
"老眼鏡を着用していないと文字が読めず、近接攻撃の命中精度と電子工学、裁縫スキルを使う製"
"作にペナルティーを受けます。開始時の所持品に老眼鏡が追加されます。"

msgid "Without some fuel, I'm gonna be obsolete."
msgstr "燃料がないと、足手まといになってしまう。"

msgid "Witness me stand tall!"
msgstr "勇姿を見ておいてくれ！"

msgid ""
"Woah woah woah, cool your jets.  I can't let this spread about me, so name your price "
"and keep quiet, and I might give you a discount."
msgstr ""
"おっとっと、落ち着きなって。そんな噂を広められちゃ困る。黙っててくれたら、それなりのも"
"んは支払う。それに、今後は割引価格で商売してやってもいい。"

msgid ""
"Woah, <name_g>, I don't even know where to start.  The riots?  I think it was going on "
"sooner than that.  There were bad murmurs going on a few weeks before that happened.  "
"Lots of really scary crimes, not your usual stuff but like cannibalism and some real "
"unspeakable shit, you know?  When the riots started, I think I was already primed to "
"think of it as something different from a normal equality riot or anything like that.  "
"I think that's part of how I got out safer, I had had some time to get some stuff and "
"get going.  People were abso-fuckin-lutely crazy in those days.  It was a lot like the "
"pandemic a few years back, except for all of the gruesome violence everywhere."
msgstr ""
"はぁ、<name_g>、何が発端なのかすら分からないよ。暴動か？いや、兆候はそれ以前からあっ"
"た。数週間前から変な噂が広まっていたんだ。本当に恐ろしい、普通じゃない犯罪、誰かが人を"
"食ったとか、口にも出したくない類の話を聞いただろ？だから、暴動が始まった時は既に、これ"
"は普通じゃないって気がしていたんだ。それもあってか、安全なうちに避難できた。あの頃は皆"
"メチャクチャにイカレていた。何年か前にあった感染症の大流行を思い出したけど、あの時でも"
"こんなに酷い暴力が横行したりはしなかった。"

msgid "Woah, lucky for you.  How did you find out about <the_cataclysm>?"
msgstr "わぁ、運が良かったな。どうやって<the_cataclysm>の事を知ったんだ？"

msgid ""
"Woah, woah, we're just a little short on space here.  The game requires a minimum "
"terminal size of %dx%d to run.  %dx%d isn't quite enough!  Can you make the terminal "
"just a smidgen taller?"
msgstr ""
"あらあら、ほんの少し広さが足りませんね。このゲームが正常に動作するには%dx%dより大きい画"
"面サイズが必要です。%dx%d丁度では動作しません。もう少し縦幅を広げてみては？"

msgid ""
"Woah, you're really intent, hey?  That's a lot for most people here.\"  The money "
"exchanges hands.  \"That's enough to get two people off guard duty for an afternoon, "
"even with all the ugliness back there.  And you know what?  I'll help out, too, so "
"make that three.  I can appreciate someone who's willing to put their money where "
"their mouth is."
msgstr ""
"おいおい、随分と気前がいいんだな？ここの住人にとっちゃ大金だ...[スモークスはマーチを受"
"け取った]...これだけあれば、午後の警備担当を2人は引き抜ける。それから、もちろん俺も手伝"
"うから、3人がかりで仕事ができる。あんたが太っ腹で助かるよ。"

msgid "Woman of Color"
msgid_plural "copies of Woman of Color"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/ウーマン・オブ・カラー)"

msgid "Women"
msgstr "女性"

msgid "Won't display content or suffix matches"
msgstr "容器アイテムと接尾辞を表示しない"

msgid "Won't sell their own equipment"
msgstr "所持アイテムは販売しない"

msgid "Won't you run out of propane?"
msgstr "プロパンガスが不足しないのか？"

msgid "Wonderful!  I'll start the smelting as soon as possible."
msgstr "でかした！これで選別を始められる。"

msgid "Wonderful!  I'm sure this will be quite helpful."
msgstr "素晴らしい！とても助かるよ。"

msgid ""
"Wonderful!  Now I just need to get an undamaged, complete archive, and we can really "
"figure out what happened."
msgstr ""
"本当に素晴らしい！後は破損のない記録データさえあれば、何が起こったのか把握できそうだ。"

msgid "Wonderful!  Thank you so much!  This will keep me running for a long, long time."
msgstr "やった！本当にありがとう！これで停電とはおさらばだな。"

msgid "Wonderful!  This should do for a while."
msgstr "でかした！これでしばらくは持ちそうだ。"

msgid "Wonderful, let me know when it is done."
msgstr "良かった。終わったら教えてくれ。"

msgid "Wondering how it all happened, any ideas?"
msgstr "どうしてこんなことになったのか、思い当たることはないのか？"

msgid ""
"Wondering if the whole world is like this now.  It has to be, right?  I was watching "
"some foreign news channels when everything was going down, and it sounded like things "
"were just as bad there…"
msgstr ""
"今、世界中がこんな感じなのかって、考えてたんだ。きっとそうなんだろうな。世界が崩壊した"
"とき、外国のニュース番組を見たけれど、こっちと同じくらい酷い状況だった..."

msgid "Wood"
msgstr "木材"

msgid "Wooden Cabin Cruiser"
msgstr "木造キャビンクルーザー"

msgid ""
"Woodlice reproduce by carrying their eggs in a pouch and releasing them as juveniles.  "
"Their mancae look like small adults except for their pale color."
msgstr ""
"ワラジムシは親が抱える卵嚢の中で育ち、幼体になるとそこから這い出します。サイズと体色の"
"薄さ以外は、成虫と同じ姿をしています。"

msgid "Woodworker"
msgstr "製材工"

msgid "Woodworking"
msgstr "木材加工"

msgid "Wool"
msgstr "羊毛"

msgid "Wool Allergy"
msgstr "羊毛アレルギー"

msgid "Wool-lined boots designed for warmth."
msgstr "暖かさを保つためのウールの裏地が付いたブーツです。"

msgid "Work here?  No, of course not.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr "ここで？いいや、違う。もう行かないと。"

msgid "Work in Progress Limb Stuff"
msgstr "変更 - 開発途中の四肢システム"

msgid "Work on any nearby Blueprint: construction zones."
msgstr "付近の建設計画区域で建設作業を進めます。"

msgid "Work on craft"
msgstr "製作を再開する"

msgid "Work on craft or disassembly"
msgstr "未完成の製作・分解を再開"

msgid "Worked On"
msgstr "被制御"

msgid ""
"Worked as a salesman - high end farming equipment.  Now I know, it may not sound that "
"fancy, but you'd be shocked at how pricy those machines can get.  I was lucky enough "
"to be on a fairly remote farm when everything went to shit.  In a way, being a "
"salesman saved me and the experience from the job might allow me to make a living in "
"the apocalypse, bartering for gear and trinkets, so I got that going for me, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"セールスマンをしていた。高性能な農機具のね。信じられないかもしれないが、農機具ってのは"
"非常に高価なんだ。世界が崩壊したときは、幸運なことに郊外の農場に来ていた。ある意味では"
"セールスマンという仕事に救われたとも言えるな。仕事の経験を生かして機械や道具を上手く"
"物々交換することで、この世界を生き延びられたんだ。"

msgid "Working at camp"
msgstr "拠点で作業中"

msgid ""
"Working copper and bronze shares a lot of techniques with blacksmithing, but the more "
"ductile copper-containing metals have a trick all their own."
msgstr ""
"銅や青銅を加工するには、高い鍛冶の技術はもちろん、より延性の高い銅含有金属加工特有のコ"
"ツが必要です。"

msgid "Working to expand your camp!\n"
msgstr "拠点拡張のために働いています！\n"

msgid "Working to harvest your fields!\n"
msgstr "土地の作物を収穫しています！\n"

msgid "Working to plant your fields!\n"
msgstr "土地に作物を植えています！\n"

msgid "Working to plow your fields!\n"
msgstr "土地を耕しています！\n"

msgid "Working with fur and faux fur is a skill all its own."
msgstr "毛皮やフェイクファーを加工する技術をもっています。"

msgid "Working with glass and heat without poisoning or perforating yourself."
msgstr "中毒になったり怪我をしたりしないように、ガラスを上手く加工する技術です。"

msgid ""
"Working with leather requires a specific set of skills and tools… a set you are "
"familiar with."
msgstr "革を加工するには、専門的なスキルと道具...できれば使い慣れた道具が必要です。"

msgid "Working with pipes and pipe fittings to transport fluids without leakage."
msgstr "パイプやパイプ継手を使って、漏れないように液体を輸送する技術です。"

msgid ""
"Working with plastic using your hands, including carving, molding, and gluing it.  You "
"know how to identify thermoplastics that are suitable for mold casting, and how to "
"identify the right plastic for the right job."
msgstr ""
"彫刻、成形、接着などのプラスチック加工技術です。金属鋳造に適した熱可塑性樹脂に関する技"
"術と、様々な作業に適したプラスチックを選ぶ知識を身に着けています。"

