msgid "Would a nomad do this?  Nope.  Don't think so."
msgstr "放浪者がそんなことするか？しないだろう。馬鹿な考えは止すんだ。"

msgid "Would you accept any money for it?"
msgstr "料金を支払ったら食べ物を貰えるのか？"

msgid "Would you be interested in bartering?"
msgstr "物資の取り引きをしないか？"

msgid "Would you be interested in trading at all?"
msgstr "物資の取り引きに興味はないか？"

msgid "Would you be willing to buy any food?"
msgstr "食べ物を買い取ってくれないか？"

msgid ""
"Would you believe that they don't!  Not a one in the whole place.  Well, maybe "
"downstairs, but that's a different matter, isn't it?  Say, you're not planning on "
"sticking around, right?  You're a free-roller, not a settler, seems like to me.  Don't "
"know if I could beg or cajole you into maybe keepin' an ear out for a new guitar for "
"me?  There gotta still be plenty out there not gettin' any love these days.  Whattya "
"say?  Help an old man play some blues?  Would be good to have some real music around "
"this place.  Be good for PEOPLE, you know what I'm sayin'?"
msgstr ""
"残念ながら持っていないんだ！そう都合のいい人はいない。まぁ、階下にはいるかもしれない"
"が、それは別の問題だろ？そう、別に考えたりこだわったりする必要のない話だと思ってるな？"
"君はここの住民でなく放浪者だ、私と一緒でね。新しいギターで君を楽しませるためなら、懇願"
"だって甘言だってするつもりだよ？こんな状態じゃ、愛を感じることすら滅多にない。そうだ"
"ろ？この老いぼれがブルースを弾くのを助けてもらえないか？ここで生演奏ができれば皆が喜ぶ"
"だろう。人々の為になることをする、言っている意味が分かるだろう？"

msgid "Would you kindly not do that?"
msgstr "そんなことをしないでもらえるか？"

msgid "Would you like me to give you some cardboard?"
msgstr "段ボールが必要か？"

msgid "Would you like something to eat?"
msgstr "何か食べ物を譲ろうか？"

msgid "Would you like to buy any supplies?"
msgstr "消耗品を買わないか？"

msgid "Would you like to come with me?"
msgstr "一緒に来てもらえないか？"

msgid "Would you like to join me on my travels?"
msgstr "私の旅に同行する気はない？"

msgid ""
"Would you like to travel with me?  Someone good with a trade could be helpful, and "
"it's got to be better than wasting away here."
msgstr ""
"私と一緒に来ないか？取り引きが上手い人はきっと役に立つし、ここで無駄な時間を過ごしてい"
"るよりはいい。"

msgid ""
"Would you please reconsider?  Arturo's had some bad hallucinations before, he'll go "
"crazy without them."
msgstr ""
"考え直してくれないか？アルトゥーロは以前も酷い幻覚症状が出たことがある。薬がないと耐え"
"られそうにない。"

msgid "Would you really touch the sacred resting place of the dead?"
msgstr "本当に神聖なる死者の寝床を暴きますか？"

msgid ""
"Wounds are incredibly dangerous to you, as they barely heal at all.  Your HP whilst "
"asleep, as well as your broken limbs, heal at 10% of the regular rate."
msgstr ""
"回復力は無いに等しく、死の危険性が付きまといます。睡眠中のHP回復速度はもちろん、骨折し"
"た手足の回復速度も通常の10%です。"

msgid "Wounds heal over time.  Bandages and antiseptic speed that up."
msgstr "傷は時間経過とともに治癒します。包帯や消毒薬を使えば治りが早まります。"

msgid "Wow!  Everything looks so… nevermind."
msgstr "うわっ！なんだかすごく...続きが思いつかない。"

msgid "Wow, crazy, I can't believe you really dreamed <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr "わぁ、それはすごい。<the_cataclysm>の事を夢で見たなんて。"

msgid "Wow, my stomach is so hungry it's talking!"
msgstr "うわっ、食べ物がなさすぎて胃が喋り出した！"

msgid ""
"Wow, perfect.  Here are some of my own remedies and if those don't work try my other "
"gift."
msgstr ""
"わぁ、完璧だよ。自作の医薬品を用意したんだ。もし効果がなかったら、他のも試してみてく"
"れ。"

msgid "Wow, perfect.  Thanks.  Here's your reward."
msgstr "よし、完璧だ。ありがとう。報酬を受け取ってくれ。"

msgid "Wow, that smell takes me back."
msgstr "わぁ、懐かしい匂いだ。"

msgid ""
"Wow, that's a lot more jars than it sounded on paper.  Thanks.  Here's your payment."
msgstr "わぁ、思っていたよりも随分たくさん瓶があるな。ありがとう。報酬をどうぞ。"

msgid "Wow, you failed?  All that work, down the drain…"
msgstr "ええっ、失敗したのか？全て失われたのか..."

msgid "Wow, you failed?  How…"
msgstr "えっ、失敗したの？どうやって..."

msgid "Wow."
msgstr "へぇ。"

msgid "Wow.  This place is <swear> crazy, I'm outta here."
msgstr "うわっ。<swear>、イカれた所に来てしまったな、もう出ていくよ。"

