msgid "You can't focus while choking!"
msgstr "窒息中は集中できません！"

msgid "You can't fold the %s while it's in motion."
msgstr "動作中は%sを折り畳めません。"

msgid "You can't get sufficient leverage to open that with your %1$s."
msgstr "%1$sの性能が低すぎてこじ開けられません。"

msgid "You can't get the %1$s on the rack."
