msgstr "殻の中からは足元のアイテムを一括移動できません。"

msgid "You can't haul things while you're riding."
msgstr "騎乗中は足元のアイテムを一括移動できません。"

msgid ""
"You can't hear anything and your head aches from all the noise.  You can't converse "
