msgstr "遠視でよく見えないため、確実な命中は期待できません。"

msgid "You can't improve your %s any further this way."
msgstr "この方法ではこれ以上%sを改善できません。"

msgid "You can't improve your %s any further, considering the degradation."
msgstr "%sは劣化しており、これ以上は修復できません。"

msgid "You can't inscribe an item that isn't solid!"
msgstr "固体でなければ字を記せません！"

msgid "You can't install a filthy CBM!"
msgstr "不潔なCBMは移植できません！"

msgid "You can't install bionics while mounted."
msgstr "騎乗中に生体部品の移植はできません。"

msgid "You can't install parts while driving."
msgstr "運転中は部品を取り付けられません。"

msgid "You can't learn this spell."
msgstr "この呪文を習得できません。"

msgid "You can't lend out books?  What kind of library is that?"
msgstr "本当に本を借りられないのか？そんな図書館があるのか？"

msgid "You can't let yourself be consumed by grief.  It will get better."
msgstr "悲しみに身を任せていてはいけない。いつか元気を取り戻せるはずだ。"

msgid "You can't light a fire in midair."
msgstr "そこには点火できません。"

msgid "You can't light a fire there."
msgstr "そこには点火できません。"

msgid "You can't look away from the faultline…"
msgstr "断層線から目を逸らせません..."

msgid ""
"You can't look away from the impossible shape, staring at it is making you feel sick, "
