msgstr ""
"不可能物体を見ていると気分が悪くなりますが、目を逸らすことができません。逃げましょう！"

msgid "You can't manage that in your current condition."
msgstr "今の状態では滑空できません。"

msgid "You can't manage to get airborne in your current state."
msgstr "今の状態では滑空できません。"

msgid "You can't mend stuff while driving."
msgstr "運転中は修理できません。"

msgid "You can't mine there."
msgstr "ここは掘れません。"

msgid "You can't move mass quantities while you're in your shell."
msgstr "殻の中ではアイテムを一括移動できません。"

msgid "You can't move mass quantities while you're riding."
msgstr "騎乗中はアイテムを一括移動できません。"

msgid "You can't move that, it's attached to the wall."
msgstr "%sを移動できません。"

msgid "You can't move the %s while you're boarding it."
msgstr "騎乗中は開けません。"

msgid "You can't move until you get free!"
msgstr "罠を外すまで動けません！"

msgid "You can't move while in your shell.  Deactivate it to go mobile."
msgstr "殻にこもっているため動けません。移動するには殻から出てください。"

msgid "You can't move!"
msgstr "一騎討ちだ！"

msgid "You can't muster the effort to throw anything…"
msgstr "投擲する気力が湧きません..."

msgid "You can't muster up the effort to throw anything…"
msgstr "投擲する気力が湧きません..."

msgid "You can't open things while you're in your shell."
msgstr "殻の中で何かを開けることはできません。"

msgid "You can't open things while you're riding."
msgstr "騎乗中は開けません。"

msgid "You can't open this lock."
msgstr "このロックは開けません。"

