msgstr "%sを所持していないと密封できません。"

msgid "You can't pass time while controlling a moving vehicle."
msgstr "車両の操縦中に待機はできません。"

msgid "You can't peek around corners while you're in your shell."
msgstr "殻の中で角を覗きこむことはできません。"

msgid "You can't peek around corners while you're riding."
msgstr "騎乗中は角を覗きこむことはできません。"

msgid "You can't peek down there."
msgstr "ここから下層を覗けません。"

msgid "You can't pick anything up while you're in your shell."
msgstr "殻の中から何かを拾得することはできません。"

msgid "You can't pick anything up while you're riding."
msgstr "騎乗中はアイテムを拾えません。"

msgid "You can't place a %s there."
msgstr "そこには%sを置けません。"

msgid "You can't place a %s there.  It contains a deployed object already."
msgstr "そこには%sを設置できません。既に設置物があります。"

msgid "You can't place a %s there.  It contains a trap already."
msgstr "そこには%sを設置できません。既に罠があります。"

msgid "You can't place items here!"
msgstr "ここにはアイテムを置けません！"

msgid "You can't place more food while it's milling."
msgstr "製粉中に追加投入はできません。"

msgid "You can't place more food while it's smoking."
msgstr "燻製中は食品を追加できません。"

msgid "You can't place that many."
msgstr "多すぎて入りません。"

msgid "You can't place the %s there!"
msgstr "そこには%sを置けません！"

msgid "You can't play multiple musical instruments at once."
msgstr "騎乗中は楽器を演奏できません。"

msgid "You can't play music underwater."
msgstr "水中では演奏できません。"

msgid "You can't play music while mounted."
msgstr "騎乗中は楽器を演奏できません。"

msgid "You can't pour there!"
msgstr "その場所へは注げません！"

msgid "You can't pry that."
msgstr "それはこじ開けられません。"

msgid "You can't put items there."
msgstr "そこにはアイテムを置けません。"

msgid "You can't put the %s away like that."
msgstr "%sをそれ自体に収納することはできません。"

msgid "You can't put the %s inside itself."
msgstr "%sをそれ自体に収納することはできません。"

msgid "You can't quite work out what the dream is about… it just keeps changing."
msgstr "常に変化し続ける...何とも形容しがたい夢を見ました。"

msgid "You can't read a computer screen."
msgstr "画面に表示された文章が読めません。"

msgid "You can't read an unpowered ebook."
msgstr "画面に表示された文章が読めません。"

msgid "You can't read, and don't understand the screen or the buttons!"
msgstr "画面やボタンの文字が読めず、意味を理解できません！"

msgid "You can't read."
msgstr "読めません。"

msgid ""
"You can't recognize what this is supposed to be, but you imagine it'd be a very "
"awkward thing to have in one's body."
msgstr "何の部品かよく分かりませんが、体内に埋め込んだまま過ごすのは非常に不便です。"

msgid "You can't refill a moving vehicle."
msgstr "動いている車両には補充できません。"

msgid "You can't reload a %s!"
msgstr "%sには装填できません！"

msgid ""
"You can't remember the last time you had a proper meal, and it's starting to take its "
"toll."
msgstr "最後にちゃんと眠ったのはいつだっけ。"

msgid "You can't remove a part of your body."
msgstr "肉体の一部は取り外せません。"

msgid "You can't repair stuff while driving."
msgstr "運転中は修復できません。"

msgid "You can't see <context_val:pos>."
msgstr "<context_val:pos>が視認できません。"

msgid "You can't see anything in front of your vehicle!"
msgstr "車両前方の視界が確保できません！"

msgid ""
"You can't see it's light, but you know the sun is there.  It's the same perfect black "
"as the rest of the sky."
msgstr ""
"光は見えませんが、どこかで太陽が輝いていることは分かります。空一面が真っ黒に塗られてい"
"ます。"

msgid "You can't see the Sun from here."
msgstr "このからでは太陽が見えません。"

msgid "You can't see the camera screen, you're blind."
msgstr "目が見えないので、カメラを撮影できません。"

msgid "You can't see the destination."
msgstr "その先は視認できません。"

msgid "You can't see the sky from here."
msgstr "ここからでは天候を確認できません。"

msgid "You can't see the terrain here."
msgstr "地形が見当たりません。"

msgid "You can't see to craft!"
msgstr "手元が見えないため製作できません！"

msgid "You can't see to do that!"
msgstr "視界が暗いため作業できません！"

msgid "You can't see to sew!"
msgstr "暗くて裁縫ができません！"

msgid "You can't see vehicles or appliances here."
msgstr "車両/設備が見当たりません。"

msgid "You can't see very far from this spot."
msgstr "あまり遠くまで見渡せません。"

msgid "You can't see well and are working slowly."
msgstr "視界が悪く、作業が遅くなっています。"

msgid "You can't see well enough to fight."
msgstr "視界が悪すぎて製作を続けられません。"

msgid "You can't self-install this CBM."
msgstr "このCBMは自力で移植できません。"

msgid ""
"You can't shake the feeling something's watching you from the dark, just out of sight."
msgstr "暗闇の中、こっそりと何者かに見られているような気がしてなりません。"

msgid "You can't siphon from a moving vehicle."
msgstr "動いている車両からは抜き取れません。"

msgid ""
"You can't sit still as you feel your heart pounding out of your chest.  You probably "
"overdosed on those stims."
msgstr "心臓が飛び出しそうで座っていられません。興奮物質を過剰摂取してしまったようです。"

msgid "You can't sleep while controlling a vehicle."
msgstr "車両の操縦中に睡眠はできません。"

msgid "You can't smash things while you're in your shell."
msgstr "殻の中で何かを叩くことはできません。"

msgid "You can't stand the sunlight!"
msgstr "日光に耐えられません！"

msgid ""
"You can't stand to prostrate yourself before your lessers and hate it when they don't "
"immediately do what you say.  Persuasion is much more difficult, but you're better at "
"lying and intimidating."
msgstr ""
"自分より立場の低い者に頭を下げるのも、言うことを聞いてもらえないのも、我慢できません。"
"他人を説得するのが非常に苦手ですが、嘘や威圧は得意です。"

msgid "You can't stop clenching your jaw."
msgstr "%sと入れ替われません。"

msgid "You can't stop shivering and twitching.  Life is so short."
msgstr "震えと痙攣が止まりません。一生がこれほどまでに短いなんて。"

msgid "You can't take it any more.  Rest first; everything else later."
msgstr "これ以上は行動できません。まずは休み、他のことは後回しにしましょう。"

msgid "You can't take that item off."
msgstr "このアイテムは脱げません。"

msgid "You can't talk."
msgstr "読めません。"

msgid "You can't taste much of anything with this cold."
msgstr "風邪を引いているので食事を味わえません。"

msgid "You can't taste much of anything with this flu."
msgstr "インフルエンザに罹っているので食事を味わえません。"

msgid ""
"You can't tell what you are anymore.  Everything and yet nothing, like you weren't "
"meant to exist.  But you do, and you're a force, no matter what happens."
msgstr ""
"己が何者であるか分かりません。まるで存在自体が間違いであるかのように、あらゆるものを持"
"ちながら何も持っていません。しかし何が起ころうと、あなたはやり遂げます。あなたこそが力"
"です。"

msgid "You can't toggle fuel saving mode on a non-fueled CBM."
msgstr "発電CBM以外は自動停止モードを切り替えられません。"

msgid "You can't travel there."
msgstr "そこに移動できません。"

msgid "You can't trust everything that you see."
msgstr "目に見えるものが何もかも信じられません。"

msgid "You can't turn the vehicle while on a ramp."
msgstr "傾斜地にある車両は方向転換できません。"

msgid "You can't unload a %s!"
msgstr "%sからは抜き取れません！"

msgid "You can't unload a rechargeable %s!"
msgstr "充電式の%sから抜き取れるものはありません！"

msgid "You can't unload from a moving vehicle."
msgstr "動いている車両からは取り出せません。"

msgid "You can't unload the %s from the bike rack."
msgstr "%sをラックから降ろせません。"

msgid "You can't unwield this."
msgstr "これは脱げません。"

msgid "You can't use a %s there."
msgstr "%sは使用できません。"

msgid "You can't use any of your powers!"
msgstr "超能力が使えません。"

msgid "You can't use anything while incorporeal."
msgstr "実体がないため何も使用できません。"

msgid "You can't use filthy items for healing."
msgstr "汚れたアイテムでは治療できません。"

msgid "You can't use first aid on a bionic limb."
msgstr "人工物の四肢に応急処置はできません。"

msgid "You can't use the %1$s with another of its kind."
msgstr "%1$sと同種のアイテムを同時に使用することはできません。"

msgid "You can't use this mortar."
msgstr "これは食べられません。"

msgid "You can't use your %1$s to pry up the nails."
msgstr "%1$sを使って釘を抜けません。"

msgid "You can't use your %s while holding it."
msgstr "運転中は%sを発射できません。"

msgid "You can't wait for your change.  It can't be long now."
msgstr "もう待ってはいられません。変化の時はすぐ傍まで迫っています。"

msgid "You can't wear anything while incorporeal."
msgstr "実体がないため何も着用できません。"

msgid "You can't wear the %s."
msgstr "%sを着用できません。"

msgid "You can't wield a part of your body."
msgstr "肉体の一部は取り外せません。"

msgid "You can't wield anything while incorporeal."
msgstr "実体がないため何も装備できません。"

msgid "You can't wield loose gases."
msgstr "気体は装備できません。"

msgid "You can't wield spilt liquids."
msgstr "こぼれた液体は装備できません。"

msgid "You can't wield the %1$s."
msgstr "%1$sを装備できません。"

msgid "You can't wield the %s with only one arm."
msgstr "%sは片手で装備できません。"

msgid "You can't wield this.  It looks like it has to be attached to a bionic."
msgstr "このアイテムはCBMに取り付けて使う必要があるため、装備できません。"

msgid "You can't wield this.  Wielding it would make it impossible to unwield it."
msgstr "このアイテムは既にCBMに取り付けられているため、装備できません。"

msgid "You can't wield unbroken frozen liquids."
msgstr "砕いていない凍った液体は装備できません。"

msgid "You can't wield your %s while driving."
msgstr "運転中は%sを発射できません。"

msgid "You cancel unloading the tool."
msgstr "工具の抜き取りを中断しました。"

msgid "You cancel your alarm."
msgstr "アラームの設定を解除しました。"

msgid "You cannot activate %1$s!  To read a description of %1$s, press '!', then '%2$c'."
msgstr ""
"%1$sは有効化できません！%1$sの説明を表示するには'!'を押した後に'%2$c'を押してください。"

msgid ""
"You cannot activate %1$s!  To read a description of %1$s, press '%2$s', then '%3$c'."
msgstr ""
"%1$sは有効化できません！%1$sの説明を表示するには'!'を押した後に'%2$c'を押してください。"

msgid "You cannot activate %s while mounted."
msgstr "騎乗中は%sを起動できません。"

msgid "You cannot activate Time Dilation while mounted."
msgstr "騎乗中は%sを起動できません。"

msgid "You cannot add that type of zone to a vehicle."
msgstr "この区域は車両に設定できません。"

