msgid "You cannot bring yourself to consume human flesh."
msgstr "騎乗中は体重を計測できません。"

msgid "You cannot build a camp here."
msgstr "ここには拠点を作れません。"

msgid "You cannot build there!"
msgstr "その場所には建設できません！"

