msgstr "そのアイテムを所持していません！"

msgid "You do not have that item."
msgstr "そのアイテムを所持していません。"

msgid "You do not have the required ID card to activate this mech."
msgstr "このメックを起動するのに必要なIDカードがありません。"

msgid ""
"You do not need defense.  You do not need a plan.  You need strength.  Strength will "
"break your opponents' defenses and overwhelm them completely.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25% of Strength but decreased by 25% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"守備も、計略も、必要ありません。必要なのは力です。力で敵の防御を打ち砕き、完全に圧倒し"
"ます。\n"
"\n"
"筋力x25%の命中上昇、器用x25%の命中低下"

msgid ""
"You do not realize the gravity of your claim.  When you understand the Song better, "
"you will understand the danger of his actions."
msgstr ""
"その主張がどれほど重いものか理解していないようだ。歌を深く理解すれば、彼の行動の危険性"
"も理解できるだろう。"

msgid "You do not see any creature here."
msgstr "モンスターが見当たりません。"

msgid "You do not see any furniture here."
msgstr "設置物が見当たりません。"

msgid "You do realize that the front door is just open?"
msgstr "正面玄関が開いていることに気付いていないのか？"

