msgid "You have long brown hair, worn loose and carefree!"
msgstr "長い茶髪をまとめず無造作にしています！"

msgid "You have long gray hair, in the style of a mullet."
msgstr "襟足を長く残した銀髪のマレットヘアです。"

msgid "You have long gray hair, pulled back into a ponytail."
msgstr "長い銀髪を後頭部でまとめています。"

