msgstr "襟足を長く残した緑髪のマレットヘアです。"

msgid "You have long green hair, pulled back into a ponytail."
msgstr "長い緑色の髪を後頭部でまとめています。"

msgid "You have long green hair, swooping over one eye."
msgstr "長い緑色の髪を一方の目元に寄せて垂らしています。"

msgid "You have long green hair, worn loose and carefree!"
msgstr "長い緑色の髪をまとめず無造作にしています！"

msgid "You have long hair, pulled back into a ponytail."
msgstr "長い髪を後頭部でまとめています。"

msgid "You have long hair, swooping over one eye."
msgstr "長い髪を一方の目元に寄せて垂らしています。"

msgid "You have long pink hair, in the style of a mullet."
msgstr "襟足を長く残したピンク色のマレットヘアです。"

msgid "You have long pink hair, pulled back into a ponytail."
msgstr "長いピンク色の髪を後頭部でまとめています。"

msgid "You have long pink hair, swooping over one eye."
msgstr "長いピンク色の髪を一方の目元に寄せて垂らしています。"

msgid "You have long pink hair, worn loose and carefree!"
msgstr "長いピンク色の髪をまとめず無造作にしています！"

msgid "You have long purple hair, in the style of a mullet."
msgstr "襟足を長く残した紫色のマレットヘアです。"

msgid "You have long purple hair, pulled back into a ponytail."
msgstr "長い紫色の髪を後頭部でまとめています。"

msgid "You have long purple hair, swooping over one eye."
msgstr "長い紫色の髪を一方の目元に寄せて垂らしています。"

msgid "You have long purple hair, worn loose and carefree!"
msgstr "長い紫色の髪をまとめず無造作にしています！"

msgid "You have long red hair, in the style of a mullet."
msgstr "襟足を長く残した赤髪のマレットヘアです。"

msgid "You have long red hair, pulled back into a ponytail."
msgstr "長い赤髪を後頭部でまとめています。"

msgid "You have long red hair, swooping over one eye."
msgstr "長い赤髪を一方の目元に寄せて垂らしています。"

msgid "You have long red hair, worn loose and carefree!"
msgstr "長い赤髪をまとめず無造作にしています！"

msgid ""
"You have long sideburns that connect to your moustache, with the tip of the chin "
"shaven clean."
msgstr "口髭と繋がった長い頬髯が生えており、顎の先端は綺麗に剃られています。"

msgid "You have long white hair, in the style of a mullet."
msgstr "襟足を長く残した白髪のマレットヘアです。"

msgid "You have long white hair, pulled back into a ponytail."
msgstr "長い白髪を後頭部でまとめています。"

msgid "You have long white hair, swooping over one eye."
msgstr "長い白髪を一方の目元に寄せて垂らしています。"

msgid "You have long white hair, worn loose and carefree!"
msgstr "長い白髪をまとめず無造作にしています！"

msgid "You have long, messy hair, worn loose and carefree!"
msgstr "長いボサボサの髪をまとめず無造作にしています！"

msgid "You have lost a lot of blood, and your condition worsens."
msgstr "大量の血液を失い、容体が悪化しています。"

msgid "You have lost the item you were using to make the repair."
msgstr "火を起こすために使っていたアイテムを失いました。"

msgid "You have lost the item you were using to start the fire."
msgstr "火を起こすために使っていたアイテムを失いました。"

msgid ""
"You have lost your foothold and can no longer command the world around you, the world "
"sees you now as only an unruly child."
msgstr ""
"足元がおぼつかず、周囲の世界を把握できなくなりました。世界から、手に負えない子供だと思"
"われているように感じます。"

msgid "You have marked this article to not display a sprite when worn."
