msgid "Zhivotnaya Kniga"
msgid_plural "copies of the Zhivotnaya Kniga"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/ジヴォートナヤ・クニーガ)"

msgid "Zia Sun necklace"
msgid_plural "Zia Sun necklaces"
msgstr[0] "聖なる象徴(ジアの太陽)"

msgid "Ziggy"
msgstr "ｼﾞｷﾞｰ"

msgid "Zimbabwean flag"
msgid_plural "Zimbabwean flags"
msgstr[0] "国旗(ｼﾞﾝﾊﾞﾌﾞｴ)"

msgid "Zinc"
msgstr "亜鉛"

msgid "Zincite"
msgstr "紅亜鉛鉱"

msgid "Zip up"
msgstr "ジッパーを閉じる"

msgid "Zoe"
msgstr "ｿﾞｲ"

msgid "Zoey"
msgstr "ｿﾞｰｲ"

msgid "Zohar: The Book of Splendor: Basic Readings from the Kabbalah"
msgid_plural "copies of Zohar: The Book of Splendor: Basic Readings from the Kabbalah"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/ゾーハル:光輝の書:カバラの基礎を読み解く)"

msgid "Zombie Army"
msgstr "ゾンビの軍隊"

msgid "Zombie Forces"
msgstr "ゾンビ部隊"

msgid "Zombie Kinderling Death"
msgstr "炭化子供ゾンビ死亡"

msgid "Zombie PD, to protect and zombify!"
msgstr "ゾンビ警察、保護と奉死！"

msgid "Zombie Survival Guide"
msgid_plural "copies of Zombie Survival Guide"
msgstr[0] "本(一般/ゾンビサバイバルガイド)"

msgid "Zombie Trap"
msgstr "ゾンビトラップ"

msgid "Zombie bite"
msgstr "ゾンビ咬傷"

msgid ""
"Zombie brutes and hulks have really tough hide, but skeletal juggernauts with their "
"bone plates are the worst.  Don't bother shooting at them with lower-caliber guns, the "
"bullet will bounce right off!"
msgstr ""
"凶暴ゾンビと巨体ゾンビの皮膚はとても分厚いが、巨体骸骨ゾンビは更に硬い。口径の小さな銃"
"で撃っても、弾を跳ね返されるから無駄だ！"

msgid "Zombie contagion"
msgstr "ゾンビ感染"

msgid ""
"Zombie guts.  Your appetite may have been spoiled by one look at the twisted, "
"compacted tubes and sacs that form this clump of foul entrails.  Why then does it make "
"you think of frozen spaghetti and meatballs?"
msgstr ""
"ゾンビの臓物です。捻じれて縮んだ管や嚢からなる悪臭を放つ塊を一目見ただけで、食欲が減退"
"しそうです。でも、どうして冷凍スパゲティやミートボールを連想してしまうのでしょうか？"

msgid ""
"Zombie hulks are NASTY, but they're easy to outsmart.  If there's other monsters "
"between you and them, they'll kill the monster for you!"
msgstr ""
"巨体ゾンビはやっかいな奴だが、裏をかくのは簡単だ。間に他のモンスターを挟めば、そっちを"
"攻撃してくれるよ！"

msgid "Zombie kinderling dies."
msgstr "炭化子供ゾンビが死亡します。"

msgid "Zombie wound"
msgstr "ゾンビ掻傷"

msgid ""
"Zombies are pretty dumb… heck, most monsters are!  If you can get a fire going between "
"you and them, they'll just run straight through it."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビは結構まぬけ...まあ他のモンスターも大抵まぬけだ！直線状に火を起こしておけば、あい"
"つらはまっすぐ火に突っ込んでくるよ。"

msgid ""
"Zombies cannot be intimidated or humiliated, so this stiff brush is only useful for "
"scouring toilet bowls."
msgstr ""
"この硬いブラシは便器を洗うときにしか役立ちません。ゾンビを威圧したり侮辱したりもできま"
"せん。"

msgid ""
"Zombies crash through your bar setup at home, smashing the bottles and spilling "
"everything.  You fall to your knees in the wreckage and wait for the end."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビが自宅のバーカウンターを破壊し、ボトルを粉々に砕き、中身を全てこぼしてしまう夢を"
"見ました。残骸の中に膝をつき、終わりの時を待つしかありません。"

msgid ""
"Zombies have absorbed latent energies which must be released into the stream of warp "
"once more.  Kill at least 10 zombified humans or creatures before returning to your "
"sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr ""
"転移エネルギーを体内に吸収したゾンビたちを倒し、エネルギーを転移の流れに戻してやる必要"
"があります。帰還するまでに10体以上のゾンビ化した人間または動物を倒し、報酬として転移の"
"欠片を得ましょう。"

msgid ""
"Zombies have absorbed latent energies which must be released into the stream of warp "
"once more.  Kill at least 100 zombified humans or creatures before returning to your "
"sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr ""
"転移エネルギーを体内に吸収したゾンビたちを倒し、エネルギーを転移の流れに戻してやる必要"
"があります。帰還するまでに100体以上のゾンビ化した人間または動物を倒し、報酬として転移の"
"欠片を得ましょう。"

msgid ""
"Zombies have absorbed latent energies which must be released into the stream of warp "
"once more.  Kill at least 50 zombified humans or creatures before returning to your "
"sanctuary for bonus warp shards."
msgstr ""
"転移エネルギーを体内に吸収したゾンビたちを倒し、エネルギーを転移の流れに戻してやる必要"
"があります。帰還するまでに50体以上のゾンビ化した人間または動物を倒し、報酬として転移の"
"欠片を得ましょう。"

msgid ""
"Zombies in cities will spawn at the start of the game, but may also wander around.  "
"All monsters are represented by letters (or sprites in the Tiles version) on your "
"screen; a list of monster names, as well as their positions relative to you, is "
"displayed on the right side of the screen.  The 'compass' will display monsters that "
"you see but are currently off the screen."
msgstr ""
"ゲームが開始すると街にゾンビが出現し、動き回ります。全てのモンスターは画面上に文字(タイ"
"ルバージョンではグラフィック)で表現されます。画面の右側には、モンスターの名前と自分を中"
"心とした相対的な位置が表示されます。東西南北を示すコンパスには、表示画面の範囲外におり"
"視認できるモンスターが表示されます。"

msgid "Zombies nearby"
msgstr "開始/ゾンビの傍"

msgid "Zombified animals aren't good for eating, and the fur's no good either."
msgstr "ゾンビ化した動物は食べないほうがいい。でも毛皮が役に立つことはあるだろう。"

msgid "Zone activities"
msgstr "区域作業"

msgid "Zone name:"
msgstr "区域名: "

msgid "Zone:"
msgstr "区域: "

msgid "Zones manager"
msgstr "区域管理"

msgid "Zones tied to vehicles cannot be displayed"
msgstr "車両に関連付けられた区域は表示できません"

msgid "Zoo (Cages)"
msgstr "動物園(飼育檻)"

msgid "Zoo (Giftshop)"
msgstr "動物園(土産物屋)"

msgid "Zoom Threshold"
msgstr "マップ縮小表示/閾値"

msgid "Zoom in"
msgstr "拡大"

msgid "Zoom out"
