msgid ""
"[PER 10] What is up with you?  What's with the fake accent, and speaking in the third "
"person?"
msgstr "[感覚 10] どうしたんだ？発音も話し方もどこか変じゃないか？"

msgid "[PER 8] If you hate it, then why are you smiling?"
msgstr "[感覚 8] 嫌だと言っている割に、楽しそうな顔だな？"

msgid ""
"[PER 8] The original markings on that case had been scratched out.  Who did it really "
"belong to?"
msgstr ""
"[感覚 8] そのケース、元々付いていたマークが消されているようだ。本当は何のケースだったん"
"だ？"

msgid "[PRETTY] I think we're going to be great friends, don't you agree?"
msgstr "[可憐] 私たちはきっと大親友になれる。そうは思わないか？"

msgid ""
"[PRETTY] Remember that nice thing I did for you?  Can you do something nice for me?"
msgstr "[可憐] あなたの依頼を上手くこなしたことは覚えている？何かお礼はないのか？"

msgid "[PRETTY] That smile is very nice.  It makes me smile too."
msgstr "[可憐] とっても素敵な笑顔だ。おかげで私も笑顔になれたよ。"

