msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A little over a year has passed since the apocalypse started, and you're about to face "
"your second summer in Hell."
msgstr ""
"終末の日から1年余り経過しました。地上の地獄での、二度目の夏が始まろうとしています。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Accident or illness left you under intensive care.  When your hospital was overrun, "
"you were considered a lost cause and left behind.  You awaken to the sound of movement "
"around the hospital."
msgstr ""
"病弱な体質から、人生の大半を様々な病院内で過ごしてきました。現在入院している病院が避難"
"を開始した際に、どうやら存在を忘れられてしまったようです。一人取り残され、何かの物音で"
"目を覚ましました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After a lifetime of hard work, you managed to settle down in a posh retirement "
"community.  You saw the riots on the news but assumed they would have no reason to "
"attack some harmless old folks.  That assumption was proven wrong by a group of "
"lunatics breaking in, leaving you no choice but to deal with them personally.  Welcome "
"to your golden years."
msgstr ""
"現役時代に一生懸命働き、ようやく高級老人ホームでの暮らしを勝ち取りました。暴動のニュー"
"スを見ても、暴徒が無害な老人を攻撃するなんてあり得ないと思っていましたが、ホームに乱入"
"してきた狂人たちによって、それが間違いだったことが証明されました。もう自力で対処するし"
"かありません。豊かな老後生活の始まりです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As if the world ending wasn't enough, it seems some kind of extradimensional powers "
"that be have taken an interest in you.  You have been placed on a floating island high "
"above the Earth, safe but isolated.  Only by using the reality-bending powers of warp "
"technology can you visit the world below in brief, randomly-targeted excursions.  "
"Venture down, gather supplies, and return with only what you can carry to upgrade your "
"home base and your stash over time.  The powers of the warp make you unable to ever "
"truly die, so on failing such an expedition, you will simply lose all items and "
"equipment you were carrying and be swiftly returned home at low health."
msgstr ""
"世界の終焉だけでは満足できなかった超次元的な存在に、目を付けられてしまったようです。地"
"球の上空に浮かぶ、孤立した安全な浮島に連れて来られました。転移技術を応用した現実改変能"
"力によって、地表のランダムな地点を訪れ、短期間過ごすことができます。探索してアイテムを"
"集め、できる限り持ち帰り、拠点と物資を少しずつ充実させていきましょう。転移の力によっ"
"て、死ぬことはできなくなりました。遠征中に死亡すると、所持していたアイテムは全て失わ"
"れ、体力が低下した状態ですぐに拠点へ戻されます。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before the world ended, bionics were reserved for the rich and the famous.  You might "
"not have been either, but you wanted in.  Hidden offices sequestered away in "
"basements, anesthetic smuggled out of hospitals, and desperate people with little to "
"lose could get you what you wanted.  If you went too deep, however, your augmentation "
"may have come at a price…"
msgstr ""
"滅亡前の世界のCBMは富裕層と著名人の物でしたが、つい分不相応な願望を持ってしまいました。"
"地下の隠しオフィス、病院から不正入手した麻酔薬、失うものなど何もない人々のお陰で欲しい"
"物を手に入れましたが、あまり深入りしすぎると、高い代償を支払うことになるかもしれませ"
"ん... "

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Despite all the soldiers, guns, and minefields, the military base you were in was "
"overrun by the dead.  Everyone was ordered to fall back to the armory, but during all "
"the chaos you got lost and you are now stuck in the warehouse by yourself.  You are "
"not sure if anyone made it to the armory, or if you are the last one alive."
msgstr ""
"あらん限りの兵士、銃、地雷を投入したにもかかわらず、基地は死者に制圧されました。武器庫"
"への退却という最後の命令が下されましたが、混乱の中で部隊からはぐれ、今は一人で倉庫に閉"
"じ込められています。武器庫にたどり着けた者はいるのか、自分が最後の生存者なのか、何一つ"
"分かりません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"During your escape you got lost and ended up at the wrong location.  Get your bearings "
"and make a plan.  You'll need it."
msgstr ""
"避難中に道に迷い、知らない土地に来てしまいました。まずは自分の位置を確認し、計画を立て"
"ましょう。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of evacuation, you got bitten by something!  You didn't get "
"proper medical care, and now the wound has started turning green."
msgstr ""
"パニックと混沌の中を避難している時に、何かに噛まれてしまいました！適切な治療が受けられ"
"ないまま、傷口が緑色に変色し始めています。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of the evacuation, you got bitten by something!  You didn't get "
"proper medical care, and now the wound has started turning green."
msgstr ""
"混乱に巻き込まれ慌てて避難している最中に、何かに噛まれてしまいました！適切な治療を受け"
"られないまま、傷口が緑色に変色し始めています。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the panic of a fleeing crowd, you were bitten by what you can only describe as a "
"zombie.  A prickling sensation and a sense of doom washes over you, and you're not "
"sure whether it's some kind of rabies or not.  Better seek out some antivirals just in "
"case…"
msgstr ""
"パニックに陥り逃げ惑う群衆のただ中で、間違いなくゾンビとしか言いようのない化け物に噛ま"
"れ、チクチクとした痛みと絶望感に苛まれています。致死性の病気に罹ったのかどうか分かりま"
"せんが、念のため抗ウイルス薬を探した方がいいかもしれません..."

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"It is the winter after zero hour.  As you were scavenging for food and a warm place to "
"stay at, you heard the sound of lots of movement nearby."
msgstr ""
"大変動後の冬の季節です。食べ物と暖かい場所を探していると、近くでたくさんの何かが動く物"
"音が聞こえてきました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"It is the winter after zero hour.  As you were scavenging for food and a warm place to "
"stay, you heard the sound of lots of movement nearby."
msgstr ""
"大変動後の冬の季節です。食べ物と暖かい場所を探していると、付近から様々な物音が聞こえて"
"きました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"It's been a year since the apocalypse, and winter is fast approaching.  You and your "
"company have managed to gather up enough supplies to finally settle down somewhere, "
"away from the death and destruction.  Life has been hard for you, but in your heart "
"you still hold a vision of a bright future lying ahead."
msgstr ""
"運命の日から一年が経ち、冬はすぐそこまで来ています。死と破壊から逃れるために仲間と協力"
"して十分な物資を集め、ようやく定住できる場所を見つけました。苦労続きの生活ですが、心の"
"中には明るい未来が広がっています。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"New England is dotted with old forts from the Revolutionary War, and many of them are "
"still standing.  When things started getting really bad, it seemed like a natural "
"place to hole up for a while, and it turns out that many, many other people had the "
"same idea.  The peace didn't last long.  Now everyone else is undead, and you're "
"trapped inside the walls with them.  The single entrance being a tight choke point is "
"looking a lot less useful now…"
msgstr ""
"ニューイングランド地方には、今でも独立戦争時代の古い砦が点在しています。情勢が悪化し始"
"めた頃、砦へ避難しようと考えるのはごく自然なことであり、多くの人が同じような行動をとり"
"ました。しかし、その平和も長くは続きません。ゾンビとなった避難民と共に、防壁の中に閉じ"
"込められてしまいました。防備のための一つしかない入り口も、今や窮屈なだけで何の効果もあ"
"りません..."

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Once it became clear that the world was ending you took to the skies, hoping that your "
"flying skills could lead you to safety.  During your flight you got lost and had to "
"land on an empty field."
msgstr ""
"世界の終末が避けられない状況になり、身に着けた操縦技術を駆使して空に旅立ちました。安全"
"圏に辿り着けることを願いましたが、現在地が分からなくなり、何もない野原に着陸するしか選"
"択肢はありませんでした。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Once it became clear that the world was ending you took to the skies, hoping that your "
"flying skills could lead you to safety.  You found no standing safe zones, and when "
"your fuel ran out, were forced to land over an empty bridge."
msgstr ""
"世界の終末が避けられない状況になり、身に着けた操縦技術を駆使して空に旅立ちました。安全"
"圏に辿り着けることを願いましたが、そんなものは残っていません。燃料が切れたため、無人の"
"橋の上に着陸するしか選択肢はありませんでした。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you relentlessly.  You "
"can outrun it, but it always seems to find you eventually.  The only escape is for one "
"of you to die."
msgstr ""
"大変動が始まって以来、何者かが執拗に追いかけてきます。いくら逃げても、結局は見つかって"
"しまいます。この追跡から逃れるには、どちらかが死ぬしかありません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you relentlessly.  You "
"can try to fight it, but each time it falls it will rise again.  The only escape is "
"for you to die."
msgstr ""
"大変動が始まって以来、何者かが執拗に追いかけてきます。いくら逃げても、結局は見つかって"
"しまいます。この追跡から逃れるには、どちらかが死ぬしかありません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Som nigromancie hath brought yow hidder!  Ye have only the hoose on youre legges and "
"the knyf at youre syde and youre prayeres to Marie moder of God."
msgstr ""
"何らかの魔術によって現代に連れて来られました！脚にはズボン、腰にはナイフ、他に持ってい"
"るのは聖母マリアへの祈りの言葉程度です。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Seems like you're on your own."
msgstr "どういう訳か、気が付くと洞窟の中にいました。傍に誰もいないようです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Someone else is with you."
msgstr "どういう訳か、気が付くと洞窟の中にいました。傍に誰かいるようです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The building you had chosen to reside in has suddenly caught fire!  You might want to "
"leave."
msgstr "立て篭もっていた建物から急に火の手が上がりました！急いで逃げましょう。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The scientists stopped their experiments on you abruptly, leaving you behind while "
"they evacuated before lockdown.  Find a way to escape or starve to death."
msgstr ""
"研究者たちは突然実験を中止し、自分を放置してここが封鎖される前に脱出してしまいました。"
"脱出する方法を探し出しましょう。餓死するという選択もありますが。 "

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Together with some others you decided to take up arms against the horde.  Now you are "
"reconsidering whether that was a wise choice."
msgstr ""
"他の何人かと共に、大群に戦いを挑むことを決意しました。それが本当に賢い判断だったのか、"
"少し疑問が湧き始めています。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When FEMA camps ran out of space the authorities used what was left of their manpower "
"to round up people at gunpoint.  The stadiums they forced everyone into did nothing to "
"slow down the madness and it spread like wildfire.  You managed to slip away from the "
"worst violence but you are now surrounded and need to escape quickly!"
msgstr ""
"FEMAキャンプに空きがなくなると、政府当局は残された職員を動員し、銃口を突きつけて市民を"
"一箇所に集めました。市民が収容されたスタジアムでは狂気が野火のように広がり、溢れだしま"
"した。最悪の事態からは逃れましたが、包囲網からは抜け出せていません。迅速に脱出しましょ"
"う！"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were convicted or working in a prison.  Now the "
"inmates and guards alike have turned into mindless horrors and joined forces… you "
"might need to expedite your escape plans."
msgstr ""
"大変動が起こる前に有罪判決を受け、刑務所で服役していました。今や、囚人も刑務官も仲良く"
"心無い怪物になり果てています...脱獄計画を前倒しで実行する必要がありそうですね。 "

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were working in a nuclear power plant.  Now you're "
"trapped inside, surrounded by the shambling bodies of what used to be your coworkers.  "
"The reactor's shut down, but you don't know if there's been a radiation leak and you "
"need to get away from here fast before you find out the hard way."
msgstr ""
"原子力発電所で働いている時に大変動が起こり、かつて同僚たちだった無残な死体と共に原子力"
"発電所に閉じ込められてしまいました。原子炉は停止しましたが、放射能漏れが起きている可能"
"性もあります。しかし、今は調査よりも逃げる方が先です。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the apocalypse broke out, you were evacuated to a small underground bunker.  Here "
"you have lived, never leaving, lest the dangers of the unknown find you.  Supplies are "
"running low, and for the first time since the Cataclysm, you will be forced to face "
"the outside world."
msgstr ""
"終末が訪れ、小さなシェルターに避難しました。未知の危険を避けるため、全く外に出ない生活"
"を続けていましたが、いよいよ物資が底をつき、あの日以来初めて、外の世界と向き合わざるを"
"得ない苦境に立たされています。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the riots came to your home, you ran underground and hid.  Now days later you are "
"lost and hear movement echoing in the dark."
msgstr ""
"暴動が自宅まで達したため、地下空間へ逃げ込みました。数日間彷徨っていると、暗闇の向こう"
"から何かの物音が聞こえてきました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed the "
"evacuation and are stuck in a city full of the risen dead."
msgstr ""
"意固地、無知、それとも単なる不運が原因か。逃げ遅れてしまい、動く死体だらけの街に取り残"
"されました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed the "
"evacuation and are stuck in a large building full of the risen dead."
msgstr ""
"意固地、無知、それとも単なる不運が原因か。逃げ遅れてしまい、動く死体だらけの大きな建物"
"内に取り残されました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"While being transported to a different military base, the pilot lost control of the "
"helicopter and crashed in the middle of nowhere.  You seem to be the only survivor."
msgstr ""
"別の軍事基地への移送の途中でヘリコプターが操縦不能になり、人里離れた場所に墜落しまし"
"た。他に生存者はいないようです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"While trying to escape town, you had to dodge a horde into your holdout, becoming "
"separated from your compatriots.  You've only got one leg to your name, no arms, and "
"now you're surrounded by zombies.  Just how are you going to get out of this one?"
msgstr ""
"大群を避けて街から避難する中で、仲間とはぐれてしまいました。元々脚の一本と両腕を失って"
"おり、しかも今はゾンビに囲まれている状況です。一体どうやって生き延びればいいのでしょう"
"か？"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are the only one that made it.  Everyone else died nearby.  You have to get out of "
"here!"
msgstr ""
"助かったのは自分だけです。傍にいた皆は死んでしまいました。ともかくここから脱出しましょ"
"う！"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You decided the open road would be a better prospect than the zombie-filled cities.  "
"While en route to your destination, you were involved in a crash that totaled your "
"vehicle.  Injured and alone, you'll need to think fast if you want to survive."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビだらけの都市部よりも開けた公道の方がマシだと思い車を走らせていましたが、目的地に"
"向かう途中で事故に巻き込まれました。車は大破しケガも負った孤立無援の状態で、生き延びる"
"ために次の策を早く考えなければなりません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You decided the open road would be a better prospect than the zombie-filled cities.  "
"While en route to your destination, you were involved in a wreck.  When you look "
"around, you can no longer spot the road you were driving on.  Just how hard did you "
"hit your head?"
msgstr ""
"ゾンビだらけの都市部よりも公道の方がマシだと思い車を走らせていましたが、目的地に向かう"
"途中で事故に巻き込まれました。辺りを見渡すと、車は先程まで走っていた筈の道とは違う場所"
"に停まっています。頭を強く打ったのでしょうか？"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You don't know what it was but you managed to lose it for the time being.  Now you are "
"injured, surrounded and the building is on fire.  You hope you have some time before "
"it returns to finish the job."
msgstr ""
"それが何なのかは分かりませんが、ともかく何かを失いました。しかも怪我をしており、ゾンビ"
"に囲まれ、建物は燃えています。奴が仕事を終えるために戻ってくるまで、まだ時間に余裕があ"
"るといいのですが。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid "You feel spores crawling beneath your skin.  It's only a matter of time."
msgstr "胞子が皮膚の下を這っているのを感じます。あまり時間は残されていません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and moaning is fainter this far from "
"civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."
msgstr ""
"気が付いたら森の中にいました。文明からかけ離れたこの場所まで届く叫び声や呻き声はわずか"
"ですが、ここでどうやって生きていくのか考えておいた方がよさそうです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the moaning is fainter this far "
"from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."
msgstr ""
"気が付いたら森の中にいました。文明からかけ離れたこの場所まで届く叫び声や呻き声はわずか"
"ですが、これから何をするのか考えておいた方がよさそうです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have been heavily experimented upon for the advancement of science, willingly or "
"not.  Once the Cataclysm struck, you escaped the lab and wandered aimlessly, ending up "
"in a forest."
msgstr ""
"遺伝子科学の発展のために、同意の有無にかかわらず、様々な研究の実験台にされ続けていまし"
"た。大変動が起きたため、研究所を脱出して当てもなく彷徨い、やがて森に辿り着きました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have found yourself in the most alien place you've ever seen.  The hot, humid air "
"and the organic appearance of the structure make you feel like you're trapped inside a "
"giant creature.  Whatever it is, you need to get out of here before They find you."
msgstr ""
"気が付くと、今まで見たこともない異様な場所にいました。高温多湿の空気と有機的な壁に囲ま"
"れて、まるで巨大な生き物の体内に閉じ込められている気分です。敵の正体が何であれ、見つか"
"る前にここから脱出する必要があります。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) safety in a "
"wilderness.  The only thing that really bothers you is a mysterious sky-high wall seen "
"in the distance."
msgstr ""
"パニックの波を掻き分けて、屋外の(比較的)安全な場所を確保しました。ただ一つ気になるの"
"は、遠くに見える奇妙な高い壁です。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) safety in an "
"abandoned building.  Unfortunately, while you're the only one here now, you are "
"definitely not the first person to be here, and in its current state this building no "
"longer seems nearly as secure as one might have hoped."
msgstr ""
"パニックの波を掻き分けて、(比較的)安全な廃墟にたどり着きました。現在は一人きりですが、"
"残念ながらこの場所には先客がいたようです。このままでは、この建物もそれほど安全とは言え"
"ません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) safety in "
"one of the many government evac shelters."
msgstr ""
"パニックの波を掻き分けて、(比較的)安全な公共避難シェルターになんとかたどり着きました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) safety in "
"one of the many government evac shelters.  However, the people you came with started "
"to turn and now they're out for your flesh!  You've holed up in the basement for now, "
"but sooner or later you have to make for the door… and fast!"
msgstr ""
"パニックの波を掻き分けて、(比較的)安全な公共避難シェルターになんとかたどり着きました。"
"しかし、一緒に避難した人々が豹変し、こちらを襲い始めました！今は地下室に隠れています"
"が、いつかはドアを開け...素早く脱出しなければなりません！"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) safety in "
"one of the many government evac shelters.  While evacuating, you noticed a mysterious "
"sky-high wall in the distance, seemingly cutting off travel in every direction around "
"you."
msgstr ""
"パニックの波を掻き分けて、(比較的)安全な公共避難シェルターになんとかたどり着きました。"
"ただ一つ気になるのは、遠くに見える奇妙な高い壁が、周囲を隙間なく囲んでいるように見える"
"ことです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You heard the global, worsening news and saw the nightmare in the cities firsthand — a "
"situation that prompted you to jump from low-rent motel to cheap trailer, trying to "
"outrun the madness.  While only you know where you'd planned to go, when you heard the "
"government's last broadcast and realized 'no help was coming,' you resolved to raise a "
"dejected toast and sink to the bottom of a bottle for as long as you could.  What "
"happened in the following days of drunken stupor is an enigma.  What you do know, is "
"that it's time to see how much of the world there's left to return to."
msgstr ""
"世界的な情勢悪化のニュースを聞き、都市部の悪夢を目の当たりにしました。狂った世界から逃"
"げるために安モーテルを抜け出し、安トレーラーに飛び乗りました。その後どこへ逃げる気だっ"
"たのかはもう覚えていませんが、政府からの最後の放送を聞いた頃には「助けは来ない」と悟"
"り、後は失意のどん底で乾杯し、できる限り長く酔って気を紛らわせること以外何も考えられま"
"せんでした。酒に溺れていたその後の数日間、何が起きていたのかは覚えていません。今分かる"
"のは、残っているかどうかも怪しい現実世界と対峙するときが来たということだけです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You start drunk to the point of incapacitation, depressed, infected, surrounded by "
"fire, and sick with the flu.  This day went downhill really fast."
msgstr ""
"何もできないほど酔っ払い、気分は落ち込み、感染症に罹っており、火に囲まれ、全裸で、風邪"
"を引いています。今日は本当に酷い一日です。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were camping in the wild to let things back home cool off.  One night strange "
"noises closed in on you and you were attacked.  You managed to get away but can feel "
"things moving in the dark."
msgstr ""
"事態が収束して平穏な世界に戻るまでは、キャンプ生活を続けることに決めていました。ある"
"夜、奇妙な物音がして、何者かに襲われました。何とか逃げ切ったものの、宵闇の中で何かが動"
"いている気がします。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were convicted or working in a high-security prison before the Cataclysm.  "
"Unfortunately, you're still in it, so you need to figure out how to escape.  It's "
"located on a remote island to boot; you'll eventually need to escape that also."
msgstr ""
"大変動が起こる前に有罪判決を受け、セキュリティが厳重な刑務所で服役していました。残念な"
"がら、まだ脱獄の算段は立てられていません。おまけにこの刑務所は離島にあるため、島から脱"
"出する方法も探す必要があります。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deemed an essential employee and required to stay behind during the "
"facility's evacuation.  You'd better find your lanyard with your badge before the "
"automated defenses notice that you don't have one."
msgstr ""
"必要不可欠なスタッフと見なされ、非常事態の最中も施設に残るよう指示されました。自律型警"
"備システムに気付かれない内に、どこかに置いた身分証明バッジ付きのネックストラップを探し"
"出した方がよさそうです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were deemed an essential employee and required to stay behind during the lab's "
"evacuation.  Find a way to escape or starve to death."
msgstr ""
"必要不可欠なスタッフと見なされ、非常事態の最中も研究所に残るよう指示されました。脱出方"
"法を見つけなければ、餓死するしかありません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life when the world ended, surrounded by riches and eating "
"well every day.  Now you've woken up, alone and drugged, in a room of your mansion "
"that you don't recognize.  As you fight to remain conscious, you hear heavy footsteps "
"nearby.  Time to get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"世界が崩壊するまでは、毎日富と贅沢な食事に囲まれて上流階級の生活を送っていました。ある"
"日薬を盛られ、ふと目覚めると、見覚えのない大邸宅の一室に一人置き去りにされていました。"
"何とか意識を保とうと必死になっていると、周囲からは重い足音が響いてきました。早く脱出し"
"た方がよさそうです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were participating in a mining operation when you found… something.  You're not "
"sure what, but it sure is dark down here."
msgstr ""
"鉱山で採掘作業をしていて...何か...を見つけました。正体も分からず、しかも辺りは真っ暗で"
"す。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were trying to scavenge for supplies, and now some rough group of bandits has "
"dragged monsters in with them where you were hiding!"
msgstr ""
"物資を調達していると、危険な盗賊団がモンスターを引き連れて、隠れ場所に乗り込んできまし"
"た！"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You'd been unsurprised when your vacation — a hastily arranged holiday to a remote "
"resort to maintain distance from the riots — had been put out of its misery when state-"
"wide evacuation was ordered after weeks of worsening violence, and the complex had "
"been placed on a shortlist for civilian gathering sites.  After days of waiting for a "
"non-existent rescue and refugees bringing tales of monsters and the dead, the "
"remaining staff had taken steps to keep spirits up, and last evening, they did that in "
"the best way they knew — hosting a party.  Considering that it lured scores of "
"zombies, you could probably classify that decision as a 'road to literal hell paved "
"with good intentions.'"
msgstr ""
"暴動から逃れるために急遽休暇を取り、人里離れたリゾート地に向かいました。数週間にわたる"
"治安の悪化を受けて州全体に避難勧告が出された段階でもリゾート地は平和そのもので、この複"
"合施設が民間人の避難所に指定されたことを聞いても、何の驚きもありませんでした。何日待っ"
"ても救助隊はやって来ません。避難してきた者たちは怪物や蘇った死者の噂をしています。昨夜"
"は、滞在者の気分が少しでも明るくなるように、従業員たちが考えうる中で最善のイベント...す"
"なわちパーティーが開かれました。結果として多数のゾンビを引き寄せてしまったことを考える"
"と、これはまさに「善意で舗装された地獄への道」の典型例と言えます。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've attracted the attention of living dead in some way, now they're all around you "
"and you'll likely have to fight through them if you want to escape."
msgstr ""
"何かをきっかけに動く死体の注意を引いてしまい、今や周囲一帯を囲まれています。逃げ出すつ"
"もりなら、ゾンビの群れと戦う必要がありそうです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've found a safe place away from the cities and devoid of the living dead.  Looks "
"like you're on your own…"
msgstr ""
"都市から離れ、生ける屍のいない安全な場所を見つけました。どうやら自給自足で生きていくし"
"かないようです..."

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A little over a year has passed since the apocalypse started, and you're about to face "
"your second summer in Hell."
msgstr ""
"終末の日から1年余り経過しました。地上の地獄での、二度目の夏が始まろうとしています。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Accident or illness left you under intensive care.  When your hospital was overrun, "
"you were considered a lost cause and left behind.  You awaken to the sound of movement "
"around the hospital."
msgstr ""
"病弱な体質から、人生の大半を様々な病院内で過ごしてきました。現在入院している病院が避難"
"を開始した際に、どうやら存在を忘れられてしまったようです。一人取り残され、何かの物音で"
"目を覚ましました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After a lifetime of hard work, you managed to settle down in a posh retirement "
"community.  You saw the riots on the news but assumed they would have no reason to "
"attack some harmless old folks.  That assumption was proven wrong by a group of "
"lunatics breaking in, leaving you no choice but to deal with them personally.  Welcome "
"to your golden years."
msgstr ""
"現役時代に一生懸命働き、ようやく高級老人ホームでの暮らしを勝ち取りました。暴動のニュー"
"スを見ても、暴徒が無害な老人を攻撃するなんてあり得ないと思っていましたが、ホームに乱入"
"してきた狂人たちによって、それが間違いだったことが証明されました。もう自力で対処するし"
"かありません。豊かな老後生活の始まりです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As if the world ending wasn't enough, it seems some kind of extradimensional powers "
"that be have taken an interest in you.  You have been placed on a floating island high "
"above the Earth, safe but isolated.  Only by using the reality-bending powers of warp "
"technology can you visit the world below in brief, randomly-targeted excursions.  "
"Venture down, gather supplies, and return with only what you can carry to upgrade your "
"home base and your stash over time.  The powers of the warp make you unable to ever "
"truly die, so on failing such an expedition, you will simply lose all items and "
"equipment you were carrying and be swiftly returned home at low health."
msgstr ""
"世界の終焉だけでは満足できなかった超次元的な存在に、目を付けられてしまったようです。地"
"球の上空に浮かぶ、孤立した安全な浮島に連れて来られました。転移技術を応用した現実改変能"
"力によって、地表のランダムな地点を訪れ、短期間過ごすことができます。探索してアイテムを"
"集め、できる限り持ち帰り、拠点と物資を少しずつ充実させていきましょう。転移の力によっ"
"て、死ぬことはできなくなりました。遠征中に死亡すると、所持していたアイテムは全て失わ"
"れ、体力が低下した状態ですぐに拠点へ戻されます。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before the world ended, bionics were reserved for the rich and the famous.  You might "
"not have been either, but you wanted in.  Hidden offices sequestered away in "
"basements, anesthetic smuggled out of hospitals, and desperate people with little to "
"lose could get you what you wanted.  If you went too deep, however, your augmentation "
"may have come at a price…"
msgstr ""
"滅亡前の世界のCBMは富裕層と著名人の物でしたが、つい分不相応な願望を持ってしまいました。"
"地下の隠しオフィス、病院から不正入手した麻酔薬、失うものなど何もない人々のお陰で欲しい"
"物を手に入れましたが、あまり深入りしすぎると、高い代償を支払うことになるかもしれませ"
"ん... "

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Despite all the soldiers, guns, and minefields, the military base you were in was "
"overrun by the dead.  Everyone was ordered to fall back to the armory, but during all "
"the chaos you got lost and you are now stuck in the warehouse by yourself.  You are "
"not sure if anyone made it to the armory, or if you are the last one alive."
msgstr ""
"あらん限りの兵士、銃、地雷を投入したにもかかわらず、基地は死者に制圧されました。武器庫"
"への退却という最後の命令が下されましたが、混乱の中で部隊からはぐれ、今は一人で倉庫に閉"
"じ込められています。武器庫にたどり着けた者はいるのか、自分が最後の生存者なのか、何一つ"
"分かりません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"During your escape you got lost and ended up at the wrong location.  Get your bearings "
"and make a plan.  You'll need it."
msgstr ""
"避難中に道に迷い、知らない土地に来てしまいました。まずは自分の位置を確認し、計画を立て"
"ましょう。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of evacuation, you got bitten by something!  You didn't get "
"proper medical care, and now the wound has started turning green."
msgstr ""
"パニックと混沌の中を避難している時に、何かに噛まれてしまいました！適切な治療が受けられ"
"ないまま、傷口が緑色に変色し始めています。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In the chaos and panic of the evacuation, you got bitten by something!  You didn't get "
"proper medical care, and now the wound has started turning green."
msgstr ""
"混乱に巻き込まれ慌てて避難している最中に、何かに噛まれてしまいました！適切な治療を受け"
"られないまま、傷口が緑色に変色し始めています。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In the panic of a fleeing crowd, you were bitten by what you can only describe as a "
"zombie.  A prickling sensation and a sense of doom washes over you, and you're not "
"sure whether it's some kind of rabies or not.  Better seek out some antivirals just in "
"case…"
msgstr ""
"パニックに陥り逃げ惑う群衆のただ中で、間違いなくゾンビとしか言いようのない化け物に噛ま"
"れ、チクチクとした痛みと絶望感に苛まれています。致死性の病気に罹ったのかどうか分かりま"
"せんが、念のため抗ウイルス薬を探した方がいいかもしれません..."

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"It is the winter after zero hour.  As you were scavenging for food and a warm place to "
"stay at, you heard the sound of lots of movement nearby."
msgstr ""
"大変動後の冬の季節です。食べ物と暖かい場所を探していると、近くでたくさんの何かが動く物"
"音が聞こえてきました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"It is the winter after zero hour.  As you were scavenging for food and a warm place to "
"stay, you heard the sound of lots of movement nearby."
msgstr ""
"大変動後の冬の季節です。食べ物と暖かい場所を探していると、付近から様々な物音が聞こえて"
"きました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"It's been a year since the apocalypse, and winter is fast approaching.  You and your "
"company have managed to gather up enough supplies to finally settle down somewhere, "
"away from the death and destruction.  Life has been hard for you, but in your heart "
"you still hold a vision of a bright future lying ahead."
msgstr ""
"運命の日から一年が経ち、冬はすぐそこまで来ています。死と破壊から逃れるために仲間と協力"
"して十分な物資を集め、ようやく定住できる場所を見つけました。苦労続きの生活ですが、心の"
"中には明るい未来が広がっています。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"New England is dotted with old forts from the Revolutionary War, and many of them are "
"still standing.  When things started getting really bad, it seemed like a natural "
"place to hole up for a while, and it turns out that many, many other people had the "
"same idea.  The peace didn't last long.  Now everyone else is undead, and you're "
"trapped inside the walls with them.  The single entrance being a tight choke point is "
"looking a lot less useful now…"
msgstr ""
"ニューイングランド地方には、今でも独立戦争時代の古い砦が点在しています。情勢が悪化し始"
"めた頃、砦へ避難しようと考えるのはごく自然なことであり、多くの人が同じような行動をとり"
"ました。しかし、その平和も長くは続きません。ゾンビとなった避難民と共に、防壁の中に閉じ"
"込められてしまいました。防備のための一つしかない入り口も、今や窮屈なだけで何の効果もあ"
"りません..."

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Once it became clear that the world was ending you took to the skies, hoping that your "
"flying skills could lead you to safety.  During your flight you got lost and had to "
"land on an empty field."
msgstr ""
"世界の終末が避けられない状況になり、身に着けた操縦技術を駆使して空に旅立ちました。安全"
"圏に辿り着けることを願いましたが、現在地が分からなくなり、何もない野原に着陸するしか選"
"択肢はありませんでした。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Once it became clear that the world was ending you took to the skies, hoping that your "
"flying skills could lead you to safety.  You found no standing safe zones, and when "
"your fuel ran out, were forced to land over an empty bridge."
msgstr ""
"世界の終末が避けられない状況になり、身に着けた操縦技術を駆使して空に旅立ちました。安全"
"圏に辿り着けることを願いましたが、そんなものは残っていません。燃料が切れたため、無人の"
"橋の上に着陸するしか選択肢はありませんでした。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you relentlessly.  You "
"can outrun it, but it always seems to find you eventually.  The only escape is for one "
"of you to die."
msgstr ""
"大変動が始まって以来、何者かが執拗に追いかけてきます。いくら逃げても、結局は見つかって"
"しまいます。この追跡から逃れるには、どちらかが死ぬしかありません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Since the start of the Cataclysm, something has been hunting you relentlessly.  You "
"can try to fight it, but each time it falls it will rise again.  The only escape is "
"for you to die."
msgstr ""
"大変動が始まって以来、何者かが執拗に追いかけてきます。いくら逃げても、結局は見つかって"
"しまいます。この追跡から逃れるには、どちらかが死ぬしかありません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Som nigromancie hath brought yow hidder!  Ye have only the hoose on youre legges and "
"the knyf at youre syde and youre prayeres to Marie moder of God."
msgstr ""
"何らかの魔術によって現代に連れて来られました！脚にはズボン、腰にはナイフ、他に持ってい"
"るのは聖母マリアへの祈りの言葉程度です。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Seems like you're on your own."
msgstr "どういう訳か、気が付くと洞窟の中にいました。傍に誰もいないようです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "Somehow, you found yourself in a cave.  Someone else is with you."
msgstr "どういう訳か、気が付くと洞窟の中にいました。傍に誰かいるようです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The building you had chosen to reside in has suddenly caught fire!  You might want to "
"leave."
msgstr "立て篭もっていた建物から急に火の手が上がりました！急いで逃げましょう。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The scientists stopped their experiments on you abruptly, leaving you behind while "
"they evacuated before lockdown.  Find a way to escape or starve to death."
msgstr ""
"研究者たちは突然実験を中止し、自分を放置してここが封鎖される前に脱出してしまいました。"
"脱出する方法を探し出しましょう。餓死するという選択もありますが。 "

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Together with some others you decided to take up arms against the horde.  Now you are "
"reconsidering whether that was a wise choice."
msgstr ""
"他の何人かと共に、大群に戦いを挑むことを決意しました。それが本当に賢い判断だったのか、"
"少し疑問が湧き始めています。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When FEMA camps ran out of space the authorities used what was left of their manpower "
"to round up people at gunpoint.  The stadiums they forced everyone into did nothing to "
"slow down the madness and it spread like wildfire.  You managed to slip away from the "
"worst violence but you are now surrounded and need to escape quickly!"
msgstr ""
"FEMAキャンプに空きがなくなると、政府当局は残された職員を動員し、銃口を突きつけて市民を"
"一箇所に集めました。市民が収容されたスタジアムでは狂気が野火のように広がり、溢れだしま"
"した。最悪の事態からは逃れましたが、包囲網からは抜け出せていません。迅速に脱出しましょ"
"う！"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were convicted or working in a prison.  Now the "
"inmates and guards alike have turned into mindless horrors and joined forces… you "
"might need to expedite your escape plans."
msgstr ""
"大変動が起こる前に有罪判決を受け、刑務所で服役していました。今や、囚人も刑務官も仲良く"
"心無い怪物になり果てています...脱獄計画を前倒しで実行する必要がありそうですね。 "

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were working in a nuclear power plant.  Now you're "
"trapped inside, surrounded by the shambling bodies of what used to be your coworkers.  "
"The reactor's shut down, but you don't know if there's been a radiation leak and you "
"need to get away from here fast before you find out the hard way."
msgstr ""
"原子力発電所で働いている時に大変動が起こり、かつて同僚たちだった無残な死体と共に原子力"
"発電所に閉じ込められてしまいました。原子炉は停止しましたが、放射能漏れが起きている可能"
"性もあります。しかし、今は調査よりも逃げる方が先です。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the apocalypse broke out, you were evacuated to a small underground bunker.  Here "
"you have lived, never leaving, lest the dangers of the unknown find you.  Supplies are "
"running low, and for the first time since the Cataclysm, you will be forced to face "
"the outside world."
msgstr ""
"終末が訪れ、小さなシェルターに避難しました。未知の危険を避けるため、全く外に出ない生活"
"を続けていましたが、いよいよ物資が底をつき、あの日以来初めて、外の世界と向き合わざるを"
"得ない苦境に立たされています。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the riots came to your home, you ran underground and hid.  Now days later you are "
"lost and hear movement echoing in the dark."
msgstr ""
"暴動が自宅まで達したため、地下空間へ逃げ込みました。数日間彷徨っていると、暗闇の向こう"
"から何かの物音が聞こえてきました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed the "
"evacuation and are stuck in a city full of the risen dead."
msgstr ""
"意固地、無知、それとも単なる不運が原因か。逃げ遅れてしまい、動く死体だらけの街に取り残"
"されました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Whether due to stubbornness, ignorance, or just plain bad luck, you missed the "
"evacuation and are stuck in a large building full of the risen dead."
msgstr ""
"意固地、無知、それとも単なる不運が原因か。逃げ遅れてしまい、動く死体だらけの大きな建物"
"内に取り残されました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"While being transported to a different military base, the pilot lost control of the "
"helicopter and crashed in the middle of nowhere.  You seem to be the only survivor."
msgstr ""
"別の軍事基地への移送の途中でヘリコプターが操縦不能になり、人里離れた場所に墜落しまし"
"た。他に生存者はいないようです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"While trying to escape town, you had to dodge a horde into your holdout, becoming "
"separated from your compatriots.  You've only got one leg to your name, no arms, and "
"now you're surrounded by zombies.  Just how are you going to get out of this one?"
msgstr ""
"大群を避けて街から避難する中で、仲間とはぐれてしまいました。元々脚の一本と両腕を失って"
"おり、しかも今はゾンビに囲まれている状況です。一体どうやって生き延びればいいのでしょう"
"か？"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are the only one that made it.  Everyone else died nearby.  You have to get out of "
"here!"
msgstr ""
"助かったのは自分だけです。傍にいた皆は死んでしまいました。ともかくここから脱出しましょ"
"う！"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You decided the open road would be a better prospect than the zombie-filled cities.  "
"While en route to your destination, you were involved in a crash that totaled your "
"vehicle.  Injured and alone, you'll need to think fast if you want to survive."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビだらけの都市部よりも開けた公道の方がマシだと思い車を走らせていましたが、目的地に"
"向かう途中で事故に巻き込まれました。車は大破しケガも負った孤立無援の状態で、生き延びる"
"ために次の策を早く考えなければなりません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You decided the open road would be a better prospect than the zombie-filled cities.  "
"While en route to your destination, you were involved in a wreck.  When you look "
"around, you can no longer spot the road you were driving on.  Just how hard did you "
"hit your head?"
msgstr ""
"ゾンビだらけの都市部よりも公道の方がマシだと思い車を走らせていましたが、目的地に向かう"
"途中で事故に巻き込まれました。辺りを見渡すと、車は先程まで走っていた筈の道とは違う場所"
"に停まっています。頭を強く打ったのでしょうか？"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You don't know what it was but you managed to lose it for the time being.  Now you are "
"injured, surrounded and the building is on fire.  You hope you have some time before "
"it returns to finish the job."
msgstr ""
"それが何なのかは分かりませんが、ともかく何かを失いました。しかも怪我をしており、ゾンビ"
"に囲まれ、建物は燃えています。奴が仕事を終えるために戻ってくるまで、まだ時間に余裕があ"
"るといいのですが。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid "You feel spores crawling beneath your skin.  It's only a matter of time."
msgstr "胞子が皮膚の下を這っているのを感じます。あまり時間は残されていません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and moaning is fainter this far from "
"civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."
msgstr ""
"気が付いたら森の中にいました。文明からかけ離れたこの場所まで届く叫び声や呻き声はわずか"
"ですが、ここでどうやって生きていくのか考えておいた方がよさそうです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the moaning is fainter this far "
"from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out here."
msgstr ""
"気が付いたら森の中にいました。文明からかけ離れたこの場所まで届く叫び声や呻き声はわずか"
"ですが、これから何をするのか考えておいた方がよさそうです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have been heavily experimented upon for the advancement of science, willingly or "
"not.  Once the Cataclysm struck, you escaped the lab and wandered aimlessly, ending up "
"in a forest."
msgstr ""
"遺伝子科学の発展のために、同意の有無にかかわらず、様々な研究の実験台にされ続けていまし"
"た。大変動が起きたため、研究所を脱出して当てもなく彷徨い、やがて森に辿り着きました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have found yourself in the most alien place you've ever seen.  The hot, humid air "
"and the organic appearance of the structure make you feel like you're trapped inside a "
"giant creature.  Whatever it is, you need to get out of here before They find you."
msgstr ""
"気が付くと、今まで見たこともない異様な場所にいました。高温多湿の空気と有機的な壁に囲ま"
"れて、まるで巨大な生き物の体内に閉じ込められている気分です。敵の正体が何であれ、見つか"
"る前にここから脱出する必要があります。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) safety in a "
"wilderness.  The only thing that really bothers you is a mysterious sky-high wall seen "
"in the distance."
msgstr ""
"パニックの波を掻き分けて、屋外の(比較的)安全な場所を確保しました。ただ一つ気になるの"
"は、遠くに見える奇妙な高い壁です。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) safety in an "
"abandoned building.  Unfortunately, while you're the only one here now, you are "
"definitely not the first person to be here, and in its current state this building no "
"longer seems nearly as secure as one might have hoped."
msgstr ""
"パニックの波を掻き分けて、(比較的)安全な廃墟にたどり着きました。現在は一人きりですが、"
"残念ながらこの場所には先客がいたようです。このままでは、この建物もそれほど安全とは言え"
"ません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) safety in "
"one of the many government evac shelters."
msgstr ""
"パニックの波を掻き分けて、(比較的)安全な公共避難シェルターになんとかたどり着きました。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) safety in "
"one of the many government evac shelters.  However, the people you came with started "
"to turn and now they're out for your flesh!  You've holed up in the basement for now, "
"but sooner or later you have to make for the door… and fast!"
msgstr ""
"パニックの波を掻き分けて、(比較的)安全な公共避難シェルターになんとかたどり着きました。"
"しかし、一緒に避難した人々が豹変し、こちらを襲い始めました！今は地下室に隠れています"
"が、いつかはドアを開け...素早く脱出しなければなりません！"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have survived the initial wave of panic, and have achieved (relative) safety in "
"one of the many government evac shelters.  While evacuating, you noticed a mysterious "
"sky-high wall in the distance, seemingly cutting off travel in every direction around "
"you."
msgstr ""
"パニックの波を掻き分けて、(比較的)安全な公共避難シェルターになんとかたどり着きました。"
"ただ一つ気になるのは、遠くに見える奇妙な高い壁が、周囲を隙間なく囲んでいるように見える"
"ことです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You heard the global, worsening news and saw the nightmare in the cities firsthand — a "
"situation that prompted you to jump from low-rent motel to cheap trailer, trying to "
"outrun the madness.  While only you know where you'd planned to go, when you heard the "
"government's last broadcast and realized 'no help was coming,' you resolved to raise a "
"dejected toast and sink to the bottom of a bottle for as long as you could.  What "
"happened in the following days of drunken stupor is an enigma.  What you do know, is "
"that it's time to see how much of the world there's left to return to."
msgstr ""
"世界的な情勢悪化のニュースを聞き、都市部の悪夢を目の当たりにしました。狂った世界から逃"
"げるために安モーテルを抜け出し、安トレーラーに飛び乗りました。その後どこへ逃げる気だっ"
"たのかはもう覚えていませんが、政府からの最後の放送を聞いた頃には「助けは来ない」と悟"
"り、後は失意のどん底で乾杯し、できる限り長く酔って気を紛らわせること以外何も考えられま"
"せんでした。酒に溺れていたその後の数日間、何が起きていたのかは覚えていません。今分かる"
"のは、残っているかどうかも怪しい現実世界と対峙するときが来たということだけです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You start drunk to the point of incapacitation, depressed, infected, surrounded by "
"fire, and sick with the flu.  This day went downhill really fast."
msgstr ""
"何もできないほど酔っ払い、気分は落ち込み、感染症に罹っており、火に囲まれ、全裸で、風邪"
"を引いています。今日は本当に酷い一日です。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were camping in the wild to let things back home cool off.  One night strange "
"noises closed in on you and you were attacked.  You managed to get away but can feel "
"things moving in the dark."
msgstr ""
"事態が収束して平穏な世界に戻るまでは、キャンプ生活を続けることに決めていました。ある"
"夜、奇妙な物音がして、何者かに襲われました。何とか逃げ切ったものの、宵闇の中で何かが動"
"いている気がします。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were convicted or working in a high-security prison before the Cataclysm.  "
"Unfortunately, you're still in it, so you need to figure out how to escape.  It's "
"located on a remote island to boot; you'll eventually need to escape that also."
msgstr ""
"大変動が起こる前に有罪判決を受け、セキュリティが厳重な刑務所で服役していました。残念な"
"がら、まだ脱獄の算段は立てられていません。おまけにこの刑務所は離島にあるため、島から脱"
"出する方法も探す必要があります。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deemed an essential employee and required to stay behind during the "
"facility's evacuation.  You'd better find your lanyard with your badge before the "
"automated defenses notice that you don't have one."
msgstr ""
"必要不可欠なスタッフと見なされ、非常事態の最中も施設に残るよう指示されました。自律型警"
"備システムに気付かれない内に、どこかに置いた身分証明バッジ付きのネックストラップを探し"
"出した方がよさそうです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were deemed an essential employee and required to stay behind during the lab's "
"evacuation.  Find a way to escape or starve to death."
msgstr ""
"必要不可欠なスタッフと見なされ、非常事態の最中も研究所に残るよう指示されました。脱出方"
"法を見つけなければ、餓死するしかありません。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life when the world ended, surrounded by riches and eating "
"well every day.  Now you've woken up, alone and drugged, in a room of your mansion "
"that you don't recognize.  As you fight to remain conscious, you hear heavy footsteps "
"nearby.  Time to get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"世界が崩壊するまでは、毎日富と贅沢な食事に囲まれて上流階級の生活を送っていました。ある"
"日薬を盛られ、ふと目覚めると、見覚えのない大邸宅の一室に一人置き去りにされていました。"
"何とか意識を保とうと必死になっていると、周囲からは重い足音が響いてきました。早く脱出し"
"た方がよさそうです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were participating in a mining operation when you found… something.  You're not "
"sure what, but it sure is dark down here."
msgstr ""
"鉱山で採掘作業をしていて...何か...を見つけました。正体も分からず、しかも辺りは真っ暗で"
"す。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were trying to scavenge for supplies, and now some rough group of bandits has "
"dragged monsters in with them where you were hiding!"
msgstr ""
"物資を調達していると、危険な盗賊団がモンスターを引き連れて、隠れ場所に乗り込んできまし"
"た！"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You'd been unsurprised when your vacation — a hastily arranged holiday to a remote "
"resort to maintain distance from the riots — had been put out of its misery when state-"
"wide evacuation was ordered after weeks of worsening violence, and the complex had "
"been placed on a shortlist for civilian gathering sites.  After days of waiting for a "
"non-existent rescue and refugees bringing tales of monsters and the dead, the "
"remaining staff had taken steps to keep spirits up, and last evening, they did that in "
"the best way they knew — hosting a party.  Considering that it lured scores of "
"zombies, you could probably classify that decision as a 'road to literal hell paved "
"with good intentions.'"
msgstr ""
"暴動から逃れるために急遽休暇を取り、人里離れたリゾート地に向かいました。数週間にわたる"
"治安の悪化を受けて州全体に避難勧告が出された段階でもリゾート地は平和そのもので、この複"
"合施設が民間人の避難所に指定されたことを聞いても、何の驚きもありませんでした。何日待っ"
"ても救助隊はやって来ません。避難してきた者たちは怪物や蘇った死者の噂をしています。昨夜"
"は、滞在者の気分が少しでも明るくなるように、従業員たちが考えうる中で最善のイベント...す"
"なわちパーティーが開かれました。結果として多数のゾンビを引き寄せてしまったことを考える"
"と、これはまさに「善意で舗装された地獄への道」の典型例と言えます。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've attracted the attention of living dead in some way, now they're all around you "
"and you'll likely have to fight through them if you want to escape."
msgstr ""
"何かをきっかけに動く死体の注意を引いてしまい、今や周囲一帯を囲まれています。逃げ出すつ"
"もりなら、ゾンビの群れと戦う必要がありそうです。"

msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've found a safe place away from the cities and devoid of the living dead.  Looks "
"like you're on your own…"
msgstr ""
"都市から離れ、生ける屍のいない安全な場所を見つけました。どうやら自給自足で生きていくし"
"かないようです..."

