msgctxt "type of damage"
msgid "%1$s %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s%2$s"

msgid "tz-CRACKck!"
msgstr "メリッ...メリメリメリッ！"

msgid "töttchen"
msgid_plural "töttchen"
msgstr[0] "トットヒェン"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"\"Holy shit, what are the odds?  OK, stand back and hold on.\"  Jenny begins peppering "
"you with questions, which you answer to the best of your ability.  She seems quite "
"satisfied.  \"Well, I can't thank you enough,\" she smiles after a few minutes.  \"You "
"probably just saved me weeks of reinventing the wheel.  Here, it's not much but it's "
"all I've got.\"  She hands you a bundle of the local currency."
msgstr ""
"「嘘でしょ、そんな偶然ある？オーケー、ちょっと待って。」投げかけられた質問にできる限り"
"答えると、ジェニーはおおむね満足したようです。「もう、本当に、感謝してもしきれない"
"ね。」質疑応答が終わり、彼女は微笑みました。「これで、私が車輪を再発明するのに費やす筈"
"だった時間を節約できたわけだ。これ、少ないけど、受け取って。」彼女はセンター内で使われ"
"ている通貨の束を手渡しました。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*is a well-kept middle aged woman with dark hair tied back in a long braid.  She looks "
"surprised as you approach.  \"Ah!  You are new.  I'm sorry, I'm Mangalpreet.\""
msgstr ""
"*は長い黒髪を三つ編みにした髪型の、小綺麗な中年女性です。こちらを見て驚いたようです。"
"「あら！見ない顔ね。失礼、私はマンガルプリートです。」"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "*leans casually against the brick wall of the shelter.  \"Hello again, gorgeous\""
msgstr "*は壁に寄りかかり、気軽に答えました。「また会ったね、お洒落さん。」"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "*peers at you for a while before speaking.  \"Oh, you're back.\""
msgstr "*はしばらくこちらを覗き込み、やがて話し始めました。「なに、戻ってきたの。」"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*seems impossibly young at first glance, her dark face nervous when she sees you "
"looking her way.  On closer inspection as you approach, you see that she is likely in "
"her early teens, but the contrast to the weary faces around makes her age stand out.  "
"\"Oh, uh… hi.  You look new.  I'm Aleesha.\""
msgstr ""
"*は非常に若いようで、暗い顔つきから緊張が見て取れます。近寄ってよく見ると10代前半あたり"
"に見えますが、周囲の疲れた大人たちの顔との対比によって非常に幼い印象を受けます。"
"「あっ、えーと...こんにちは。はじめまして。私はアリーシャ。」"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*stands in the middle of a cramped kitchen, covered in flour.  The scene looks "
"reminiscent of easier times, but the illusion is broken as he apron shifts to reveal a "
"heavy machete and holstered pistol on  her belt.  She looks up as you approach, then "
"beams in recognition.  \"Welcome to Dana's Bakery, stranger!\"  She laughs brightly.  "
"\"Glad you made out this way.  What can I do for you?\""
msgstr ""
"*は穀粉塗れになりながら、狭いキッチンに立っています。かつての平和だった頃を思い出す光景"
"ですが、エプロンの下、ベルトに刺さっている大きなナタとホルスターに収まったハンドガンを"
"見ると、現実に引き戻されます。近寄ると彼女は顔を上げ、目を輝かせました。「ダナのパン屋"
"にようこそ、お客さん！」明るく笑っています。「来てくれて嬉しいよ、ご注文は？」"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*tips his cowboy hat and sets his feet far apart as he faces you.  \"Howdy, pardner.\""
msgstr ""
"*はカウボーイハットを被り、足を大股に開き、こちらに向き直りました。「ハウディ、友よ。」"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*turns to look at you, lifting an enormous cowboy hat off his eyes.  He appears to be "
"in the process of growing out a set of bushy muttonchops and a handlebar moustache.  "
"Bright blue eyes peer out from his wrinkled face.  \"Howdy, pardner.  They call me "
"Clemens.  John Clemens.  I'm an ol' cowhand.\""
msgstr ""
"*は巨大なカウボーイハット越しにこちらを見ました。生い茂ったもみあげとカイゼルひげを整え"
"ている最中だったようです。顔は皺だらけで、目の色は青です。「ハウディ、ようこそ。俺ぁク"
"レメンス、ジョン・クレメンスだ。くたびれた牛追いさ。」"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "いやぁ、本当に太っ腹だねぇ。交渉成立だ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr "ああ、生存者か！君の心が安らかでありますように。僕はトム、よろしくね。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Ain't you heard it?  It's been screeching out in the forest during the night for a "
"while now, keeps me up sometimes.  I'm too scared to go out and see what that thing "
"is.  If you'd kill it, I'd be in your debt forever."
msgstr ""
"聞いたことはないか？夜中に時々、森から金切り声が聞こえてくるんだ。恐ろしくてとても様子"
"を見に行く気にはなれない。もし退治してくれたら、一生恩に着るよ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr "よしよし、分かった。ジェレミアを弟子にして、知識を学ばせるとしよう。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Always good to see you, friend."
msgstr "友よ、また会えて嬉しいぞ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Always nice to meet a fellow outsider.  How can I help you?"
msgstr "訪問者はいつだって歓迎するよ。どんな用事で来たんだ？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"And how many people have you killed?  Maybe it was in self defense, maybe because you "
"wanted their gear.  It's all the same.  I give their death meaning.  I hate that I "
"have to do it, I truly do, but you really must understand, there is no other way.  The "
"sooner I finish my mission, the sooner all this madness can end."
msgstr ""
"じゃあ、あんたは何人殺した？荷物が欲しかったから。自分の身を守るため。全部同じさ。私は"
"死に意味を与えられるんだ。こんなことはやりたくないと、本心から思っている。でも、他に方"
"法はない。理解してくれ。私が仕事を早く終えることができれば、こんな狂気ともおさらばでき"
"るんだ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Are you one of them?"
msgstr "あんたは奴らの仲間なのか？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "本当にいいのか？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small talk…"
msgstr "本気か？くだらない話をしていられるほど安全な場所だとは思えないな..."

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Daym.  You're probably the best dancer I've ever had the honor of meeting.  Well "
"done.  Well done indeed."
msgstr ""
"なんてこった。こりゃ今まで見た中で最高のダンスだ。よくやった。まったくもって、よくやっ"
"た。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Did you find them, <name_g>?"
msgstr "<name_g>、連れて来てくれたか？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha!  Think before you speak, chum.  Eight icons for an honest day's work, I say "
"the system's broken!"
msgstr ""
"ハハハ！なあ、話す前に頭を使ったらどうだ。一日まじめに働いて、聖画カード8枚だ。こういう"
"のを制度の破綻って言うんだ！"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Have you asked the scavenger boss if they'd have anything?"
msgstr "スカベンジャー部隊のリーダーには相談してみたか？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Have you ever noticed how… wait no, never mind."
msgstr "ちょっと気づいたんだが...いや、何でもない。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Have you had a problem with memory, friend?  I was the one who asked you this, I "
"thought I explained why I could not."
msgstr ""
"友よ、記憶力は大丈夫か？私は君にこの仕事を頼んだ張本人だし、なぜ仕事を手伝えないのか説"
"明した筈だが。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Hello stranger, I don't think we've met before.  Its nice to meet you, name's Simon."
msgstr "やあ、見知らぬ人。話したことはなかったね。はじめまして、サイモンだ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr "やあ旅の人、何しに来たんだ？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Hello, my friend."
msgstr "やあ、友よ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Hey stranger.  How's life treatin' ya these days?"
msgstr "やあ、見かけない顔だな。ここ最近、調子はどうだ？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Hey there, friend."
msgstr "やあ、こんにちは。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Hey, did you notice that there's working wi-fi here?  Not that anything else is online "
"anymore, but still."
msgstr "なあ、ここでWi-Fiが使えるって知ってた？いや、ネットには繋がってないんだけどさ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Hey, who the fuck are you?  I haven't seen you 'round.  Ah, fuck it, it doesn't "
"matter.\n"
"Here's the rules.  The first and most important one: ALWAYS CLOSE THE FUCKING ENTRY "
"DOOR BEHIND YOUR ASS!  If you're okay with that, the following rules are: don't fuck "
"with us, don't steal from us, don't start a fight without a reason with someone from "
"us.  Got it, punk?  Now get lost."
msgstr ""
"おい、誰だこいつは？知らない奴だ。ああ、クソッ、別に構わねぇ。\n"
"ここでのルール。まず一番重要なこと。お前がケツを向けてる、そこの出入口を常に閉じてお"
"け！理解できたな、じゃあ次のルールだ。一つ、仲間を怒らせるな。一つ、仲間から盗むな。一"
"つ、理由もなく仲間と喧嘩をするな。ひよっ子、分かったか？分かったら、失せな。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Hmm, well it is not ideal but I appreciate you trying and being willing to help.  I "
"will have to do my best despite the bad memories.  Thank you, my friend."
msgstr ""
"ううん、十分な人数とは言えないが、協力を申し出てくれて助かるよ。嫌なことを思い出すかも"
"しれないが、頑張らないと。ありがとう、友よ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "How are you here?  Are you one of them, somehow?  What's going on?"
msgstr "どうやってここへ？まさか、奴らの仲間なのか？どういうことだ？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I barely understand what's going on *now*.  Why do you think I'd know how the world "
"ended?"
msgstr ""
"「今の状況」をまったく理解できない。どうして私が、世界が崩壊したことを知っていると思っ"
"たんだ？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "I got my rights to be here, chum.  Squatter's rights!"
msgstr "私はここにいる権利があるんだ、そうだろ。ここに居座る権利だ！"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I guess you probably wouldn't have noticed this place before shit hit the fan, but "
"I've been down here for quite a while."
msgstr ""
"騒ぎが始まるまで、こんな場所があるなんて気付きもしなかっただろ。でも、私は長いことこの"
"辺りで暮らしてたんだ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I see things sometimes, and there's no way anyone could look like you!  I know you're "
"not real, and if you are, stay away you ugly <name_b>!"
msgstr ""
"幻覚は時々見るが、お前みたいなのが現実に存在する筈がない！どう見ても、お前は幻だ、もし"
"本当にいるなら、それ以上近寄るな、なんて醜いんだ、<name_b>！"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "I see.  And you live still.  Does that mean you managed to stop him?"
msgstr "そうだ。おまえが今も生きているということは、彼を止められたのか？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I suppose that's true.  Still not a very nice way to break the news to someone you "
"accidentally robbed…"
msgstr "確かに、その通りだ。でも、それを盗人が被害者に直接言うのはどうかと思う..."

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "I'm glad you could make it here.  May the Lord have mercy on you."
msgstr "よくぞここまで来てくださいました。あなたに主の御慈悲がありますように。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more that I see, "
"the less I can explain.  I don't know why humans would want this, but if you're a "
"brain-sucking alien, this is the place to be."
msgstr ""
"考えないようにしていたけれど、本当かもしれないな。色々な経験を積むほど、説明のつかない"
"現象が増えていく。人間がこんなことを望むとは思えない。もし脳ミソが大好物のエイリアン"
"だったら、確かに地球は楽園だと思うだろう。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "It is good to see you again, my friend."
msgstr "また会えて嬉しいよ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"It saddens me to see a talented Kindred lose his way so greatly, but I take solace in "
"the fact that you are unscathed."
msgstr ""
"才能ある同胞が深く道に迷っているのは悲しむべきことだが、おまえが無事だったということに"
"安堵しているよ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"It's nice to meet you too, survivor.  It's a tragedy what's become of the New England "
"Church Community, perhaps it'll flourish again someday."
msgstr ""
"ええ、よろしくね、生存者さん。今のニューイングランド教会コミュニティは辛い状況だけど、"
"いつかまた、賑わいが戻ってくると思うわ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"No dice.  You asked me to come along.  This is what you get.  If you don't like it, "
"I'll take my fee and go back to the center.  Ain't hard to find contracts."
msgstr ""
"ダメだ。私について来るよう頼んだだろう。それが代価だ。気に入らないなら私は勝手にセン"
"ターへ戻る。次の雇い主も簡単に見つかるだろうからな。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"No offense, but my clients definitely would not like me giving strangers directions to "
"their hideouts.  You'll have to find them on their own terms."
msgstr ""
"申し訳ないが、見ず知らずの者に隠れ家の場所を教えたりしたら、お客にそっぽを向かれてしま"
"うよ。自分の足で探してくれ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Now try not to do whatever you did again.  No, don't tell me more."
msgstr "今後は同じ失敗を繰り返さないようにな。ほら、言い訳は無用だ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Oh my, am I dealing with a professional dancer here?  Sweet moves, friend."
msgstr "おいおい、こりゃプロのダンサーじゃないか？素晴らしい動きだな、友よ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Oh well, yet another survivor.  Welcome to our group, I'm Katherine."
msgstr "おや、まだ生存者がいたとはね。ようこそ、私はキャサリン。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Oh, wow!  You're a real gem, you know that?  Thanks for even thinking of it."
msgstr "おいおい！本当に親切な人だな？気持ちだけで十分だよ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Oh, you're not one of the <zombies>.  Come on in, just don't cause any trouble."
msgstr "ああ、<zombies>の仲間じゃないのか。どうぞ、ただし面倒は起こさないように頼むよ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're not one of them.  Those <zombies>, I mean.  Come on in, just don't cause "
"any trouble."
msgstr ""
"ああ、奴らじゃないのか。奴らってのは、<zombies>のこと。どうぞ、騒ぎを起こさないように"
"な。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Oooooh.  Oh.  You did not just fucking go there.  Let's leave the fatties to die, "
"hey?  Wanna know how easy it is to find fucking *thyroid medication* after the "
"apocalypse, asshat?  Besides, there are more skills than heavy lifting needed now… no, "
"you know what?  Screw it.  You're not worth my time."
msgstr ""
"ちょっとちょっと。へぇ。言っちゃいけないことを言ったな。デブは見殺しにしよう、って？大"
"変動の後でクソ*甲状腺ホルモン剤*なんて簡単に見つかると思う？しかも、私は重いものを持つ"
"以上に今必要とされる技術を持って...まあいいや、あんたに何が分かる？くだらない。あんたと"
"話しても時間の無駄だ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Screw You!"
msgstr "くたばりやがれ！"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Seen any good movies lately?"
msgstr "最近は、何かいい映画を見た？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Seriously?  You've already done so much.  I won't say no, though."
msgstr "本当に？今までもたくさん助けてもらったのに。でも、手伝ってくれるなら心強いよ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "So, you have survived."
msgstr "そうか、無事だったのだね。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Sold!  Thanks for helping me out, friend."
msgstr "買った！助けてくれてありがとう、友よ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Sure thing, friend!  Let's see how you can move to this one."
msgstr "もちろんだ、友よ！こんなのはどうだろう。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Surprise!\"  They do jazz hands.  \"Sorry.  Well, I'm told that I'm part of a small "
"group right now.  Maybe you were the first."
msgstr ""
"驚いただろう！」クランベリーは両手をひらひらと動かしておどけました。「失礼、小規模なグ"
"ループだとは聞いている。多分あんたが先輩だろう。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Take it easy now.  Wouldn't want you coming back here too soon."
msgstr "無理はしないように。すぐに戻って来るんじゃないよ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Thank you for trying, my friend.  With you and me that will be five, I will do my best "
"to be strong and assist in the cleanup."
msgstr ""
"協力者を集めてくれてありがとう、友よ。私と君が加われば5人で作業できる。頑張って片付けを"
"終わらせよう。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"That ain't the point here, chum.  Don'tcha get it?  This was MY territory, but they "
"took it away from me.  Now they think of us as nothin' but a <swear> nuisance."
msgstr ""
"お前、そんなことはどうでもいいだろ。分からないのか？ここは私の縄張りだったのに、奴らに"
"奪われたんだ。今や厄介者としか思われてない、<swear>。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"That is quite alright, four should be enough though I appreciate your offer.  Four "
"people will make the job much easier and I will do my best even if it is painful.  My "
"thanks, friend."
msgstr ""
"ありがとう、申し出には感謝するが、4人もいれば十分だ。これで作業はかなり楽になるし、苦し"
"くても頑張れる。本当に助かったよ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Things are coming along.  I have a lot of studying to do before I know how to fix my "
"design issues, but the book you brought definitely has everything I need.  Now that "
"I've got some progress to show, administration is much more willing to help me get the "
"parts I need.  You've been a great gofer, but I can probably handle the rest on my "
"own.  Check back in a week or two!"
msgstr ""
"順調に進んでる。設計の問題の解決方法を探す以前にやるべきことはたくさんあるけど、必要な"
"知識はあなたがくれた本に一通り載ってるみたい。運営班に進捗状況を知らせたら、必要な部品"
"の調達を前よりもずっと積極的に手伝ってくれるようになった。あなたのお使いの腕は素晴らし"
"かったけど、あとは自力で何とかなると思う。1、2週間経ったらまた聞きに来て！"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Well I'll be damned, a fellow survivor!  I'm Darryl, nice to meet you."
msgstr "こいつぁ驚いた、まだ生存者がいたとはね！俺はダリル、よろしくな。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Well now, that's quite a kind offer, and I appreciate you looking past my full-body "
"pubic hair.  Sorry though.  I've come to feel sort of responsible for this little "
"gaggle of squatters.  As long as I'm the only one providing for them, I don't think I "
"can leave."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、親切な申し出も、全身から生えてる毛についてしつこく尋ねたりしなかったことも嬉"
"しく思ってるよ。でも、私はこの騒がしい居座り組達に対して、ある種の責任を感じるように"
"なってしまったんだ。私が物資を渡せる唯一の人間である限り、ここを去ろうとは思わない。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Well well, another traveler.  Don't try anything, you're outnumbered here and we're "
"well armed."
msgstr ""
"おやおや、また旅の人か。妙な真似はしないでくれよ。こっちには大勢いるし、武器もたくさん"
"あるんだからな。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Well, well.  I'm glad you are back."
msgstr "やぁやぁ。戻ってきてくれて嬉しいよ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Well, well.  You are back."
msgstr "やぁ、やぁ。戻ってきてくれたね。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Well, you got me there.  I sure ain't one to block a fellow farmer's right to reclaim "
"this God-given earth."
msgstr ""
"確かに、そうだな。神から授かった大地を取り戻すためだ。農家は手伝ってやらないとな。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Well… I'll be honest, I didn't even think Dave could be sorted out, and you've gone "
"and called my bluff!  It's a darn fine thing you've done for that poor soul.  Listen, "
"I wasn't… entirely serious about wanting to come with you, but if you can convince the "
"others to go, then I guess I'll come along."
msgstr ""
"そうか...正直なところ、デイブを何とかできるとは思っていなかったんだが、君は見事やりと"
"げ、私はしっぺ返しを食らったわけだ！気の毒な人のため真摯になって行動したんだな。ええ"
"と、実は...君からの提案については、あまり真剣には考えていなかったんだ。でも、他の人達を"
"説得して連れ出せたら、私も一緒に行こう。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Well… you have shown that you can survive out there, and you've been able to provide "
"food, so I know you're thriving more than we are here.  All right, I'll tell you "
"what.  I'm not going anywhere without my friends here, we've been through way too much "
"together.  If you can convince Luo, Brandon, and Yusuke to come along, then I'll go."
msgstr ""
"そうだな...そこへ行けば生き残れるし、食べ物もある。ここよりも豊かな生活ができるだろう。"
"分かった、じゃあこうしよう。ここの友人たちが行かないのなら、私もここに留まる。もしあな"
"たがルオ、ブランドン、ユウスケの3人を説得出来たら、私も一緒に行こう。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Where you say you're from again?  You're not as worldly as you look.  I'm talking "
"about weed.  Marijuana.  Wondered if you've happened upon any."
msgstr ""
"君はどこから来たんだ？見た目ほど世俗的じゃないんだな。ハッパの話だよ。マリファナ。偶然"
"見たことすらないなんて驚いたよ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Woof, you ready for a real hot take?  The <swear> government did this to us.  "
"Intentionally, or at least sort-of intentionally."
msgstr ""
"へぇ、ブッ飛んだ意見を聞く心の準備はできた？政府がやったんだよ、<swear>。意図的に、ある"
"いは多少意図的にね。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm real hungry and they put drugs in most of the food.  I can see you're not "
"like that."
msgstr ""
"ああ、すごくお腹が空いていたけど、奴らは大抵の食べ物に毒を入れているからな。君はそんな"
"ことしないって信じているよ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Yeah, just that I sometimes see things.  I wanna be sure you're real."
msgstr "ああ、時々幻覚が見えるんだ。あんたが本当にそこにいるのか、確認させてほしい。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  Have you noticed how they pay us in these tiny little gold coins?\"  Cranberry "
"holds one up for emphasis.  \"It's bizarre.  You'd think they have a gold mine in "
"there, but no, they don't, so they make me cross the damn world grabbing gold bars.  "
"As far as scrip goes, it seems inconvenient as hell to make."
msgstr ""
"ああ。ちっぽけな金貨が支払われただろう？」クランベリーは一枚のコインを掲げました。「妙"
"な話だ。別に近所に金鉱脈がある訳じゃない。ろくでもない世界の隅から隅まで探し回って、金"
"を集める仕事があるんだよ。臨時の貨幣なんて不便なものを作る奴がこの世にいるとはね。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Yes, my friend.  You have done so much for me, I would be glad to teach you what I "
"can.  I must ask a small amount in trade, for materials.  I hope you understand."
msgstr ""
"もちろんだ、友よ。君は色々と手伝ってくれたからね。私にできることなら喜んで教えるよ。資"
"材は物々交換で少量しか手に入らなかった。分かってもらえると助かるよ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You ever see the Matrix?  This is it.  In real life.  To keep us locked in here, the "
"creators of the simulation have to make sure we're just the right level of miserable.  "
"I think their algorithms got messed up though, and went into overdrive, because all "
"this is a little implausible.  Still, I guess we're still jacked in, so maybe it's "
"working."
msgstr ""
"マトリックスって映画を見たことは？まさにあれなんだ。この生活が。このシミュレーションの"
"作者は、私たちをここに閉じ込めておくために、ある程度辛い状況に置き続ける必要がある。最"
"近ありえない事ばかり起きているのは、きっとアルゴリズムが滅茶苦茶になって、暴走状態に"
"陥ったに違いない。でも、この幻想が終わらないんだから、まだ機能はしているんだ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local herbalist."
msgstr "初めて見る顔だな、どうぞよろしく。私はコスタス、地元で薬草医をしている。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You sure?  I mean, you've been traveling for a long time, haven't you?  Alright, it's "
"your decision.  Let me know when you changed your mind."
msgstr ""
"本気か？その、ずっと長旅続きだったんじゃないのか？いや、君自身の決断が大事だ。気が変"
"わったらまた言ってくれ。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You think you're immortal, huh, <name_b>?"
msgstr "おいおい、<name_b>、自分が不死身だとでも思ってるのか？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You're back, and still alive!  Whoa."
msgstr "わぁ、よく無事に戻ってきたね！すごい。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You're creepy.  I'm sorry for your lack of friends but, like, I'm literally a kid.  "
"Everyone on Earth turned into a zombie, we're running out of toilet paper and "
"everything, and my parents are gone.  I know they're still alive and they're looking "
"for me.  I miss them.  Is that enough personal stuff for you?"
msgstr ""
"気持ち悪っ。あなたに友達がいないのは可哀そうだと思うけど、見て分かるとおり、私はまだ子"
"供なんだよ。地球に暮らす皆がゾンビになって、トイレットペーパーも何もかも無くなって、両"
"親ともはぐれちゃって。きっとまだ生きてて、私を捜してると思う。早く会いたいな。私の個人"
"的な話はこれくらいで十分でしょ？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "You're new here, who the hell put you up to this crap?"
msgstr "おい新入り、誰に言われてやってんだ？"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You're right, but I still think there's something bigger out there.  Something evil.  "
"It doesn't matter whether science can explain it because we damn sure don't seem "
"capable of defeating it."
msgstr ""
"その言い分は正しいけれど、私には、何か巨大な力が働いているとしか思えない。邪悪な力だ。"
"科学で説明できるかどうかは問題じゃない。何故なら、説明しようがしまいが、私たちに勝ち目"
"がないからね。"

msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Your mind is open.  More than most.  Perhaps one day, you too will feel the power of "
"the song and become Kindred.  For now, traveller, listen, listen and feel the song."
msgstr ""
"受け入れてくれるのだな。この上なく良い心がけだ。きっと、おまえもいつか歌の力を感じ、我"
"らの同朋となるだろう。旅人よ、歌を感じ取れるよう、今は耳を傾け続けなさい。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"\"Holy shit, what are the odds?  OK, stand back and hold on.\"  Jenny begins peppering "
"you with questions, which you answer to the best of your ability.  She seems quite "
"satisfied.  \"Well, I can't thank you enough,\" she smiles after a few minutes.  \"You "
"probably just saved me weeks of reinventing the wheel.  Here, it's not much but it's "
"all I've got.\"  She hands you a bundle of the local currency."
msgstr ""
"「嘘でしょ、そんな偶然ある？オーケー、ちょっと待って。」投げかけられた質問にできる限り"
"答えると、ジェニーはおおむね満足したようです。「もう、本当に、感謝してもしきれない"
"ね。」質疑応答が終わり、彼女は微笑みました。「これで、私が車輪を再発明するのに費やす筈"
"だった時間を節約できたわけだ。これ、少ないけど、受け取って。」彼女はセンター内で使われ"
"ている通貨の束を手渡しました。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*is a well-kept middle aged woman with dark hair tied back in a long braid.  She looks "
"surprised as you approach.  \"Ah!  You are new.  I'm sorry, I'm Mangalpreet.\""
msgstr ""
"*は長い黒髪を三つ編みにした髪型の、小綺麗な中年女性です。こちらを見て驚いたようです。"
"「あら！見ない顔ね。失礼、私はマンガルプリートです。」"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "*leans casually against the brick wall of the shelter.  \"Hello again, gorgeous\""
msgstr "*は壁に寄りかかり、気軽に答えました。「また会ったね、お洒落さん。」"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "*peers at you for a while before speaking.  \"Oh, you're back.\""
msgstr "*はしばらくこちらを覗き込み、やがて話し始めました。「なに、戻ってきたの。」"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*seems impossibly young at first glance, her dark face nervous when she sees you "
"looking her way.  On closer inspection as you approach, you see that she is likely in "
"her early teens, but the contrast to the weary faces around makes her age stand out.  "
"\"Oh, uh… hi.  You look new.  I'm Aleesha.\""
msgstr ""
"*は非常に若いようで、暗い顔つきから緊張が見て取れます。近寄ってよく見ると10代前半あたり"
"に見えますが、周囲の疲れた大人たちの顔との対比によって非常に幼い印象を受けます。"
"「あっ、えーと...こんにちは。はじめまして。私はアリーシャ。」"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*stands in the middle of a cramped kitchen, covered in flour.  The scene looks "
"reminiscent of easier times, but the illusion is broken as he apron shifts to reveal a "
"heavy machete and holstered pistol on  her belt.  She looks up as you approach, then "
"beams in recognition.  \"Welcome to Dana's Bakery, stranger!\"  She laughs brightly.  "
"\"Glad you made out this way.  What can I do for you?\""
msgstr ""
"*は穀粉塗れになりながら、狭いキッチンに立っています。かつての平和だった頃を思い出す光景"
"ですが、エプロンの下、ベルトに刺さっている大きなナタとホルスターに収まったハンドガンを"
"見ると、現実に引き戻されます。近寄ると彼女は顔を上げ、目を輝かせました。「ダナのパン屋"
"にようこそ、お客さん！」明るく笑っています。「来てくれて嬉しいよ、ご注文は？」"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*tips his cowboy hat and sets his feet far apart as he faces you.  \"Howdy, pardner.\""
msgstr ""
"*はカウボーイハットを被り、足を大股に開き、こちらに向き直りました。「ハウディ、友よ。」"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"*turns to look at you, lifting an enormous cowboy hat off his eyes.  He appears to be "
"in the process of growing out a set of bushy muttonchops and a handlebar moustache.  "
"Bright blue eyes peer out from his wrinkled face.  \"Howdy, pardner.  They call me "
"Clemens.  John Clemens.  I'm an ol' cowhand.\""
msgstr ""
"*は巨大なカウボーイハット越しにこちらを見ました。生い茂ったもみあげとカイゼルひげを整え"
"ている最中だったようです。顔は皺だらけで、目の色は青です。「ハウディ、ようこそ。俺ぁク"
"レメンス、ジョン・クレメンスだ。くたびれた牛追いさ。」"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "いやぁ、本当に太っ腹だねぇ。交渉成立だ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr "ああ、生存者か！君の心が安らかでありますように。僕はトム、よろしくね。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Ain't you heard it?  It's been screeching out in the forest during the night for a "
"while now, keeps me up sometimes.  I'm too scared to go out and see what that thing "
"is.  If you'd kill it, I'd be in your debt forever."
msgstr ""
"聞いたことはないか？夜中に時々、森から金切り声が聞こえてくるんだ。恐ろしくてとても様子"
"を見に行く気にはなれない。もし退治してくれたら、一生恩に着るよ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr "よしよし、分かった。ジェレミアを弟子にして、知識を学ばせるとしよう。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Always good to see you, friend."
msgstr "友よ、また会えて嬉しいぞ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Always nice to meet a fellow outsider.  How can I help you?"
msgstr "訪問者はいつだって歓迎するよ。どんな用事で来たんだ？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"And how many people have you killed?  Maybe it was in self defense, maybe because you "
"wanted their gear.  It's all the same.  I give their death meaning.  I hate that I "
"have to do it, I truly do, but you really must understand, there is no other way.  The "
"sooner I finish my mission, the sooner all this madness can end."
msgstr ""
"じゃあ、あんたは何人殺した？荷物が欲しかったから。自分の身を守るため。全部同じさ。私は"
"死に意味を与えられるんだ。こんなことはやりたくないと、本心から思っている。でも、他に方"
"法はない。理解してくれ。私が仕事を早く終えることができれば、こんな狂気ともおさらばでき"
"るんだ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Are you one of them?"
msgstr "あんたは奴らの仲間なのか？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "本当にいいのか？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small talk…"
msgstr "本気か？くだらない話をしていられるほど安全な場所だとは思えないな..."

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Daym.  You're probably the best dancer I've ever had the honor of meeting.  Well "
"done.  Well done indeed."
msgstr ""
"なんてこった。こりゃ今まで見た中で最高のダンスだ。よくやった。まったくもって、よくやっ"
"た。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Did you find them, <name_g>?"
msgstr "<name_g>、連れて来てくれたか？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha!  Think before you speak, chum.  Eight icons for an honest day's work, I say "
"the system's broken!"
msgstr ""
"ハハハ！なあ、話す前に頭を使ったらどうだ。一日まじめに働いて、聖画カード8枚だ。こういう"
"のを制度の破綻って言うんだ！"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Have you asked the scavenger boss if they'd have anything?"
msgstr "スカベンジャー部隊のリーダーには相談してみたか？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Have you ever noticed how… wait no, never mind."
msgstr "ちょっと気づいたんだが...いや、何でもない。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Have you had a problem with memory, friend?  I was the one who asked you this, I "
"thought I explained why I could not."
msgstr ""
"友よ、記憶力は大丈夫か？私は君にこの仕事を頼んだ張本人だし、なぜ仕事を手伝えないのか説"
"明した筈だが。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Hello stranger, I don't think we've met before.  Its nice to meet you, name's Simon."
msgstr "やあ、見知らぬ人。話したことはなかったね。はじめまして、サイモンだ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr "やあ旅の人、何しに来たんだ？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hello, my friend."
msgstr "やあ、友よ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hey stranger.  How's life treatin' ya these days?"
msgstr "やあ、見かけない顔だな。ここ最近、調子はどうだ？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Hey there, friend."
msgstr "やあ、こんにちは。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Hey, did you notice that there's working wi-fi here?  Not that anything else is online "
"anymore, but still."
msgstr "なあ、ここでWi-Fiが使えるって知ってた？いや、ネットには繋がってないんだけどさ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Hey, who the fuck are you?  I haven't seen you 'round.  Ah, fuck it, it doesn't "
"matter.\n"
"Here's the rules.  The first and most important one: ALWAYS CLOSE THE FUCKING ENTRY "
"DOOR BEHIND YOUR ASS!  If you're okay with that, the following rules are: don't fuck "
"with us, don't steal from us, don't start a fight without a reason with someone from "
"us.  Got it, punk?  Now get lost."
msgstr ""
"おい、誰だこいつは？知らない奴だ。ああ、クソッ、別に構わねぇ。\n"
"ここでのルール。まず一番重要なこと。お前がケツを向けてる、そこの出入口を常に閉じてお"
"け！理解できたな、じゃあ次のルールだ。一つ、仲間を怒らせるな。一つ、仲間から盗むな。一"
"つ、理由もなく仲間と喧嘩をするな。ひよっ子、分かったか？分かったら、失せな。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Hmm, well it is not ideal but I appreciate you trying and being willing to help.  I "
"will have to do my best despite the bad memories.  Thank you, my friend."
msgstr ""
"ううん、十分な人数とは言えないが、協力を申し出てくれて助かるよ。嫌なことを思い出すかも"
"しれないが、頑張らないと。ありがとう、友よ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "How are you here?  Are you one of them, somehow?  What's going on?"
msgstr "どうやってここへ？まさか、奴らの仲間なのか？どういうことだ？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I barely understand what's going on *now*.  Why do you think I'd know how the world "
"ended?"
msgstr ""
"「今の状況」をまったく理解できない。どうして私が、世界が崩壊したことを知っていると思っ"
"たんだ？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "I got my rights to be here, chum.  Squatter's rights!"
msgstr "私はここにいる権利があるんだ、そうだろ。ここに居座る権利だ！"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I guess you probably wouldn't have noticed this place before shit hit the fan, but "
"I've been down here for quite a while."
msgstr ""
"騒ぎが始まるまで、こんな場所があるなんて気付きもしなかっただろ。でも、私は長いことこの"
"辺りで暮らしてたんだ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I see things sometimes, and there's no way anyone could look like you!  I know you're "
"not real, and if you are, stay away you ugly <name_b>!"
msgstr ""
"幻覚は時々見るが、お前みたいなのが現実に存在する筈がない！どう見ても、お前は幻だ、もし"
"本当にいるなら、それ以上近寄るな、なんて醜いんだ、<name_b>！"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "I see.  And you live still.  Does that mean you managed to stop him?"
msgstr "そうだ。おまえが今も生きているということは、彼を止められたのか？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I suppose that's true.  Still not a very nice way to break the news to someone you "
"accidentally robbed…"
msgstr "確かに、その通りだ。でも、それを盗人が被害者に直接言うのはどうかと思う..."

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "I'm glad you could make it here.  May the Lord have mercy on you."
msgstr "よくぞここまで来てくださいました。あなたに主の御慈悲がありますように。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more that I see, "
"the less I can explain.  I don't know why humans would want this, but if you're a "
"brain-sucking alien, this is the place to be."
msgstr ""
"考えないようにしていたけれど、本当かもしれないな。色々な経験を積むほど、説明のつかない"
"現象が増えていく。人間がこんなことを望むとは思えない。もし脳ミソが大好物のエイリアン"
"だったら、確かに地球は楽園だと思うだろう。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "It is good to see you again, my friend."
msgstr "また会えて嬉しいよ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"It saddens me to see a talented Kindred lose his way so greatly, but I take solace in "
"the fact that you are unscathed."
msgstr ""
"才能ある同胞が深く道に迷っているのは悲しむべきことだが、おまえが無事だったということに"
"安堵しているよ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"It's nice to meet you too, survivor.  It's a tragedy what's become of the New England "
"Church Community, perhaps it'll flourish again someday."
msgstr ""
"ええ、よろしくね、生存者さん。今のニューイングランド教会コミュニティは辛い状況だけど、"
"いつかまた、賑わいが戻ってくると思うわ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"No dice.  You asked me to come along.  This is what you get.  If you don't like it, "
"I'll take my fee and go back to the center.  Ain't hard to find contracts."
msgstr ""
"ダメだ。私について来るよう頼んだだろう。それが代価だ。気に入らないなら私は勝手にセン"
"ターへ戻る。次の雇い主も簡単に見つかるだろうからな。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"No offense, but my clients definitely would not like me giving strangers directions to "
"their hideouts.  You'll have to find them on their own terms."
msgstr ""
"申し訳ないが、見ず知らずの者に隠れ家の場所を教えたりしたら、お客にそっぽを向かれてしま"
"うよ。自分の足で探してくれ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Now try not to do whatever you did again.  No, don't tell me more."
msgstr "今後は同じ失敗を繰り返さないようにな。ほら、言い訳は無用だ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Oh my, am I dealing with a professional dancer here?  Sweet moves, friend."
msgstr "おいおい、こりゃプロのダンサーじゃないか？素晴らしい動きだな、友よ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Oh well, yet another survivor.  Welcome to our group, I'm Katherine."
msgstr "おや、まだ生存者がいたとはね。ようこそ、私はキャサリン。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Oh, wow!  You're a real gem, you know that?  Thanks for even thinking of it."
msgstr "おいおい！本当に親切な人だな？気持ちだけで十分だよ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Oh, you're not one of the <zombies>.  Come on in, just don't cause any trouble."
msgstr "ああ、<zombies>の仲間じゃないのか。どうぞ、ただし面倒は起こさないように頼むよ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're not one of them.  Those <zombies>, I mean.  Come on in, just don't cause "
"any trouble."
msgstr ""
"ああ、奴らじゃないのか。奴らってのは、<zombies>のこと。どうぞ、騒ぎを起こさないように"
"な。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Oooooh.  Oh.  You did not just fucking go there.  Let's leave the fatties to die, "
"hey?  Wanna know how easy it is to find fucking *thyroid medication* after the "
"apocalypse, asshat?  Besides, there are more skills than heavy lifting needed now… no, "
"you know what?  Screw it.  You're not worth my time."
msgstr ""
"ちょっとちょっと。へぇ。言っちゃいけないことを言ったな。デブは見殺しにしよう、って？大"
"変動の後でクソ*甲状腺ホルモン剤*なんて簡単に見つかると思う？しかも、私は重いものを持つ"
"以上に今必要とされる技術を持って...まあいいや、あんたに何が分かる？くだらない。あんたと"
"話しても時間の無駄だ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Screw You!"
msgstr "くたばりやがれ！"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Seen any good movies lately?"
msgstr "最近は、何かいい映画を見た？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Seriously?  You've already done so much.  I won't say no, though."
msgstr "本当に？今までもたくさん助けてもらったのに。でも、手伝ってくれるなら心強いよ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "So, you have survived."
msgstr "そうか、無事だったのだね。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Sold!  Thanks for helping me out, friend."
msgstr "買った！助けてくれてありがとう、友よ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Sure thing, friend!  Let's see how you can move to this one."
msgstr "もちろんだ、友よ！こんなのはどうだろう。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Surprise!\"  They do jazz hands.  \"Sorry.  Well, I'm told that I'm part of a small "
"group right now.  Maybe you were the first."
msgstr ""
"驚いただろう！」クランベリーは両手をひらひらと動かしておどけました。「失礼、小規模なグ"
"ループだとは聞いている。多分あんたが先輩だろう。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Take it easy now.  Wouldn't want you coming back here too soon."
msgstr "無理はしないように。すぐに戻って来るんじゃないよ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Thank you for trying, my friend.  With you and me that will be five, I will do my best "
"to be strong and assist in the cleanup."
msgstr ""
"協力者を集めてくれてありがとう、友よ。私と君が加われば5人で作業できる。頑張って片付けを"
"終わらせよう。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"That ain't the point here, chum.  Don'tcha get it?  This was MY territory, but they "
"took it away from me.  Now they think of us as nothin' but a <swear> nuisance."
msgstr ""
"お前、そんなことはどうでもいいだろ。分からないのか？ここは私の縄張りだったのに、奴らに"
"奪われたんだ。今や厄介者としか思われてない、<swear>。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"That is quite alright, four should be enough though I appreciate your offer.  Four "
"people will make the job much easier and I will do my best even if it is painful.  My "
"thanks, friend."
msgstr ""
"ありがとう、申し出には感謝するが、4人もいれば十分だ。これで作業はかなり楽になるし、苦し"
"くても頑張れる。本当に助かったよ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Things are coming along.  I have a lot of studying to do before I know how to fix my "
"design issues, but the book you brought definitely has everything I need.  Now that "
"I've got some progress to show, administration is much more willing to help me get the "
"parts I need.  You've been a great gofer, but I can probably handle the rest on my "
"own.  Check back in a week or two!"
msgstr ""
"順調に進んでる。設計の問題の解決方法を探す以前にやるべきことはたくさんあるけど、必要な"
"知識はあなたがくれた本に一通り載ってるみたい。運営班に進捗状況を知らせたら、必要な部品"
"の調達を前よりもずっと積極的に手伝ってくれるようになった。あなたのお使いの腕は素晴らし"
"かったけど、あとは自力で何とかなると思う。1、2週間経ったらまた聞きに来て！"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Well I'll be damned, a fellow survivor!  I'm Darryl, nice to meet you."
msgstr "こいつぁ驚いた、まだ生存者がいたとはね！俺はダリル、よろしくな。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well now, that's quite a kind offer, and I appreciate you looking past my full-body "
"pubic hair.  Sorry though.  I've come to feel sort of responsible for this little "
"gaggle of squatters.  As long as I'm the only one providing for them, I don't think I "
"can leave."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、親切な申し出も、全身から生えてる毛についてしつこく尋ねたりしなかったことも嬉"
"しく思ってるよ。でも、私はこの騒がしい居座り組達に対して、ある種の責任を感じるように"
"なってしまったんだ。私が物資を渡せる唯一の人間である限り、ここを去ろうとは思わない。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well well, another traveler.  Don't try anything, you're outnumbered here and we're "
"well armed."
msgstr ""
"おやおや、また旅の人か。妙な真似はしないでくれよ。こっちには大勢いるし、武器もたくさん"
"あるんだからな。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Well, well.  I'm glad you are back."
msgstr "やぁやぁ。戻ってきてくれて嬉しいよ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Well, well.  You are back."
msgstr "やぁ、やぁ。戻ってきてくれたね。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well, you got me there.  I sure ain't one to block a fellow farmer's right to reclaim "
"this God-given earth."
msgstr ""
"確かに、そうだな。神から授かった大地を取り戻すためだ。農家は手伝ってやらないとな。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well… I'll be honest, I didn't even think Dave could be sorted out, and you've gone "
"and called my bluff!  It's a darn fine thing you've done for that poor soul.  Listen, "
"I wasn't… entirely serious about wanting to come with you, but if you can convince the "
"others to go, then I guess I'll come along."
msgstr ""
"そうか...正直なところ、デイブを何とかできるとは思っていなかったんだが、君は見事やりと"
"げ、私はしっぺ返しを食らったわけだ！気の毒な人のため真摯になって行動したんだな。ええ"
"と、実は...君からの提案については、あまり真剣には考えていなかったんだ。でも、他の人達を"
"説得して連れ出せたら、私も一緒に行こう。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Well… you have shown that you can survive out there, and you've been able to provide "
"food, so I know you're thriving more than we are here.  All right, I'll tell you "
"what.  I'm not going anywhere without my friends here, we've been through way too much "
"together.  If you can convince Luo, Brandon, and Yusuke to come along, then I'll go."
msgstr ""
"そうだな...そこへ行けば生き残れるし、食べ物もある。ここよりも豊かな生活ができるだろう。"
"分かった、じゃあこうしよう。ここの友人たちが行かないのなら、私もここに留まる。もしあな"
"たがルオ、ブランドン、ユウスケの3人を説得出来たら、私も一緒に行こう。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Where you say you're from again?  You're not as worldly as you look.  I'm talking "
"about weed.  Marijuana.  Wondered if you've happened upon any."
msgstr ""
"君はどこから来たんだ？見た目ほど世俗的じゃないんだな。ハッパの話だよ。マリファナ。偶然"
"見たことすらないなんて驚いたよ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Woof, you ready for a real hot take?  The <swear> government did this to us.  "
"Intentionally, or at least sort-of intentionally."
msgstr ""
"へぇ、ブッ飛んだ意見を聞く心の準備はできた？政府がやったんだよ、<swear>。意図的に、ある"
"いは多少意図的にね。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm real hungry and they put drugs in most of the food.  I can see you're not "
"like that."
msgstr ""
"ああ、すごくお腹が空いていたけど、奴らは大抵の食べ物に毒を入れているからな。君はそんな"
"ことしないって信じているよ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Yeah, just that I sometimes see things.  I wanna be sure you're real."
msgstr "ああ、時々幻覚が見えるんだ。あんたが本当にそこにいるのか、確認させてほしい。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  Have you noticed how they pay us in these tiny little gold coins?\"  Cranberry "
"holds one up for emphasis.  \"It's bizarre.  You'd think they have a gold mine in "
"there, but no, they don't, so they make me cross the damn world grabbing gold bars.  "
"As far as scrip goes, it seems inconvenient as hell to make."
msgstr ""
"ああ。ちっぽけな金貨が支払われただろう？」クランベリーは一枚のコインを掲げました。「妙"
"な話だ。別に近所に金鉱脈がある訳じゃない。ろくでもない世界の隅から隅まで探し回って、金"
"を集める仕事があるんだよ。臨時の貨幣なんて不便なものを作る奴がこの世にいるとはね。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Yes, my friend.  You have done so much for me, I would be glad to teach you what I "
"can.  I must ask a small amount in trade, for materials.  I hope you understand."
msgstr ""
"もちろんだ、友よ。君は色々と手伝ってくれたからね。私にできることなら喜んで教えるよ。資"
"材は物々交換で少量しか手に入らなかった。分かってもらえると助かるよ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You ever see the Matrix?  This is it.  In real life.  To keep us locked in here, the "
"creators of the simulation have to make sure we're just the right level of miserable.  "
"I think their algorithms got messed up though, and went into overdrive, because all "
"this is a little implausible.  Still, I guess we're still jacked in, so maybe it's "
"working."
msgstr ""
"マトリックスって映画を見たことは？まさにあれなんだ。この生活が。このシミュレーションの"
"作者は、私たちをここに閉じ込めておくために、ある程度辛い状況に置き続ける必要がある。最"
"近ありえない事ばかり起きているのは、きっとアルゴリズムが滅茶苦茶になって、暴走状態に"
"陥ったに違いない。でも、この幻想が終わらないんだから、まだ機能はしているんだ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local herbalist."
msgstr "初めて見る顔だな、どうぞよろしく。私はコスタス、地元で薬草医をしている。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You sure?  I mean, you've been traveling for a long time, haven't you?  Alright, it's "
"your decision.  Let me know when you changed your mind."
msgstr ""
"本気か？その、ずっと長旅続きだったんじゃないのか？いや、君自身の決断が大事だ。気が変"
"わったらまた言ってくれ。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You think you're immortal, huh, <name_b>?"
msgstr "おいおい、<name_b>、自分が不死身だとでも思ってるのか？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You're back, and still alive!  Whoa."
msgstr "わぁ、よく無事に戻ってきたね！すごい。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You're creepy.  I'm sorry for your lack of friends but, like, I'm literally a kid.  "
"Everyone on Earth turned into a zombie, we're running out of toilet paper and "
"everything, and my parents are gone.  I know they're still alive and they're looking "
"for me.  I miss them.  Is that enough personal stuff for you?"
msgstr ""
"気持ち悪っ。あなたに友達がいないのは可哀そうだと思うけど、見て分かるとおり、私はまだ子"
"供なんだよ。地球に暮らす皆がゾンビになって、トイレットペーパーも何もかも無くなって、両"
"親ともはぐれちゃって。きっとまだ生きてて、私を捜してると思う。早く会いたいな。私の個人"
"的な話はこれくらいで十分でしょ？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "You're new here, who the hell put you up to this crap?"
msgstr "おい新入り、誰に言われてやってんだ？"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You're right, but I still think there's something bigger out there.  Something evil.  "
"It doesn't matter whether science can explain it because we damn sure don't seem "
"capable of defeating it."
msgstr ""
"その言い分は正しいけれど、私には、何か巨大な力が働いているとしか思えない。邪悪な力だ。"
"科学で説明できるかどうかは問題じゃない。何故なら、説明しようがしまいが、私たちに勝ち目"
"がないからね。"

msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Your mind is open.  More than most.  Perhaps one day, you too will feel the power of "
"the song and become Kindred.  For now, traveller, listen, listen and feel the song."
msgstr ""
"受け入れてくれるのだな。この上なく良い心がけだ。きっと、おまえもいつか歌の力を感じ、我"
"らの同朋となるだろう。旅人よ、歌を感じ取れるよう、今は耳を傾け続けなさい。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"\"Holy shit, what are the odds?  OK, stand back and hold on.\"  Jenny begins peppering "
"you with questions, which you answer to the best of your ability.  She seems quite "
"satisfied.  \"Well, I can't thank you enough,\" she smiles after a few minutes.  \"You "
"probably just saved me weeks of reinventing the wheel.  Here, it's not much but it's "
"all I've got.\"  She hands you a bundle of the local currency."
msgstr ""
"「嘘でしょ、そんな偶然ある？オーケー、ちょっと待って。」投げかけられた質問にできる限り"
"答えると、ジェニーはおおむね満足したようです。「もう、本当に、感謝してもしきれない"
"ね。」質疑応答が終わり、彼女は微笑みました。「これで、私が車輪を再発明するのに費やす筈"
"だった時間を節約できたわけだ。これ、少ないけど、受け取って。」彼女はセンター内で使われ"
"ている通貨の束を手渡しました。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*is a well-kept middle aged woman with dark hair tied back in a long braid.  She looks "
"surprised as you approach.  \"Ah!  You are new.  I'm sorry, I'm Mangalpreet.\""
msgstr ""
"*は長い黒髪を三つ編みにした髪型の、小綺麗な中年女性です。こちらを見て驚いたようです。"
"「あら！見ない顔ね。失礼、私はマンガルプリートです。」"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "*leans casually against the brick wall of the shelter.  \"Hello again, gorgeous\""
msgstr "*は壁に寄りかかり、気軽に答えました。「また会ったね、お洒落さん。」"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "*peers at you for a while before speaking.  \"Oh, you're back.\""
msgstr "*はしばらくこちらを覗き込み、やがて話し始めました。「なに、戻ってきたの。」"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*seems impossibly young at first glance, her dark face nervous when she sees you "
"looking her way.  On closer inspection as you approach, you see that she is likely in "
"her early teens, but the contrast to the weary faces around makes her age stand out.  "
"\"Oh, uh… hi.  You look new.  I'm Aleesha.\""
msgstr ""
"*は非常に若いようで、暗い顔つきから緊張が見て取れます。近寄ってよく見ると10代前半あたり"
"に見えますが、周囲の疲れた大人たちの顔との対比によって非常に幼い印象を受けます。"
"「あっ、えーと...こんにちは。はじめまして。私はアリーシャ。」"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*stands in the middle of a cramped kitchen, covered in flour.  The scene looks "
"reminiscent of easier times, but the illusion is broken as he apron shifts to reveal a "
"heavy machete and holstered pistol on  her belt.  She looks up as you approach, then "
"beams in recognition.  \"Welcome to Dana's Bakery, stranger!\"  She laughs brightly.  "
"\"Glad you made out this way.  What can I do for you?\""
msgstr ""
"*は穀粉塗れになりながら、狭いキッチンに立っています。かつての平和だった頃を思い出す光景"
"ですが、エプロンの下、ベルトに刺さっている大きなナタとホルスターに収まったハンドガンを"
"見ると、現実に引き戻されます。近寄ると彼女は顔を上げ、目を輝かせました。「ダナのパン屋"
"にようこそ、お客さん！」明るく笑っています。「来てくれて嬉しいよ、ご注文は？」"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*tips his cowboy hat and sets his feet far apart as he faces you.  \"Howdy, pardner.\""
msgstr ""
"*はカウボーイハットを被り、足を大股に開き、こちらに向き直りました。「ハウディ、友よ。」"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"*turns to look at you, lifting an enormous cowboy hat off his eyes.  He appears to be "
"in the process of growing out a set of bushy muttonchops and a handlebar moustache.  "
"Bright blue eyes peer out from his wrinkled face.  \"Howdy, pardner.  They call me "
"Clemens.  John Clemens.  I'm an ol' cowhand.\""
msgstr ""
"*は巨大なカウボーイハット越しにこちらを見ました。生い茂ったもみあげとカイゼルひげを整え"
"ている最中だったようです。顔は皺だらけで、目の色は青です。「ハウディ、ようこそ。俺ぁク"
"レメンス、ジョン・クレメンスだ。くたびれた牛追いさ。」"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Ah, a rich man I see.  I think you have yourself a deal."
msgstr "いやぁ、本当に太っ腹だねぇ。交渉成立だ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr "ああ、生存者か！君の心が安らかでありますように。僕はトム、よろしくね。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Ain't you heard it?  It's been screeching out in the forest during the night for a "
"while now, keeps me up sometimes.  I'm too scared to go out and see what that thing "
"is.  If you'd kill it, I'd be in your debt forever."
msgstr ""
"聞いたことはないか？夜中に時々、森から金切り声が聞こえてくるんだ。恐ろしくてとても様子"
"を見に行く気にはなれない。もし退治してくれたら、一生恩に着るよ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr "よしよし、分かった。ジェレミアを弟子にして、知識を学ばせるとしよう。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Always good to see you, friend."
msgstr "友よ、また会えて嬉しいぞ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Always nice to meet a fellow outsider.  How can I help you?"
msgstr "訪問者はいつだって歓迎するよ。どんな用事で来たんだ？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"And how many people have you killed?  Maybe it was in self defense, maybe because you "
"wanted their gear.  It's all the same.  I give their death meaning.  I hate that I "
"have to do it, I truly do, but you really must understand, there is no other way.  The "
"sooner I finish my mission, the sooner all this madness can end."
msgstr ""
"じゃあ、あんたは何人殺した？荷物が欲しかったから。自分の身を守るため。全部同じさ。私は"
"死に意味を与えられるんだ。こんなことはやりたくないと、本心から思っている。でも、他に方"
"法はない。理解してくれ。私が仕事を早く終えることができれば、こんな狂気ともおさらばでき"
"るんだ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Are you one of them?"
msgstr "あんたは奴らの仲間なのか？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "本当にいいのか？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Are you sure?  This doesn't seem like a particularly safe place for small talk…"
msgstr "本気か？くだらない話をしていられるほど安全な場所だとは思えないな..."

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Daym.  You're probably the best dancer I've ever had the honor of meeting.  Well "
"done.  Well done indeed."
msgstr ""
"なんてこった。こりゃ今まで見た中で最高のダンスだ。よくやった。まったくもって、よくやっ"
"た。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Did you find them, <name_g>?"
msgstr "<name_g>、連れて来てくれたか？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Ha ha ha!  Think before you speak, chum.  Eight icons for an honest day's work, I say "
"the system's broken!"
msgstr ""
"ハハハ！なあ、話す前に頭を使ったらどうだ。一日まじめに働いて、聖画カード8枚だ。こういう"
"のを制度の破綻って言うんだ！"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Have you asked the scavenger boss if they'd have anything?"
msgstr "スカベンジャー部隊のリーダーには相談してみたか？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Have you ever noticed how… wait no, never mind."
msgstr "ちょっと気づいたんだが...いや、何でもない。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Have you had a problem with memory, friend?  I was the one who asked you this, I "
"thought I explained why I could not."
msgstr ""
"友よ、記憶力は大丈夫か？私は君にこの仕事を頼んだ張本人だし、なぜ仕事を手伝えないのか説"
"明した筈だが。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Hello stranger, I don't think we've met before.  Its nice to meet you, name's Simon."
msgstr "やあ、見知らぬ人。話したことはなかったね。はじめまして、サイモンだ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Hello traveler, what brings you here?"
msgstr "やあ旅の人、何しに来たんだ？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Hello, my friend."
msgstr "やあ、友よ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Hey stranger.  How's life treatin' ya these days?"
msgstr "やあ、見かけない顔だな。ここ最近、調子はどうだ？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Hey there, friend."
msgstr "やあ、こんにちは。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Hey, did you notice that there's working wi-fi here?  Not that anything else is online "
"anymore, but still."
msgstr "なあ、ここでWi-Fiが使えるって知ってた？いや、ネットには繋がってないんだけどさ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Hey, who the fuck are you?  I haven't seen you 'round.  Ah, fuck it, it doesn't "
"matter.\n"
"Here's the rules.  The first and most important one: ALWAYS CLOSE THE FUCKING ENTRY "
"DOOR BEHIND YOUR ASS!  If you're okay with that, the following rules are: don't fuck "
"with us, don't steal from us, don't start a fight without a reason with someone from "
"us.  Got it, punk?  Now get lost."
msgstr ""
"おい、誰だこいつは？知らない奴だ。ああ、クソッ、別に構わねぇ。\n"
"ここでのルール。まず一番重要なこと。お前がケツを向けてる、そこの出入口を常に閉じてお"
"け！理解できたな、じゃあ次のルールだ。一つ、仲間を怒らせるな。一つ、仲間から盗むな。一"
"つ、理由もなく仲間と喧嘩をするな。ひよっ子、分かったか？分かったら、失せな。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Hmm, well it is not ideal but I appreciate you trying and being willing to help.  I "
"will have to do my best despite the bad memories.  Thank you, my friend."
msgstr ""
"ううん、十分な人数とは言えないが、協力を申し出てくれて助かるよ。嫌なことを思い出すかも"
"しれないが、頑張らないと。ありがとう、友よ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "How are you here?  Are you one of them, somehow?  What's going on?"
msgstr "どうやってここへ？まさか、奴らの仲間なのか？どういうことだ？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"I barely understand what's going on *now*.  Why do you think I'd know how the world "
"ended?"
msgstr ""
"「今の状況」をまったく理解できない。どうして私が、世界が崩壊したことを知っていると思っ"
"たんだ？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "I got my rights to be here, chum.  Squatter's rights!"
msgstr "私はここにいる権利があるんだ、そうだろ。ここに居座る権利だ！"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"I guess you probably wouldn't have noticed this place before shit hit the fan, but "
"I've been down here for quite a while."
msgstr ""
"騒ぎが始まるまで、こんな場所があるなんて気付きもしなかっただろ。でも、私は長いことこの"
"辺りで暮らしてたんだ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"I see things sometimes, and there's no way anyone could look like you!  I know you're "
"not real, and if you are, stay away you ugly <name_b>!"
msgstr ""
"幻覚は時々見るが、お前みたいなのが現実に存在する筈がない！どう見ても、お前は幻だ、もし"
"本当にいるなら、それ以上近寄るな、なんて醜いんだ、<name_b>！"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "I see.  And you live still.  Does that mean you managed to stop him?"
msgstr "そうだ。おまえが今も生きているということは、彼を止められたのか？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"I suppose that's true.  Still not a very nice way to break the news to someone you "
"accidentally robbed…"
msgstr "確かに、その通りだ。でも、それを盗人が被害者に直接言うのはどうかと思う..."

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "I'm glad you could make it here.  May the Lord have mercy on you."
msgstr "よくぞここまで来てくださいました。あなたに主の御慈悲がありますように。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"I've been trying not to think about it, but you could be right.  The more that I see, "
"the less I can explain.  I don't know why humans would want this, but if you're a "
"brain-sucking alien, this is the place to be."
msgstr ""
"考えないようにしていたけれど、本当かもしれないな。色々な経験を積むほど、説明のつかない"
"現象が増えていく。人間がこんなことを望むとは思えない。もし脳ミソが大好物のエイリアン"
"だったら、確かに地球は楽園だと思うだろう。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "It is good to see you again, my friend."
msgstr "また会えて嬉しいよ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"It saddens me to see a talented Kindred lose his way so greatly, but I take solace in "
"the fact that you are unscathed."
msgstr ""
"才能ある同胞が深く道に迷っているのは悲しむべきことだが、おまえが無事だったということに"
"安堵しているよ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"It's nice to meet you too, survivor.  It's a tragedy what's become of the New England "
"Church Community, perhaps it'll flourish again someday."
msgstr ""
"ええ、よろしくね、生存者さん。今のニューイングランド教会コミュニティは辛い状況だけど、"
"いつかまた、賑わいが戻ってくると思うわ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"No dice.  You asked me to come along.  This is what you get.  If you don't like it, "
"I'll take my fee and go back to the center.  Ain't hard to find contracts."
msgstr ""
"ダメだ。私について来るよう頼んだだろう。それが代価だ。気に入らないなら私は勝手にセン"
"ターへ戻る。次の雇い主も簡単に見つかるだろうからな。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"No offense, but my clients definitely would not like me giving strangers directions to "
"their hideouts.  You'll have to find them on their own terms."
msgstr ""
"申し訳ないが、見ず知らずの者に隠れ家の場所を教えたりしたら、お客にそっぽを向かれてしま"
"うよ。自分の足で探してくれ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Now try not to do whatever you did again.  No, don't tell me more."
msgstr "今後は同じ失敗を繰り返さないようにな。ほら、言い訳は無用だ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Oh my, am I dealing with a professional dancer here?  Sweet moves, friend."
msgstr "おいおい、こりゃプロのダンサーじゃないか？素晴らしい動きだな、友よ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Oh well, yet another survivor.  Welcome to our group, I'm Katherine."
msgstr "おや、まだ生存者がいたとはね。ようこそ、私はキャサリン。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Oh, wow!  You're a real gem, you know that?  Thanks for even thinking of it."
msgstr "おいおい！本当に親切な人だな？気持ちだけで十分だよ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Oh, you're not one of the <zombies>.  Come on in, just don't cause any trouble."
msgstr "ああ、<zombies>の仲間じゃないのか。どうぞ、ただし面倒は起こさないように頼むよ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Oh, you're not one of them.  Those <zombies>, I mean.  Come on in, just don't cause "
"any trouble."
msgstr ""
"ああ、奴らじゃないのか。奴らってのは、<zombies>のこと。どうぞ、騒ぎを起こさないように"
"な。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Oooooh.  Oh.  You did not just fucking go there.  Let's leave the fatties to die, "
"hey?  Wanna know how easy it is to find fucking *thyroid medication* after the "
"apocalypse, asshat?  Besides, there are more skills than heavy lifting needed now… no, "
"you know what?  Screw it.  You're not worth my time."
msgstr ""
"ちょっとちょっと。へぇ。言っちゃいけないことを言ったな。デブは見殺しにしよう、って？大"
"変動の後でクソ*甲状腺ホルモン剤*なんて簡単に見つかると思う？しかも、私は重いものを持つ"
"以上に今必要とされる技術を持って...まあいいや、あんたに何が分かる？くだらない。あんたと"
"話しても時間の無駄だ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Screw You!"
msgstr "くたばりやがれ！"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Seen any good movies lately?"
msgstr "最近は、何かいい映画を見た？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Seriously?  You've already done so much.  I won't say no, though."
msgstr "本当に？今までもたくさん助けてもらったのに。でも、手伝ってくれるなら心強いよ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "So, you have survived."
msgstr "そうか、無事だったのだね。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Sold!  Thanks for helping me out, friend."
msgstr "買った！助けてくれてありがとう、友よ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Sure thing, friend!  Let's see how you can move to this one."
msgstr "もちろんだ、友よ！こんなのはどうだろう。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Surprise!\"  They do jazz hands.  \"Sorry.  Well, I'm told that I'm part of a small "
"group right now.  Maybe you were the first."
msgstr ""
"驚いただろう！」クランベリーは両手をひらひらと動かしておどけました。「失礼、小規模なグ"
"ループだとは聞いている。多分あんたが先輩だろう。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Take it easy now.  Wouldn't want you coming back here too soon."
msgstr "無理はしないように。すぐに戻って来るんじゃないよ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Thank you for trying, my friend.  With you and me that will be five, I will do my best "
"to be strong and assist in the cleanup."
msgstr ""
"協力者を集めてくれてありがとう、友よ。私と君が加われば5人で作業できる。頑張って片付けを"
"終わらせよう。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"That ain't the point here, chum.  Don'tcha get it?  This was MY territory, but they "
"took it away from me.  Now they think of us as nothin' but a <swear> nuisance."
msgstr ""
"お前、そんなことはどうでもいいだろ。分からないのか？ここは私の縄張りだったのに、奴らに"
"奪われたんだ。今や厄介者としか思われてない、<swear>。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"That is quite alright, four should be enough though I appreciate your offer.  Four "
"people will make the job much easier and I will do my best even if it is painful.  My "
"thanks, friend."
msgstr ""
"ありがとう、申し出には感謝するが、4人もいれば十分だ。これで作業はかなり楽になるし、苦し"
"くても頑張れる。本当に助かったよ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Things are coming along.  I have a lot of studying to do before I know how to fix my "
"design issues, but the book you brought definitely has everything I need.  Now that "
"I've got some progress to show, administration is much more willing to help me get the "
"parts I need.  You've been a great gofer, but I can probably handle the rest on my "
"own.  Check back in a week or two!"
msgstr ""
"順調に進んでる。設計の問題の解決方法を探す以前にやるべきことはたくさんあるけど、必要な"
"知識はあなたがくれた本に一通り載ってるみたい。運営班に進捗状況を知らせたら、必要な部品"
"の調達を前よりもずっと積極的に手伝ってくれるようになった。あなたのお使いの腕は素晴らし"
"かったけど、あとは自力で何とかなると思う。1、2週間経ったらまた聞きに来て！"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Well I'll be damned, a fellow survivor!  I'm Darryl, nice to meet you."
msgstr "こいつぁ驚いた、まだ生存者がいたとはね！俺はダリル、よろしくな。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Well now, that's quite a kind offer, and I appreciate you looking past my full-body "
"pubic hair.  Sorry though.  I've come to feel sort of responsible for this little "
"gaggle of squatters.  As long as I'm the only one providing for them, I don't think I "
"can leave."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、親切な申し出も、全身から生えてる毛についてしつこく尋ねたりしなかったことも嬉"
"しく思ってるよ。でも、私はこの騒がしい居座り組達に対して、ある種の責任を感じるように"
"なってしまったんだ。私が物資を渡せる唯一の人間である限り、ここを去ろうとは思わない。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Well well, another traveler.  Don't try anything, you're outnumbered here and we're "
"well armed."
msgstr ""
"おやおや、また旅の人か。妙な真似はしないでくれよ。こっちには大勢いるし、武器もたくさん"
"あるんだからな。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Well, well.  I'm glad you are back."
msgstr "やぁやぁ。戻ってきてくれて嬉しいよ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Well, well.  You are back."
msgstr "やぁ、やぁ。戻ってきてくれたね。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Well, you got me there.  I sure ain't one to block a fellow farmer's right to reclaim "
"this God-given earth."
msgstr ""
"確かに、そうだな。神から授かった大地を取り戻すためだ。農家は手伝ってやらないとな。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Well… I'll be honest, I didn't even think Dave could be sorted out, and you've gone "
"and called my bluff!  It's a darn fine thing you've done for that poor soul.  Listen, "
"I wasn't… entirely serious about wanting to come with you, but if you can convince the "
"others to go, then I guess I'll come along."
msgstr ""
"そうか...正直なところ、デイブを何とかできるとは思っていなかったんだが、君は見事やりと"
"げ、私はしっぺ返しを食らったわけだ！気の毒な人のため真摯になって行動したんだな。ええ"
"と、実は...君からの提案については、あまり真剣には考えていなかったんだ。でも、他の人達を"
"説得して連れ出せたら、私も一緒に行こう。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Well… you have shown that you can survive out there, and you've been able to provide "
"food, so I know you're thriving more than we are here.  All right, I'll tell you "
"what.  I'm not going anywhere without my friends here, we've been through way too much "
"together.  If you can convince Luo, Brandon, and Yusuke to come along, then I'll go."
msgstr ""
"そうだな...そこへ行けば生き残れるし、食べ物もある。ここよりも豊かな生活ができるだろう。"
"分かった、じゃあこうしよう。ここの友人たちが行かないのなら、私もここに留まる。もしあな"
"たがルオ、ブランドン、ユウスケの3人を説得出来たら、私も一緒に行こう。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Where you say you're from again?  You're not as worldly as you look.  I'm talking "
"about weed.  Marijuana.  Wondered if you've happened upon any."
msgstr ""
"君はどこから来たんだ？見た目ほど世俗的じゃないんだな。ハッパの話だよ。マリファナ。偶然"
"見たことすらないなんて驚いたよ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Woof, you ready for a real hot take?  The <swear> government did this to us.  "
"Intentionally, or at least sort-of intentionally."
msgstr ""
"へぇ、ブッ飛んだ意見を聞く心の準備はできた？政府がやったんだよ、<swear>。意図的に、ある"
"いは多少意図的にね。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I'm real hungry and they put drugs in most of the food.  I can see you're not "
"like that."
msgstr ""
"ああ、すごくお腹が空いていたけど、奴らは大抵の食べ物に毒を入れているからな。君はそんな"
"ことしないって信じているよ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Yeah, just that I sometimes see things.  I wanna be sure you're real."
msgstr "ああ、時々幻覚が見えるんだ。あんたが本当にそこにいるのか、確認させてほしい。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah.  Have you noticed how they pay us in these tiny little gold coins?\"  Cranberry "
"holds one up for emphasis.  \"It's bizarre.  You'd think they have a gold mine in "
"there, but no, they don't, so they make me cross the damn world grabbing gold bars.  "
"As far as scrip goes, it seems inconvenient as hell to make."
msgstr ""
"ああ。ちっぽけな金貨が支払われただろう？」クランベリーは一枚のコインを掲げました。「妙"
"な話だ。別に近所に金鉱脈がある訳じゃない。ろくでもない世界の隅から隅まで探し回って、金"
"を集める仕事があるんだよ。臨時の貨幣なんて不便なものを作る奴がこの世にいるとはね。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Yes, my friend.  You have done so much for me, I would be glad to teach you what I "
"can.  I must ask a small amount in trade, for materials.  I hope you understand."
msgstr ""
"もちろんだ、友よ。君は色々と手伝ってくれたからね。私にできることなら喜んで教えるよ。資"
"材は物々交換で少量しか手に入らなかった。分かってもらえると助かるよ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You ever see the Matrix?  This is it.  In real life.  To keep us locked in here, the "
"creators of the simulation have to make sure we're just the right level of miserable.  "
"I think their algorithms got messed up though, and went into overdrive, because all "
"this is a little implausible.  Still, I guess we're still jacked in, so maybe it's "
"working."
msgstr ""
"マトリックスって映画を見たことは？まさにあれなんだ。この生活が。このシミュレーションの"
"作者は、私たちをここに閉じ込めておくために、ある程度辛い状況に置き続ける必要がある。最"
"近ありえない事ばかり起きているのは、きっとアルゴリズムが滅茶苦茶になって、暴走状態に"
"陥ったに違いない。でも、この幻想が終わらないんだから、まだ機能はしているんだ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local herbalist."
msgstr "初めて見る顔だな、どうぞよろしく。私はコスタス、地元で薬草医をしている。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You sure?  I mean, you've been traveling for a long time, haven't you?  Alright, it's "
"your decision.  Let me know when you changed your mind."
msgstr ""
"本気か？その、ずっと長旅続きだったんじゃないのか？いや、君自身の決断が大事だ。気が変"
"わったらまた言ってくれ。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "You think you're immortal, huh, <name_b>?"
msgstr "おいおい、<name_b>、自分が不死身だとでも思ってるのか？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "You're back, and still alive!  Whoa."
msgstr "わぁ、よく無事に戻ってきたね！すごい。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You're creepy.  I'm sorry for your lack of friends but, like, I'm literally a kid.  "
"Everyone on Earth turned into a zombie, we're running out of toilet paper and "
"everything, and my parents are gone.  I know they're still alive and they're looking "
"for me.  I miss them.  Is that enough personal stuff for you?"
msgstr ""
"気持ち悪っ。あなたに友達がいないのは可哀そうだと思うけど、見て分かるとおり、私はまだ子"
"供なんだよ。地球に暮らす皆がゾンビになって、トイレットペーパーも何もかも無くなって、両"
"親ともはぐれちゃって。きっとまだ生きてて、私を捜してると思う。早く会いたいな。私の個人"
"的な話はこれくらいで十分でしょ？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "You're new here, who the hell put you up to this crap?"
msgstr "おい新入り、誰に言われてやってんだ？"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You're right, but I still think there's something bigger out there.  Something evil.  "
"It doesn't matter whether science can explain it because we damn sure don't seem "
"capable of defeating it."
msgstr ""
"その言い分は正しいけれど、私には、何か巨大な力が働いているとしか思えない。邪悪な力だ。"
"科学で説明できるかどうかは問題じゃない。何故なら、説明しようがしまいが、私たちに勝ち目"
"がないからね。"

msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Your mind is open.  More than most.  Perhaps one day, you too will feel the power of "
"the song and become Kindred.  For now, traveller, listen, listen and feel the song."
msgstr ""
"受け入れてくれるのだな。この上なく良い心がけだ。きっと、おまえもいつか歌の力を感じ、我"
"らの同朋となるだろう。旅人よ、歌を感じ取れるよう、今は耳を傾け続けなさい。"

